(20684, 3587, 1013, 102420, 1072936800, '', 'Thanks for the update!\n\n\n\nNow, does anyone know if there is a buying macro for the Smoke Grenades and the Night Vision Goggles? The list doesn\'t seem to included those two items.\n\n\n\nUpdate:  "sgren" and "nvgs" will buy the smoke grenade and NVGs, respectively.\n\n\n\nAlso, there\'s an interesting addition to the config.cfg.... a line at the end reading "exec userconfig.cfg" and this note at the beginning...\n\n\n\n// Add custom configurations to the file "userconfig.cfg".\n\n\n\n\n\n[]', '127.0.0.1', 1),
