(21817, 3756, 1013, 102434, 1072936800, 'HOW TO GET CUSTOM LOGOS! [please sticky!]', 'OK WHAT YOU NEED TO DO...\n\n\n\n\n\nGet your pldecal.wad file on hand.\n\n\nRight click on the logo>properties.\n\n\nMake sure the logo is 16 kb or less or it will not appear in game.\n\n\nAt the bottom of the properties box, there should be 3 selections. Read-Only, Hidden, and Archive. Uncheck all of them except for Read-Only.\n\n\n\n\n\nPlace this file into the \n\n\nx:\\Steam\\SteamCache\\Counter-Strike\\Cstrike\\\n\n\nfolder.\n\n\n\n\n\nIf it asks to replace, click yes.\n\n\n\n\n\nNow in that same folder you placed the logo in (cstrike), there should be two files in there.\n\n\n\n\n\ncustom.hpk\n\n\ncustom.hp2\n\n\n\n\n\nYOU MUST DELETE THEM BOTH! VERY IMPORTANT!\n\n\n\n\n\nAfter this is all done, you may start up CS.\n\n\nHave fun, happy spraying!\n\n\n\n\n\nP.S. DO NOT GO INTO THE OPTIONS AND LOOK FOR YOUR SPRAY IN THE LIST. IT WILL NOT BE THERE. THIS LOGO IS A CUSTOM FILE AND IS INDEPENDENT FROM CS.\n\n\n\n\n\nThis fix is guaranteed, so if you have any problems with this, contact me at:\n\n\n\n\n\nAIM - x sN 5\n\n\nICQ - 199455181\n\n\nYAHOO - tekr0n\n\n\nMSN - tekr0n@msn.com (mailto:tekr0n@msn.com)\n\n__________________\n\nEine...Zwei...Drei...Vier...F�nf...Sechs...Sieben...Acht...Neun...AUS!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
