(25042, 4134, 1013, 102497, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by *Supra*LePoser* \n\nIs this compatability tab on XP... i am running 2000 Adv. Serv. and there is General, Shortcut, Security.... thanks for some one finally figuring out this freezing ****  \n\n\n\nTo enable the compatibility tab on windows2000 you must be logged as admin and execute this command\n\n\n\nregsvr32 c:\\winnt\\apppatch\\slayerui.dll\n\n\n\n\n\n(I hope that you know how to execute a command [] , if you don\'t know don\'t ask because you\'r too stupid to understand!)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
