(41516, 6715, 1013, 100049, 1072936800, 'Steam 6/18 Release', 'We\'ve released a new version of the desktop components of Steam to the beta. If you restart Steam, you will automatically receive this update.\n\n\n\nThis update is mostly targeted at improving the stability of the Steam Authentication server. There are no changes to any of the games with this release.\n\n\n\nWe\'ll will be doing a new release in the next few days of Counter-Strike 1.6 that will address a number of the issues that have been posted in these forums. We\'re constantly working on making Steam and Counter-Strike better, and appreciate all of the feedback from everyone. Everyone working on the beta reads these forums each day.\n\n\n\nWe\'ll also be releasing a Steam enabled version of the Linux game server, which will increase the number of quality game servers the beta.\n\n\n\nErik Johnson', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(41518, 6715, 1013, 102794, 1072936800, 'Thank you', 'Thank you erik for all your hard work with STEAM...it is a success even with all the complaining of these noobs you will find in this forum.  Keep up the good work...I am sure with your work and our feedback, we will make counter-stirke final release a very good one!  Thx again.[]', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(41519, 6715, 1013, 102795, 1072936800, '', 'Good work.\n\n\n\nI love when Steam works, it\'s great.\n\n\n\nAlso, in the next update, fix the Dual Berreta bug where if your using them you cant pick up another weapon without dropping them first.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
