(50169, 7251, 1005, 102872, 1072936800, '', 'Just get Wally, it has a wizard based interface, it puts it by itself in 256 colors.\n\n\n\n\n\nand the best feature? it takes 5 seconds to make your tag.\n\n__________________\n\nword...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(50256, 7251, 1005, 100989, 1072936800, '', 'And like i said, if you want better quality, do it manually with texture/wad making tools and Photoshop or Paintshop.\n\n__________________\n\n~Neme, the Soujiro\'ed one', '127.0.0.1', 1),
