(62207, 7251, 1005, 102873, 1072936800, '', 'Yeah, i know what you mean.\n\n\nLike a folder where you put your X.bmp files in your steam cache folder, and then, an interface where you can choose the one that will be your pldecal.wad file?\n\n\nIs that it?\n\n\n\n\n\nI\'d like that too.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(64793, 7251, 1005, 102874, 1072936800, '', 'What if i want my picture to be 404, 716. It won\'t let me.\n\n__________________\n\nRyo\'s gonna die and it\'s gonna be bloody! - Shogo m.a.d.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(69074, 7251, 1005, 100989, 1072936800, '', 'ABout the dimentions of the picture, both dimentions have to be multiples of 16, AND the product of the 2 numbers MUST be less than 12288.\n\n\n\n\n\na good and common size = 112 x 64 (my spray specifically)\n\n\n\n\n\nand 128 x 64 is cool too.\n\n\n\n\n\nmost people use 112 x 96 for box like sprays, and 112 x 64 for elongated ones.\n\n\n\n\n\nExperiment ^_^.\n\n\n\n\n\nAlso, you need your colors down correctly.\n\n\n\n\n\n256 Color pallet, with the 255th color set to RGB value 0 0 255  (pure blue). Also make sure that all other pure blues (0 0 255) other than the 255\'th color is set to RGB 0 0 254 (One step down from pure blue, but looks the same neways ^_^.\n\n\n\n\n\nIf confusing, just post and I\'ll clarify. If you need a specific program help, just ask and I\'ll assit ja.\n\n\n\n\n\nEDIT: Using the pure blue set on the 255th pallet block is the TRANSPARENCY, which is not shown in the game.\n\n__________________\n\n~Neme, the Soujiro\'ed one', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(71401, 7251, 1005, 102875, 1072936800, 'here, a program to do it manually', 'here the files 4 it. sry, got \'em alr. few years, cant say where i got them from\n\n\ncolorspr.zip 68kB (http://www.netcologne.de/~nc-loerscma/colorspr.zip)\n\n\n\n\n\nok, got a german readme added, but here is also an detailed english explanation how u do it:\n\n\n\n\n\nwhat u need:\n\n\n calculator (windows calculator can do it)\n\n\n graphic program (no, paint is not enough)\n\n\n counterstrike or another half life game (wouldnt be so interesting creating sprays if u dont got it []\n\n\n\n\n\n1. get a pic which is\n\n\n a) extreme funny\n\n\n b) naked or\n\n\n c) lame\n\n\nok, now we first need a good resolution.\n\n\n2. crop away the unimportant part of the pic\n\n\n\n\n\n3. we now try to resize it without shrinking/enlarging one side too much. it takes 2-3 steps, but its worth and after 2 sprays pretty easy.\n\n\nlook under file info  what resolution it got.\n\n\nthen divide the bigger number by the smaller one. we need the relation.\n\n\n\n\n\nwe now hope that the realtion is very close to one found here:\n\n\n(in my zip the following is the spray.txt)\n\n\n16 x 688     11008     43\n\n\n32 x 336     10752     10.5\n\n\n48 x 224     10752      4.66667\n\n\n64 x 160     10240      2.5\n\n\n80 x 144     11520      1.8\n\n\n80 x 128     10240      1.6\n\n\n96 x 112     10752      1.16667\n\n\nleft is the resolution. middle the real amount of  pixel (maybe u can use it if u like high resolution [] and last number is the relation between height and width)\n\n\n\n\n\nso. i guess we got about 1.5\n\n\nso we r close to the 96 x 112 one.\n\n\nthen... lets change our image to 96 x 112.\n\n\n(if u dont got a relation  close to one in the list, try to crop a little bit more of one side)\n\n\n\n\n\nin paint shop pro its in the menu, search for resize image  or smthing which sound simelar []\n\n\nbe sure to switch off the relation lock. otherwise ot never looks deformed but ull also harly ever get it to the right resolution.\n\n\n\n\n\n4. ok, now we still got 32bit colors, but we are only allowed to use 256 colors...\n\n\ncolors - decrease color depth - 256 colors.\n\n\na menu will pop up, where u can try out a few options. if u make it right u will hardly see a difference to the 32bit picture\n\n\n\n\n\n5. edit palette\n\n\nlast rule we have to follow is , that last palette color is the transparent color  blue.\n\n\nso go to\n\n\ncolor - change palette\n\n\nchoose last color box and set it to RGB 0 0 255.\n\n\nmake sure that there is no other 0 0 255 color, or if there is, just change it a little bit.\n\n\n\n\n\n6. pixel work\n\n\nif the palette change  let some blue dots appear in ur pic, then choose another color in ur palette and paint those dots with it.\n\n\ndont trust new appeared intensive blue dots. in game they always hide cuz they change to transparent\n\n\n\n\n\n7. if u want, make the background transparent by painting it intensive blue\n\n\n\n\n\n8. give it a filename\n\n\nsorry, but u need to give it a 8 + 3 filename. colorspr is not the latest program. and 8 chars are really enough for all ur pics []\n\n\n\n\n\n#############\n\n\n9. work with the colorspr\n\n\n\n\n\nive added a bat file. maybe u shd edit it before first use.\n\n\nu have to use 8+3 dir names. if u dont know them use start run "command" and there use "dir /x" to see dirs and files in current directory in the 8+3 format.\n\n\n(... to change dir use "cd dirname"  or to go one dir up, use "cd ..")\n\n\n\n\n\nthe bat 1.creates a wad, 2.copies it into hl dir and 3. deletes the bmp file., so never move ur bmp into the colorspr dir. only copy it.\n\n\n\n\n\nif u want to make it read-only then\n\n\ntry out the command "attrib filename +r"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\non, u now nearly got it.\n\n\n\n\n\nnow we got the \'debugging\':\n\n\nif u forgot any of the steps above, it wont converti bmp to a wad file. but dont worry. if it dont convert it, it will at least tell u what u forgot. the messages first look a but confusing, but they are really simple. just only read the last line []\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nand now u got it.\n\n\n\n\n\nthe door spray which hopefully works to make the next n00b mad. or..\n\n\nthe naked chick. u may loose the game, get fragged 4 times in a row w/o even one kill, u still got ur naked chick spray [].\n\n\ndont try to spray that naked chick in enemy base. its too much fun  spraying chicks, so u will inadvertently spray one also in ur base, and then half team will stare at it, shooting some \'dots in the pic\' ^^\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nif u r present low on creativity, ive also uploaded some pics 338kB (http://www.netcologne.de/~nc-loerscma/pics.zip) i use.\n\n\nthey are not all from me, but i just collect the best ones []\n\n\n\n\n\nsome are even from the program sprayview with which u can get every spray u ever seen in hl  (because u can only see them bcuz they are saved in one file on ur hd)\n\n\n\n\n\nif its a picture from sprayview, u still need to change the color depth from 32 bit down to 8 bit.\n\n\n\n\n\nif u dont know if it got 32 or 8 bit, and pic alr got the right resolution, just check its filesize. if its ~10-15  kB  its ready to convert.\n\n\nif it got 50-60 kB, u shd reduse colors\n\n\n\n\n\nok, hope uve understand all steps. []\n\n\ngreetingz, Ame', '127.0.0.1', 1),
