(46356, 7453, 1013, 102906, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Electronic Punk \n\n\ndo you use hlamp ?  \n\n\n\n\n\nFrom CS-NATION\n\n\nIMPORTANT: HLAmp is now detected as a cheat by VAC. "Close Winamp and delete the HLamp DLL and scripts, and you should be all set." I feel very sorry for Disk2 at this moment, but I\'ll be even more sorry for you if you\'re banned until 2008 because of HLAmp and VAC.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(46359, 7453, 1013, 102907, 1072936800, '', 'ok, for those that do not believe that these bans come from no where: they do.  I was just banned until 7-1-2008 [] \n\n\nfirst: i have never cheated, have never downloaded a cheat, have never looked at a page with cheats, and i am completely against cheating, of any sort.  i used to, however, use buy scripts in 1.5, but not in 1.6.\n\n\n\n\n\nIf you say that system specs can be useful:\n\n\nIntel P4, not overclocked\n\n\nGeforce Ti4200\n\n\nD3D mode, full bright/gamma, 1152 pixels, highest qualities (hell, who knows if that helps or not)\n\n\n256mb ram\n\n\nand nothing else of pertinence to CS...\n\n\n\n\n\nI HAVE however, changed to my nick at a friends house, then he disconnected from that server without changing the name back.  (oh big whoop?)  But I doubt that has any relevance whatsoever.\n\n\n\n\n\nBug?  Hell I hope so, because no one else has touched my computer since the last time I was on it until I was banned.  So there []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
