(46414, 7453, 1013, 102910, 1072936800, '', 'Exactly the same thing has happened to me. Yesterday I was playing away after DL Steam v2 and swapped servers, suddenly i was banned until 2008. I had nothing running in the background to screw it up for me. Have had to make a new Steam account just to play again.\n\n\n\n\n\nMy comp specs;\n\n\n\n\n\n2000+ XP\n\n\nAbit KR7A-RAID\n\n\n512m DDR\n\n\nGF 3 Ti500\n\n\nSB Live 5.1\n\n\n\n\n\nHope that helps.\n\n\n\n\n\nOne final thing i wanted to say is how disgusted i am with some members of the community who accuse us of cheating. Just remember until 2 days ago most of us in this post were just like you and we were unlucky, we dont cheat, we dont want to cheat so just STFU.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
