(46561, 7453, 1013, 102913, 1072936800, '', 'Most likely you were using HLAmp...If so, that is why you were banned. The latest VAC security modules contain a bug that will ban till 2008 because it thinks HLAmp is a hack. They are working on fixing this but I am not sure if they can delete your ban.\n\n\nKeep up-to-date with the latest news posts, because if you would have, you wouldn\'t have had to have posted because you would know about this bug.\n\n\nMAIN CS NEWS SITES:\n\n\nwww.VUGaming.com (http://www.VUGaming.com)\n\n\nwww.CSCentral.com (http://www.CSCentral.com)\n\n\nhttp://csnation.counter-strike.net (http://csnation.counter-strike.net)\n\n__________________\n\nNathan Dodd\n\n\nVUGaming Networks\n\n\nwww.VUGaming.com\n\n\nCS-Nation Staff\n\n\nwww.CSNation.net\n\n\nSteam Support Staff\n\n\nwww.steampowered.com', '127.0.0.1', 1),
