(46157, 7488, 1005, 103425, 1072936800, 'I know for a fact there is a cheat for 1.6 secure server', 'I\'ve already tested the cheat and i know it works. Ball cheat,wall cheat, aimbot, skin cheat, white walls.  So don\'t sit there and tell me i\'m paranoid.  I run a clean server and all of a sudden I\'m getting my ass owned within a weeks time. Well i did a little digging and found what they were using, I tested it on my server which is running in secure mode with VAC enabled. I had no problem owning then. \n\n\n\n\n\nCheaters Suk!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(46158, 7488, 1005, 103421, 1072936800, '', 'quote:example: Aim Bots;Wall Hacks etc..\n\n\nI know some "Scripting" for the game (CS),\n\n\nand have made a few maps with "Hammer" and \n\n\nnone of the scripts ,I have seen etc.. \n\n\nare really nothing all that bad..\n\n\n\n\n\n??? what are you trying to say here ???\n\n\n\n\n\nquote:I also downloaded and tried some,\n\n\n(so called) working cheats for counter strike 1.5 and NONE of these will work, on CS 1.6, because of the nature in which, ( HL.exe is launched )\n\n\n\n\n\nYES  1.5 .  1.6 is diff then 1.5... 1.6 added more hack protection and vac helped to ban hackers and detect OLDER hacks\n\n\n\n\n\nquote:And the respawn thing that another guy was,\n\n\nasking if people were interested in...(on another post)\n\n\nIs an absolutly retarded cheat (if it works)\n\n\n- USLESS & LAME !!! ha ha ha.......\n\n\n\n\n\nacually in my server i have a respawn mod for amx.. its fun we just keep respawning... so the rounds dont end untill the time limits (well round limits)\n\n\n\n\n\nquote:"These" people are actually cheating, or at least explain to me technicly how you can "exec" these hacked Dll\'s or EXE\'s .... let me know !\n\n\nCause in my opinion, It\'s a bunch of Paranoid Mis-Informed.. \n\n\nBULL ... \'cause they suck at CS ?\n\n\n\n\n\nYes People do hack in 1.6... i have seen my friends do it.. and i have to admit when 1.6 first came out i hacked for a few days... but i did it to see whats diff with new hacks.. ive been in cs from beta 3... its been funny the origionlay hacks were just models with spikes coming out of them... but now you cant use them because the servers know the model is too big (consistancy error) and it wont let you use them... believe me... hacks are real... maybe you should research stuff more... and LEARN that hacks can go from read alreat to ****ing everquest... even games like diablo and game poeple really dont play like swat3 and games like that...\n\n\n\n\n\nFollowing quote from [THE CLAN]BUnnY:\n\n\nquote:YES there are cheats saddly, go to **site here** and you can see how many loser hacks they have there, Valve sould get law suites on there asses or some thing.\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease remove that website from the forums\n\n\n\n\n\nok sorry bunny... im not tring to be an asshole or anything im just saying that you really shouldn\'t provie hacking sites to the cs community... i understand why you put it there\n\n\ni just dont want lots of people ruining the cs community by hacking...\n\n\n\n\n\nquote:I tested it on my server which is running in secure mode with VAC enabled. I had no problem owning then. \n\n\n\n\n\nobvioulsy when a new hack comes out... yes its vac proof.. and most of the time hlg and punkbuster proof... its sad but its seen hacks for many years... i played cs from beta 3 and to tell ytou the truth there was ALWAYS "HACKS" maybe not wall hacks but think about it.. spiked models... yeah.... lets see... skin hacks... YEAH all the old things they they dont try to use anymore were hacks BACK then... but oh well... \n\n\ni hope hacking just gets eliminated because i am a really really good cs player... i can pretty much own anyone in my server and most of my clanmates... just one person or acually 4 dracolm, emerica, spike speigal, and wesley pipes.. those are some of my best clanmates...  Some times ill be playing witha  bunch of normal 1.6 noobs and all of a suden they start calling me a hacker because my score is like 29/4 and so on.. **** like that... i just laugh.. because I know that im not hacking... the other day a ****ing noob called me a blowjob lol... yeah he said \n\n\nquote:YOUR A ****ING BLOWJOB YOU HACKSTICK\n\n\nthats a little noobish and i think this kid was like 20\n\n\nthen i was like HAHAHA this kids a ****ing ****** and he left... then i was like damnit.... oh well he sucked anyways then i just had fun witht the other poeple on my server', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(46162, 7488, 1005, 100593, 1072936800, '', 'unfortunatly the worst effect of cheats is the paranoia it has created within the cs community...\n\n\n\n\n\nmost people refuse to relize that alot of the people they accuse aren\'t cheating.  I think VAC is actually doing a great job cleaning  up cheaters... i think i\'ve only seen one since VAC has been re-enabled for 1.6 a few days ago...  sure there will be cheaters now and then, but the best thing everyone can do is try and stop accusing so much...  the way these little kids are learning about the cheats in the first place is because some guy dies and starts screaming accusisions on the mic... and thats how people learn about cheats in the first place...  if someones cheating, there is no need to say it out loud cause its usually obvious... if its not obvious then you shouldnt say anything either, cause if they really are cheating, then they will eventiually get detected by VAC...  and not saying anything reduces some of the paranioa and doesnt tell the kiddies that they should go search for these cheats they keep hearing about...\n\n\n\n\n\nthats just my own opinion\n\n__________________\n\n><<>><<>><<>><\n\n\n__________________', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(46185, 7488, 1005, 103424, 1072936800, '', 'well...\n\n\nExactly what i expect to hear....\n\n\nand yet I didn\'t get a chance to Check that URL..\n\n\nseems to be gone now...\n\n\nwell I\'\'l do a little re quoating myself..\n\n\n(Stick)\n\n\n"So don\'t sit there and tell me i\'m paranoid. I run a clean server and all of a sudden I\'m getting my ass owned within a weeks time"\n\n\n\n\n\nAre you sure that you wernt just playing someone "really" good ?\n\n\nDo we not all have up and down periods, when we play diff versions of cs over long periods of time ?\n\n\nI have friends who having playing longer than me, and they have Quit \'cause they lost there skills and/or just need a break for a while...\n\n\nOh and you don\'t need to copy and paste what I wrote, \n\n\nI am aware of what I said !\n\n\n well I still want more proof other than.....\n\n\n"I seen this and I seen that so .............\n\n\nMaybe I need to see some weird stuff for myself.. i guess if ya all are right I will soon enough , then right ?\n\n\n\n\n\nI still have only seen glitches: from auto director mode and thats about it..\n\n\nAND A WHOLE LOT of Hysteria !\n\n\nanywayz.. Have fun, I do .. besides any of this...\n\n\nI still love the crap out of CS.. CYA \'round []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
