(46314, 7488, 1005, 102914, 1072936800, '', 'personally on my clan server... we ban anyone who we suspet are cheating.. if they arent 2 bad.. there are other servers to play on.. and i myself have been called a hacker before... i have hacked back in 1.3, but its no fun.. well unless u rage other players.. but thats besides the point.. i\'ve never seen hacks personally for 1.6.... never looked, but im guessing there are.. every other anti-cheat there is, people get around it.. vac is prolly no different. thats my 2 cents []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(46349, 7488, 1005, 102170, 1072936800, '', 'I have been playing this game a long time, and you can feel\n\n\nwhen someone is cheating, i get accused of cheating almost every time i play, and i think it�s right to question about wh, aimbot etc if you are sure about it. But if some stupid **** with 200 ping, bitch about getting killed by one with 30 ping, and talks about cheat, thats wrong. But if someone with 250 ping, jumps around a corner and get 6 hs in 1 sec, thats a cheater or extreme super mega duck luck!! but i think the vac is working, i have only seen one (maybe 2) cheaters since vac was released, bah i wish i had a demo on that guy!! like 50 hs, 300 ping! impossible!!\n\n\nand if not he would kick the **** out of Potti, HeatoN and company..\n\n\n\n\n\nAnd i think westsidebud only wrote this to get some urls, so he can cheat..\n\n\n\n\n\nbtw: am i the only one in the world who has never dll a cheat? not even for testing!! all the people who downloads these cheats for testing i hope you do it on lan, otherwise you are G.A.Y!!!\n\n\n\n\n\nand another thing! watch out for virus and trojans when you download the cheats! and why do ppl call "cheaters" for hackers?\n\n\nthats ****ing stupid.. they don�t make the program they only DOWNLOAD IT!!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(46427, 7488, 1005, 103424, 1072936800, '', 'Well I will use my "deluded" "english" to explain, \n\n\nas best as I can....  First off...\n\n\nI am talking about a certain type of cheat....\n\n\nAnd Not one of the millions of pathetic scripts... \n\n\nwhich I might add, I have wrote few myself []\n\n\nFor ex:  I use the following, (sometimes)\n\n\n"BUY SCRIPTS", <---- Really helpfull ! (the game comes with a couple anyways !) so calling that a cheat is hillarious !\n\n\n"JUMP CROUCH", <--- Convienant/Saves Time/Effort !\n\n\n"BURST FIRE TOGGLE( 2 Bullet )", <--- Gets me killed ALOT !\n\n\n"FAST PISTOL", <--- Convienant/Saves Time/Effort !\n\n\n"FAST KNIFE STAB", <--- Convienant/Saves Time/Effort !\n\n\n"SWITCH HANDS", <--- Useless actually !\n\n\n"WALK TOGGLE", <-- Never use it...\n\n\n"CROUCH TOGGLE", <-- Never use it...\n\n\n"TURN AROUND 180 degrees", <----Good for seeing which one of your team mates are Flashing you or TK\'ing you, \n\n\nat spawn LOL..    So..\n\n\nI wrote them myself and have added a pile of cvar\'s to another .cfg file that say for example displays net graph and changes my cl_bob to 0...\n\n\nAnd.. test this stuff for your self and you too will find that you only get out of the game what you put into it....\n\n\nFor example I have found a pile of no recoil scripts..\n\n\n1 of them is  an"24kb .exe" that people have changed the name and have takin turns, stealing the credit for LOL.. LOSERS !\n\n\nWhich this thing does the exact same thing as the non ".exe" \n\n\nno-recoil scripts.. which these all run by temporarly changing the cl_pitchspeed and using the look down command really quick ..I have tried them all and made an extremly complicated version of my own, using many other cvars... My point ?\n\n\nIt sure did\'t help me at all and made my Results WAY worse than just playing normally...Hooray every few bullets my crosshair was  a bit lower.. lol\n\n\nFurther more I would recommend, trying to keep your mouse as still as possible/Crouch and not pulling down every time you shoot.. Very Dumb idea... and obviousley time some bursts or jump around like a bunny when needed !\n\n\nSo another example is the "Sniper Blackout", which does nothing more than toggle\'s "hud_draw 1" on and off ! \n\n\nand again useless, YOU STILL have to be able to shoot, \n\n\nvery , very small adavantage.. \n\n\nand just gets me killed and is a pain in the azz, So i don\'t use it !\n\n\nSo basicly I am talking about a Type of cheat like(Metacheat 1.8)\n\n\nwhere it requires you to "exec" a DLL and use a hacked "exe" to launch "HL.exe" which I myself have tried many methods, just like trying to exec "METAMOD\'s .DLL" on a listen-Server.. YOU CAN\'T !\n\n\nRead the other posts in the Forum here GUYS you agree when it suits your interests etc..\n\n\nRegardless, yes I am SURE that soon enough someone will,\n\n\n"find a way" , And we\'ll stop \'em as usual []\n\n\nBut the Hacking situation is Nothing like it is in 1.5 (Right Now!)\n\n\nSo as much as I am NOT the biggest fan on using Steam to play CS 1.6 , They obviously have prevented a whole lotta cheating from starting up..\n\n\nAnd if any of you "Hackers/Hacker Sites etc.." are reading this watch your back, \'cause I\'ll rat you azz out,\n\n\nto Steam (or maybe make an Anti Cheat of my own []\n\n\nLastly Where\'s the Beef ? Put your money where your Mouth is !\n\n\nLets see the Hacks..... If you Got some Hardcvore Brutal hack running On a (CLIENT) NOT SERVER !!!! I\'ll tell you what server to meet me on ! And you you have every right to own me(on CS 1.6)for a while..... \n\n\nshoot ya\'s later people, And Have fun, It\'s just a Game !', '127.0.0.1', 1),
