(46241, 7496, 1013, 100590, 1072936800, '', 'I mean really let\'s not fix the models looking backwards, or fix the reload sounds for the glock and spas, or add a VAC filter in the server options, or update any of the sounds or player models, let\'s focus on the bots! I think focusing on making the bots is a great idea, I mean there\'s allready bots you can download for free out there, and a million things needed to be done to make this game better, but I say let\'s work on the bots and a couple sky and weather effects. that sounds good to me..what the hell is the point in posting our suggestions? do we have any say in anything at all? seriously is it that ****ing bad of an idea to add VAC to the filters, or to make all the guns facing the correct way (ak47 charging handle shouldn\'t be on the left), or making the CT arms have the uniforms on them...damnit..', '127.0.0.1', 1),
