(47164, 7623, 1013, 102924, 1072936800, '', 'After patching, all the in-game text was gone, no chat messages, no text on GUI menus, and no text in the scoreboard.. that\'s a nice change []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(47165, 7623, 1013, 102925, 1072936800, '', 'If everyone was wondering, the only things that are changed between the 7/2 release and the 7/4 release are:\n\n\n\nNew:\n\nFixed bug when drawing fonts with full screen anti-aliasing on. \n\n\n\nRemoved:\n\nAdded option to settings to enable/disable auto launching steam on windows start. \n\nSteam icon now turns red instead of spinning when updating. \n\nReworked UI for Steam updating to look more like the rest of the UI.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(47166, 7623, 1013, 102798, 1072936800, '', 'hmmm.. i had to quit the server and restart it. now it\'s updating. it didn\'t auto-anything.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(47173, 7623, 1013, 102141, 1072936800, '', 'quote:- Fixed bug where radar would disappear during gameplay. \n\n\n\nI\'ll believe this when I see it... It\'s been bugged for literally years.\n\n\n\n\n\nIt\'s nice they fixed the saving favorites information while ingame.\n\n\n\nI hope they fix your killer\'s name not being highlighted in red on the scoreboard.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(47182, 7623, 1013, 100705, 1072936800, '', 'I just updated ~5 mins ago, and guess what, I am now banned for previous cheating violations.... Now I have one thing to say, WTF! I have never even touched a 1.6 hack... let alone an all-round CS hack... now wtf\n\n\n\n*EDIT*\n\n********************************************\n\nYou have been automatically disconnected\n\nfrom this secure server because an illegal\n\ncheat was detected on your computer.\n\nRepeat violators may be permanently banned\n\nfrom all secure servers.\n\n\n\nFor help cleaning your system of cheats, visit:\n\nhttp://www.counter-strike.net/cheat.html (http://www.counter-strike.net/cheat.html)\n\n********************************************\n\nRe-installed steam, re-updated cs 1.6 and I still get banned....\n\n\n\n*EDIT*EDIT*\n\nI am now missing the csrtike folder out of steamcache and it\'s now re-updating.....\n\n\n\n*EDIT*EDIT*EDIT*\n\nNow it seems that the shhhhtuff has officially hit the fan.... it suddenly stopped updating, cstrike folder is still missing and it acts like its there.....\n\nbtw\n\n********************************************\n\nYour connection to this secure server has been\n\nrejected.\n\n\n\nBecause of past cheating violations, you have\n\nbeen banned from playing on all secure servers\n\nuntil 2008-07-03 17:55:08.\n\n\n\nRepeat violators may be permanently banned\n\nfrom all secure servers.\n\n\n\nFor more information, visit:\n\nhttp://www.counter-strike.net/cheat.html (http://www.counter-strike.net/cheat.html)\n\n********************************************\n\n\n\n*EDIT*EDIT*EDIT*EDIT*\n\nI have looked through errorlogs and found this...\n\nfailed with error 9: The mount path does not exist\n\n?????????\n\nit has 4 errorlogs and it is dated within the time from the initial mess up (?????????????)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(47185, 7623, 1013, 100590, 1072936800, '', 'I can\'t seem to manually update my CS. Is this only a server side version or something? I see in my Monitor tab that CS is updating but I can still go in and the play the game. Usually it tells me that it\'s updating and gives me an estimated wait time.[]', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(47193, 7623, 1013, 102141, 1072936800, '', 'Ya the update process is even more screwed than the last time if you start from scratch. (or forced to from steam not responding after update causing you to delete and start from the steam installer)\n\n \n\nI finally got my CS to update by right clicking on the game and choosing options. Then click on the Status applet. Now in the last update this was the only way I could get cs to update by selecting the "make sure to update automatically". It would then show you your update download bandwidth which was the only updating information you could get that the game was actually downlaoding. Eventually it finished but you never know how long it will take.\n\n\n\nThe new update is even more screwed up. Now if you select "update game automatically" it will begin to download the game files but it will them automatically revert to "Do not automatically keep game up to date" (or whatever the wording is).\n\n\n\nI finally found that if I selected nothing the box would say "do not automatically download" but it showed that it was updating above it with the download bandwidth!\n\n\n\nWTF? Owell atleast I\'m getting the game files I need...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(47231, 7623, 1013, 102926, 1072936800, '', 'bug: steam monitor doens\'t report the correct bandwidth usage, it said my cable modem was downloading at a meg a second when  the fastest it can go is 120kb/sec\n\n\n\nbullet_head I hope when you say "I have never even touched a 1.6 hack... let alone an all-round CS hack... " your not implying you were using a home-made hack.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
