(49637, 7960, 1013, 103028, 1072936800, '', 'I got 4 quesitons for eric and I don\'t know when he is on so could you post this for me.\n\n\n\n1. If I use half-life to play the mod versions of day of defeat, and counter-strike, how will steam effect me?? Will I have to buy each one?? Or can I just play it how I do now on steam.\n\n\n\n2. Will half-life2 run on my computer? It is a AMD Athlon XP 1800+, 256 Ram (I am upgrading this to 720 or whatever it is) and GeForce 4 MX graphics card and an 80 gig hard drive.\n\n\n\n3. In half-life 2 will making models for weapons and players be easier?? I always have a hard time trying to do them in 3dstudio max.\n\n\n\n4. Where the heck is TFC2?? Are you going to make it a hl2 mod that comes with it like you did TFC? I must have it!! I must!!! It always looked so cool, but you guys never update or sites or anything, so I have no clue whats going on behind you little office windows and firewalls! HEH', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(49640, 7960, 1013, 100280, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by -=Druid=- \n\nI got 4 quesitons for eric and I don\'t know when he is on so could you post this for me.\n\n\n\n1. If I use half-life to play the mod versions of day of defeat, and counter-strike, how will steam effect me?? Will I have to buy each one?? Or can I just play it how I do now on steam.\n\n\n\n2. Will half-life2 run on my computer? It is a AMD Athlon XP 1800+, 256 Ram (I am upgrading this to 720 or whatever it is) and GeForce 4 MX graphics card and an 80 gig hard drive.\n\n\n\n3. In half-life 2 will making models for weapons and players be easier?? I always have a hard time trying to do them in 3dstudio max.\n\n\n\n4. Where the heck is TFC2?? Are you going to make it a hl2 mod that comes with it like you did TFC? I must have it!! I must!!! It always looked so cool, but you guys never update or sites or anything, so I have no clue whats going on behind you little office windows and firewalls! HEH  \n\n\n\n1. No, you have to buy HL2. You play as you do now.\n\n\n\n2. Yes\n\n\n\n3. Don\'t know, no one asked\n\n\n\n4. He said it was coming I think\n\n\n\nWell thats the best I can do for being in there', '127.0.0.1', 1),
