(59395, 9181, 1013, 100844, 1072936800, '', 'Sadly it\'s not complicated at all and I see many people using that exploit.\n\n\n\nBuy a shield. Set up last weapon so you can switch between knife and pistol.\n\n\n\nNow arm shield while holding knife (shield covers face). Now hit "last weapon used" to switch to gun. As long you leave the shield in unguarded and dont move it, you can shoot anyone in front of you and never recieve damage.\n\n\n\nEvery server I\'ve been on so far I\'ve seen at least one person doing this. One loser with the exploit can take out an entire team.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
