(69634, 10333, 1013, 100049, 1072936800, 'Steam 8/05', 'There is a new version of Steam available to the beta. If you shutdown Steam now and restart you will automatically be brought up to date.\n\n\n\n\n\nChangelist:\n\n\n- Fixed bug where steam monitor would occasionally show incorrect data when first opened\n\n\n- Fixed game name of mods showing incorrectly in \'third party\' section of Games list\n\n\n- Changed friends authorization request dialogs to appear sequentially, instead of all opening at the same time\n\n\n- Fixed bug where you couldn\'t re-add a user to your list who had previously been removed\n\n\n- Increased heartbeat rate to server if friends or chat dialog windows are open\n\n\n- Fixed a problem when using Friends behind a firewall.\n\n\n- Fixed logged friends chats being saved incorrectly.\n\n\n- Fixed problem where users would not always get disconnected properly, and have messages build up to be sent to them.\n\n\n- Fixed problem where Steam would not properly update for users running WindowBlinds.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(69636, 10333, 1013, 100050, 1072936800, '', 'Thank you Mr.Johnson []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
