(70374, 10430, 1013, 100050, 1072936800, 'CS:CZ Models Preloaded on Steam..', 'Hi, if you guys don\'t read CS-Nation...\n\n\n\nHere i found a nice news about CS:CZ on Steam....\n\n\n\nTwo CS:CZ players models are preloaded on steam right now.\n\n\n\nHead to: C:\\Program Files\\Steam\\SteamCache\\email@email.com\\Counter-Strike\\cstrike\\models\\player\\\n\n\n\nand look at millitia and spetznaz, it\'s two CS:CZ players models.\n\n\n\nhere i have two screenshots of the models in question:\n\n\n\nSpetznaz: http://tinyurl.com/j8yk (http://tinyurl.com/j8yk)\n\n\n\nMillitia: http://tinyurl.com/j8yo (http://tinyurl.com/j8yo)\n\n\n\nSo, i think CS:CZ is coming soon... sooner than you think', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(70378, 10430, 1013, 100105, 1072936800, '', 'Cool, will it let you replace the other player models with it?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
