(70438, 10430, 1013, 100050, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Emfoor \n\nI don\'t see any models in there.\n\n\n\nOnly folders.  \n\n\n\n\n\nyeah of course, if you look at all the models / gun models / players models... you only can see the folder because the .mdl file is encrypted in the gcache.cgf ... \n\n\n\nAnd that\'s why you can\'t use custom models in 1.6.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(70451, 10430, 1013, 100109, 1072936800, '', 'Hmm why are they pre-loading it? Are they presuming that EVERYONE in the Steam community will go & buy it? []\n\n\n\nAnd for those who won\'t, perhaps they don\'t want lots of extra files that just take up space. What should they do? []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(70486, 10430, 1013, 100110, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Alec_85 \n\nHmm why are they pre-loading it? Are they presuming that EVERYONE in the Steam community will go & buy it? :)\n\n\n\nAnd for those who won\'t, perhaps they don\'t want lots of extra files that just take up space. What should they do? :confused:  \n\n\n\npreloading it because CS1.6 is going to be the multiplayer component of CS:CZ, so they should have the same models, yes?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
