(72925, 10749, 1013, 100049, 1072936800, '', 'If you are getting a crash when you start the game, try this:\n\n\n\n1. Exit Steam.\n\n2. Restart (and download new Steam update).\n\n3. Launch CS.\n\n\n\nWe\'re working through a way that will prevent people from getting into this situation.\n\n\n\nLet me know if this fixes it.\n\n\n\nErik', '127.0.0.1', 1),
