(79930, 11562, 1013, 100049, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Calhoun \n\ndoes that mean I will have to pay for Steam? I hope not  \n\n\n\nNo, you do not have to pay for Steam.\n\n\n\nYou will have to own a copy of Half-Life, Counter-Strike, or any other product that includes a WON CD-Key after the beta resets to play them.\n\n\n\nAfter the userbase is converted to Steam, you will have the ability to purchase existing and new titles via Steam.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
