(222015, 11767, 1013, 100028, 1072936800, '', 'Why would you want to run in D3D mode when you can run in OPENGL mode?\n\n\n\n\n\nOPENGL is at least 10x better, images are cleaner, fps are much higher and overall rendering is sharp and accurate.\n\n\n\n\n\nD3D gives a very poor representation of HL.\n\n\n\n\n\nD3D mode also makes everything look laggy.\n\n__________________\n\nWould you like a little Cheeze with that Whine?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
