(84153, 11934, 1013, 100589, 1072936800, '', 'Steam is free, its the content that will need to be paid for.\n\nFor people who don\'t own Half-life it means the end.\n\nOr I guess you can buy the games online or subscribe []\n\n\n\nThinking about it, I am curious how the mods will work.\n\n\n\nEach mod is powered by the HL engine, yet the current selection generate their own files. Alot of mods use exisiting HL content and it would be daft for each mod to have its own 400 meg cache.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
