(87203, 12319, 1013, 100318, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Thorinos \n\nCounter-Strike 1.6 ????? The final version ??? \n\n\n\nI\'d say there will never be a final version now. I hope that VALVe fixes bugs when they come out, instead of waiting half a year for a new release. That is what, I hope, is the point (or a minor point) of Steam.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
