(87230, 12319, 1013, 100695, 1072936800, '', 'Converting all users to Steam? WTF does that mean?  There is something very wrong with this picture.\n\n\n\nAs far as I read it, the only thing that is changing is that you will need a new Steam account and a CD-Key to use Steam.  CS 1.6 is still beta.  They haven\'t said squat about 1.5, so I should be able to run hl.exe -game cstrike tomorrow night and be able to play 1.5 without Steam.  Is that right?  But in a few weeks they are going to make 1.6 offical, and you WILL need Steam to play that. \n\n\n\nNow, I am not one to bash Valve.  When 1.4 came out, I was happy, I liked the changes, and I like the changes in 1.6.  But Steam is NOT a good idea.  The system that was in place before, the ole\' download new .exe file to update, and .exe to use when playing single player/lan worked just damn fine.  Ever heard the phrase "If ain\'t broke, don\'t fix it" ?  Ok yeah, I like the new In-GAME GUI, it makes things a lot easier to manage, and bots are good, and Friends is also a great idea.  But all those things could\'ve been added into an .exe file.  Steam also requires a lot of bandwidth, the kind that 56k users don\'t have.  That is dropping a lot of users right there.  Plus you have to have an internet connection to play a LAN game or play bots by yourself? How stupid is that, why would anyone play Bots when they are online and can just go play real people?  Steam is also really buggy.  One day it will work just fine, but the next it won\'t work at all.  \n\n\n\nThey are going to try to sell us games over Steam, now granted you can go buy a Retail copy of HL2 or CS2, but really, who wants to pay for something when all they have to show for it is their logon name and password? I think most people are going to want to have something in their hands when the fork out their cash.  And pay by monthly basis? Please, don\'t make me laugh.  Valve can\'t even release a SINGLE update in 9 months, let alone a whole other mod.\n\n\n\nThe bottom line is that the old system worked fine, and this new one is going to alienate a lot of users.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(87253, 12319, 1013, 100435, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Rogue_Warrior \n\nValve can\'t even release a SINGLE update in 9 months, let alone a whole other mod.\n\n\n\nThe bottom line is that the old system worked fine, and this new one is going to alienate a lot of users.  \n\n\n\nwhat? the sum of you entire argument is that valve doesnt rapid fire updates into the community? am i grossly misinterpreting this? bc/ if thats what you mean, youre completly insane. you think steam is buggy? do you have any idea how long this beta has been running for? now imagine a patch released say every 2 months, with minimal testing. it would be a hell of a lot worse than this, and if youre too stubborn to realize this myb you should play another developer\'s games. steam is here to prevent bugs, and has steadily improved throughout the beta process. if you choose to only see the problems w/ steam, and none of the advantages, them you should stop playing. im dead serious about this, and it applies to all of you who have done nothing of recent save complain.\n\n\n\nSteam isnt perfect, but nether anything else, and untill you all realize this you should reconsider complaining endlessly about the potential for change. the advantages far outway the drawbacks, and its sickening to think that a corporation and all its work should be denouced purely bc/ some nub had a bad experience w/ the beta.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(88099, 12444, 1005, 100734, 1072936800, 'Awful font...', 'I am one of the few people how think "Wow, CS1.6 - really good", but i don\'t know the ... *lets come on topic*\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease change the font before the release. It really sucks... It\'s hardly to read it - maybe make it a little big bigger and change the color(what cvar have i to set?).\n\n\n\n\n\nSo thx for CS1.6-font ;-)\n\n\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\nSideWinder\n\n__________________\n\nWelcome to whereever you are...and now visit my homepage: www.sidewindershome.net', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(88694, 12444, 1005, 100735, 1072936800, '', 'whats particular font? the ingame GUI font? if its big and ugly try increasing your resolution in the video settings and youll be fine\n\n__________________\n\nI pwn n00bs like a fat kid pwns a box of donuts', '127.0.0.1', 1),
