(88852, 12444, 1005, 100627, 1072936800, '', 'In 800X600 resolution it\'s big and ugly too. Regular font style would be nice, but not bold for crying out loud.\n\n__________________\n\nWaiting for things to change... in the mean time enjoying my time while playing Urban Terror where the dev team cares and cheaters are busted for good.\n\n\nAnd may i remind you: http://www.petitiononline.com/nosteam/petition.html Say NO! to Steam petition is still going.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(88967, 12444, 1005, 100736, 1072936800, '', 'agreed \n\n\nfont sucks', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(89036, 12444, 1005, 100737, 1072936800, '', 'I agree, in 1600x1200 is absolutely HUGE.  The majority of people who play CS, can see the screen fine... they aren\'t blind.  For the love of god, put a cvar in that allows you to adjust the fon\'t size!  The auto-help font size is the biggest, but the information font is almost as big, as well as the buy and radio menu fonts.  Please, please, please, put in a cvar that lets you reduce the font size.  That\'s the only *major* gripe I have with 1.6, I could get used to the shield, plus the shield will probably be tweaked.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIn short, when you go higher in resolution, you expect fonts to become smaller so you get more "screen real estate" but its the complete opposite with CS 1.6, please fix this.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
