(91972, 12660, 1005, 100152, 1072936800, '', 'the rumor is that the bots were removed to simplify the program and make it easier to transfer on the steam network, they were trying to lighten the load by removing non-essential stuff. The offline content is being worked on right now, they put it on the backburner because they had to get steam out before the release of HL2.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
