(95249, 12660, 1005, 100805, 1072936800, 'I\'d rather have the bots included and the shield done away with...', 'I\'d rather have the bots included and the shield done away with...\n\n\n\neven though the bots system would account for a much larger size in the final 1.6 than just the riot shield by itself, I\'m just saying that the riot shield isn\'t as fun because it can\'t shoot back at you or run around weapon-less at your command.\n\n\n\nLOL...knife-wielding bots are sweet for sniper practice.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
