(91210, 12899, 1005, 100871, 1072936800, '', 'If you don\'t like the grey skin. you can download a skin from here (http://steamskinners.jbdubbs.com/) then use your custom fonts', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(91220, 12899, 1005, 100869, 1072936800, '', 'My point being, I\'d like to use the default theme with my custom fonts, but it just doesn\'t seem to want to work []\n\n\n\nNone of the steam skins really caught my eye :/', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(91238, 12899, 1005, 100871, 1072936800, '', 'You could create a folder in your skins folder called "green" or something and copy the needed files from the normal steam skin into that folder, then use that skin and customize it', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(91304, 12899, 1005, 100606, 1072936800, '', 'none of those font changes seem to effect the actual in-game scoreboard font. That\'s what\'s annoying me the most. Please tell me if and how to change the horrid font for the scoreboard! I run CS in 800x600 and need to get that font size much smaller and unbolded. Basically, I want the 1.5 font back exactly for the scoreboard.\n\n\n\nThanks for any help you can provide.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(91339, 12899, 1005, 100871, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Lovok \n\nnone of those font changes seem to effect the actual in-game scoreboard font. That\'s what\'s annoying me the most. Please tell me if and how to change the horrid font for the scoreboard! I run CS in 800x600 and need to get that font size much smaller and unbolded. Basically, I want the 1.5 font back exactly for the scoreboard.\n\n\n\nThanks for any help you can provide. \n\nOpen your trackerscheme.res file (notepad will do fine for that, or wordpad)\n\nThen go to line 255 or search for "EngineFont" (with quotes)\n\nAll those instances of Verdana Bold can be changed to anything you want, but find your respected y-resolution and edit that one\n\nThe 1.5 scoreboard used Arial', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(91410, 12899, 1005, 100869, 1072936800, '', 'vh1: you seem to know about editing the TrackerScheme.res file, do you have a guide detailing which setting in the TrackerScheme.res you can change to edit a specific ingame font?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(91590, 12899, 1005, 100867, 1072936800, '', 'I will post my settings later one. I\'ve tried them and they really are very nice. And yes, you can use it on the default skin, i\'ve explained it in the first post:\n\n"Update: If you don\'t want to use the gray skin (I just use it to keep the original font sizes) you can always use the x:\\steam\\resource\\Trackerscheme.res which will edit the fonts for the default steam skin."\n\n\n\nI\'ll also post a meaning for each instance of fonts later on today (gotta go to college heh)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(91598, 12899, 1005, 100869, 1072936800, '', 'I tried editing the default Trackerscheme.res, which didn\'t work for some reason.\n\n\n\n\n\nBut cheers for your help []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(92032, 12899, 1005, 100606, 1072936800, '', 'Well, I\'ve edited my trackerscheme.res file significantly. Yes, I have the correct one. I chaged everything under "//////FONT/////" to Arial, no dropshadow, Tall 12. Everything was changed the way I wanted it to except the in-game scoreboard which is still Verdana Bold with Dropshadow and is way too big. I don\'t know what else to do.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(92591, 12899, 1005, 100867, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Lovok \n\n\nWell, I\'ve edited my trackerscheme.res file significantly. Yes, I have the correct one. I chaged everything under "//////FONT/////" to Arial, no dropshadow, Tall 12. Everything was changed the way I wanted it to except the in-game scoreboard which is still Verdana Bold with Dropshadow and is way too big. I don\'t know what else to do.  \n\n\n\n\n\nThat\'s about the only thing you cannot change...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(92656, 12899, 1005, 100738, 1072936800, '', 'i edited the file so i get this !!! 1024 x 768 ONLY !!!\n\n\n\n\n\nedited:\n\n\nhttp://members.lycos.nl/willyjanpri.../steam_1024.JPG (http://members.lycos.nl/willyjanprijs1/cs1.6/steam_1024.JPG)\n\n\n\n\n\norigional:\n\n\nhttp://members.lycos.nl/willyjanpri...e_dust2_1.6.JPG (http://members.lycos.nl/willyjanprijs1/cs1.6/de_dust2_1.6.JPG)\n\n\n\n\n\nyou can download the files here steam_1024.zip:\n\n\nhttp://members.lycos.nl/willyjanprijs1/cs1.6/ (http://members.lycos.nl/willyjanprijs1/cs1.6/)\n\n\n\n\n\ndownload if you want to (ps. it is a skin).\n\n\n\n\n\nStart steam go to settings and select as skin GREEN', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(92865, 12899, 1005, 100867, 1072936800, '', 'I edited the first post with a new Tutorial.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
