(93212, 12899, 1005, 100872, 1072936800, '', 'Could someone please give a description of what can be changed in TrackerScheme.res, like go down in order of the FONTS list.\n\n\n\n\n\n"Default" - changes ?\n\n\n"DefaultUnderline" - changes ?\n\n\n"DefaultSmall" - changes ?\n\n\n"DefaultVerySmall" - changes ?\n\n\n"MenuLarge" - changes ?\n\n\n"Marlett" - changes ?\n\n\n"EngineFont" - changes ?\n\n\n"CreditsFont" - changes ?\n\n\n"Legacy_CreditsFont" - changes ?\n\n\n\n\n\nIf anyone has time to post exactly what each changes would help a lot.\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(93255, 12899, 1005, 100867, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by RandomJester \n\n\nCould someone please give a description of what can be changed in TrackerScheme.res, like go down in order of the FONTS list.\n\n\n\n\n\n"Default" - changes ?\n\n\n"DefaultUnderline" - changes ?\n\n\n"DefaultSmall" - changes ?\n\n\n"DefaultVerySmall" - changes ?\n\n\n"MenuLarge" - changes ?\n\n\n"Marlett" - changes ?\n\n\n"EngineFont" - changes ?\n\n\n"CreditsFont" - changes ?\n\n\n"Legacy_CreditsFont" - changes ?\n\n\n\n\n\nIf anyone has time to post exactly what each changes would help a lot.\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks.  \n\n\n\n\n\ndude it\'s in the FIRST POST! @_@;;;;;', '127.0.0.1', 1),
