(96909, 14270, 1013, 101006, 1072936800, 'Not sure I agree', 'You say you cannot setup new accounts, but I did and I can continually logon through this account; it is only my original account that cannot logon - it claims it doesn\'t exist.\n\n\nYou cannot create a new account with the SAME email address as the non-working one, sure, but if you use a different email it seems to create ok.\n\n\n\n\n\nWhen I logon with the new account details it asks me for my cd-key when I try play a game, so I reckon as long as I don\'t enter it in there, I shouldn\'t have 2 accounts using the same cd-key and it shouldn\'t get blocked, saving the catastrophe of sending an email to tech support.\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks for your post, at least someone is trying to help, unlike the owners of this forum (hint hint).\n\n\n\n\n\nSplattoon', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(96932, 14270, 1013, 100999, 1072936800, '', 'Yeah thats what i meant, thx for the clarification. What basically i\'ve been hearing nonstop is people not being able to log in, so they panic and create another acccount with the same email address but use the same cd key and wonder why it got disabled...sigh...glad some people out there are enjoying this postage...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(UPDATE- STEAM VERIFICATION SERVERS ARE STILL DOWN...SO STOP POSTING ABOUT HOW YOU CAN\'T LOG ON!!!)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
