(96971, 14270, 1013, 100999, 1072936800, 'Go with a fresh one!!', 'If you already have steam installed and it\'s converted a few of your files, you can try to download it through steam although i wouldn\'t recommend it. (In fact you cant right now as far as i know cuz the master server is down) I would uninstall your current installation of steam and download the installer with all of the cache files, the 700 mb one. They released the full installer today so this way you won\'t have to deal with the irritating process of downloading and installing each cache package and from my experience now with the full installation, it runs smooth as silk...at least until they shut down the master servers...heheh....', '127.0.0.1', 1),
