(97252, 14270, 1013, 100999, 1072936800, 'Full means Full', 'Yes when I say it is the full install, I mean it is the full install it will have all of the cache file to be used so you should have no prob. Also, when uninstalling your previuos installation of steam,just do the normal uninstall not the custom or full becuase this will keep your account and custom files installations handy so you don\'t have to make them again.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(97260, 14270, 1013, 101009, 1072936800, '', 'Ok Im getting many different errors with steam, and I don\'t really understand what everyone else is saying.\n\n\n\n\n\nAnways i\'ve been continuously trying to get onto steam for the past 2 hours, but I have been unsuccesful.  I can\'t get on because of one or more of these reasons:\n\n\n\n\n\nA.  I get the master authentication server error (I figured out whats wrong with that.)\n\n\n\n\n\nB.  It says my account which I created yesterday, does not exist, or my password is incorrect, but I entered my password multiple times, correctly, but it still doesn\'t work.\n\n\n\n\n\nC.  If I\'m able to get onto steam, I click a server, and it freezes.\n\n\n\n\n\nD.  The most annoying one is if I click on a server, and It goes through, it tells me something about how its looking for 350 MB to install counter-strike again, when I\'m well aware that I have plenty of space.  I click the install button, but it does nothing.\n\n\n\n\n\nOk I know these were probably answered somewhere but can anyone help me with reasons C and D?  I would appreciate it.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(97278, 14270, 1013, 100999, 1072936800, 'In Regards To B,C,and D', 'Problems B and C have to do with their verification servers being down. When those servers go down, steam treats your account like it doesn\'t exist so the only thing you can do is to wait for it to go back up. As for joining a game and having it freeze, that means the master server went down (again) and you\'ll just have to wait for that to get back up. Remember the main posting of this thread should adress most of these issues. Hope this helps!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(98096, 14540, 1013, 101062, 1072936800, 'GJ Steam, Bad Job Half-Life', 'I was frustrated cause Steam was slow and I couldnt get it to work but I found out that i had a corrupted Steam, SO JUST GET STEAM FROM FILEPLANET THE OTHERS DONT WORK. Anyways, Steam is really good, but 1.6 is terrible. And im not one of those sheild/weapon complainers, I mean 1.6 sucks, it feels like I am playing an f\'in cartoon. CS 1.5 was so much more realistic, 1.6 is so bad it feels like I am playing another game. My idea:\n\n\n\n1. Keep Steam.\n\n2. Bring back 1.5 and add sheild and rifles to it.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
