(112621, 17100, 1013, 101508, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Supra_Soldier \n\n\nBut will we ever see CZ??? I won\'t my bots back, and frankly i dont see teh point of getting rod of them, its not like they were hearting anything \n\n\n\n\n\nThey were in the beta so that they could test them out before the release in Condition Zero.\n\n\n\n\n\nThey were never intended to be permanent without CZ.\n\n\n\n\n\nAnd who knows if we\'ll ever see it? Hopefully it won\'t turn into another Daikatana.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
