(119064, 18252, 1013, 101718, 1072936800, 'Net_sendpacketerror: WSAEINTR', 'Recently when I am playing 1.6, for no reason at all, I\'ll get the following error \n\nNet_sendpacketerror: WSAEINTR \n\nThis will cause steam to crash and close. \n\nI did a metacrawler search for the error, and came to 2 sites that both said I was to " Uninstal the QOS software from ur lan connection and ur internet connection" considering I saw the same fix from different people on 2 different sites, I figured to try it, since the steam forums werent helping any. unintsall went fine. I hop back on counter-strike 1.6, play 3 maps, near the end of the 3rd map, im running with my knife out, and bam I get the same \n\nNet_sendpacketerror: WSAEINTR \n\nUgh Please help \n\nThis is one fo the websites. \n\nhttp://www.techfest.com/wwwboard/messages/663.shtml (http://www.techfest.com/wwwboard/messages/663.shtml)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
