(121078, 18596, 1005, 101786, 1072936800, 'Bots Is Coming To Cs 1.6', 'As many of you have noticed, the CS Bot was removed from the non-beta release of Counter-Strike 1.6. \n\n\n\nHowever, this is not a permanent situation. The bots will be back. \n\n\n\nDue to the popularity of the Official Counter-Strike Bot, Valve and Turtle Rock Studios have been hard at work on a major enhancement involving them, which will be announced soon. \n\n\n\nThe Official Counter-Strike Bots have learned a lot during their time away. We think you\'ll have even more fun with them when they return. \n\n\n\n\n\nhttp://www.turtlerockstudios.com/forums/csbot. (http://www.turtlerockstudios.com/forums/csbot.)\n\n\n\n\n\nSO DON\'T WORRY, ITS JUST TAKING ITS TIME NOW.\n\nHope You Have Patients Waiting\n\n\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nKey features of the Official Counter-Strike Bot include:\n\n\n\nSelectable difficulty levels that provide a fun and exciting experience to everyone from first-time \n\ngame players to seasoned veterans of the Counter-Strike online community. \n\nAn automated learning system that allows the bots to play on almost any map without requiring\n\nhuman intervention. \n\nExtremely realistic and human-like behavior, resulting in opponents that feel "real" - a subtle,\n\nyet critical prerequisite for creating an exciting gaming experience.\n\n\n\nA unique "navigation mesh" system that provides a more robust representation of the\n\n"walkable" areas of the environment than is possible with traditional waypoints. \n\nComplex 3D navigation: Bots smoothly navigate the Counter-Strike world, jumping up on ledges, climbing ladders, crawling through ducts, breaking through windows, opening doors, and even \n\njumping down from higher levels to surprise their enemies. \n\nTeam tactics and cooperation. Terrorists work together to plant and guard the bomb, while \n\nCounter-Terrorists radio enemy locations and request backup. Bots also respond to radio \n\ncommands issued by human players. \n\nThe ability to play all of the Counter-Strike scenarios: Plant the Bomb, Rescue the Hostages, \n\nEscort the VIP, as well as good \'ol "deathmatch". \n\nProficiency with the full Counter-Strike arsenal, including Smoke, Flashbang, and HE Grenades, knives, and all weapons. In addition, the bots understand how to use different classes of weapons to good effect (ie: knives vs. pistols vs. shotguns vs. rifles vs. sniper rifles)\n\n\n\nA human-like attention system: Bots can only see and hear what a real player would in the same\n\nsituation . They check corners and hiding spots, "lead" their aim around corners, investigate noises, \n\nand in general act on incomplete information. This results in bots that can be surprised and even panic. \n\nA visual and auditory pipeline that delays incoming stimuli to simulate human reaction times. \n\nSmooth and realistically imperfect weapon aiming, based on each bot\'s individual skill level.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(121176, 18596, 1005, 101786, 1072936800, 'TIME TO WAIT.', 'IT WILL BE RELEASED IN A FEW MONTHS OR SO,COULD BE EARLIER', '127.0.0.1', 1),
