(511504, 18596, 1005, 101793, 1072936800, 'Bots Is Coming To Cs 1.6', 'And where did you read this?\n\nquote:Originally posted by PodBot Man \n\n[B]As many of you have noticed, the CS Bot was removed from the non-beta release of Counter-Strike 1.6. \n\n\n\nHowever, this is not a permanent situation. The bots will be back. \n\n\n\nDue to the popularity of the Official Counter-Strike Bot, Valve and Turtle Rock Studios have been hard at work on a major enhancement involving them, which will be announced soon. \n\n\n\nThe Official Counter-Strike Bots have learned a lot during their time away. We think you\'ll have even more fun with them when they return. \n\n\n\n\n\nhttp://www.turtlerockstudios.com/forums/csbot (http://www.turtlerockstudios.com/forums/csbot)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
