(512752, 18596, 1005, 100566, 1072936800, '', 'quote:The bots will not be coming back to 1.6. \n\n\n\nThe bots are now part of CZ. That means you\'ll have to purchase CZ to play with the bots. \n\n\n\nThat said, we have substantially improved them, and will continue to enhance them through Steam, so if you enjoyed the bots in the beta, you\'ll really like the new bots in CZ. \n\n\n\n-Mike\n\n\n\n- Thanks for posting everyone an old post back when it wasn\'t announced that the bots were gonna be in CZ only.\n\n\n\nhttp://www.turtlerockstudios.com/fo...topic.php?t=110 (http://www.turtlerockstudios.com/forums/csbot/viewtopic.php?t=110) - 5th post down.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
