(127150, 18963, 1013, 101890, 1072936800, '', 'Ok, i could go get a CD-key cracker, hell I could write one myself, but then I would be screwing someone else. And thats just not cool.\n\n\n\nBut alls well that ends well, I have a friend that works at EB, hes going to write down a CD-key off of one of the copies of HL they got that didn\'t work. That way I get a valid, legal, cd-key, and no one gets screwed.\n\n\n\nThanks Valve, you\'ve been a big help :P', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(123783, 19075, 1013, 101901, 1072936800, 'Email activation', 'It might be an idea to have some kind of email activation to confirm people\'s email addresses are real. It would stop a lot of misuse by people pretending to be valve employees online. As a  test I successfully used Doug\'s email address and name. Anyone could believe I am him and I could cause a lot of damage with false information. It needs sorting asap.\n\n\n\nhttp://www.halflife2.net/images/logged.jpg (http://www.halflife2.net/images/logged.jpg)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
