(124380, 19149, 1005, 100513, 1072936800, '', 'Yes i do, i want custom sprays in color.\n\n\n\n\n\nIf fact i want to know how to creat them. I did a spray will a program called wally and its a  *.wad file.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWhat do i do now?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(124389, 19149, 1005, 101914, 1072936800, '', 'Using the half life decal wizard with Wally should produce a file called pldecal.wad. Put this in the cstrike dir. This should work unless logo handling has changed.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(124400, 19149, 1005, 100513, 1072936800, '', 'i tried replacing the padical wad and a file called custom but it didn\'t work', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(124450, 19149, 1005, 101915, 1072936800, '', 'making a skin is a whole other story it involves like  3 programs and time , you need photoshop and wally and some other prog.\n\n\n\n\n\ninstallin them is a different story you name it "PLDECAL.WAD" put it  where askujin saiid to \n\n\n\n\n\nif u want sprays go to edit-strike.nl  or something its like \n\n\n\n\n\ncrowley is an idiot he is a total nub he is ruining the forums with bad advice', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(124857, 19149, 1005, 101914, 1072936800, '', 'No, you are wrong, first of all, nobody has mentioned skins except you. \n\n\nThe program "Wally" has a half life custom decal wizard which makes the pldecal.wad file. I mentioned nothing about making skins and neither did anyone else. The person who made this thread already has Wally and gives the impression that he knows how to use it with previous versions of CS.\n\n\n\n\n\nIs this the "bad advice" that you complained about?\n\n\n\n\n\nCatch_ME, try editing the origional 1.5 pldecal file with the Wally logo wizard and then copying it over to the Steam cstrike folder. You should also make it read only once it is there or cs is liable to overwrite it. Also, make sure that the filename within the pldecal file is "{LOGO", without the quotes. The Wally decal wizard should do this on its own though.\n\n\nI actually havent tried making a custom decal for 1.6 yet, Ill get right on it and write something a bit more detailed in a bit.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nActually, the thread\'s author is nowhere to be found. I meant Catch_ME.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(124886, 19149, 1005, 101916, 1072936800, 'Sprays', 'Directions for Counter-Strike Steam 1.6 Beta \n\n\nAfter Downloading Decal converter and making your .wad file. (see above) \n\n\n\n\n\nGoto my computer C:/ProgramFiles/Steam/SteamApps/Counter-Strike/cstrike . \n\n\n\n\n\nOnce you have that folder open you need to delete these files custom.hbk,  and the pldecal.wad file. \n\n\n\n\n\nThen go to the logos folder in that window and delete all the files in that folder but leave the folder. \n\n\n\n\n\nThen you can make your pldecal.wad file, mark it read only and put it into the cstrike folder. \n\n\n\n\n\nTHE END', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(124907, 19149, 1005, 101914, 1072936800, '', 'Thanks, I wouldn\'t have deleted what is in the logos folder, would have taken me forever.\n\n\nM_Prime and others, you can get Decal Converter here:\n\n\nhttp://www.fileplanet.com/files/60000/64268.shtml (http://www.fileplanet.com/files/60000/64268.shtml)\n\n\nI still preffer Wally though.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(125000, 19149, 1005, 100513, 1072936800, '', 'Wow cool.\n\n\n\n\n\nWell i\'ll try it now.\n\n\n\n\n\nEDIT: Should i actually see it on my CS options?\n\n\n\n\n\nEDIT2: Ok i dont see it in my options at all', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(125166, 19149, 1005, 101917, 1072936800, '', 'If you are still having problems go here (http://cscustom.fr.st/) where you can get a copy of decal convertor. It is really quick and simple to use and will have a custom spray running in no time. Make sure you  set your default game folder for decals as C:\\Program Files\\Steam\\SteamApps\\your e-mail\\counter-strike\\cstrike and that the wad file you make isn\'t to large, I find if they are to large they tend not to work. (nothing more then about 14kb.) You will find that any spray you make will not show straight away because you need to allow the server to upload the decal first, it should work after 3 or 4 sprays. The great thing about this program is that there is no need for any other graphics program, you just choose your picture, resize it and make the decal, is that simple. Also you will not see your spray in your CS options, I am not sure if it is the same with 1.6 but in 1.5 if were to go into your game options you would lose your custom spray and it would be replaced with the default lambda spray.\n\n__________________\n\nWant great Counter Strike? Come pay us a visit at The Asylum 66.208.107.38:27015\n\n\n\n\n\nhttp://sga.recongamer.com', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(125276, 19149, 1005, 101918, 1072936800, '', 'i dont know about 1.6 but in 1.5 it would not show in the options and in fact would be overwritten as soon as you entered the options. however if you simply copied the pldcal.wad to your cstrike folder it would automatically be used whenever you spray\n\n__________________\n\nusing something steampowered will inevitably make you sweat', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(125311, 19149, 1005, 101919, 1072936800, '', 'To prevent it being overwritten, make pldecal.wad read-only.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(124828, 19261, 1005, 101933, 1072936800, 'Low-End Computer users and 3dFx card fixes!', 'Yes, I have a lowend computer, 300mhz Celeron, Voodoo3 2000, and 384mb memory. I got CS 1.6 Work pretty good. The only thing is that I can\'t play clan matches no more, because have a fps of 15 in de_aztec. My FPS is now 30-50, at it\'s low, 15. I can play dust1 & 2 properly, and prodigy runs well too.\n\n\n\n\n\nNow I want to tell you what I did. First time I opened CS 1.6, I noticed that MiniGL drivers aren\'t usable anymore. So I knew I have to tweak a bit to get it work. First thing was that I installed WickedGL FULL version, 3.0. Then, put opengl32.dll from C:\\Prog Files\\Wicked\\ to C:\\Windows\\System and overwrited the old file, (I suggest a backup copy) then I put my WickedGl minidriver to C:\\Games\\Steam\\SteamApps\\myemail@provider.com\\counter-strike\\gldrv\\ And overwrited the old file. Then I copied the hole **** (GLDRV folder) in C:\\Games\\Steam\\SteamApps\\myemail@provider.com\\gldrv. Then, opened Steam > Games > rightclick on Counter-Strike > properties > launch options > write there ��gldrv 3dfxgl.dll� without ��.\n\n\n\n\n\nNow I had a working CS with opengl. So, that\'s not all. Put resolution to 640x480, texture depth to 16bit, smokesprites to medium, max smokepuffs to 1 and max shells to 1. I wasn\'t still happy and I put corpsestay to 1 (1= one second, 0 = corpses stay). FPS didn\'t still satisfy me. So I Rebooted, put bios, overclocked my Celeron 300mhz to 374mhz (4.5 x 83mhz) and my computer started. So Now my CS runs �fine� and I can play it barely! If you want more fps, you should open your console, and write �gl_texturemode gl_nearest� without �� and textures come ugly, but fps raises. You can also write �gl_texturemode gl_linear� without �� but your fps won\'t raise so much, but walls are not awful big pixels then. To reset gl_texturemode, change server or quit CS. It will automatically reset gl_texturemode to default.\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks for listening, I Hope that I have helped 3dfx users. If you want to know where to get WickedGL 3.0, Private message me.\n\n\n\n\n\nAnd you should NEVER overclock your CPU with fsb like 83mhz, because it can **** up your hdd, pci and agp cards, but I was desperate. Usually you only have to format your drives if you fuc]{ those things up.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
