(132387, 20294, 1005, 101914, 1072936800, '', 'Yes, old (1.5) player models have different animations. The worst one: when they die, they dont fall down, instead they tread water as if they were swimming in the air. This gets very confusing if one live person is lurking among the dead people.\n\n\n\n\n\nI would advise that you all extract the p_ models into a extra folder within the models folder. Valve might allow custom p_ models in the future and having all the matching p_ models handy would make things a lot easier when you want them back.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
