(132562, 20294, 1005, 101914, 1072936800, 'OMG', 'In the ....Steam\\SteamApps\\email@yourserviceprovider.com\\counter-strike\\cstrike\\ dir make a folder called maps and put all CUSTOM maps into this. DO NOT put any of the old default maps in because some will be inconsistant with the new versions.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
