(135620, 21046, 1005, 102094, 1072936800, '', 'quote: A Zombie: \n\n\n\n\n\nHave you been under a rock or something?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYes, I\'ve actually been under a rock...\n\n\n\n\n\nWhat is steam?  I don\'t know because I\'ve been under a rock.\n\n\n\n\n\nWhere did I find this software?  I don\'t know because I\'ve been under a rock.\n\n\n\n\n\nIs WON going down soon? I don\'t know because I\'ve been under a rock.\n\n\n\n\n\nDoes having this help people prepare for when WON.net does go down? I don\'t know because I\'ve been under a rock.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThink about it for a second... would I take the time to list this and post all of this information if I wasn\'t at least informed on the current situation with 1.5,1.6, and the WON network?\n\n\n\n\n\nI\'ve been playing since CS Beta 5.2, I know this community, I know this game, I know how these updates work.\n\n\n\n\n\nI am not afraid of change, I am afraid that Steam is going to ruin CS b/c they want people to use HL2 instead anyways, which = more $$$ for ValvE.  Hey, they\'re a business -- they\'ve got to do whats best for them.\n\n\n\n\n\nBut I am a CS enthusiast, so I am doing whats best for me, and the other 100,000 CS "purists" out there that feel ValvE is getting lazy.\n\n\n\n\n\nMaybe you should give me a little more credit, and not treat me like a retard, seeing as how I just made a f|_|ck1ng breakthrough here as far as WON authing goes\n\n__________________\n\nhttp://www.**************/easyrhinohl/\n\n\n\n\n\nUSE 1.5 WITHOUT WON!!!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
