(266571, 21578, 1013, 102113, 1072936800, 'Steam has problems drop steam untill fixed', 'Liston up. if it wort for Cal being 1.6 only I would have droped 1.6 in a heart beat.\n\n\nI have come to the concluesen that steam has eerrors that they have to fix. Why not shut the damn thing down and let Cal go back to 1.5? I\'m getting sick and tired of these errors...\n\n\n\n\n\nSteam with all these complants i would shut down the server in a heart beat. but you guys are being stubberen.\n\n\n\n\n\nSmarten up and before you release **** make sure you fixed out all the bugs... and you call your selfs perfessionals.\n\n\n\n\n\nTo you guys it\'s like chrimass you wanna open up the present so bad you open it up before your suppose to! Don\'t rush **** cause in the end there\'s so many problems.\n\n\n\n\n\nYour fault that there\'s problems..\n\n\nYour fault that people are complaning..\n\n\nYour falut that Cal went to 1.6...\n\n\nYour fault that LAN does not work ****....\n\n\nYour fault I posted this damn forsaken post!\n\n__________________\n\nFoD| Private CS 1.6 Server\n\n\n\n\n\nContact me at fodshadowfax@hotmail.com to join fod.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(268837, 21578, 1013, 102103, 1072936800, '', 'I\'ve seen several "major" updates to Steam go by, but there have been no soulution to the major NAT problem yet. The fact that you can\'t play with an other ip-address than the gameserver is sending for authentication, is putting a lot of admins out of their own servers. \n\n\nCome on Valve! Give us an solution NOW! That would be a small reward for all the hours we have put into ceeping your CS the no. 1 online game.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
