(141491, 21987, 1013, 102124, 1072936800, 'same', 'yep, same issues!  I was hoping that this patch would actually fix the issue i\'m having with steam ... first time i played it went fine ... now, it takes over 5 minutes to enter a game (and yes i followed the advice of others and ran a defrag - didnt help).  Whenever i try to run a game it just sits there trying to connect for ever until i finally get so bored that i give up.  Though occassionally (very rare) i do actually get into a game.\n\n\n\n\n\nand now this update has completely messed things up with these #Steam labels.\n\n\n\n\n\n[]  Very unhappy and losing faith quickly.  Not sure I want to shell out the cash for HL2 if I\'m gonna have these types of issues so often.  One of the best things about HL and its mods were the ability to get into a game as fast as you could.  But now Steam has not only killed that but is worse than any other multi-player game i have played when it comes to joining a game.\n\n\n\n\n\n[]', '127.0.0.1', 1),
