(149291, 23258, 1013, 102153, 1072936800, 'Good news for all gamers ?', 'ok ive worked out what can be done to make everyone happy.\n\n\n\n\n\nwe can update 1.5 to 1.6-nosteam & the current 1.6 will become or stay 1.6-steam\n\n\n\n\n\nThis means steam lovers can use steam with no changes and valve can carry on testing steam ready for HL2\n\n\n\n\n\nFor 1.6-nosteam it will just take a simple update to hlds servers to remove the won auth.\n\n\n\n\n\noff course this will mean 1.6-nosteam will not be able to use VAC but as will all know there are many anti cheat system around that can do as good a job if not better. This will not cost valve any real money + it will give players that can\'t use steam somewhere to play and them that wish not to use steam.\n\n\n\n\n\nI know this is not a perfect solution , but it would save some face at valve and id say make 99% of gamers happy.\n\n\n\n\n\nok what do u recon, every body happy ???\n\n__________________\n\nOp^m0nkEy', '127.0.0.1', 1),
