(149387, 23258, 1013, 102155, 1072936800, '', 'Yeah most people dont like using steam because it messes with people\'s computers. Steam is not very reliable and it is not worth using, so they should make a mod version of 1.6 for people who dont like to use steam and people who like steam can keep it but i bet there is no one who likes steam. Some people like to use other programs to connect to servers like gamespy, allseeing eye and hlsw because it is an easy way to connect rather than waiting for steam to load. I think that monkey is right there should be a mod version of 1.6 for nosteam infact i dont think that there should be steam at all! Steam is just another compaq pc. I say  make a mod version for all Counter Strike lovers.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
