(149867, 23258, 1013, 102158, 1072936800, '', 'This is amazing, \n\n\n\n\n\nThis thread sounds just like one I read the last time there was a version change in CS, new version sucks whine whine, this sucks that sucks... leave it alone , let us keep what we have. we like bunnyhopping...\n\n\n\n\n\nThen they ironed out pretty much all the problems and the whiners got used to the new version, the very very few that didn\'t still run old servers & _some_ people play them.   But really, How many old version servers can you find? 10?  50?  even if there\'s 200, thats compared to 50,000 + CS 1.5 servers, I think you\'ll get used to 1.6 AND Steam.\n\n\n\n\n\nIf you will really truly never be happy playing 1.6, I suggest you do one of two things, \n\n\nOne is to find another game...\n\n\nThe other is to do all the work involved in setting up a 1.5 server and learning how to run it THEN figuring out how to make it work without WON and valve id\'s, I suspect that that part WILL piss off Valve so I\'d keep my head low if I were you...\n\n\n\n\n\nGood luck, the rest of us are moving forward.\n\n\n\n\n\nJust as an aside, \n\n\n   I\'m personally pretty sure that all the problems I\'ve had with steam since Valve released the update that fixed the AMD problem are more related to the DDOS attacks on the network and content servers than anything Valve has done wrong...\n\n\nPerhaps if the criminals doing the DDOSs would devote their time and obviously not inconsiderable expertise to CREATING something (perhaps a game to replace HL/CS???) instead of trying to stop the flow of progress then we could all just get on with our lives and our games...\n\n\n\n\n\nSadly, It seems that they are just not that smart....', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(149296, 23261, 1013, 102159, 1072936800, 'Customising the Game loading screens', 'What you need to do is slice an image into 12  .tga files. and name them accordingly as per the ones in my zip.\n\n\n\nI made a loading screen for the TFC side of steam and the zip is on my homepage on the Steam skins page.\n\n\n\nYou can see the image sizes in the zip if you want to make your own screens. \n\n\n\nJust put the images into a folder called "resource" under whichever mod you play.\n\n\n\nhere is a pic of my loading screen and skin\n\n\n\nhttp://members.sniffout.com/zoff/cu...roundflexv3.jpg (http://members.sniffout.com/zoff/customize/othimg/steambackgroundflexv3.jpg)\n\n\n\nMore screens here on my Steam section\n\n\n\nhttp://members.sniffout.com/zoff/customize/steam.htm (http://members.sniffout.com/zoff/customize/steam.htm)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHomepage http://members.sniffout.com/zoff/ (http://members.sniffout.com/zoff/)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAnyone else want to host it feel free', '127.0.0.1', 1),
