(157058, 24394, 1013, 101972, 1072936800, 'KEEP YOUR FAVES!!!', 'FOUND ANOTHER SOLOUTION WITH NO DELETING!!!\n\n\n\n\n\nIf you can still get your fave servers up on dektop try to connect to one, wait until it gets to verifying resources and cancel.\n\n\n\n\n\nYou should now get all ya servers refreshed!\n\n\n\n\n\nSWEEEEET!\n\n[]Attachment: stare at the dot and move ya head back and forth.gif (attachment.php?s=9767bc7b19abc3e00a38e1d79732560e&postid=157058)\n\nThis has been downloaded 2331 time(s).\n\n__________________\n\nKingDom1606\n\n\n*============================*\n\n\nI..................Windows 2000..............I\n\n\nI...............AMD Duron 1.3GHz...........I\n\n\nI..................128MbSDRAM...............I\n\n\nI...............Nvidia TNT2 64pro............I\n\n\nI...................40 Gb HDD..................I\n\n\nI....................52x CD-R...................I\n\n\nI..............BT Voyager 100 ADSL........I\n\n\nI.............Creative Soundblaster.........I\n\n\n:+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++:', '127.0.0.1', 1),
