(165119, 25873, 1013, 102229, 1072936800, 'Freezing at "establishing network connection" or "validating resources"', 'Ok, I\'ve basically been able to get steam to work for about THREE DAYS and that was over 2 weeks ago. I\'ve done a bunch of reinstalling after encountering newer issues but now I\'m back to the pirmary problem:\n\n\nSteam never goes past establishing network connections, and if it does, then it gets stuck on the validating resources. \n\n\n\n\n\nIt may be that my connection is weird at my college, they may have messed with the firewall or something, but I can never fully connect into a game anymore. If and when it does get past the network connections part, it will consistently do it and do it pretty fast, yet will get stuck then on the validating resources. \n\n\n\n\n\nPresently however, it will not get past the network connections message even though I am connecting to servers with 25 pings.\n\n\n\n\n\nAnyone know whats up?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
