(196835, 30673, 1013, 102342, 1072936800, '', 'first of all, thx to sherman, i never thought that one of the valve guy�s will answer my question.\n\n\n\n\n\nok, my cs is working now!\n\n\n\n\n\nif i installed it with the full_install.exe the problem occurs.\n\n\nif i install it completely from the internet, its running.\n\n\n\n\n\npardon my english too! :-)\n\n\n\n\n\nand because someone is reading it\n\n\n\n\n\nfix the problem with spec_menu 0 \n\n\nsame with the long waitingtimes between the mapchanges!\n\n\n\n\n\non our server the shild is not allowed! only for ur information\n\n\nits stupid to jump like apes in front of each other!\n\n\nshild destroys cs!\n\n\n\n\n\nthx and bye!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(194359, 30892, 1013, 100027, 1072936800, 'FIX: SteamProcessCall(WaitforAppReadytoLaunch) error 15:Cache read failure', 'The current workaround for this is to\n\n\n\n- right click the game w/ the problem in the Games window\n\n- get Properties\n\n- set Do Not Keep This App Up to Date (if not already)\n\n- click Delete Local Game Content\n\n- OK\n\n- double-click the game and hit OK\n\n\n\nIt will download the game content again but the bug won\'t happen.\n\n\n\nWe\'re working on getting a fix for this that doesn\'t require downloading content again.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(197631, 30892, 1013, 100349, 1072936800, '', 'Check out info on the Oct. 31 patch.  Should help with this problem!\n\n\n\n/index.php?area=news (/index.php?area=news)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
