(196991, 31278, 1005, 102255, 1072936800, '', 'Please post system specs, console log, error log or anything else that might help us identify the problem.\n\n__________________\n\nSYSTEM SPECS\n\n__________________\n\n\n\nOS: MS Windows XP Pro SP1\n\nHDs: 120 GB (NTFS) & 40 GB (FAT32)\n\nCPU: Intel Pentium 4 @ 2.53 GHz\n\nGPU: GeForce4 Ti 4600 128 MB (45.23 Drivers)\n\nPRAM: 1 GB DDRAM \n\nVMEM: 3.4 GB\n\nConnection: Comcast Cable (600/80 Kbps)\n\nSettings:\n\n-OpenGL w/VSync, AA, AF and TS Off\n\n-1280x1024 resolution\n\n-32-bit color\n\n\n\nProud Co-Founder of the m00c Patrol.\n\n66.208.104.166:27015 - KDB pub\n\n69.56.171.228:27015 - S_c_T pub\n\n208.184.33.208:27015 - team.cH pub', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(197074, 31278, 1005, 102344, 1072936800, '', 'i get the same problem, i\'m guessing it\'s just the speed of the system, or possibly a combination of that and lag, although my dsl gets me 50 or better ping on any server i play on.\n\n\n\nmy loads alway fail, essentially. here are my specs:\n\n\n\n-p4 1.7 ghz\n\n-gef4 ti 4600 128mb\n\n-256mb rdram (ya, low)\n\n-win xp pro\n\n-plenty of free hd space (multiple gb)\n\n-don\'t run anything but possibly winamp/aim while playing', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(197097, 31278, 1005, 102345, 1072936800, '', 'A lot of people are having the same problem. Here are my specs if it helps any..\n\n\n\nAthon 1800XP\n\nRadeon 9700 Pro\n\n512 pc2400 ddr ram\n\nsoyo dragon plus mobo\n\nsblive value\n\nWinXP pro', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(197159, 31278, 1005, 102255, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by InSOmnlaC \n\nA lot of people are having the same problem. Here are my specs if it helps any..\n\n\n\nAthon 1800XP\n\nRadeon 9700 Pro\n\n512 pc2400 ddr ram\n\nsoyo dragon plus mobo\n\nsblive value\n\nWinXP pro  \n\n\n\nWhat is soyo dragon plus mobo?  Anywho, if this is happening to many people; a good ole Steam reinstall will prolly fix it.  I\'ll get back to you after a search.\n\n\n\nEDIT: My findings indicate this only happens when switching to a map you do not have downloaded, or another custom map.  My guess this is a STEAM error not recognising the custom map because its not one of the officials.  You may just have to reconnect until the dev\'s can get on top of this one.\n\n__________________\n\nSYSTEM SPECS\n\n__________________\n\n\n\nOS: MS Windows XP Pro SP1\n\nHDs: 120 GB (NTFS) & 40 GB (FAT32)\n\nCPU: Intel Pentium 4 @ 2.53 GHz\n\nGPU: GeForce4 Ti 4600 128 MB (45.23 Drivers)\n\nPRAM: 1 GB DDRAM \n\nVMEM: 3.4 GB\n\nConnection: Comcast Cable (600/80 Kbps)\n\nSettings:\n\n-OpenGL w/VSync, AA, AF and TS Off\n\n-1280x1024 resolution\n\n-32-bit color\n\n\n\nProud Co-Founder of the m00c Patrol.\n\n66.208.104.166:27015 - KDB pub\n\n69.56.171.228:27015 - S_c_T pub\n\n208.184.33.208:27015 - team.cH pub', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(198175, 31278, 1005, 102343, 1072936800, '', 'thx for the replys... my specs \n\n\n\nOS: Windows XP Pro SP1 \n\nCPU: Intel Pentium 4, 3.1 GHz \n\nGPU: GeForce 4 Ti 4600 128 MB \n\nPRAM: 1 GB DDRAM \n\nVRAM: 3.4 GB \n\nConnection: 512kps\n\nSettings: \n\n-1280x1024 resolution \n\n-32-bit color \n\n-OpenGL, VSync Off', '127.0.0.1', 1),
