(205385, 32592, 1013, 102357, 1072936800, '', 'god damn i have this problem 2.\n\n\n\ni have 3 cd keys, 1 used for my brothers laptop, 1 for this comp, and one spare.\n\n\n\ni used 1 of the CD keys for this comp for quite sometime since steam launched which was probably a few weeks [or even few months] and one day, i go to my games list, and discover all my games are uninstalled.\n\n\n\nso what i do is install my CS, but theya sk for my CD key, so what i did was put in the CD key i used for this comp once again.  and it worked, so i thought ok phew.\n\n\n\nthen i closed my CS, and tried playing again, and they asked for CD key again.  so i was like ok maybe this CD key is screwed, so i used the spare one.  unfortunately, the spare one became screwed like my first one.  2 of my CD keys were eaten up ffs. \n\n\n\n\n\nnow before i play my CS< i have to install the games, put in my CD key.  cant even have fun. no use installing custom maps whatsoever cause all will be gone.  i hope STEAM will fix this problem soon.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNote also that our CD keys are REAL, FRESH, ORIGINAL, AUTHENTIC, GENUINE and gotten off Halflife packs.  i mean if they were FAKE ones, how the hell did we\n\n\n\n1) Install and play 1.6 for few months in the first place\n\n2) Install and play 1.5  online\n\n\n\n\n\nthis is worse than the shield bug.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
