(208620, 33060, 1013, 102322, 1072936800, 'Fix Steam Now', 'I did not pay for this game to sit and wait for uploads. Either fix my game or return the money i spend (for all 5 of my copies). I dont know about you, but sitting and waiting for this "program" to run with 65-99% cpu usage in the background for half the day. I want a fix now, or a refund. If you are unwilling to give me either i will not hesitate to open a lawsuit about this. I dont even care about the money i will spend on this, as i have enough, but i do care about the principle - and about you wasting my ****ing time.\n\n\n\nbtw, while youre at it - fix my fps also. When a perferred computer is \n\nquote:Half-Life Counter-Strike Box  \n\nPreferred:\n\nPentium II 333MHz or better\n\nDirect3D compatible 3D accelerator card\n\n64MD RAM\n\n\n\nWHY THE HELL IS MY AMX XP 1600+ my gf2 ti overclocked to hell (which is running better than a geforce4 mx) a ****ing fps config and tweaked settings not good enough for 99fps. What the hell is taking up my cpu? It runs fine in 1.5, with 100 fps in the middle of 4 people and 2 smokes on the ground in front of me.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
