(208814, 33060, 1013, 102364, 1072936800, '', 'does anyone else get what I have dubbed "gunfight lag"\n\n\n\nrunning around the map with 100fps and 40ms ping is fine... until you start shooting or somoene starts shooting at you, in which case CS pauses for a fraction of a second, but enough to get you killed in a rush.\n\n\n\ngunfight lag has a tendency to become unbearable when headshots are involved.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(208831, 33060, 1013, 102364, 1072936800, '', 'oh... and a GF2mx400 runs just fine.... if you have CS 1.5.  \n\n\n\nI used to get 100fps with ZERO lag before steam came along and forced me to upgrade my WHOLE MACHINE!\n\n\n\nCS 1.5: ran beautifully with my old Duron 1Ghz, 512MB ram, GF2mx400, winXP.\n\n\n\nCS 1.6: has issues running even with AthlonXP 2200+, 512MB ram, GF4ti4200, winXP.  Unbearable under old config.\n\n\n\nSure, you added a few guns and a shield, and a nice interface.  But whatever else you did... might wanna rethink that part.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
