(217442, 34284, 1005, 101342, 1072936800, 'DoD 1.1 this week?? or lies?', 'H-L Day of Defeat Patch Plans [November 11, 2003, 5:14 PM EST] - 2 Comments\n\n\nValve sends along word of plans to release a beta update for Day of Defeat this week. Here\'s word on plans to patch the Half-Life World War II modification: \n\n\n\n\n\nDay of Defeat 1.1 Beta Available Via Steam This Week\n\n\nDay of Defeat 1.1 is in the final stages of development and will be available for wide beta testing via Steam later this week. The team-based multiplayer game sends players into Axis vs. Allies battles set in Western Europe during WWII. Version 1.1 adds enhanced animation through the incorporation of Valve\'s nine-way blending system. DoD 1.1 also includes new maps plus a host of tweaks and fixes. For more information visit \n\n\nwww.dayofdefeat.com (http://www.dayofdefeat.com) or www.steampowered.com. (http://www.steampowered.com.) \n\n\n\n\n\nhttp://www.bluesnews.com/ (http://www.bluesnews.com/)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
