(220653, 34788, 1013, 102390, 1072936800, '', 'I got the same problem with Direct3d now (always used it before) but also I have another.\n\n\n\nI changed my settings to Open GL which should work fine, but whenever I try to enter a server (wether in software mode or Open GL) it gives me a Fatal Error: NET_SendPacket ERROR:WSAEINVAL. (Windowed Error, not blue screen).\n\n\n\nI\'m on a 1.3 AMD Athlon, 640mb DDR ram, GeForce4 ti4600, Hercules Digifire soundcard, Gigabyte 7DX mobo and a 2mb Cable Conn.\n\n\n\nAny ideas?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
