(261245, 34788, 1013, 102391, 1072936800, 'the pain...', 'please, stop it with the "i\'m fine with opengl" comments.  it hurts.  most people here either can\'t use it or their cards run horribly on it.  in my case i\'ve been forced to drop res on an lcd monitor and i\'m sure many of you know what that means - nasty, blurry screen.  and even on the lower resolutions my framerate is bad.  okay, i\'m tired of repeating myself.\n\n\n\npoint is, stop gloating about how opengl works fine for you or how it\'s better than d3d.  that\'s totally beside the point.\n\n\n\nthank you.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
