(262147, 34788, 1013, 100028, 1072936800, '', 'D3D is a miserable interface for HL1, no one should be using it.\n\n\n\nOPENGL has always been the best driver hands down.\n\n\n\nAnyone that thinks D3D is better than OPENGL has something seriously wrong with their computer or they have some other reason for wanting to use D3D that has nothing to do with performance.\n\n\n\nI feel bad for all those folks out there with older crappy graphics cards and even more so for anyone with the crappy new Intel graphics chips (Intel really dropped the ball on those chips) but for all of you who can upgrade, $50 gets you a G4 MX440 card that is a really excellent for playing HL.\n\n__________________\n\nWould you like a little Cheeze with that Whine?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(262162, 34788, 1013, 102395, 1072936800, '', 'Are you on crack!? Direct3D works a lot better than OpenGL for me... if anything sucks, Its OpenGL!!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(223268, 35451, 1013, 102402, 1072936800, 'Precondition Assertion Failed', 'Man, these errors are getting out of control. Are you trying to kill CS and half life?\n\n\n\nAnyways, here is the error as follows:\n\n\n\nName: Entry IsValid\n\nProgram: C:\\Program Files\\Steam\\Steam.exe\n\nFile: Src\\CachedFileFixedDirectory.exe\n\nLine: 702\n\n\n\n(!((m_uMaxEntries <= 0xFFFF)) || (m_MiniEntries[uEntry].m_u16Flags & CCachedFileFixedFirectoryEntry::s_cu16ValidMask) != 0))\n\n\n\nI can click ignore and get past it..if I like the same error box popping up every 2 seconds. This prevents me from play any games with steam.\n\n[]Attachment: thanks_valve.png (attachment.php?s=4859d29c3d690a8769372adae70c184a&postid=223268)\n\nThis has been downloaded 66 time(s).\n\n__________________\n\nSpecs:\n\n\n\nOS: Windows XP Sp1\n\nCPU: Athlon XP 1700+\n\nMemory: 1 Gig PC2700\n\nVideo Card: RADEON 9700 (non-pro) 8x AGP\n\nSound: Audigy 2.0', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(225164, 35451, 1013, 102402, 1072936800, '', 'Also, I would like to note that I have not been able to change my connection speed in recent builds from 56k to anything else.\n\n__________________\n\nSpecs:\n\n\n\nOS: Windows XP Sp1\n\nCPU: Athlon XP 1700+\n\nMemory: 1 Gig PC2700\n\nVideo Card: RADEON 9700 (non-pro) 8x AGP\n\nSound: Audigy 2.0', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(226901, 35451, 1013, 102402, 1072936800, '', 'Ok, I got it fixed. If I just click the ignore button 90 million times, it finnally gives up and lets me play.\n\n\n\nNow, is there any way to change my connection speed from 56k to DSL? It never registers that I changed it.\n\n\n\nBtw, I would appreciate a responce, this is a support forum.\n\n__________________\n\nSpecs:\n\n\n\nOS: Windows XP Sp1\n\nCPU: Athlon XP 1700+\n\nMemory: 1 Gig PC2700\n\nVideo Card: RADEON 9700 (non-pro) 8x AGP\n\nSound: Audigy 2.0', '127.0.0.1', 1),
