(223715, 35561, 1005, 100349, 1072936800, 'FIX for missing chat text', 'If you don\'t see chat text and other text is missing in DOD 1.1, it\'s probably because you\'re running a custom Steam skin.  Go back to the default skin, restart Steam, and you should see chat messages.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
