(229049, 36611, 1005, 102428, 1072936800, 'When is CZ come out?', 'Its the 18th of November and guess what........ NO CZ. Ive hurd that CZ was coming out December 16th and CSX is coming out November 20th. Now i\'m not sure how true that is but when you say a game is done... ppl expect it to be done and shipped on time because weve been waiting for freakin 4 years after Rogue, Gearbox, and Ritual have all given up. Lets not hope this happens again.... Jus hope its coming out TONIGHT', '127.0.0.1', 1),
