(229398, 36611, 1005, 102432, 1072936800, 'Steam is a nub', 'CZ will not be released until the Steam platform is able to handle the increased load on the system.  Currently Steam is only able to handle 20-30% of the Counter-Strike community, which is why the WON servers are still active.  If WON was shutdown right now, and everyone was forced to use Steam & 1.6, everything would collapse.  This is the same if CZ was released...the system is just not stable or large enough yet to be able to handle the strain of a single game title release.\n\n\n\nnotice the Status page for Steam...it shows how many servers that are currently down?  too many.  of the bandwidth possible, only 40% or so is currently being used, which would mean we could safely double the current CS1.6 community.  but that is still not enough to shut down 1.5 completely or release a new title.\n\n\n\nwaiting impatiently,\n\n[KORT] wasn\'t me', '127.0.0.1', 1),
