(242986, 38817, 1026, 102441, 1072936800, 'Server Crashes After new hlds update', 'I have a counter-strike server, running adminmod, hlguard, metamod and statsme.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAfter i have installed the new hlds update, my server crahses...\n\n\n\n\n\nI have installed the latest metamod v.1.17\n\n\n\n\n\nStatsme 2.17\n\n\n\n\n\nHLGuard v1.50\n\n\n\n\n\nAdmin-Mod v2.50.58\n\n\n\n\n\nBefore the update my server was working fine, but now it wont start, if i have statsme running...\n\n\nIf i remove the win32 addons\\statsme\\dlls\\sm_cstrike_mm.dll in the metamods plugin.ini the server works again, but i would like to run statsme on the server...   \n\n\n\n\n\nplz help me...  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBest Regards\n\n\nM|meR.dk\n\n__________________\n\nM|meR', '127.0.0.1', 1),
