(246434, 39456, 1013, 102458, 1072936800, 'hello', 'Yea, I have what seems like the same problem....look at my other post and try the things I tried perhaps they will work for you (it\'s entitled "PLEASE HELP...."game unavailable" + other shiot").  For example go games, right click on cs, go to properties and see what the updates are set to.  It might be set to "never update."  If so, try changing to "always keep it updated."  Didn\'t work for me because an error popped up but it might work for you.  Good luck.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
