(246850, 39456, 1013, 102459, 1072936800, '', 'I have this problem too...\n\n\n\n\n\nIt happens once in a while and every Steam user gets it when it happens. Its a Steam-side problem and a client-side one. Just be patient and it will be fixed (Usually in 5-10 mins, but remember the word usually).\n\n\n\n\n\nHope that cleared a few things out.\n\n__________________\n\nSony Vaio 430G (Digital Studio PC)\n\n\nRemote Control For Watching and Recording TV on PC\n\n\nPentium 4 2.80C Ghz (800 FSB)\n\n\n512MB PC-2700 333MHz DDR\n\n\nRadeon 9200 128MB Video Card\n\n\n120GB Hard Drive (7200rpm)\n\n\nDVD�RW / CD-RW (16x10x32)\n\n\nDVD-ROM (16x)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
