(247210, 39456, 1013, 102461, 1072936800, 'YES', 'OMG Cyrax I think thats the problem. I read some where about someone having a problem with hl.exe still being open when steam was closed and to fix this permanately you have to remove the compatability mode. Then I remembered that I had to press ctrl+atl+del for some reason and I closed CS that way and I was able to get back in without having to restart. I am gonna do this straight away and report back. Thank You sooo much!\n\n\n\n\n\n/EDIT\n\n\nYES IT WORKS! Go into C:\\Program Files\\Steam\\SteamApps\\"your email"\\counter-strike and right click on hl.exe and click on the compatability tab and remove compatability. [][] This should be sticked for all those people having the problem with "Game currently not avaliable" problems.\n\n__________________\n\nEddie', '127.0.0.1', 1),
