(249832, 39989, 1026, 102462, 1072936800, 'Easy HLDS Update Tool v2.0', 'MOVED, LAST TIME:\n\n/forums/...;threadid=50127 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=50127)\n\n\n\n\n\n-------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nOLD POST:\n\n\n\n\n\n---------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nOLD THREADS:\n\n/forums/...;threadid=39033 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=39033)\n\n/forums/...;threadid=39270 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=39270)\n\n\n\n\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nWhat is this program?\n\nThis program makes it SIMPLE to update your HLDS and Mods! You just fill in some details, and hit update. Way easier than the command line one that comes with steam.\n\n\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nDecember 1, 2003:\n\nI FOUND THE PROBLEM!!! THIS *IS* THE WORKING FIX!!!\n\n\n\nIf you have already downloaded the program, and cant get it to run, go into the dir that the EXE is in, and create a BLANK TEXT FILE named "settings.ini" and your problem is FIXED.\n\n\n\nIf you havent, i have included this file in the download below.\n\n\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nWell I have completed version 2 with MANY minor fixes as well as major ones.\n\n\n\nYou can see some screenshots here: \n\nhttp://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS1.jpg (http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS1.jpg) <-- Updated for V2\n\nhttp://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS2.jpg (http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS2.jpg) \n\nhttp://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS3.jpg (http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/SS3.jpg) \n\n\n\nand you can download the utility here: \n\n\n\nhttp://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpd...yHLDSUpdate.zip (http://www.KaoticElites.com/HLDSUpdater/EasyHLDSUpdate.zip)\n\n\n\nPLEASE EVEN IF YOU HAVE NO PROBLEMS AT ALL, POST A REPLY TO BUMP THIS, OR GIVE ME YOUR COMMENTS/SUGGESTIONS. THANK YOU!!\n\n\n\nPlease inform me about ANY and EVERY bug found! no matter how small! Comments and suggestions are GREATLY appreciated. Thanks! \n\n\n\nNOTE: \n\nThis is not a *fix* or update for the update tool, its just an easier way of using it. \n\n\n\nInstalling: \n\nExtract all of the zip files anywhere on your PC, for best results extract to the same folder as \'HLDSUpdateTool.exe\' (usually C:\\HLServer) \n\n\n\nThen just run the EXE provided! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n--KaOs \n\n\n\nValve please tell me if you like my work, I would love to hear from you.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
