(512016, 40325, 1013, 102479, 1072936800, '', 'REGENERATION - To save you this trouble in the future, here\'s some ideas.\n\n\n\n1. Never flame. Even if you \'come out on top\' you just look unprofessional, and as a result it degrades the public opinion of your topic.\n\n\n\n2. The way it\'s presented. I\'d advise getting your site for the drivers to not look like warez .nfo, because that\'s what it does now.\n\n\n\n3. The driver installer itself. I actually opened the package then quit because the greeting message has things like \'Such & such owns you\' or \'If she\'s over 16 and looks nice\' the idea is once again to appear professional, so you\'re taken seriously.\n\n\n\nThese little steps will vastly improve that initial reaction to your drivers, and can hopefully make them more common if they improve things like reports say they are.  You said in a previous reply you were old enough to be someone\'s father. Then as the cliche goes, act your age.\n\n\n\nThis isn\'t intended as flamebait, but frankly the reaction you\'ve received will not change until those points outlined do. Sorry if thats harsh, but I try to call it like I see it.\n\n\n\nRegards,\n\n\n\nShockwave', '127.0.0.1', 1),
