(263070, 41141, 1005, 102483, 1072936800, '', 'yeah same problem, i believe its the security module. Also if your clients are getting overflowed delete your motd.txt that worked for me, shame the rest of steam dont work too good, i knew moving from won would be a challenge but geez steam makes  a mountain out of a molehill!!!!!!!!!!!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(263111, 41141, 1005, 102480, 1072936800, '', 'LOL I know the feeling.  I still think Steam will be a good thing when they get all the bugs worked out, but WOW what a lotta bugs!\n\nI\'m not running the security module (secure = 0) on my server, and some still get load failed when they go thru a mapchange, I\'ve heard several reasons for it; client issues; server issues; I guess we\'ll just have to wait on this one, until a Steam update comes along that fixes it.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(257676, 41168, 1005, 102484, 1072936800, 'Finally ! An Official Possible Counter To A Shield !', 'Don\'t bother reading the title again, you read it right the first time. In some news (http://csnation.counter-strike.net/comments.php?id=6752 (http://csnation.counter-strike.net/comments.php?id=6752)) off of CS-Nation, Jess Cliffe of Valve has confirmed that there will be a LAW (rocket launcher) released for CS:CZ. Your probably saying yea, but thats in CZ and I\'ve heard rumors of rocket launcher in CS ... well earlier CSN reported that elements of CS and CS:CZ will eventually be combined to form one massive mulitplayer experience (http://csnation.counter-strike.net/...csinfo/next.csn (http://csnation.counter-strike.net/view.php/csinfo/next.csn)) ... now this will take time becasue they dont wanna release all of these new items at once, but ... THE DAYS OF THE SHIELD WHORING NEWBS ARE QUICKLY DWINDLING ! ! ! DID SOMEONE SAY PARTY ? ! ? ! \n\n\n\nCSN is my homepage BTW ... LOL', '127.0.0.1', 1),
