(258753, 41362, 1005, 102483, 1072936800, 'will this be ignored as well valve?', 'ok lots of questions, might as well post it so the community can see, since it looks like it is only us server admins that is keeping this community alive, thanks for the constant support "valve" in our struggle.  \n\n\n\nfirst of all i want to know why does the server seem to kick players halfway through a map and when it kicks clients, it kicks about 8,  i know its not the security module because all players have been in the server for at least 10 mins before we all got kicked.  this has heppened on just abot all the maps so iut looks like you have some problems there.\n\n\n\nserver specs\n\n\n\n2mb connection\n\n2.6ghz pentium 4\n\n1.2gig ddr ram\n\non  linux\n\namx 9.6j\n\nmetamod 1.17\n\nday of defeat 1.1b\n\n\n\n\n\nSecondly that security module is total crap, does vac actually do anything?\n\nall ive seen it do is ban players who use cheating death... the tool u use to not cheat..lol\n\n\n\ni have managed to get our server to have a respectable pings but im unable to even think about a 32 player server as your new hlds usess way too much cpu power and the game is covered in bugs and mishaps, metamod, amx, admin mod all suffer, valve why dont u ever consider about actually working with the guys who make these pluggins, they help to make the game much better online,and help us server admins out to no end.  without them you woudlnt have any servers fullstop, remeber we pay for these servers you do not, there are many other games online which has the potential to put steam out of action.  dont try to ruin the community, it was perfect before steam came about.\n\n\n\nAlso are you gonna do anything about the doors they suck, they open in the wrong dirrection on every map and well if the game is suppossed to be more realisistic then this needs more work.\n\nAlso the other bug with the players orentation, enemy players look the other way when u r look at them, making you think they are not looking at you,  then you get shot....\n\n\n\nalso the kar is ruined, you have basically given the allies the upper hand, you have weakened the kar, given the garrand more accuracy and left the british rifle alone..lol  i think that  needs more work too.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis is not a flaming post, this is a post that needs to be read, valve your only hurting yourselves here.  Since steam has come about the entire HL community has been in kaos.  I have faith that you will correct these problems, but it would be nice to know that you actually do intend to do somethign about them...  i dunno what to suggest but maybe valve you should pop into a server or two and see for yourself.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
