(258728, 41764, 1013, 102505, 1072936800, '', 'many people are having this problem. i waited in #steam for over 9 hours yesterday. and then i got a PM from an admin there and he told me to restart then blocked all my messages. wow great help. i tried to say i already had restarted but he blocked the message. #steam is the worst help ever. dont even bother. they will jsut tell you to restart/reinstall. they dont even know solutions to anything', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(258946, 41764, 1013, 102507, 1072936800, '', 'I am pretty sure that shutdown/ restart wont do the trick, I havent been able to join a server for 2, TWO(!!), weeks now.\n\n\n\n...STEAM what have you done for me lately?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
