(262266, 41915, 1005, 102523, 1072936800, 'VALVE...... Linux', 'Please fire the person who writes your linux binaries, as they do not know what in the hell they are doing.  It is a sad day in the world when a damned windows cs server runs better than a linux server.  Its also not a good sign when there are server updates three days in a row.... I am really not trying to flame anyone, but when counter strike lags my box, i just dont understand, it should not be that way....... THIS GAME IS BASED ON THE QUAKE 2 ENGINE!!!!!!!!!   Im not going to bother to leave my server specs because i know its not the server, JUST GET YOUR ASSES IN GEAR!!!!!!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
