(262785, 41915, 1005, 102526, 1072936800, '', 'yeah..agreed....\n\n\n\nDear Valve Team, if you are not able to get this damn linux libarys as fast as for windoze...PLS publish the linux source code to get some FAST and STABLE linux binarys from the community..guess that would be 10 times faster than to wait for some [color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color] kicking stuff from ur linux coder....\n\n\n\nbtw..just compile the windoze source code on a linux machine doenst makes a fast linux binary.....for some reason i beleave thats the wait they went after steam release..[]  [<-- i realy dunno what i wanted to say here....strange...ahhh...enlightning [] ]\n\n\n\ni mean : i guess the way they went....(compiling windows sources for linux) \n\n\n\n*sorry..but im pissed of from hundrets of gamers just crying about server lags and so on...but they are completly right, cause the server ar lagging baaaaad, and i mean REALY bad*', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(263063, 41915, 1005, 102483, 1072936800, '', 'agreed margarita time!s, or have they got another agenda here?\n\nDo they want to rid us of linux servers?\n\nor lower the size of our servers?\n\n\n\n\n\ni dunno but valve your really making a mess of things...\n\nbefore long u wont have any servers linux or windows so you wont have any players online, and then guess what all this con\n\nversion to steam will be the biggest pink elephant you have bought.\n\n\n\nplease please please listen to the very community that keeps your company afloat!!!!\n\n\n\nget it sorted and sharpish!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
