(268377, 42193, 1005, 102455, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by SimOps \n\nWe are running a linux\n\n2.66 nhz 800 fsb\n\n1 gb ddr 3200\n\nand get 100 - 125 on with no effect on game play.\n\nThis may be due to your box location.\n\nWe are in 2 NAC\'s  \n\n\n\nYou\'re telling me you get 100-125 players on a 2.6Ghs box with 1 gig of ram?  AMD or Intel?  Which OS please?  Also, what maps are in your rotation?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
