(268961, 42193, 1005, 102156, 1072936800, '', 'There is no way he is getting 100 players on those specs.  At least not with Steam.  It\'s impossible.\n\n\n\nIt has NOTHING to do with the connection.  The CPU wouldnt take the abuse.  \n\n\n\nSorry Qwerty but your lying.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
