(269006, 42193, 1005, 102532, 1072936800, '', 'I can only say that with the P4 2.6 800 fsb / the ramm and the  connection..it only has spikes on joining..then it settles out fine.\n\nYes I have had that many on the 4 public servers I had running on the same box.\n\n\n\nI have only 2 pubs now as I sold the others...gotta make a buck here and there.\n\n\n\nI have no answer as to why..dumb luck?\n\n\n\nWe have not had that many in a few weeks...now we get 64 players and the game runs fine....plus our private servers...not very heavy.\n\n\n\nMight be the settings that we run...your guess is as good as the next guy.\n\n\n\nWe are not here to lie or brag, just telling you what we got/get....I could care less one way or the other..I know what we get....and am very happy.\n\n\n\nmap cycle:\n\ndust\n\ndust2\n\ndirtdust\n\naztec\n\npacific\n\nitaly\n\n\n\ntest us out and see for your self.\n\n\n\nwe get high volume players at 1000-2400 est.\n\n\n\nI would be glad for you to load up both pubs and see for your self...the proof is in the pudding.\n\n\n\nNuff said.\n\nSpecs:\n\nP4 2.6 800 fsb\n\n1 gb ddr400 ram\n\n40 gb Wd se hdd "gamers edition"\n\nThe Planet "data center"', '127.0.0.1', 1),
