(266744, 42531, 1013, 100694, 1072936800, 'Bug Report 12/10/03', 'Please list any bugs that are new, or have not been addressed yet. What to list: \n\nThe bug. \n\nHow you got it. \n\nWhen you got it. \n\nCan you reproduce it? \n\n\n\nThanks, \n\nRitchey~ \n\n\n\nPlease stay on topic. These rules apply:\n\n/forums/show...;threadid=14256 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=14256)\n\n\n\nHere\'s a complete list of the changes:\n\n\n\nALL GAMES:  \n\nFixed problem in Direct3D mode where the game would be unavailable for some users. Direct3D mode should work now, but note that OpenGL will provide a better play experience if your video card is capable\n\nFixed regression that was causing the \'load failed\' crash to happen on level change\n\nOptimized some of the particle drawing code\n\nFor mod makers - debugging mods no longer requires the steam.dll to be copied into the game directory\n\n\n\nDAY OF DEFEAT\n\nAdded client side env_models for static prop type models\n\nRandom class now abides by class limits\n\nNo random class in clan matches\n\nAdded exit decal on gunshots\n\nRestored door opening behavior to original style ( face the door and it opens away from you, face away and it opens towards you )\n\nFixed sniper rifle lowering when a sniper moved, even though he was still scoped\n\nFixed a bug where you would drop your weapon, pick it back up and it would have less ammo\n\nRe-added weapon names to console death messages ( bob killed fred with garand )\n\nAdded "teamkill" text to the console death messages ( bob teamkilled chuck with kar )\n\nFixed being able to jumpshoot if the minimap was open fullscreen\n\nFixed a cut off label in scoreboard\n\nNow cannot +use grenades while deployed\n\n"hud_draw 0" now hides the spectator bar\n\nFixed player animation being 90 degrees off on mg sandbag deploy\n\nFixed spectator angles on minimap player icons\n\nFixed strange health numbers drawing in the spec bar\n\nFixed gunshot decal on subsequent bullet hits\n\nAdded control point name to log file cap messages\n\nFixed hud reset on stop demo recording\n\nFixed ammo on mg42 and 30cal view model not showing above 8 bullets\n\nFixed player models jittering because of animation blend\n\nFixed an evil evil hack that stopped the player from shooting when their mg42 overheated\n\nFixed some more empty cells in the scoreboard showing up as squares\n\n\n\nDOD HLTV \n\nFixed client env_models drawing\n\nFixed brit sleeves\n\nDraw objective icons on hud and in minimap\n\nDraw grenades on the minimap for both teams\n\nFixed teams and playerclass in the scoreboard\n\nAdded timeleft and number of hltv spectators to the spec bar\n\nFixed weather effects not drawing\n\nNo vgui menus in hltv spec\n\n\n\nCOUNTER-STRIKE: \n\nFixed shield exploit that involved dropping a weapon and buying a pistol in a specific order; you must restart your dedicated server to pick up this change\n\n\n\nTEAM FORTRESS CLASSIC: \n\nFixed icon for ALT-TAB menu and window title bar not being displayed properly\n\nMoved flaginfo to the chat text area so it will work properly', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(266794, 42531, 1013, 102534, 1072936800, '', 'HLDM, whenever suitvolume is bigger than 1 (it can go up to 2 using the slide bar on options), in lan and single player it closes the game with the following error:\n\n\n\nfatal error\n\nSV_StartSound: volume = 392\n\n\n\n(392 or other number depending how much is suitvolume)\n\n\n\nhappens every time u get the suit or the longjump modedule\n\n(it doesnt happen on multiplayer)\n\n\n\nthis happens always, and i got it in 2 different machines, one with windows Me and other with windows 2000, in both default and eax sound settings (with no messing with other sound vars)\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nSteam, in the windows ME machine, cant copy/paste in any steam window.\n\n\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nHLDM, blurred crosshairs, temporaly sorted using vid_d3d 1 (credit to pmers tolon for this fix), dunno if that\'s how is meant to be as it isnt necessary on old won setup, so mentioned just in case.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nrandom HL.EXE error, no reproducible :/\n\n\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nall these bugs are still there after today\'s update. This is all for now, hope it helps.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(266796, 42531, 1013, 100443, 1072936800, 'Commonly Reported Bug List', 'I\'ll be using this spot on the first page of this thread to keep track of commonly reported bugs here so people don\'t have to search for them.\n\n\n\nI\'ll edit this post to include common bugs once some have been submitted.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(266826, 42531, 1013, 102535, 1072936800, '', 'When I run in developer mode, "developer 1" is the CVAR to enable it, I notice that my Counter-Strike is running into some problems every few seconds [ranging from 20-40s intervals]. I am kind of confused why this happening, and I wonder if anyone can help me. \n\n\n\nI analyzed the problem like this: \n\nI an running: \n\n1.80 Ghz P4 oc 1.99 \n\nSoundlive Blaster Live! XGamer+ \n\nATI Radeon 9600 PRO \n\n\n\nWhen playing counter-strike, I got the problem \n\n"Sentence or Pitch shift ignored. > 16 playing!" every so often, so trying to solve it, I went on google and realized that this was a sound issue, so I turned on my s_eax, since EAX is a creative hardware plugin. \n\n\n\nAlso, I turned off the Sound Acceleration on dixdiag [the Direct X dialog], so that isn\'t the problem. And, no, even if I turn the CVAR developer to 0, the problem still occurs, just it would be reported to me. So, can anyone help me? \n\n\n\nWhen either the "Sentence or Pitch shift ignored. > 16 playing!" error or the "sound overrun" error occurs, I notice a BIG latency raise and my bullets become ineffective and my CS lags. \n\n\n\nThis only happens when I am in a fights. When I am facing a few people or more, my bullets become inneffective, unaccurate and everything sort of lags. I get the error "Sentence or Pitch shift ignored > 16"', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(266839, 42531, 1013, 102536, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Orbital \n\nWhen I run in developer mode, "developer 1" is the CVAR to enable it, I notice that my Counter-Strike is running into some problems every few seconds [ranging from 20-40s intervals]. I am kind of confused why this happening, and I wonder if anyone can help me. \n\n\n\nI analyzed the problem like this: \n\nI an running: \n\n1.80 Ghz P4 oc 1.99 \n\nSoundlive Blaster Live! XGamer+ \n\nATI Radeon 9600 PRO \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\ni\'ve been getting the same since one of the previous updates.\n\n\n\nping is same as before 20-30\n\njust get lag showing up in netgraph\n\n\n\nxp2500 @ xp3200\n\n512mb ddr400\n\nR9800 pro\n\n1mb cable\n\n\n\nhopefully this update will resolve this problem\n\n\n\nEDIT: the bug is still there []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(266872, 42531, 1013, 102537, 1072936800, '', 'Not sure if its a bug or by design.\n\n\n\nWhen I try and change me Internet Connection speed in Steam (it is currently set at "DSL >256k"), it always reverts back to "DSL >256k" (no matter what speed I pick, lower or faster).\n\n\n\nI have 1M ADSL connection.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(266873, 42531, 1013, 100332, 1072936800, 'bug?!', 'sv_lan 1 while create a listen server, is it should be?\n\n\n\nsetting.scr wont load while create a listen server 1st time after launch steam/cs, solution now is launch steam/cs, create a listen server, type disconnect command and create a server again', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(266938, 42531, 1013, 102538, 1072936800, '', 'I have to press: a, e, u, i or o before I can type anything in the console, otherwise it just disapears. Oh, and it doesn\'t matter if console is at 1 or 0.\n\nbtw, I have posted this bug twice before, it never gets fixed.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(267100, 42531, 1013, 102539, 1072936800, 'some bugs', '1)If one calls the console in the game, no bindings more function for example there. \n\nTherefore if one liked to do a Screenhsot of the consoles, one must key in this. \n\n\n\n2) Since 1.6 it happens sometimes, that the weapon is in the right hand although cl_righthand is 0. \n\nIs in fact pithy in the match if the weapon in the other hand. \n\n\n\n3) The mistake steps it onto that sometimes to remain killed opponents in their position and to wobble something. \n\nIt looks like if he had droped from the server. ( This happens when you play the german version) \n\nScreenshot: \n\nhttp://www.shooter-world.de/dead.jpg (http://www.shooter-world.de/dead.jpg) \n\n\n\n4) when you click on the banner at the monitor gui, steam open the link with the internet explorer, not with the default browser \n\n\n\n5) click on Games->Proberties->Update News, when i scroll this page, steam.exe causes a very high cpu usage\n\n\n\n6) when you want to watch demos, you have to edit the demos with a hexeditor and replace +showscores with -showscores for example. Without the modification, CS crashes if someone calls the scoreboard in the demo \n\n\n\n\n\noffline version would be nice []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(267426, 42531, 1013, 102292, 1072936800, '', 'everytime i click login or create new account my steam will just crash to the system try and my specs are good i am running a network firewall disabled open the ports and tried a direct connetction more info here \n\n\n\n/forums/show...mp;pagenumber=1 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=21174&perpage=15&pagenumber=1)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(268105, 42531, 1013, 102540, 1072936800, '', 'Please fix the steam.DLL crash when opening Steam. This seems to occur to every Win9x machine I installed Steam on. All this happened right after the new update yesterday. I can\'t even open up Steam now. All these updates are creating more problems then fixes!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(268141, 42531, 1013, 102541, 1072936800, 'pretty bad bug', 'I\'ve been getting a pretty bad bug when running tfc.\n\ni don\'t have enough of cs or the other mods downloaded to run them yet, so i\'m not sure if it will be present in them (i\'m expecting it to affect all mods, since it\'s video card related).\n\n\n\nThe problem has something to do with AGP support for my video card.  Before i disabled AGP using dxdiag, at the moment when tfc would start using my video card, hl.exe would get a page fault error, and either freeze my display on the menu (if tfc was started by shortcut), or simply dump me back into my desktop (if it was started through the connect option in steam).  When i got it to dump me back into my desktop, since the in-game video settings were set to a lower resolution, it changed my desktop video settings to that resolution.  I then tried to reset the resolution, and my rundll32.exe crashed (so i was screwed).\n\nNow that i have disabled AGP, i can get into a tfc game ONLY by using the connect option in steam.  If i try to open up the game from a shortcut, it has the same error as before, where hl.exe crashes in the background, and i\'m left with a frozen display until i reboot.\n\nHopefully, since this is a major bug, valve will try to find a fix for this as soon as possible.\n\n\n\nfor FULL details, including my system specs, see my main thread in the Support forum: /forums/...?threadid=42164 (/forums/showthread.php?threadid=42164)\n\n\n\nnote: since my last post there, i have re-installed the new video card driver, and tfc still behaves the same as i have described with AGP disabled. Steam is updated to the most recent version.\n\nI still have not tried to see what happens in d3d mode, (which i will do shortly).. all my testing has been done in openGL.  Hehe.. i say "testing" because it feels like i\'m a beta tester []\n\n\n\nEDIT:\n\n\n\nOk, now that the playable part of CS downloaded, i tried loading it up from the steam connect option and the freeze happened right when steam said "Validating game resources".  This happened with AGP still disabled.  Unless that is the point at which CS begins using the video card, it\'s strange that it happens then, instead of right before you would normally see the server message.\n\n\n\nNOW I\'M CONFUSED:\n\nTFC isn\'t acting like it did before. First it crashed when i had AGP enabled, whenever i re-enabled it, it always crashed.. and i mean ALWAYS.  Anyways, my display was all messed up the other day, so i turned AGP on again.  Later in the day, i attempted to play tfc, and it worked... with AGP on! What is going on here.. something is messed up about this.  Also, i\'ve experienced a brand new problem (besides the connection lost on map change)\n\nAfter being kicked by tfc because of a connection problem, hl.exe crashed (it seems to love doing that)\n\nand then steam crashed, giving me this:\n\nProgram D:\\PROGRAM FILES\\STEAM\\STEAM.EXE\n\nFile:  \\p4clients\\rel_beta\\Projects\\Common\\Misc\\Win32Stru\n\ncturedExceptions.cpp\n\nLine: 261\n\npStructuredExceptionPointers->ExceptionRecord->NumberParameters==2\n\n(Press Retry to debug the application - JIT debugging must be enabled)\n\nWhen i click on Retry, it says:\n\nRuntime Error!\n\nProgram: D:\\PROGRAM FILES\\STEAM\\STEAM.EXE\n\nThis application has requested the Runtime to terminate it in an unusual way.\n\nPlease contact the application\'s support team for more information.\n\n\n\nSo here i am... trying to contact the support team []\n\nHow many bugs will i stumble into? Wanna start taking bets? [] rofl!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(268338, 42531, 1013, 100796, 1072936800, '', 'load still fails at map change.  at least now there\'s a pretty little message telling me that.  like i couldn\'t have figured that out myself.\n\n\n\nhere\'s the pretty picture (http://mysite.verizon.net/res71imq/untitled.jpg)\n\n\n\nand here\'s the condump when load fails.\n\n\n\nquote:load failed.\n\nLast 32 messages parsed.\n\n28658 0016 svc_deltapacketentities\n\n528658 0022 svc_pings\n\n528662 0008 svc_time\n\n528662 0013 svc_clientdata\n\n528662 0016 svc_deltapacketentities\n\n528662 0029 svc_pings\n\n528667 0008 TextMsg\n\n528667 0042 svc_time\n\n528667 0047 svc_clientdata\n\n528667 0050 svc_deltapacketentities\n\n528667 0063 svc_pings\n\n528670 0008 svc_time\n\n528670 0013 svc_clientdata\n\n528670 0016 svc_deltapacketentities\n\n528670 0022 svc_pings\n\n528674 0008 svc_time\n\n528674 0013 svc_clientdata\n\n528674 0016 svc_deltapacketentities\n\n528674 0022 svc_pings\n\n528679 000 svc_time\n\n528679 0013 svc_clientdata\n\n528679 0016 svc_deltapacketentities\n\n528679 0022 svc_pings\n\n528683 0008 svc_time\n\n528683 0013 svc_clientdata\n\n528683 0016 svc_deltapacketentities\n\n528683 0022 svc_pings\n\n528687 0008 svc_time\n\n528687 0013 svc_clientdata\n\n528687 0016 svc_deltapacketentities\n\n528687 0022 svc_pings\n\nBAD:   -1:svc_bad\n\noutgoing reliable seq: 181070\n\nincoming reliable seq: 1\n\nincoming reliable ack: 1\n\nConnection to server lost during level change.\n\n\n\nservers are randomly dropping clients.  used to happen on a new round start.  now it even happens in the middle of round.  can\'t think of anything that would cause it.  here\'s the log from that.\n\n\n\nquote:Requesting pldecal.wad from server\n\nprocessing AY&SY~\n\nLast 32 messages parsed.\n\n541931 0227 svc_sound\n\n541931 0240 svc_sound\n\n541937 0008 svc_time\n\n541937 0013 svc_clientdata\n\n541937 0033 svc_deltapacketentities\n\n54193 0147 svc_event\n\n541937 0207 svc_sound\n\n541937 0220 svc_sound\n\n541937 0233 svc_sound\n\n541937 0245 svc_sound\n\n541946 0008 Battery\n\n541946 0011 Battery\n\n541946 0014 Battery\n\n541946 0017 Battery\n\n541946 0020 Battery\n\n541946 0023 Battery\n\n541946 0026 Battery\n\n541946 0029 Battery\n\n541946 0032 Battery\n\n541946 0035 Battery\n\n541946 0038 ScoreAttrib\n\n541946 0041 ScoreAttrib\n\n541946 0044 Battery\n\n541946 0047 Battery\n\n541946 0050 SendAudio\n\n541946 0073 TextMsg\n\n541946 0122 svc_temp_entity\n\n541946 0131 svc_customization\n\n541946 0169 CurWeapn\n\n541946 0173 CurWeapon\n\n541946 0177 svc_filetxferfailed\n\nBAD:  188:svc_bad\n\nHost_Error: CL_ParseServerMessage: Illegible server message - svc_bad\n\n\n\nNetchan_Clear() : reliable length not 0, reliable_sequence: 23, incoming_reliable_acknowledged: 0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nxp2000\n\ng4 ti4400\n\n256mb ddr\n\nxp pro sp 1', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(268787, 42531, 1013, 100588, 1072936800, '', 'HL.EXE was gone from my cstrike folder with no reason!?!\n\nI had to get a copy from my DoD folder.\n\n\n\nWhen I ran Steam and wanted to play, CS did not started. I checked why and saw that HL.exe wasn\'t here anymore.\n\n\n\nI never played with files nor opened my cstrike folder so I wonder why this program has been deleted.\n\n\n\nThe day before, it worked fine.\n\n\n\nEdit: OS specs :\n\n- Windows 2000 Pro SP4, NTFS.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(269106, 42531, 1013, 102542, 1072936800, '', 'In DOD I think granadier has the old same bug that you can fire while reloading, It happened to me. THe other thing, in dod_scape after a while, I cant see sand bags or thanks, everything is invisible, even some walls, dont know why. I\'m using OpenGl and latest Nvidia driver.\n\n\n\nWinXP SP1 Professional, P4 2.66mhz HT, 512ddr pc3200, gforce2 gts 32ddr, 1024x768 res', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(271987, 43297, 1026, 102546, 1072936800, 'Error creating user account', 'for some reason, whenever i create a steam account for the dedicated server, i get the following messages:\n\n\n\nChecking bootstrapper version\n\nCreating Account\n\nAuthenticationServerRSAPublicKey failed signature verification\n\n\n\nbefore, when i made an account, it worked fine, but i had to scrap that because of some other errors which i wont go into. I then started over again, and it gives me the error. I have tryed using a different log in name, and i have tryed placing the hlds_l folder in a different destination folder. I have no clue what is going on, and any clues would be great\n\n\n\nthanks\n\nDeemo', '127.0.0.1', 1),
