(274233, 43535, 1013, 102551, 1072936800, '', 'there is no steam process wheni control alt del. take for instance... i restart my computer... everything is fresh. no steam can possibly be open. no programs have been opened. I click on steam... it says updating steam... then it reaches 26% and it just closes on me... then 5 seconds later that message that i wrote out earlier pops up about access denied and not deleting steam or some crap.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(274528, 43650, 1013, 102554, 1072936800, 'delete steam.exe failed!!??!??', 'Today I went through EVERY message in this forum, finding many problems with Steam. And yes, I\'ve got one too.... I installed Steam Dec 14th, it updated, and I played CS to my hearts content. But today (DEC 15th) I tried loading Steam, and while it was downloading the update, at bout 25% it said:\n\n\n\nSteam.exe (main exception): ERROR: delete of Steam.exe failed, Win32 Error 5 "Access is denied"\n\n I\'ve tried un-installing Steam, rebooting after and so forth to no-avail. I seen 1 other message about this same problem, but dude\'s answer didnt help either... PLEASE HELP!!!! aaaaaaahh!\n\n\n\n\n\np.s. Why didn\'t they just keep Steam in Beta for another 10 years before it cam out?!?!?!?!?!!?!?!? :>', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(274630, 43650, 1013, 102555, 1072936800, '', 'Are you an admin in your computer?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(274669, 43650, 1013, 102556, 1072936800, '', 'well if you ARE trying to delete Steam, you cant have any of it running, and it runs auto in the background, so make sure you close that down before trying to delete/uninstall', '127.0.0.1', 1),
