(286109, 45503, 1013, 102577, 1072936800, '', 'This is THE best article ever written on gotfrag IMO. Nothing in this article is untrue. For me, CS died in 1.3. \n\n\n\nEverything in 1.3 was perfect. Watch X3 vs NiP. Then watch NoA vs SK. Just on game physics and skill alone it will be obvious which the better version was. \n\n\n\nI also agree with the money system. If the money system were fixed. 1.3 physics came back (everything about 1.3 physics, EVERYTHING!) and a Chargers only game play was used. Counter-Strike would come bac kt othe level I loved.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
