(286274, 45503, 1013, 102582, 1072936800, '', 'heh i am glad someone took it upon themselves to post on here, i suggested it on gotfrag, and lets hope something gets done.\n\n\n\ni must admit when 1.6 came out - i thought it was pretty slack, but after a while i thought it was great, and all i am waiting for is a patch that will fix this problem. I have played cs for ages, been in a few good clans - the term  i say often to my mates "once a cser, always a cser" if nothing changes valve, i am going to give it up, and this statement will become untrue. \n\n\n\nEveryone wants a game to be popular, but if nothing is done - cs will eventually die. On another note the popularity of spectating  CS at a professional level (like Shaguars) will signifcantly drop, and everyone knows all of money is made from such events \n\n\n\n\n\nValve.. do something k thx \n\n\n\ndrew // nixx', '127.0.0.1', 1),
