(314765, 49167, 1013, 102602, 1072936800, '', 'Well, I decided that just reinstalling at this point was the best bet.  So I did so.\n\n\n\nSure enough, reinstalling gave it a new "steamid" or whatever it needed.\n\n\n\nKudos to steam for getting another haxor []  No seriously, its OK...but I solved the problem myself.\n\n\n\nVxD', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(315264, 49456, 1013, 102605, 1072936800, 'Just thought I would show ya\'ll', 'This is my computer. Not like anyone cares but just to show you how crappy it is. You should post your crappy Computer too....if you got one.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIntel Celeron Processor 466 MHz\n\n\n\n96 MB SDRAM with up to 11MB of Video Memory\n\n\n\n10.2 GB Hard Drive\n\n\n\nHigh Velocity V.90 K56Flex Modem \n\n\n\nCrappy like I said. It is from 1998 so its pretty old. I need a new one.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
