(316827, 49509, 1013, 100211, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Rousuke \n\nOh so it is like a respawn hack? After getting killed, change team and become alive again. Is that what valve fixed?  \n\n\n\nExcept its not a hack because you dont need to modify the game files or use an addition, its a bug. A bug damnit...... sorry, I get carried away []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
