(317019, 49670, 1013, 100163, 1072936800, '400k update kill steam. What will happen when HL2', '400k update kill steam. What will happen when HL2 (Or any other game) comes out. Will steam be down for DAYS?\n\n\n\n\n\n So what happen? Not enough bandwith? What? Hacker KK?\n\n__________________\n\nIt\'s pass September 30, 2003 no HL2 \n\n\nIt\'s pass December 18, 1998 no TF2\n\n\nCZ went gold 2 times? (10/7/03,11/23/03) Still not out.\n\n\nOffline play October 23, 2003? LIE!\n\n\n\n\n\nHow many more can we add?\n\n\n\n\n\nA Note About WON and Counter-Strike 1.5\n\n\nSeptember 17, 2003, 11:35 am � Chris Bokitch \n\n\n \n\n\nThere seems to be a lot of confusion over the proposed plan to pull the plug on WON. WON will be available until the Steam service is working the way it was intended to. We will not simply pull the plug. If you wish to, you can reinstall Half-Life (if necessary) and play Counter-Strike 1.5 the way you always have.\n\n\n\n\n\nhttp://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=Killer+Koala&f=1\n\n\n\n\n\n/forums/member2.php?s=&action=addlist&userlist=ignore&userid=28881', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(318551, 49683, 1026, 102617, 1072936800, 'STUPID UPDATE', 'Same you guys i just started a server to day and what the helll is going on ? i am suppose to have 8 - 16 as ping and i have *****ing 130 wtf?\n\n\n\nAnyways steam really needs to fix this cause its g4y\n\n\n\nRegards\n\n\n\nmarkus', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(318587, 49683, 1026, 102618, 1072936800, '', 'I have the same lag problem since the update...My scoreboard shows me having a 40ping when before the update i would ping anywhere from 0-5ms...It also shows everyone in my server having about 20-35ms ping increase...\n\n\n\nWhen I use net_graph 3 it shows my ping as normal...So there is definatly a problem with the scoreboard...\n\n\n\n20 player cs server\n\n1.3 Duron 1gig of ram\n\nT1 connection w/bursts over 2.5mg\n\nWin Xp Os w/Sp1', '127.0.0.1', 1),
