(331867, 51466, 1005, 102653, 1072936800, '', 'its kinda funny with the para. i mean its a .50cal mg right? so technicly it should have equal or greater power than like an awp/awm. but having a fullauto awp/awm would be unbelievably cool/bad.\n\n\n\nthey need to make it between 2-3 shot kill. increased accuracy, and continue to increase the price. i think for the para a perfect stat would be something like:\n\n\n\n-60-80 damage per shot\n\n-accuracy equal to or lesser than the tmp\n\n-price in the 10k range or higher', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(331874, 51466, 1005, 102654, 1072936800, '', 'lol, the para does need an update... keep the recoil, but faster rof and damage... maby a mp5 or ak/colt rof, but with aut-sniper damage... cos its one mother of an expensive gun...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(331941, 51466, 1005, 102655, 1072936800, '', '$10k for a gun... yeah right', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(332033, 51466, 1005, 102656, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by RaptorRage \n\nThe autosniper complaints came from Colt/AK/AWP users that didn\'t want any of the other 21 guns to ruin their 90% monopoly on all the kills in CS.\n\n\n\nWhat would people do if every weapon were actually useful? Complain that all the guns work too well?\n\n\n\nlol I think you might be right.  The guns arent in the game to collect dust so its nice when they get re-balanced.\n\n\n\nIf a game consists of only a pistol, a smg, an assault rifle, and a sniper rifle people complain (as they did DoD and a few others back in the day).  So CS has many weapons but only a handful get used.  Then when they are re-balanced to be included in regular gameplay people complain some more!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(332061, 51466, 1005, 102347, 1072936800, '', 'The M249 Para is 5.56mm / .223 caliber. It uses the same ammo as the Colt. Basically it is a light machine gun or squad level automatic weapon, rather than a 7.62 mm / .30 caliber general purpose machine gun (M240 & M60) or a heavy machine gun in 12.7mm / .50 caliber (Browning M2).', '127.0.0.1', 1),
