(332194, 51466, 1005, 102658, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by V3N0N \n\nAre u from the army RaptorRage??? HTF do u know this sh|t?  \n\n\n\num..... I know all this stuff. That make me some psyco-gonna-go-columbine-on-your-[color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color] kinda person?\n\n\n\nno, not really. \n\n\n\nAt least........I hope not. \n\n\n\nBTW. I think that the para doesnt need accuricy or dmg. change, they are the same as the unsilenced m4 pretty much, what should change is have it fire slightly faster.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
