(333350, 51759, 1013, 100065, 1072936800, 'Fix the AWP re-chambering exploit, make it a must-see animation', 'First off, this isn\'t an "I hate AWP post." I really don\'t mind the awp as long as people can actually use it without some kind of scripting action along with it. I swear that anyone who is a big time awp fan uses a script (especially found in clans), then when questioned, laughs about using once. But it\'s obvious just watching them.\n\n\n\nAnd for those of you new to this script:\n\nIt\'s the awp script that instantly switches weapons once a bullet is shot from the chamber. It\'ll either switch directly to pistol, to pistol then back to awp, and one even looks like switching directly back to awp. You\'ll never see the chamber reload the next bullet. \n\n\n\nNow, don\'t say it\'s not a script, it\'s the "Q" button cause that\'s not true. It happens after every single shot so it\'s scripted. And I swear I am starting to think there\'s something else in there cause you can watch in first-person, they\'ll miss by a couple feet and still get the kill. AWPers are seriously getting massive kill:death ratios and it\'s got no skill. If they miss, they\'ll fire a couple rounds off with the pistol right after, then switch back to awp and try again. Makes it almost impossible to hit them when they\'ve got no slow-down and can jump around with a pistol in hand. The script allows them to move faster by not having the awp in hand.\n\n\n\nAnd you ever wonder why everyone uses an AWP/deagle? Well for one deagle is stronger than all pistols. But two, with an awp in hand it\'s the fastest one to switch to. There\'s no animation of the gun getting ready in your hand, it instantly shows up and is ready.\n\n\n\nMy suggestions:\n\n1) Make the scripting action available to everyone. As the ol\' saying goes "If you can\'t beat \'em, join \'em" or "If everyone else is doing it, why shouldn\'t I?"\n\n2) Actually make the reloading of the chamber mandatory (ie. Not skippable) The scripting process skips the animation, even if you do it manually.\n\n3) If the person holds an awp, they move slower not matter what other weapon they switch to.\n\n4) Make a deagle animation like the other pistols when the switch is made to that weapon.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333374, 51759, 1013, 102662, 1072936800, 'Ban the awp scripts or at least remove the exploit', 'quote:Originally posted by Killer Koala \n\nFirst off, this isn\'t an "I hate AWP post." I really don\'t mind the awp as long as people can actually use it without some kind of scripting action along with it. I swear that anyone who is a big time awp fan uses a script (especially found in clans), then when questioned, laughs about using once. But it\'s obvious just watching them.\n\n\n\nAnd for those of you new to this script:\n\nIt\'s the awp script that instantly switches weapons once a bullet is shot from the chamber. It\'ll either switch directly to pistol, to pistol then back to awp, and one even looks like switching directly back to awp. You\'ll never see the chamber reload the next bullet. \n\n\n\nNow, don\'t say it\'s not a script, it\'s the "Q" button cause that\'s not true. It happens after every single shot so it\'s scripted. And I swear I am starting to think there\'s something else in there cause you can watch in first-person, they\'ll miss by a couple feet and still get the kill. AWPers are seriously getting massive kill:death ratios and it\'s got no skill. If they miss, they\'ll fire a couple rounds off with the pistol right after, then switch back to awp and try again. Makes it almost impossible to hit them when they\'ve got no slow-down and can jump around with a pistol in hand. The script allows them to move faster by not having the awp in hand.\n\n\n\nAnd you ever wonder why everyone uses an AWP/deagle? Well for one deagle is stronger than all pistols. But two, with an awp in hand it\'s the fastest one to switch to. There\'s no animation of the gun getting ready in your hand, it instantly shows up and is ready.\n\n\n\nMy suggestions:\n\n1) Make the scripting action available to everyone. As the ol\' saying goes "If you can\'t beat \'em, join \'em" or "If everyone else is doing it, why shouldn\'t I?"\n\n2) Actually make the reloading of the chamber mandatory (ie. Not skippable) The scripting process skips the animation, even if you do it manually.\n\n3) If the person holds an awp, they move slower not matter what other weapon they switch to.\n\n4) Make a deagle animation like the other pistols when the switch is made to that weapon.  \n\n\n\nIs the Script a hack? NO\n\n\n\nPeople missing by an inch and still getting the kill,  because the enemy is running / you are watching 1st person thus you see them as if they have 0 ping / FPS are different /  connection speed is different / resolution is different / rates are different / Video Modes/Cards are different.\n\n\n\nBasically another post [color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color]ing about the AWM.\n\n\n\nNot all great snipers use scripts.\n\n\n\nSo whats your beef?  LOL do you actually need to see the sniper reload? will that make you feel better?\n\n\n\nAs for scripting I use a pistol switch occasionally, mainly because I use the Arrow keys for movement and I don\'t have a lot of options that way.  But all scripts are limited to a certain extent.  Some quick switch scripts don\'t allow you to throw a nade.\n\n\n\nI think most players do not use quick switch scripts mainly because there is always a downside to them.\n\n\n\nDo you use a Buy Script?  basically the same as any other script in a sense.  It binds multiple commands to One key. Simply making your life easier.\n\n\n\n1. These scripts ARE available to everyone.\n\n2. Pointless\n\n3. They do run slower\n\n4. Dunno wtf you\'re talking about (maybe cocking the gun)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333375, 51759, 1013, 101533, 1072936800, '', 'from what i have noticed and heard about those scripts is that,  it doesnt make the it any faster to shoot, it just gets ride of the animation.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333388, 51759, 1013, 102662, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by -[ToonZ]-Shaggy \n\nfrom what i have noticed and heard about those scripts is that,  it doesnt make the it any faster to shoot, it just gets ride of the animation.  \n\n\n\nCorrect. There is no glitch that speeds up the reloads in between shots.\n\n\n\n(Unless you\'re a little speed haxin biotch)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333389, 51759, 1013, 100065, 1072936800, '', 'Getting rid of the animation is a lie. Something people who script want you to believe. I fail to see why that would make it the most widely used script in CS history. Nobody is going to program or download a script so they don\'t have to watch animation.\n\n\n\nYes, actually seeing the sniper reload would be great. It would make him a sitting duck for a second or two. Then the awp would actually need some skill to get more than a few kills.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333391, 51759, 1013, 102662, 1072936800, '', '"Getting rid of the animation is a lie. Something people who script want you to believe."\n\n\n\nEver try pressing Q 2 times? has the same effect as a script.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333398, 51759, 1013, 100065, 1072936800, '', 'So you\'re going to hit your left mouse button, then Q, then Q again after every single awp shot? Sounds like a lot of work to hit one guy with an awp bullet.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333400, 51759, 1013, 102662, 1072936800, '', '"And you ever wonder why everyone uses an AWP/deagle? Well for one deagle is stronger than all pistols. But two, with an awp in hand it\'s the fastest one to switch to. There\'s no animation of the gun getting ready in your hand, it instantly shows up and is ready."\n\n\n\nlol @ you\n\n\n\nYes it appears instantly in your hand but it cannot be fired until the animation is over.\n\n\n\nJust because you can\'t see the animation doesn\'t mean its not doing it.\n\n\n\nIt only looks like it can be fired instantly because your watching 1st Person (i\'ll say it again: When you watch someone 1st person you see them as if they have 0 ping) \n\n\n\nAWM to FiveSeven has the same effect, yet no [color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color]ing?\n\n\n\n"So you\'re going to hit your left mouse button, then Q, then Q again after every single awp shot? Sounds like a lot of work to hit one guy with an awp bullet."\n\n\n\nDoesn\'t necessarily have to be Q. I use mouse wheel down, some people use space bar.\n\n\n\nOr just hit "Q" one time to switch to pistol.  Not really a big deal.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333407, 51759, 1013, 100065, 1072936800, '', 'It doesn\'t matter if I doing it first-person, or I\'m doing it myself, the deagle just appears in their hand. There is 0 animation, you miss with an awp, and that deagle will kill you anyways.\n\n\n\nPlus, have you ever seen anyone with an awp and a 5-seven? Does anyone actually use the combination? Nope, thanks for coming out though, here\'s your prize just for coming out. []\n\n\n\nSo explain to me this, why does everyone want to skip the animation? There\'s never any answer to this question...except for "It makes you feel like you are able to shoot faster." lol', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333416, 51759, 1013, 102347, 1072936800, '', 'If there is no advantaqge in using the script why do so many AWP users have it.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333421, 51759, 1013, 102662, 1072936800, '', '"Plus, have you ever seen anyone with an awp and a 5-seven? Does anyone actually use the combination? Nope, thanks for coming out though, here\'s your prize just for coming out.  \n\n\n\nSo explain to me this, why does everyone want to skip the animation? There\'s never any answer to this question...except for "It makes you feel like you are able to shoot faster." lol"\n\n\n\nyes ppl do use the 5-7 and awp combo. \n\n(not in leagues that\'d be stupid)\n\n\n\nEveryone wants to skip the animation for 2 reasons:\n\n\n\n1. The faster you switch to your pistol the quicker you will be able to retriet after firing a shot.\n\n\n\n2. Because any other way just looks noobish. []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333431, 51759, 1013, 100065, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by vizion0583nick \n\nyes ppl do use the 5-7 and awp combo. \n\n(not in leagues that\'d be stupid)\n\n\n\nEveryone wants to skip the animation for 2 reasons:\n\n\n\n1. The faster you switch to your pistol the quicker you will be able to retriet after firing a shot.\n\n\n\n2. Because any other way just looks noobish. []  \n\nWhy would a 5-7 look stupid in a league? It has more bullets than any other weapon besides the elites.\n\n\n\nPlus, when an awper shoots with his pistol out, he\'s moving as fast as any pistol person is. As soon as the awp goes away, he\'s instantly faster, that\'s why people use that script, to gain mobility between shots.\n\n\n\nAnd awpers aren\'t retreating, they are taking out the entire team. One guy with a script can take out 5 guys easily with a few jumps in between shots. Their record will look damn impressive within a few rounds and any scripter will deny any wrong doing.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333441, 51759, 1013, 102662, 1072936800, '', '"Why would a 5-7 look stupid in a league? It has more bullets than any other weapon besides the elites." \n\n\n\nI didn\'t say anything about it looking stupid.  It is just a weak gun in CS. Glock is 10 times better.\n\n\n\n"Plus, when an awper shoots with his pistol out, he\'s moving as fast as any pistol person is. As soon as the awp goes away, he\'s instantly faster, that\'s why people use that script, to gain mobility between shots."\n\n\n\nSo. whats wrong with that? Only idiots would just keep their AWM scoped or in hand.\n\n\n\n"And awpers aren\'t retreating, they are taking out the entire team. One guy with a script can take out 5 guys easily with a few jumps in between shots. Their record will look damn impressive within a few rounds and any scripter will deny any wrong doing."\n\n\n\nlmao then you must be playing in a horribly unskilled server if 5 guys can\'t take out one Awper.\n\n\n\nlol "wrong doing" he did nothing wrong.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333443, 51759, 1013, 102663, 1072936800, '', 'I do think that there is an exploit with the awp and deagle. when you shoot with an awp it takes 2-3 seconds to reload. when you shoot the awp and switch to hand gun and back using "Q" or your quick switch button and then you switch back to to awp again you can do it in 1 second and be ready with a shot cause you skipped that animation. plus with the deagles instant pop up no caulking animation you have an instant defense where all other hand guns have a 1 second animation with them caulking or chambering a round. I think if they change those two things to coincide with all the other guns and how they have delays when pulling them up cause of animation then the game play will change big time for awpers.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(333453, 51759, 1013, 102662, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by boomboom69 \n\nI do think that there is an exploit with the awp and deagle. when you shoot with an awp it takes 2-3 seconds to reload. when you shoot the awp and switch to hand gun and back using "Q" or your quick switch button and then you switch back to to awp again you can do it in 1 second and be ready with a shot cause you skipped that animation. plus with the deagles instant pop up no caulking animation you have an instant defense where all other hand guns have a 1 second animation with them caulking or chambering a round. I think if they change those two things to coincide with all the other guns and how they have delays when pulling them up cause of animation then the game play will change big time for awpers.  \n\n\n\nIf it was an exploit there would have been an update months ago.\n\n\n\nNo matter how fast you switch back to the AWM the shots will never be faster than the last one.\n\n\n\nIt is the exact same as using the M4A1 / Deagle combo.\n\n\n\nwhen you have a silencer on the M4 try spraying a little and switch fast to your deagle..\n\n\n\nSame effect as Awp/deagle and you cannot fire the deagle until the animation is completed.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
