(339774, 52030, 1005, 102664, 1072936800, '', 'Wow!  You know one thing I never like to do is accuse a person of lying.  For a person to be lying they have to intentionally NOT tell the truth.  And for you to KNOW that they are NOT telling the truth, you have to be able to read their minds to know what they know.   Mr ginipig is obviously a telepath and not a very good one either.  Mr ginipig?  I REALLY would like for you to come and see for yourself so that you can know that your acusations of lying are entirely false.  Oh!!  And I will remix AIM_USP_MAP just for you! I will add a bombsite and buyzones just to prove you wrong.\n\n\n\nI now remember  the site that I got the program from, but I am a little reluctant to share.  If EVERYONE can do what I\'ve found out about....it is no longer rare or special.  Can you understand that?\n\n\n\nWhy don\'t you visit my server and see for yourself.  It does not require you to download any new maps so don\'t worry about "wasting" time downloading a "new" map.  \n\n\n\nThe remixes that are in rotation are:\n\n\n\nDE_AZTEC\n\nCS_ITALY\n\nDE_CBBLE\n\nCS_ASSAULT\n\nCS_OFFICE\n\nAIM_AK-COLT\n\n\n\nCome visit and see for yourself.\n\n\n\n\n\nServer name "Detroit Plus Suburbs (Remixed Maps)" \n\nServer IP: 66.36.243.11:27015\n\n\n\nThanks for your time.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
