(355412, 54471, 1005, 101002, 1072936800, 'TFC admins are the dumbest admins', 'I was simply playing on teh server and as a scout when i saw someone run past the spawn i shot them and threw a conc on them and msot of the time i killed them and most of my kills where from team mates but i didnt say anything and just dismissed it as accidents until one player is walking into the spawn when im just coming out and tk\'s me for no reason and he starts saying i shouldnt be on defense as a scout........ so im trying to explain how i was just coming out of the spawn and was getting tked so teh admin changed me to the other team and i became a soldier and started defending and a few seconds later i got kicked when that idiot was still complaining about me on defense as a scout even though i was on the other team and he was the one tking me. how dumb an admin do you have to be to kick the victim of tk\'s\n\n\n\n\n\nedit* only posting now because the other day i was playing and killed a few of the clan which owned the server (on enemy team) and was kick banned........like wtf kind of retards get admin powers these days?\n\n\n\n\n\nedit* [burstfire.net] CTFCL Public Corpse Den was the moron server today and i\'ve got a demo becausewhen i joined and couldnt be soldier i change to hw kill one person and they start screaming out to kick me even though i had absolutly no warning and they never even attempted to say it was off limits\n\n__________________\n\nAthlon XP 2500+ @ 3200+\n\n\nEpox 8rda3+\n\n\n1024mb dual channel ddr\n\n\nSLK-900a heatsink\n\n\n32mb Geforce2 mx 100/200 AGP 4x (surprising 99fps excluding smoke)\n\n\n\n\n\nI am 36% addicted to Counterstrike. http://seanism.com/addiction/cs.php What about you?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(355615, 54471, 1005, 102693, 1072936800, '', 'We care about you getting kicked from a server, seriously.\n\n\n\n\n\nOn a more serious note, learn how to spell. \n\n\n\n\n\nOn an even more serious note, I partially agree. A lot of TFC admins don\'t have a clue, along with a large majority of the rest of the TFC players. One reason is because a lot of very young people get rights as admins. Usually, the younger people are the stupider they are. But I think if we look at Counter-Strike we\'ll find a much larger populous of ignorant admins. I could go on and on about the problems with admins in Half-Life and its mods but I wont. Quite frankly we can\'t do anything about them. Just leave and go to a different server.\n\n__________________\n\nuBeR', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(355683, 54471, 1005, 102614, 1072936800, 'TFC admins are the dumbest admins', 'quote:Originally posted by Mickie M \n\n\nedit* [burstfire.net] CTFCL Public Corpse Den was the moron server today and i\'ve got a demo becausewhen i joined and couldnt be soldier i change to hw kill one person and they start screaming out to kick me even though i had absolutly no warning and they never even attempted to say it was off limits  \n\n\n\n\n\nBut did you bother to read the message of the day which may have said it was?  Most of the time, if you read the MOTD carefully and follow the rules there, you\'ll have no problem.  Granted, TFC does have it\'s fair share of crap admins just as CS does.  I was banned from a CS server because I "never rushed with my knife out" which was apparently slowing up the admin behind me.  **** happens, just find another server.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(355787, 54471, 1005, 101002, 1072936800, '', 'you think if they didnt want hw\'s at all they\'d add a mod or set there limit to 0 like anyone with half a brain would do but if they did they wouldnt kick the person getting tked and kick the tker instead which would happen in cs, i nearly always get kicked from tfc servers with clans who i can kill to easily.......never happens in cs and ive never been kicked once in dod at all which means if your looking for losers who can\'t take being owned and who can\'t stand any challenge at all tfc servers are where to find them.\n\n__________________\n\nAthlon XP 2500+ @ 3200+\n\n\nEpox 8rda3+\n\n\n1024mb dual channel ddr\n\n\nSLK-900a heatsink\n\n\n32mb Geforce2 mx 100/200 AGP 4x (surprising 99fps excluding smoke)\n\n\n\n\n\nI am 36% addicted to Counterstrike. http://seanism.com/addiction/cs.php What about you?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(356651, 54471, 1005, 102694, 1072936800, '', 'Use some punctuation man. I can\'t tell what the hell you are trying to say first off. \n\n\n\n\n\nSecond, being an admin myself I see people banned all the time for stupid crap they pull on servers. Later I see them in forums complaining about how THEY were the victim. It wasn\'t my server you were banned from, but I\'d just like to say *there has to be more to it than that*. Everyone wants to tell their side of the story, and everyone has a different view of what happened.\n\n\n\n\n\nThird, I agree with Uber...who cares that you got kick/banned? So you come on here acting like a dumbass so we can all watch out for  you on our servers too? LOL!\n\n__________________\n\nTechbot-|tF|-\n\n\n\n\n\nhttp://www.team-fun.net', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(356719, 54471, 1005, 100037, 1072936800, '', 'Servers like [burstfire.net] CTFCL Public Corpse are more or less for "advanced players". They demand you to know how to play clan-style-like and if you dont they just kick you out.\n\n\n\n\n\nFor people not used to play clanwars it can be hard to understand the "rules" and my advice is to play elsewhere if you dont know them or learn them before joining.\n\n__________________\n\n-= [MsA]FourStroke =-', '127.0.0.1', 1),
