(362027, 55279, 1013, 100357, 1072936800, 'Complete Mod List for Half-Life and half-Life 2!', 'Complete Mod List for Half-Life and half-Life 2! \n\nThese are a couple of sucky/good/great mods. (My opinion)\n\n[=============================================]\n\n             Half-Life Mods List\n\n[=============================================]\n\nSven CO-OP (http://www.svencoop.com/) (good for the 1st few times its played)\n\nNatural Selection (http://www.natural-selection.org/) (great)\n\nAdrenaline Gamer (http://www.planethalflife.com/agmod/) (great)\n\nFireArms (http://www.firearmsmod.com/) (good)\n\nSurprise (http://www.planethalflife.com/ps07/) (great fun)\n\nMission Failed (http://www.neodelight.com/missionfailed/) (good single player)\n\nHostile Intent (http://www.planethalflife.com/hostileintent/index.asp) (havnt played it much yet cant say)\n\nEarths Special Forces (http://www.esforces.com/) (Good)\n\nScience and Industry (http://www.planethalflife.com/si/) (sucky)\n\nThe Battle Grounds (http://www.bgmod.com/) (never tryed it) \n\nInternational Online Soccer (http://www.planethalflife.com/ios/) (never tryed it)\n\nDigital Paintball (http://www.digitalpaintball.net/?site=2&sid=) (never tryed it)\n\nThe Specialists (http://www.specialistsmod.net/) (great)\n\nGrenades, Snarks & Teleporters (http://www.planethalflife.com/gst/) (sucky)\n\nBumper Cars (http://www.planethalflife.com/bumpercars/) (sucky)\n\nPublic Enemy (http://www.public-enemy.org/page/index.php?page=news&lang=engl) (Looks cool)\n\nMorbid Inclination (http://www.planethalflife.com/morbid/) (sucky)\n\nWeapons Factory (http://www.planethalflife.com/hlwf/index.html) (sucky)\n\nGlitter\'s HL-GUN (http://www.glitterstream.net/hl_gun/) (havnt tryed it yet)\n\nCounter-Life (http://cl.cscentral.com/) (good single player)\n\nDragonmod Z (http://dmz.flagrun.net/index.php) (havnt tryed it yet)\n\nUnderworld (http://www.planethalflife.com/features/motw/underworld.shtm) (good)\n\nWanted (http://www.planethalflife.com/features/motw/wantedhl.shtm) (good)\n\nFrontline Force (http://www.planethalflife.com/features/motw/flf15.shtm) (good)\n\nEscape (http://www.dmc-interactive.de/escape/index.html) (not sure but i think i played this before dont remember, but if it is what im thinking it was good)\n\nHoly Wars (http://www.planethalflife.com/holywars/news.htm) (sucky)\n\nThey Hunger 1-3/others (http://www.planethalflife.com/manke/) (great)\n\nInstaGIB:HL (http://www.planethalflife.com/instagib/) (sucky)\n\nResident Evil The Escape (http://www.planethalflife.com/rete/) (Really looking forward to this one) \n\nSex, Drugs & Beer Can (http://www.s-t-u-f-f.com/mod) (Looks dumb) \n\nGlobal Warfare (http://dynamic6.gamespy.com/~globalwarfare/) (Looks cool) \n\nDefiance (http://www.frontline2.com) (Played it a while back really didnt like it) \n\nNightwatch (http://www.hl-nightwatch.net) (Really looking forward to this one) \n\nPoke646 (http://www.poke646.com/) (Looks ok, Still need to play it) \n\nBushido (http://www.planethalflife.com/bushido/) (very interesting) \n\nChemical Existence (http://www.redgenesis.com/ce/ce.shtml) (Hum.. Maybe if they updated it would be good hehe)\n\nCounter-Strike Deathmatch (http://cs-dm.cjb.net/) (This would be cool if they finished it) \n\nUnknown (http://www.dbpshome.com/) (dunno i would like to see some ss) \n\nUnknown (http://eftd.netzgames.net) (Looks good) \n\nHalf-Life Rally (http://www.hlrally.net/) (Not a big racing fan but ill still give it a shot)\n\nCounter-Strike 1.3 mod (http://www.cs13mod.com/) (for the people who like 1.3)\n\nTour of Duty (http://www.tourofdutymod.com/) (Not into war games but for whoever is this mod looks good)\n\nMain Site (http://www.halfquake.com)\n\nHalfQuake (http://farm.muddasheep.com/hq/)\n\nHalfQuake2 (http://farm.muddasheep.com/hq2)\n\nHalfquake3 (http://farm.muddasheep.com/hq3) (Never got to play these mods but they look good, when i find some time ill check them out)\n\nGoldeneye (http://www.terragna.com/goldeneye/news.php) (Has potential lets see what they will do)\n\nMonkey Strike (http://www.monkeystrike.com/) (really dont know what to say about this :/)\n\nWater Wars (http://www.water-wars.net/ww.php) (looks fun)\n\nTest Your Skill (http://www.tys-mod.de.vu/) (Havnt played it yet)\n\nGangwars (http://www.gangwars.net/) (Dont feel this will be worth while)\n\nSweet Half-life  (http://www2d.biglobe.ne.jp/~ks_wca/shlhtm/shl_fm_e.htm) (Looks interesting)\n\nNostalgia (http://www.planethalflife.com/nostalgia/) (Havnt played it yet)\n\nParoxysm (http://dynamic3.gamespy.com/~paroxysm/site/news.shtml) (Havnt played it yet)\n\nEscape From Woomera (http://www.escapefromwoomera.org/) (Looks Cool, will try it when i get more time) \n\nEscape From Woomera walkthrough (http://users.tpg.com.au/shinobe/EscapeFromWoomera-Walkthrough.doc)\n\n[=============================================]\n\n     For more mods check out these sites.\n\n[=============================================]\n\nhttp://www.planethalflife.com/espacemod/us_index.html (http://www.planethalflife.com/espacemod/us_index.html)\n\nhttp://www.moddb.com/ (http://www.moddb.com/)\n\nhttp://www.half-life.hu/indexeng.php (http://www.half-life.hu/indexeng.php)\n\n[=============================================] \n\n             Half-Life 2 Mods \n\n[=============================================]\n\nColdwar: Melting Point (http://cw-meltingpoint.hl2files.com/) (Looks ok) \n\nNeoshock Online (http://www.neoshockmod.net/) (Looking forward to this one) \n\nStormforge (http://www.stormforge.dk/index.htm) (Looks real good) \n\nAftermath (http://www.planetunreal.com/aftermath/news.htm) (Dunno looks ok but we will see) \n\nInfected (http://infected.half-lifenews.com/) (Interesting) \n\nTeam Fortress Classic 2 (http://www.tfc2.net/) (Team Fortress Classic Fans watch out) \n\nSilenced (http://silencedmod.suddenlaunch.com/) (Really looking forward to this one, Here are some screens for this mod http://mods.moddb.com/gallery/2119/?start=0 (http://mods.moddb.com/gallery/2119/?start=0)) \n\nResistance & liberation (http://www.resistanceandliberation.com/) (Looks real good) \n\nRenegade X: The Dead 6 (http://www.renevo.com/d6/index.php) (Really looking forward to this one) \n\nPost Apocalypse (http://postapocalypse.vaneede.com/?page=home) (Looks ok, looking forward to it) \n\nXX7 (http://www.007gaming.com/xx7/index.php) (Doesnt look so great but we will see) \n\nProject Ascension (http://www.projectascension.org/) (Not much to see but still good to follow)\n\nNo More Room In Hell (http://nmrh.hlgaming.com/index.php) (Hum Interesting) \n\nNuclear Dreams (http://www.nucleardreams.com/index.php) (Going to keep an out for this one looks good) \n\nOperation: CO-IN (http://www.opcoin.net/) (Looks worth while)\n\nDawn of the Dead (http://www.littlelostpoly.co.uk/Dodmain.htm) (Dont know about this eh will see when it gets released)\n\nHull Breach (http://www.hull-breach.com) (Really looking forward to this one)\n\nEternal Silence (http://www.eternal-silence.net/) (Cant wait for this mod to come out looks really good)\n\nChaos ops (http://www.chaosops.net) (Eh doesnt look like something worth while)\n\nWar of the Worlds (http://wotw.scifiheaven.net/) (War Of the Worlds mod seems interesting.\n\nStarGate: Brokenoath (http://www.brokenoath.net/) (bassed on a old movie stargate this might be something interesting)\n\nBlack Dragon (http://www.blackdragonmod.com/) (The planes look neat waiting on this one)\n\nFirstmoon (http://www.firstmoon.net/) (Looks like a good single player mod)\n\nDracten (http://www.dracten.halflife-mods.com/news.php) (This looks like a really good single player fast passed action game)\n\nCrisis 51 (http://crisis51.hl2db.com) (not enough info for me to say anything)\n\nBoones End (http://www.boones-end.com/?section=index) (This looks great cant wait)\n\n[============================================] \n\nHave fun playing! If anyone has a different opinion about the mods plz post what you think. I would also like if people posted mods that i havnt posted and the link to the site where i can download them.\n\n\n\n+---------------------------------+\n\n|List updated June 28 2004| \n\n+---------------------------------+\n\n__________________\n\n-----------------------------------------------\n\n#Exidence @ irc.gamesurge.net\n\n-----------------------------------------------\n\n//Specs//setup//\n\nPent4 2.53\n\n512 SD DDR \n\nGeforce4 Ti 4600 128 mb\n\n120 gigs\n\nWindows xp home\n\nmx 300\n\nsupermat\n\n-----------------------------------------------\n\nHalf-Life/Half-Life 2 Mod list\n\n/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=55279\n\n==========================\n\nGame you need to look out for.\n\n/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=96383\n\n==========================\n\nhttp://www.gotfrag.com/?node=user&id=24583&x=2D91670E\n\nhttp://www.sogamed.com/member.php?id=138042\n\nhttp://www.schroet.com/member.php?id=62264', '127.0.0.1', 1),
