(414901, 61264, 1013, 102752, 1072936800, 'cd key troubles', 'Hello again.  Not to be a pest but, I need a little feedback.  I have never even used steam before, so why would my cd key be in use already?  I had thought about buying more valve software, but not if I\'m not going to be able to use it.\n\nPlease respond.\n\nuser email:\n\ndrfunbags@hotmail.com (mailto:drfunbags@hotmail.com)\n\nor alternate\n\njoannekidd@sympatico.ca (mailto:joannekidd@sympatico.ca)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
