(409894, 61328, 1013, 100027, 1072936800, 'If you never get the Validation Email', 'If Steam asks you for a validation code when you try to install the games (for instance, when you double-click on Counter-Strike and it says "You have chosen to add Half-Life Platinum Pack), it says that it sent you an email with the validation code in it.\n\n\n\nDue to a bug, that email might not be sent. If you don\'t have the email in 15 minutes, go to the main Steam window and do this:\n\n\n\n- click Settings\n\n- click Verify Email Address\n\n- click Next\n\n\n\nThis will send the email. It should arrive in a couple of minutes. If it doesn\'t, the system may be loaded down - but it will definitely send it (no bug in this one [] ). When it arrives, enter the code into the box. Steam will then let you proceed to the window where you enter your cd-key to subscribe to the games.\n\n\n\nthanks,\n\n\n\nTaylor', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(410251, 61328, 1013, 102758, 1072936800, '', 'Wow i got it in 5 minutes thanks []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
