(469211, 68076, 1005, 102804, 1072936800, 'rimmed', 'My gripe is this... they sure aren\'t having problems releasing updates for the new Condition Zero... hrmmm fresh money. They know HL2 is due out soon...I bet they are counting on us to ride the wave with the bugs in DOD till DOD2 then they figure no new money coming in from DOD so why bother? CZ on the other hand..got to put some spit shine on it to make that new money.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
