(466849, 68978, 1005, 102838, 1072936800, 'Join the b3.1 community!', 'Bored of 1.1 and Miss 3.1?\n\nA few guys are starting up a new community, where old 3.1 players can once play again, we have a few servers up at the moment and more players would help greatly, especially if you love 3.1 like we all do.\n\n\n\nhttp://threepointone.proboards27.com/index.cgi (http://threepointone.proboards27.com/index.cgi)\n\n\n\nIncludes 3.1 client download links\n\nServer Ip\'s\n\nInstructions on how to play 3.1 correctly on steam\n\n\n\nSee you on the 3.1 battlefield.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
