(467333, 68978, 1005, 102378, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by {PRS}Ajax-{TC}- \n\nBring back Beta 2.0!\n\n\n\nRunning, jumping, prone, no-recoil BAR pwnz j00! ph33r. []  \n\n\n\nare u serious about 2.0  , that was the worst version ever besides 1.0 retail . 2.1 fixed the 2.0 problems but it still sucked A$$  , then everyone came back when 3.0 and 3.1 came out .\n\n\n\nalot of people left when 2.0 came out , and the same with 1.0 retail .   \n\n\n\nlet me guess, u never played 1.3b or 1.2b  or 1.1b or 1.0b , or 6.8aplha . \n\n\n\nheres a story of dod:\n\n\n\ndod1.3 was fine except it had no  m1carbine,greasygun,k43,fg42,mg42,mg34,30cal,bazoo\n\nka,panzershreck .  then the dev team thought it was smart to add new features , so they made 2.0b , a few days later tons of people left dod because of bugs,glitches,exploits,unbalanced gameplay . then they made 2.1 for those that were still playing ,but then it sucked because the recoil was too unrealistic , and then once again they need to noob-a-ize it so they made 3.0 which was ok except it was BUGGY , then they made 3.1 which was awsome and then a few days later , some guys like me came back to dod because it finally got better , then as weeks go by and a bunch of CS goons  migrate to dod3.1 , everything was going good for a while then all the sudden the dev team gets greedy and sells dod to valve, and then valve dictates how dod will be and listens to what the crybaby n00b minority thinks , and then they make 1.0 retail , then weeks go by and alot of dod players switch to BF1942 and MOH . the failure of dod2.0b and dod1.0 retail show that  new features and noobish balancing ruin the game for the majority , solution = dont add new features unless u test them first and make sure u know what the heck ur doing or everyone will go play: CoD,MOH,BF1942 . dod1.1 is ok but it becomes usless when valve makes every steam update feature new BUGS that are worst than the previous bugs , and when they forget to test fixes before they release them .   sometimes things dont need to be fixed . dod1.3 and dod3.1  were the best .  THE END', '127.0.0.1', 1),
