(470694, 69450, 1005, 102846, 1072936800, '', 'ya but this isnt HL, HL was good this is (so far) is a peice of crap that played on all of are love for CS with nice screenshots. If you ask me if this so called patch doesnt come out  tommorow Valve needs to be sued for false advertising.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
