(495765, 72991, 1013, 100314, 1072936800, '', 'i was just wonderin what you used to record it?? i use fraps for my records. and also, what did you use to translate i to make it smaller. becuase like 1 min of fraps record it almost a gig of hdd space. when you compress it though it goes to jsut a few mbs. but the quality is dipped. i was jsut wondering what you gusy did?\n\n__________________\n\n.BPG.ZACH (Formerly known as Devastator)\n\n\n\nATI Radeon 9800 XT 256mb\n\nKingston Hyper X Dual Channel DDR 512 Mb Memory\n\nPentium 2.4 ghz 800 fsb\n\nASUS P4C800 E-Deluxe 800 FSB\n\nSB Audigy 2 platinum ex\n\nLogitech Z680 5.1 Surround Sound Speakers\n\n240 gigs of hard drive space\n\n17" Flat LCD Screen\n\nCable Modem\n\n\n\nI\'ve been a member of these forums since Jan 2003. I know it doesnt say that , because my other account got banned (I used to be Devastator).  and I\'ve beeen with steam since 1.1 beta. Before the internet knew, before YOU knew about it, or anyone else. I have a friend thats in league with valve and told me about it. I remember when there were only 4 servers running and 42 people playing on the entire steam network. so dont give me ****!\n\n\n\nWe Are Recruiting! Post on our Forums says Trial Please! (Say ZACH referred you)\n\n\n\nhttp://www.bpgaming.com/index.php\n\n\n\nI am 85% addicted to Counterstrike. http://seanism.com/addiction/cs.php]What about you?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
