(631387, 73708, 1013, 102893, 1072936800, '', 'Bump for 56k\'ers.\n\n\n\nNote to the less techniclly aware...\n\nRegedit is an awsome tool when you know how to use it... but be careful. A few un-educated tweaks could send your comp crashing to the ground. Follow directions as precisely as possible... dont try to make any extra changes that arent specifically needed.\n\n\n\nBe Warned...\n\n\n\n-RO', '127.0.0.1', 1),
