(501369, 73756, 1013, 102898, 1072936800, '', 'sorry dude but all those ppl were not unbanned...im living proof that not all bans were lifted...i got banned on the 4th of april and im still not unbanned...no hax,cheats,buy scripts,winamp....nothing but i still got banned', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(501409, 73756, 1013, 100136, 1072936800, '', 'buy scripts are not cheats, nor detected by vac as cheats...something else might be setting it off then with their new updated vac modules. i really do honestly think all of you were wrongly and falsely banned, more so because my step brother was and i know he sure wouldn\'t cheat.\n\n__________________\n\n<!--\n\n\n\nLearn to incorporate what your thread is about INTO THE TITLE of the thread before posting!!!11\n\n\n\n-->', '127.0.0.1', 1),
