(519389, 73756, 1013, 102904, 1072936800, '', 'quote:hey nick, get Valve put in as your status  hehehe some idiot here will flame you i\'m sure for not saying valve. \n\n\n\n\n\nYeah, I\'ve been meaning to get Waldo to set my account up - normally I just lurk about.  \n\n\n\n\n\nquote:I am new to the form, and do not recognize all the names of Valve employees. He is tagged as a Junior Member. Is it safe to send this guy account info?\n\n\n\n\n\nUntil Waldo gets me set up, trust the address:  nicks@valvesoftware.com (mailto:nicks@valvesoftware.com)\n\n\n\n\n\nAlso, don\'t send me your login password or CD-key.  I\'m really just looking for your steam ID, which is publically available anyways.  (join an insecure server and type \'status\' to find your steam ID)\n\n\n\n\n\n          Nick\n\n\n\n\n\n--\n\n\nNick Shaffner\n\n\nValve', '127.0.0.1', 1),
