(539709, 77674, 1013, 102944, 1072936800, '', 'Still waiting for an answer.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(539795, 77674, 1013, 102945, 1072936800, '', 'How long does it take to get an answer for a valid question?\n\nThis is also one of the reason why I am still not running steam.\n\nI am not seeing the cybercafe program people being supportive to the game center.  Can\'t get a question answered in a timely manner.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
