(534622, 77874, 1026, 102904, 1072936800, '', 'quote:why not a own VAC forum?\n\nthat would also clean up the other forums and you don\'t need to post updates twice... \n\n\n\nWell, 4 times technically.  I also post it to the hlds and hlds-linux mailing lists.  I figured I\'d just start posting here as well.\n\n\n\nAs for putting VAC in it\'s own forum:\n\n\n\nYou\'d banish me to a room with all those cheaters?  *sob* ;^)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
