(535833, 77874, 1026, 100469, 1072936800, '', 'hey nick, since i know you are gonna view this thread rofl...can you tell us your thoughts on C-D and its method of preventing cheats from running. can you tell us why VAC\'s method of detecting cheats and banning is the better way, and the advantages and disadvantages of each method? or can you make a sticky about this so you can pwn all the whiners about how vac sucks and c-d rules? THANKS  you\'re the man ;-)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
