(535844, 77874, 1026, 100469, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Nick Shaffner \n\nSorry, I can\'t comment on this.  \n\n\n\nawww thanks for the quick reply heh. couldn\'t hurt asking. anyways i just gotta say i like vac\'s method way more that c-d []\n\n\n\nsheesh linux section of your post is totally unpopular!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
