(598485, 78948, 1013, 100016, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by EricS \n\nWe\'ve found and fixed this problem.  We\'ll be releasing the fix soon.  Thanks, everyone, for your efforts to help find clues about the problem.\n\n\n\nEric Smith\n\nValve  \n\n\n\nJust the backwards facing player issue, or all the hitbox issues? Or at least most of them. []\n\n\n\nOr is the Hitbox issue a function of the backwards facing player issue or is the hitboxes issue something else entirely?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
