(550632, 79604, 1005, 102395, 1072936800, '', 'I love Valve now! (In a Non-Sexual way [])\n\n__________________\n\n/forums/showthread.php?s=&postid=575318#post575318\n\n\n\nGolden Maven said: \n\nI love how some people complain because the weapons are more balanced now. The AWP is meant to be used for great distances, and Rebirth104, you shouldn\'t be able to eliminate 5 incoming enemies with a sniper, unless you are really, really far away from them. 1 man taking down 5 incoming enemies by himself with a sniper, now that\'s unbalanced. You do know what snipers are meant for, correct? Hint : It ain\'t assault.\n\n\n\nVALVe fixed a bug, plain and simple. Explain how you can rebolt the AWP while switching guns or holding a pistol in a fire-ready position? That\'s right, you can\'t, unless you have three arms. Use your heads people, the AWP was too powerful. You\'re just mad because you no longer have an advantage, and will have to play on the same grounds as everyone else. Too bad, let the fair(er) games begin. \n\n\n\nCliffe said: Wow, Well Said.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(559597, 79604, 1005, 100419, 1072936800, '', 'What happened to this?\n\n__________________\n\nStop complaining and go back to the hole you crawled out of.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(559817, 79604, 1005, 100902, 1072936800, '', 'I suspect under the onslaught of complaints about crosshair size (which I hope the do something about) and the AWP change (which I hope they leave as is) they have adjusted their roadmap slightly. \n\n\n\nBut then again it looks like something Turtle Rock should be doing so maybe not.\n\n\n\nHopefully there will be something by the end of the week so I can play with new missions and customise some bots on the weekend.\n\n\n\nPerhaps it is on the verge of release and we are just being too darn impatient. It may be there now []\n\n\n\n\n\nEdit: It wasn\'t\n\n__________________\n\nAll opinions in this message are purely those of the author and do not reflect the opinions of the author in any way.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
