(551146, 79870, 1005, 103033, 1072936800, 'Can I ask why this was done to awp?', 'What is the purpose? Now i have to click mouse twice to zoom...sometimes 3 times. Its like you want me to stop playing this game.  I can live with the xhairs thats no big deal, but the awp...wtf...what are you gonna do now...let people play as hostages or some other stupid ****.....honestly....ask the community before you do this ****..plenty of people use csnation..or even counter-strike website...think...THINK...been playing this game since beta 5....*** *** *** sirs\n\n\n\n<< edit >>\n\nLay off the racial stuff please', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551165, 79870, 1005, 102693, 1072936800, '', 'What are you talking about no one complained about it? I\'d say about 85-87%  of all the CS have complained and [color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color]ed about the AWP. Now once they reform it, they complain and [color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color] about that. Just like everything they try to fix when people cry. Happens every time. Now spare us keep quiet.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551279, 79870, 1005, 103034, 1072936800, '', 'uber...you don\'t even know what you are talking about...\n\n\n\nhttp://www.petitiononline.com/mod_p...ned.cgi?giveawp (http://www.petitiononline.com/mod_perl/signed.cgi?giveawp)\n\n\n\nplease go there and sign the petition...I know petitions arne\'t much but they have to change this back...it\'s just horrible...\n\n\n\nOk...first of all...What makes this game so good?...it\'s the game play...the element of gameplay...the idea...the engine of this game is what makes it good. Plus...THE main reason this is one of the #1 online games is because of these so called "glitches" that steam likes to call them. When we see someone not quick switching between the awp and deagle and not quick scopin too much what do we think?..this guy isn\'t too experienced. The fact that we could quick scope and quick switch made the experienced people feel good about them selves and the fact that they are better than others...I know that\'s not a good thing to say...But it\'s the truth..The fact that there are so many glitches in this game that people could take advantage of to have an advantage over others is what made this game so competitive...and now they are taking all those elements away. I\'ll bet anyone anything that 90% of cal I players will HATE this update. And have already been cursing it. And all you people that complain about the awp and are going to reply to this and state "STFU...you don\'t know what your talking about" you all gotta get over the fact that people can kill you with one shot...Stop whining that you get awped and hating the gun when you can use the awp yourself or learn how to avoid the shots/kill awpers. Now you will all probably be saying "listen to the one who\'s whining?...your the one whining..." I have a good reason too when it comes to this. I just hope this petition gets out....and that this gets resolved soon cause this is really going to kill the game and make many people quit....', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551373, 79870, 1005, 103035, 1072936800, '', 'thats nice, now "1337" players won\'t be able to "take advantage" over others, idiot. that\'s the whole point of it', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551378, 79870, 1005, 103036, 1072936800, '', 'whats is your problem, Valve fixed the AWP bug\n\n\n\nAll you AWP players learn how to use the AWP right, and stop being lame\n\n\n\nthanks valve good work', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551404, 79870, 1005, 103037, 1072936800, '', 'Worst fix for the awp ever. This is rediculous. STOP updating steam and just leave it how it is!!! You are losing more players than gaining.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551409, 79870, 1005, 102305, 1072936800, '', 'All I can say is...about bloody time.  Re-learn the weapon kids.  It\'s not that hard.  The AWP was too easy with too many glitches.  Sacrafices had to be made...you can thank all those that abused the glitches.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551410, 79870, 1005, 103038, 1072936800, '', '"thats nice, now "1337" players won\'t be able to "take advantage" over others, idiot. that\'s the whole point of it"\n\n\n\nAre you on crack? Why don\'t you cry a little more just because someone\'s better than you. If you don\'t like it, get your own server or find one that\'s private enough that you don\'t have to worry about it.\n\n\n\nValk, you\'re just as bad. AWP wasn\'t "too easy." You\'re just one of the whiney little idiots who couldn\'t take the time to learn it.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551412, 79870, 1005, 102693, 1072936800, '', 'I know what I\'m talking about. I\'ve been through almost every update in CS. People react the same way each time, which happens to be negative. Over time they get used to to it, and its fine and fun. Then there\'s anothe rupdate and the same thing happens--whatever the reason may be (such as your examples).', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551436, 79870, 1005, 103034, 1072936800, '', 'I love the fact that this forum is filled with valve lovers...lol...And the fact that they listen to just people that complain about every damn thing in the game is just pathetic. I love the fact that valve ONLY fixed the awp glitch because so many inexperienced playesr complained about it. Especially that so many people complain about the ATI FPS Drops and the fact that they don\'t acknowledge the problem and they fix something like this. And it\'s not even a fix. Valve has to listen to the COMMUNITY and not just the threads they WANT to read on their forum community that doesn\'t know what they are talking about. I just hope the large ammount of cal I people that talk about this will make a change in this game. Cause this game is gonna lose a lot of players because of this. I bared with the autosniper fix and all the other fixes but this one is just way to over the top. \n\n\n\nalso...jonnyboy....noticing that you complete OVERLOOKED the point of my post just makes me laugh "thats nice, now "1337" players won\'t be able to "take advantage" over others, idiot. that\'s the whole point of it"....They are not taking advantage over others..They are taking advantage of what STEAM CALLS "glitches"....Knowing how the game runs isn\'t glitching...it\'s being experienced and knowing how the game runs...that\'s experienced players...But bringing this game down to the fact that none of these little tricks will be in the system will just bring this games factor down to nothing...And all the experienced people will stop playing...and I aint just saying that..They are taking away what makes this game good...what seperates experienced people from inexperienced people...\n\n\n\nI just hope SOME people can understand what I\'m trying to get across...since most of this forum is valve lovers....\n\n\n\nGG Valve!...you screwed up on the ati issue and haven\'t even acknowledged the problem and you did this drastic change to the awp?....Come on valve...Start listening to the COMMUNITY than overall just your forum which isn\'t that great either..', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551478, 79870, 1005, 102693, 1072936800, '', 'You have to look at the situation logically. If you have tens of thousands more people complaining about sometime over the people who don\'t complain, you\'ll obviously want to fix the complaints. You have to please the masses.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551502, 79870, 1005, 103038, 1072936800, '', 'I think it\'s funny how I\'ve seen someone who supports the update say "If you don\'t like the change, don\'t use it."\n\n\n\nWhy is it funny? Cause I was actually thinking the same thing. If you didn\'t like how the game was, then don\'t play it. It\'s that simple.\n\n\n\nThen there wouldn\'t be these ridiculous changes.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551543, 79870, 1005, 103034, 1072936800, '', 'I understand the logical aspect. BUT..It\'s not logical at all for valve to only listen to the people complaining about the awp and just change it without advising the community...if they had atleast a poll or something that they could ADVISE the community about what they are going to do. That would be fine. Than the inexperienced and experienced players can both vote. You don\'t see the experienced people going to the forums and posting "LOVE THE AWP FOR QUICK SCOPING/SWITCHING!"...Cause it\'s part of the game. The only people that post are complainers and that adds up just because they get awped from people who are experienced and have played this game for years. I\'ve only been playing for 1.5....I hated getting awped but I adjusted to it and got use to it and started USING the awp. I just can\'t wait to see how the CPL/CAL Community and all the leagues react to this... A lot of people WILL be quitting because of bugs like this....Well....I just want to thank the people that give LOGICAL reasoning with this situation unlike the people "Stop [color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color][color=orange][font=wingdings]û[/font][/color]ing..it\'s been changed get used to it"....', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551548, 79870, 1005, 103039, 1072936800, '', 'This is pretty lame.  If this was changed do to noobs complaining about it.  That\'s just mad ***.  They would learn how to quickswitch like everyone else, it was part of the game.  Now awping is now more noob friendly since it takes like 5 seconds to fire a second shot with the awp now.  Seriously, why do this to the awp when you could remove the shield.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551553, 79870, 1005, 103038, 1072936800, '', 'They have done polls in the official CS forums. As I stated in another post, it\'s simply the unfortunate truth and uncoordinated fools outnumber the people who\'ve mastered the game, or were at least making attempts to master it.\n\n\n\nAs a result, crappy updates like this one happen.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(551663, 79948, 1005, 102713, 1072936800, 'Headshot Sprite FIX -- Download here!', 'Heres the Sprite fix!\n\n\n\nVisit www.tkwired.com (http://www.tkwired.com) there are 2 links right on the front page to download from!\n\n\n\nDownload that .spr file, and put it in your Steam/SteamApps/[youremail]/cstrike/sprites Directory and restart your cstrike client!\n\n\n\nVisit TKWired.com, IM me on AIM, or MSN and tell me if you downloaded this!...also post on here so people know I\'m not just trying to scam you...the files are there!\n\n\n\n***BTW, UP the post if you download and like it...keep it @ top for people to see***\n\n\n\nFrom what I hear, this is working for everyone...but the crosshair isn\'t...I have yet to figure out why.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
