(551834, 79948, 1005, 102713, 1072936800, '', 'Also, they changed the spr file so if you just replace the new 640hud1.spr with the old one, you get this HUGE orange bar above the headshot icon.  I had to make this sprite file specifically for the new update.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
