(551873, 79948, 1005, 103040, 1072936800, '', 'I love it.  It shows the headshot sprite next to the sprite of the weapon that did the damage.  This is certainly an improvement in my mind.   If you see someone get a headshot, you dont think much of it.  If you see someone get a headshot with a scout, maybe you should stay back.\n\n\n\nNice job thantiktiger.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
