(551994, 79990, 1005, 102713, 1072936800, 'Crosshair FIX too! -- Download here!', 'Heres the Crosshair fix!\n\n***THIS DOES NOT FIX THE DYNAMIC CROSSHAIRS***\n\n\n\nThis fixes the LENGTH of the crosshairs.\n\nand it does NOT bring the crosshairs closer to the center like some may believe...I cannot fix that by editing the sprite.\n\n\n\nVisit www.tkwired.com (http://www.tkwired.com) there are 2 links right on the front page to download from!\n\n\n\nDownload that .spr file, and put it in your Steam/SteamApps/[youremail]/cstrike/sprites Directory and restart your cstrike client!\n\n\n\nVisit TKWired.com, IM me on AIM, or MSN and tell me if you downloaded this!...also post on here so people know I\'m not just trying to scam you...the files are there!\n\n\n\n***BTW, UP the post if you download and like it...keep it @ top for people to see***\n\n\n\nThe crosshairs are actually a LITTLE bit smaller than the old ones.  If you guys complain I\'ll make \'em a little larger...\n\n\n\n***\n\nMake sure you save the file correctly...save as file type "All files"\n\nIf you dont have a C:\\Program Files\\Steam\\SteamApps\\tktiger@tkwired.com\\counter-strike\\cstrike\\sprites folder...(the SPRITES folder part)...Make the folder and put the .spr files in it.\n\n***', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(552027, 79990, 1005, 103041, 1072936800, '', 'Much better, much much better, much much much better. Though I still think vavle needs to fix it in steam itself, and allow us to change it\'s size.\n\n\n\n- Al', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(552046, 79990, 1005, 102713, 1072936800, '', '=D\n\n\n\nYay for me...\n\n\n\nwww.TKWired.com (http://www.TKWired.com) brought you these fixes, remember that! =P', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(552050, 79990, 1005, 102980, 1072936800, '', 'edit: just dl\'d it again and tried it.\n\n\n\nITS A LOT BETTER, but its still not back to it was before.  However given that i really appreciate you doing this for tyhe community and will be using it till its fixed by valve\n\n\n\nOn a side note, your HS icon is backwords', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(552051, 79990, 1005, 103042, 1072936800, '', 'Nice job, even though we are really undoing their updates. I don\'t know what ValvE is trying to do here by doing their will with Counter-Strike. \n\n\n\nYet, as long as they will remember to seriously listen to us people, who have input on the game--Good and bad, when it comes down to it we are the ones playing the game. This is the first time they experimented with changing the crosshairs, and i guess it really wasn\'t the best of updates. \n\n\n\nBut, they did learn that changing crosshairs and hs sprite  = people dont like it. I say old HS Sprite but the gun option with it would be nice, or interchangable would be even better.\n\n\n\n\n\nFour words.\n\n\n\nI miss Steam Beta.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(552070, 79990, 1005, 102713, 1072936800, '', 'It worked for me @ 1024x768...\n\n\n\nI know you said you put it in the right folder, but just to make sure...\n\n\n\nc:\\program files\\steam\\steamapps\\[youremail]\\cstrike\\sprites', '127.0.0.1', 1),
