(552101, 79990, 1005, 103041, 1072936800, '', 'anyway you could make it smaller? it helped a ton, but smaller would be better, the file says 640? u take it off the 640x480 rez? if so could u get one off of like 1024, or even 1158, hell even 16x12? My pistols are still way to big :/\n\n\n\n- Al', '127.0.0.1', 1),
