(554976, 80370, 1005, 103044, 1072936800, 'AWP Uproar, Suggestions to Fix this Problem', 'This is taken from the GotFrag Community News, where there are several other threads condemning the updated AWP. www.gotfrag.com (http://www.gotfrag.com)\n\n\n\nquote:Well, I was going to post on the steam forums about my compliants towards the new AWP situation. Now, before I started reading the steam forums I wasn\'t really to concerned, but I see alot of people posting with explainations like this... \n\n\n\n"The AWP was bugged, you shouldn\'t have been able to quickswitch a fire like you could, it was good to fix it." \n\n\n\nNow I can understand taking out the ability to "quickswitch" between your deagle/awp as fast as it was...but added like a 2 second delay before you can even fire?...thats absolutely ridiculous. \n\n\n\nAnother common post was.. \n\n\n\n"This was needed so that the leet players wouldn\'t take advantage of the other players." \n\n\n\nWow...how about finding a server, or starting a server that doesn\'t allow awp if ANYONE is going to say something this stupid. \n\n\n\nAlso, is it fair that there is a 2 second delay on the AWP, but if you switch between ANY OTHER GUN there is no delay what so ever...so running around with a pistol with any other gun, then you run into someone switch to your gun, you now have a 2 second headstart on shooting someone if they have an awp, instead of any other gun... \n\n\n\nIts the dumbest update I\'ve seen in a very long time. Most updates I\'ve been able to handle, and this one I\'d handle to, I just decided never to awp anymore, its pointless, its almost a negative effect now, you miss that first shot and you are a sitting duck. \n\n\n\nAfter reading the Valve forums, and reading some very very newbish post, I got fed up and decided to make a post here. \n\n\n\nI tried registering for the forums on Steam to make my post but it didn\'t seem to work....go figure "its steam"... \n\n\n\nAnyway...how does Valve/Steam/nub users find it fair, that you now hae a 2 second delay on the AWP shot when switching between pistol/gun, but you don\'t have that delay on any other gun, even funnier NONE of the other sniper type guns with zoom ability... \n\n\n\nSteam, I actually liked what CS was....until this updated, it wasn\'t as bad as everyone said...this update just made those 47 year olds that still play CS, with there own server, statsme, and every wav file imaginable on their server, very very happy people, cause those are the type of people that love when steam comes out with the shield, and now...this AWP 2 second delay.\n\n\n\nAs you can see, the competetive community is seething from this update. Sure, it may make the newbies happy, along with the recreational gamers, but there is a way to make both parties happy, the non-competetive and the competetive gamers!\n\n\n\nHere is another letter on the GotFrag? Community News www.gotfrag.com (http://www.gotfrag.com)\n\n\n\nquote:Dear Steam, \n\n\n\nAre you tired of having so many people complain about the changes you make to Counter-Strike? \n\n\n\nOne of the reasons Counter-Strike is as popular as it is today. Is because it\'s different from other games in the aspect that skill has to be developed to be very good. Which is the reason some of us have been around for years, we\'re constantly trying to develop new techniques to become better. Lately though, it seems that the time taken to develop this skill is being nulled out by the fact that the game is becomming much more friendly to the newer players. \n\n\n\nI have a suggestion for you. To alleviate some of the whining every time there\'s an update. Consider having two different Game Modes. I\'m sure implementation of this wouldn\'t take much time or effort. Because obviously you can change large things in one simple patch. \n\n\n\nOne of the modes I\'m suggesting would be for the professional audience. Those who compete online and on LAN for money as well as reputation. Changes to this mode of the game can be specifically directed to the professional audience. After proper investigation has been completed, changes can be made to this mode. This can help to alleviate some of the whining that is generally accompanied with each update. \n\n\n\nThe second mode could be the "Normal Gameplay Mode" whos main audience would be those who take Counter-Strike less seriously. The gamers that tend to only play Counter-Strike once or twice a week just for fun. \n\n\n\nIt seems that the changes that have been implemented in the most recent updates of Counter-Strike, have been specifically for the non-professional audience. Which is understandable, because the bulk of the community aren\'t avid Counter-Strikers like myself. \n\n\n\nTo sum it all up, have two different CS modes. One for the pro\'s the other for the newbies... this way you can appeal to ALL of your Counter-Strike audience, and peace will be restored to the CS community once again! \n\n\n\nSincerely, \n\nmeridian | plat \n\n#meridian \n\n\n\nIf you visit www.gotfrag.com, (http://www.gotfrag.com,) you will see there is an uproar over this latest update. These are just a few sample letters, and I have no doubt you will see more letters from very profound gamers, such as shaGuar with his money article.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(555086, 80370, 1005, 103044, 1072936800, '', 'Bump', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(562165, 81241, 1005, 103438, 1072936800, 'Valve\'s dilemma', 'I can\'t believe that valve would up and change the whole feel of the awp because a couple of nubs wanted it changed.  Whether you like it not guys, the awp/deagle switch wasn\'t an error, it\'s the way the game was designed.  Leave it like that.  I\'ve been playin cs for right at 4 years this summer, when you\'ve used an awp like I do, its impossible to change what you do.  I used to come home and look forward to playing cs, now I can\'t wait to uninstall.  This forum is the most pathetic display of cs skill I\'ve ever seen.  Just listen to Viiraxe, he\'s an admin of the REAL cs gaming community over at gotfrag.  \n\n\n\nWhew, ok my flame is over, now for the real post.\n\n\n\nIt\'s just funny, nubs gripe gripe gripe about the awp because they are too stupid to know how to use one, or how to pick an awper.  Well guess what, the awp is still there, and now MORE camping is gonna happen as a result of it, because now instead of being able to pull out your deagle then go back, you have to leave your awp out if you wanna try a second shot.  All they did was slow the game down more.  I know nobody here remembers 1.3, but the game was nice and fast then....  It should be like that again, I can\'t believe you people who call yourself cs players try to change the weapons and crosshairs when the game has real issues it needs to fix.\n\n\n\nValve you\'ve done many good updates since 1.6 has been out.  The money system was the best thing you ever did to competitive cs.  Adding the galil and famas was also one of the best things you ever did.  Well, changing the awp and the crosshairs was just a mistake; and you have the chance to redeem yourself by changing it back.  The crosshairs aren\'t even that huge of a deal as long as you play in 640 like I do.  You have an entire community(other than a few noobs) at your fingertips right now, this decision could help you sell a LOT more copies of hl2.  In fact, if they don\'t fix the awp, I will never buy another valve product again.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(562198, 81241, 1005, 103439, 1072936800, '', 'If they don\'t fix the awp, i wont buy another valve product again either, and im sure many others wont', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(562243, 81241, 1005, 103440, 1072936800, '', 'I think you might be forgetting HL2 []\n\n\n\nIt wasn\'t a "couple of noobs". It was one of the main issues of the game - sure, it was controversial, I am not to bothered which way they went, but they went that way.\n\n\n\nThe thing that annoys me the most is that about 20 people agreed that the crosses should be bigger, and now they are, thousands are complaining, but they aint listninging :roll:', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(562276, 81241, 1005, 103441, 1072936800, '', 'either they make changes to make new people palying cs learn to get better or those couple thousand can quit or let it stand and have 60 percent of the players quit', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(562388, 81241, 1005, 103438, 1072936800, '', 'My point is, anybody who wanted the awp changed wanted it changed because they couldn\'t ever kill an awper with an ak, or even an awp for that reason.  The solid radar option I\'m not against, because they added a command to allow the old style, or the new style.  CS was totally even, the awp was expensive so that  one would have to save to get it.  That means they have a pistol for 2 rounds to get an awp and armor.  I think thats totally fair.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(562389, 81241, 1005, 103238, 1072936800, '', 'tru, the awp was not an unbalanced weapon.  just like automatic rifles they have their uses, it was a Long range weapon that took skill to use close range / to kill others using the awp by being more skilled.  Autos =  closer range weapon which took skill to use at long ranges.\n\n\n\nnow valve has taken away the short range capabilities AND the distinguishing factors in being able to truly "out-awp" the unskilled players that wanted the fix in the first place.\n\n\n\ncomments like "i like the awp change, i do better in pubs now and my record is better" from users that like the update.. Give us all an idea of the mentality from these group of so called cs players.  The game is about challenge and competition, not decreasing the level of skill that can be reached so that new players stand a better chance at being sucessful.\n\n\n\nthe awp change has ruined cs.\n\n\n\ni do not see why i would want to support this game when it is no longer the game i have played over the course of 3 yrs.  this is by far the worst update in my opinion.  we will continue to lose more of the great players that are the backbone of this community.\n\n\n\nvalve why don\'t you just the same delay to all other guns as well, as the logic would fit your need for "realism".  cuz u know there are ppl that have autos and shoot off a few, switch to pistol, shoot off a few pistol rounds etc., then go back to auto to shoot etc.  and u know what?  OMG they\'re glitching cuz they just bypassed the recoil recovery time on each gun by switching!\n\n\n\nby the way Valve that last part ^ is sarcasm.  please don\'t add those 2 u next "upgrade" if u know what i mean.\n\n\n\nalright then i quit Cinco de Mayo if CS is not fixed.  I agree with u Frantic1, cs is no longer enjoyable.\n\n\n\nmark on my calandar - May 5th 2004 - QUIT CS.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(562444, 81241, 1005, 103442, 1072936800, '', 'Ive already made my descision on this. I believe the whole idea was to make experienced players go out and buy CZ. I for one, will never go and do that. If Valve can pull this ****, there is no chance in hell I\'ll go out and buy CZ.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(562458, 81241, 1005, 103443, 1072936800, '', '"the awp change has ruined cs."\n\n\n\n\n\nNo decent player quits over changes to one gun. Bye. n00b.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(562524, 81241, 1005, 103238, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Arsonist \n\n"the awp change has ruined cs."\n\n\n\n\n\nNo decent player quits over changes to one gun. Bye. n00b.  \n\n\n\nthe problem is im not a decent player.  with or without the patch i\'ll own ur ingorant head.  my glock vs. ur awp, ur dead.\n\n\n\nanyways stop the bickering i am entitled to my opinions.  use some thought next time you feel like posting.\n\n\n\ni always knew morons played cs.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(562569, 81241, 1005, 103438, 1072936800, '', 'Arsonist, its people like you who got the game messed up.  It was fine until all these 12 year old nubs started playing.  CS was a game like no other, one where the skill has peaked at such a high level that there are professional leagues and $100,000 tourneys.  But as long as your doing better in pubs, thats all that matters.\n\n\n\nI would love to poll everyone on these forums and see just how many of them have ever heard of Gotfrag, CAL, or CPL, just to prove what kind of dumbasses are in these forums', '127.0.0.1', 1),
