(562620, 81241, 1005, 103444, 1072936800, '', 'i still think valve isn\'t trying to promote valve games through any of this.. i still stand by the fact that they are ****ing around to create a product (steam) that they can license to other game developers to make a huge profit.  **** the games valve is actually producing.  why would they care about there own games when they can make money off of everyone elses?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(562623, 81241, 1005, 103185, 1072936800, '', 'Anyone here actually watched a CPL game? What about a CPL game on aztec? Wait, howbout just a normal CAL game? Any idea how much awping goes on at extremely fast pace? Yeah, don\'t bother calling me a n00b because i\'m sure dozens of CAL-I players are [color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color]ing too.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
