(562636, 81241, 1005, 103438, 1072936800, '', 'circuit, valve isn\'t out to market steam.  they created it so they can update their games faster and more often.  steam\'s a good idea, the amount of cheaters has declined greatly since 1.3 when cheating was rampant.  but for valve to change the awp and crosshairs, its gonna take either a lot of people complaining and threatening, or 1 person like *cough* shaguar *cough* to sit down with valve and explain it.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(565532, 81609, 1005, 103056, 1072936800, 'Disaster Over: 1.3 Has Been Released For Steam!', 'Yep, CS 1.3 has been released for Steam.\n\n\n\nThe official site for this mod is: http://www.cs13mod.com/ (http://www.cs13mod.com/)\n\n\n\nMore info at:\n\n\n\nhttp://www.gotfrag.com/cs/threads/82303/ (http://www.gotfrag.com/cs/threads/82303/)\n\n\n\nand here:\n\n\n\nhttp://www.grumm3t.com/cs13/ (http://www.grumm3t.com/cs13/)\n\n\n\nand here:\n\n\n\nhttp://rob.gamedaemons.net/cs13.html (http://rob.gamedaemons.net/cs13.html)\n\n\n\nLatest developments and info are at #1.3 and #1.3support on irc.gamesurge.net\n\n\n\n\n\nYou can still play 1.6 with this "downgrade."  Please support this effort to get back to the old style/skill based CS.  Thanx!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
