(565580, 81609, 1005, 102666, 1072936800, 'Disaster Over: 1.3 Has Been Released For Steam!', 'quote:Originally posted by cz_ \n\nYep, CS 1.3 has been released for Steam.  Read here:\n\n\n\nhttp://www.gotfrag.com/cs/threads/82303/ (http://www.gotfrag.com/cs/threads/82303/)\n\n\n\nand here:\n\n\n\nhttp://www.grumm3t.com/cs13/ (http://www.grumm3t.com/cs13/)\n\n\n\nand here:\n\n\n\nhttp://rob.gamedaemons.net/cs13.html (http://rob.gamedaemons.net/cs13.html)\n\n\n\nMore info and support are at #1.3 and #1.3support on irc.gamesurge.net\n\n\n\n\n\nYou can still play 1.6 with this "downgrade."  Please support this effort to get back to the old style/skill based CS.  Thanx!  \n\n\n\ncool , gonna have to try this out', '127.0.0.1', 1),
