(575948, 82139, 1013, 101419, 1072936800, 'Cryout to VALVe, please fix these ~50 bugs!!', 'quote:- Models being rendered the wrong way. \n\nSituation: Various, from time to time, when you are unlucky. (THIS IS THE MOST \n\nANNOYING BUG IN THE WHOLE GAME, \n\nIT MESSES UP YOUR BRAIN AND HAUNTS YOU WHEN YOU SLEEP, DAMMIT FIX THIS ONE) \n\nComment: The models are being rendered sideways or something. \n\nWhen you are watching the model (from another computer of course) it looks as \n\nif it is looking towards the side when it in fact is looking directly at you. \n\nThis can be VERY devastating in a situation when you are sneaking up behind a \n\nlot of people. \n\nIt\'s odd, I got this all the time in DoD, but I never ever get these nowadays whenever I play CS... admittedly not often, but it happened a LOT in DoD.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(576903, 82139, 1013, 101794, 1072936800, 'this is the hard part', 'when was the last time VALVe listened to the community no matter how many people agreed with a certain thing, never... so what makes you think this will be any different. VALVe doesnt give a **** what we think... If you ask me, ruining cs is just a marketing plan so everyone quits and BUYS condition zero because VALVe is losing money on CS.\n\n\n\nAnd honestly, what happened to the aim? I recently played cs 1.3, holy jeebus, it was like a whole new game, things were registering!!! Just today i aimed for the head and, you guessed it, got a headshot!!!\n\n\n\nAnother thing that ticks me off, both players standing still, you aim, directly at the head, your crosshair is completely covering the head, then you shoot, nothing, shoot, shoot, shoot, its like your shooting blanks.  And i COMPLETELY agree with the hitbox situation when shooting someone in the BACK, it is SO completely disfigured its insane.  Shooting someone in the back of the head doesnt even count as a headshot, and i think you should also include shooting someone in the side of the body/head as well as the back, because thats pretty messed up also.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(576909, 82139, 1013, 101794, 1072936800, 'w00t', 'quote:Originally posted by Opo \n\nCheck out my website, more Counter-Strike/Counter-Strike: Condition Zero glitches on there. Aswell as suggestions for future versions, and Counter-Strike 2.\n\n\n\nhttp://www.mountaincable.net/~jameslin/ (http://www.mountaincable.net/~jameslin/)  \n\n\n\ni have a suggestion for Counter-Strike 2... Dont let VALVe make it, all problems solved.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(586731, 82139, 1013, 103082, 1072936800, '', 'was the netcode problem addressed?.. because i personally think thats the biggest.  All of the other problems will not affect anyone, if you cant even shoot them, when they 2 feet from you.,', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(655012, 82139, 1013, 100004, 1072936800, '', 'I\'m sick of people posting about the whole boosting through ceilings glitch. Yes, it is a glitch. There\'s only one other option, worldspawn. The only reason that happens is because the HL engine doesn\'t know where else to put you, so it sends you through the ceiling. The other option is just for you to die. I don\'t think that\'s what people want.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(655036, 82139, 1013, 103083, 1072936800, '', 'Also, another \'bug\'. When you watch someone getting flashed while spectating(while dead) you don\'t get the flashed effect at all.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(570248, 82189, 1013, 103084, 1072936800, 'Shut Up!!!', 'Shut up, shut up, shut up!!! Nobody is going to change anything because you people have whined and whined and whined. Jesus, get a life. Go outside, to a movie perhaps. Get a girlfriend, or friends. Complaining will fix nothing.\n\n\n\ni don\'t care, go ahead and flame me. It will mean nothing coming from a whiney ass baby. God, accept the damn changes, ****!!!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(570261, 82189, 1013, 103079, 1072936800, 'Shut Up!!!', 'quote:Originally posted by Scorched 1ce \n\nShut up, shut up, shut up!!! Nobody is going to change anything because you people have whined and whined and whined. Jesus, get a life. Go outside, to a movie perhaps. Get a girlfriend, or friends. Complaining will fix nothing.\n\n\n\ni don\'t care, go ahead and flame me. It will mean nothing coming from a whiney ass baby. God, accept the damn changes, ****!!!  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALVe does change things (AWP) because people whine. If people didn\'t whine how would VALVe know to royally **** things up? Get a life? Correct me if I\'m wrong but you sat at your computer and wrote this up. Accept the changes? Should the J e w s have accepted Hitler\'s changes? You\'re the one whining here. Now as you would say, go outside.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(570274, 82189, 1013, 103084, 1072936800, '', 'Hitler didn\'t change anything, he forced Jews at gunpoint you stupid *******. What the ****. Why you brought up Hilter is something else. Valve didn\'t change the AWP because people complained, they changed it because of the stupid exploit that people were using to gain an advantage.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(570282, 82189, 1013, 103079, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Scorched 1ce \n\nHitler didn\'t change anything, he forced Jews at gunpoint you stupid *******. What the ****. Why you brought up Hilter is something else. Valve didn\'t change the AWP because people complained, they changed it because of the stupid exploit that people were using to gain an advantage.  \n\n\n\n\n\nGo get a history lesson. Hitler became the almighty of Germany and changed the law to make almost everything Jews did illegal. I brought that up because it\'s the only thing I could think of as a comparison having just finished my history term. \n\n\n\nSo what you\'re saying is VALVe just randomly decided to now change the awp? No.  I\'m sure the idea has been edging over a cliff for a long time, but the recent 50 page post pushed it over the edge and forced VALVe to do it. Guess what, people complaing about the exploit got the awp changed. If you can\'t realize that then your just an idiot.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(570393, 82189, 1013, 103068, 1072936800, '', 'Exactly real life or not having the quick switch deagle was BS. It was a exploit, bug whatever you call it and the awpers used it to there advantage and now its gone thank you.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(570553, 82189, 1013, 103085, 1072936800, '', 'Scorched...why are you going to various posts just flaming everyone\'s ideas eh? I mean, you\'re talking about people going outside and getting a gf and going to the movies. How exactly do u kno that we dont have those or do those things? I mean, for all you kno I could be dating jenna jameson and still play CS. Also these people in these forums might only play CS when they arent out there getting laid or going to the movies and might just want to enjoy a nice game in their spare time and when it gets changed why shuldnt they get upset? I think you just need to calm down and stop assuming what people are like just because they play a game.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(571829, 82371, 1013, 103086, 1072936800, 'How about FIXING HEADSHOTS!', 'Everybody and their mother is getting headshots now.  75% of kills are headshots! That F\'d up the game.  COME ON STEAM YOU CAN SAVE YOUR SELF FROM BEING THE BIGGEST GROUP OF MORONS YET! Fix problems fast.  Don\'t change things that don\'t need to be changed.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(572039, 82371, 1013, 103087, 1072936800, '', 'The head is a significant size of the player model, reprsenting the significant size of the head in real life. A random shot to the player gives a significant chance of a headshot.\n\n\n\nIf people are actually aiming for the upper-body or the head, the probably of a headshot increases even further, so all of these headshots are not unreasonable/realistic.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(572334, 82371, 1013, 103086, 1072936800, '', 'Or they are unrealistic.  Regardless of realism, the game was more fun when it took a few more lead pieces in a body to bring it down.  Dieing with one shot is not fun, I could play rainbow 6 if i was interested in that.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(572358, 82371, 1013, 100032, 1072936800, 'How about FIXING HEADSHOTS!', 'quote:Originally posted by Cashmoney995 \n\nEverybody and their mother is getting headshots now.  75% of kills are headshots! That F\'d up the game.  COME ON STEAM YOU CAN SAVE YOUR SELF FROM BEING THE BIGGEST GROUP OF MORONS YET! Fix problems fast.  Don\'t change things that don\'t need to be changed.  \n\n\n\ngeneraly only the good players are geting 75% headshots\n\n\n\nthe noobs are only geting like 20%', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(572431, 82371, 1013, 102980, 1072936800, '', 'my god, seriously, you type of people are the ones that whined about the awp too and look at it now that poor broken useless in matches weapon.  Now u want to nerf the ak/colt so u cant kill with a headshot...just wow.\n\n\n\nHow about you go and get some skill and aim (hell download it if it makes you fricken feel better) and just play CS', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(572975, 82371, 1013, 103087, 1072936800, '', 'Hey badomen, you were adressing "us types of people".\n\n\n\nNotice that noone in the thread agreed with the poster. Did you even read the subsequent posts?\n\n\n\nYou think the AWP is useless? It\'s still more powerful and easier to use than the weapons in the game, and is still just as useful when used as a sniper weapon. Also, who mentioned anything about nerfing the ak/colt? Also what makes you think that none of us who posted in this thread have "skill", and "aim"? Way to stereotype.\n\n\n\nSpeaking of which, I\'ve already sterotyped you as the type of person that has driven me away from public CS. It\'s not the game I don\'t like, it\'s a significant part of the community.\n\n\n\nWell, at least you\'re modest and don\'t make assumptions. (also goes with the stereotype...)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(573140, 82371, 1013, 102980, 1072936800, '', 'Yes i do think the awp is alot more useless in scrims/matches.  And im sorry ive driven you away from public cs, but i rarely pub as it is so i guess i didnt notice you leaving.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
