(573792, 82371, 1013, 103086, 1072936800, '', 'Before, less headshots, lots of fun.  Now more headshots, less fun.  I\'m not a bad player, I\'m usually top 2-3 on my team.  If you really want to see it, go into a server, play a round, hit tilda and look for all the ***headshots.  Its a huge percentage.  I have some consoles saved from before, and its like half as many.  I doubt everybody just got 25% better over night.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(574758, 82371, 1013, 100560, 1072936800, '', 'Well cashmoney, my headshot % has gone extremely down to the fact i have huge crosshairs.  So probably this huge crosshair thing was to let the nubs catch up to the vets??', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(574795, 82371, 1013, 103088, 1072936800, '', 'wana talk about insane ammount of headshots? Play cs 1.5 at a lan..its like 90% headshots with the right crowd.\n\n\n\nthe only thing steam did was eliminate the need to duck to aim []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(575147, 82371, 1013, 100560, 1072936800, '', 'i used to lan 1.5, omg talk about mass headshots! I totally agree with you there.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
