(576165, 82371, 1013, 103089, 1072936800, '', 'lol there is no point in changing anything to do with the headshot hitbox, because at the end of the day whatever change occurs there will be alot of people whining.\n\n\n\nwhat would be nice is,\n\n\n\n- fixing the bullet registry, quite often bullet reg = wank. (most of the time when people whine about reg is because they cant aim properly, however there are alot of cases where the bullets dont actually register!!) \n\n\n\n-fixing the hitboxes of the rest of the body. i dont know if u ever played on a server with stats, but when i shoot sum1, 60% of the bullets hit the persons left hand, it happens with all my cs friends too.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
