(584871, 83955, 1005, 100620, 1072936800, '', 'You didn\'t read what I wrote or you can\'t grasp it.\n\n\n\nI said:\n\nIt isn\'t a reload\n\nIt\'s part of the game mechanics since it has ALWAYS been that way and it is that way with EVERY weapon in the game.\n\nIf it truely were an exploit, why isn\'t it fixed for all the weapons?\n\nVavle did not correct the universal weapon code (such as a weapon not reloading if you cancel the reload anim, the REAL reload), but instead they added lot\'s of code and made the awp an exception.\n\nWhy is that?\n\nTo nerf it and make the game more noob friendly.\n\nAdding new awp code is more time consuming anyway\n\n\n\n[edit] aimed at the M guy', '127.0.0.1', 1),
