(584941, 83955, 1005, 103101, 1072936800, 'Thread to end all AWP threads', 'quote:Originally posted by krokko \n\n First, to clarify things; the thing that you claim is disabled is not a reload animation.\n\nIt is no more a reload animation than the way the slide of any pistol flies back when you fire it. The animation displayed inbetween shots. From that we can draw the conclusion that switching from the awp to another weapon inbetween shots, is no different from fiereing a pistol and switching as soon as you fire a shot. That would ofcourse not be very efficient because of obvious reasons that I will not go in to, and if you would like me to, well... then you\'re a retard and should see a doctor.\n\n\n\nA thing to remeber about these fiereing animations is that they have NO and I mean NO effect on the rate of fire of a weapon. As you can see when fiereing a pistol such as the usp rapidly, a shot will go off before the fiereing animation has time to finnish.\n\nThat means that whatever animation is being drawn or skipped the rate of fire on the weapon WILL remain the same. \n\n\n\n\n\nSo I am asking this for clarification because I am not sure I understood your point exactly.  You are saying that when you shoot the AWP and switch to pistol then switch right back the AWP was not reloaded?  Or when you switched it to pistol after shooting and switched it back it then took the same amount of time to reload, after the switch, as it would if you never switched?  I am seriously asking to be clear.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(586122, 84145, 1013, 103107, 1072936800, 'does cliffe listen ?', 'cliffe i just dont understand where you are coming from. You change the awp which people are not happy with, but i can at least see why you did it stop the fastswitch.\n\n\n\nBut why on earth change the crosshair to 2mm? Not one person in 640x480 or 800x600 is happy with what you have done. Why change something that was perfectly fine in the first place. These small  and unneccacry changes are slowly killing cs. \n\n\n\nYou changed the crosshair to all big, and a few people moaned so you reverted to a small crosshair. Now even more people are complaining and are furious, yet you still opt to keep the annoying small crosshair.\n\n\n\nSorry if this sounds aggressive, i\'m just annoyed that a game i have played for the last 5 years is slowly being killed.\n\n\n\n/whine', '127.0.0.1', 1),
