(586237, 84145, 1013, 103092, 1072936800, '', 'I agree Tom. I posted loads on the CS forum about this in the hope that they might do something about it. I don\'t see why they can\'t roll back the changes (even if they leave the AWP as it is, just the crosshair changes) to before they went big and then small until they have fixed up a system where people can pick what they want.\n\n\n\nJust seems mad to implement something only to roll it back or change it a few days later. A chronic waste of time and resources as well. Seaweed is right, fix the bugs not the stuff people don\'t complain about.\n\n__________________\n\nThis life could be the last but we\'re too young to care.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
