(592295, 84247, 1005, 100341, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Re: Re: Re: A Small Bug... for an awesome MissionPack \n\n\n\nquote:\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nOriginally posted by D-Monkey \n\nAnyone have an idea of how to fix it, cause I would if I knew how \n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\n"Custom Counter Terrorist Map # 01" instead of "Dust"\n\n\n\nI would guess it has something to do with czero_english.txt and whether the map in question has a reference there.\n\n\n\n\n\nThat is correct Big Daddy!\n\nThere are two of these:\n\n"Career_Map_<mapname>_CAPS"      "MAPNAME"\n\n"Career_Map_<mapname>"                "Mapname"\n\n\n\nThere IS a character limit on the second string in these, the one the game actually displays, but I\'ve yet to find out the exact #.  Use about 10 characters or less as a "ROUGH" guideline.  If anyone knows the exact # or bothers to find out, please post!\n\n\n\nMy pack is STILL in the works.  Trying to work around some task string bugs.  Easy Misions done and extremely play-tested.\n\nFeatures so far:\n\ncode:-30 new custom bot personalities\n	-special "boss" player skins\n	-New names\n	-Harder skill levels\n-utilization of new tasks\n-easy through expert vdf\'s included\n-9 custom maps and navs (navs all hand tuned and painted)\n	4 de maps\n                3 cs maps\n                2 as maps\n-all images (tgas) and strings (czero_english.txt) for custom maps/skins included\n-custom splash screen by A:\\D0s\n-updated medal images by A:\\D0s\n-batch file backup/installer\n\n\n\nStill no release date, I imagine a couple of weeks.\n\nStill have to do the tasks for the remaining three difficulty levels and fine tune the bot profile and a couple of nav files.  I\'m very excited how this thing is coming together!!!  Big thanks goes out to John Connor for the original concept, nav editing and modeling.  Also Edg3 for contributing nav files for the demo.  This will be a demo add-on pack for our full release due out much further down the road.\n\n\n\nWe do need a host for these packs.  Maybe a whole new community?  It would be alot easier to host these things all on one site.  I can see these things getting quite large in the future, so sites like my free 30Mb site will not work out.  Mine is up to 70Mb!  Should be about the final size though...\n\n\n\nSleep for now...\n\nkeep on crankin these things out!  Just got Shadow Ops mission Pack.  Looking foreward to checking it out tomorrow!  Who made that one anyhow?\n\n\n\nPep\n\nAKA DEAD', '127.0.0.1', 1),
