(590348, 84358, 1005, 103117, 1072936800, '', 'Nice work Oi!!\n\n\n\nJust a couple of points to think about that I\'ve experienced with CZ...\n\n\n\nThe bots can\'t get into the vent on the roof... there is a lip and I figure they can\'t duck/jump or whatever to get in.\n\n\n\nI\'ve seen bots stuck at the chain link fence gate...\n\n\n\nThere is no water in the sewers... might be nice to add to the effect...\n\n\n\n...and there are no Hostage Rescue Zone markings on the ground...not really needed but nice to have...\n\n\n\n<edit> Oh yes, and the T bots inside just run off the end of the ledge and take damage rather than use the ladder, maybe put a railing at the end...\n\n\n\nBut all in all I like the map.. the bots are always in the damn sewers :-)\n\n\n\nCheers for now', '127.0.0.1', 1),
