(592800, 84992, 1013, 103123, 1072936800, 'Get rid of the AK47 and M4A1 - 2 many exploits', 'Aiight\n\n\n\nSo I think u should get rid of the ak47 and COLT m4a1 because they give people too mcuh of an advantage/// when u have a PISTOL or a gun like the Mp5 its impossible to kill them because they keep doing a exploit where if u pullthe mouse down it makes ur recoil not go all over, so that is a advantage they have.. if u remove those 2 guns and keep the aug / sig it will be much more evener, because they ont have that xploit where ucan can move tha mouse down...\n\n\n\nPlz valve i need u to do this, me and many others on my server think that the ak and m4 have 2 much of an advantage and it is hurting the gam in the long run', '127.0.0.1', 1),
