(593681, 84992, 1013, 103126, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by crash_keith \n\nMoving your mouse down while shooting is NOT an exploit, If you were shooting a real M4/AK you could just as easily move your arm down (If your not weak).  \n\n\n\nWell then I think there should be a workout mode, where your character has to do virtual pushups and arm curls in order to control his recoil better. That way CS can be like a RPG where the most dedicated players have the best aim, and not the people with natural talent.\n\n\n\n...JUST KIDDING', '127.0.0.1', 1),
