al_Steam_Stress_Reduction_Tool.htm)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(594960, 85250, 1005, 103130, 1072936800, 'OFF TOPIC; thisa post ISNT about the awp, crosshair size', 'U know how when u have cl_dynamiccrosshair on, ur crosshair changes size relative to how much recoil ur gun is going to have at any given time whether strafing or jumping or standing still...\n\n\n\nnow with pistols, when you crouch, ur crosshair contracts to almost a +, reducing recoil significantly.  This does NOT however happen with rifles, which would mean that crouching has no effect on rifle recoil.\n\n\n\ni actually went and tested it out...\n\n\n\nhttp://www.summerblue.net/games/cs_...sswall3_bsp.zip (http://www.summerblue.net/games/cs_report/maps/te_glasswall3_bsp.zip)\n\n\n\nand \n\n\n\nhttp://www.summerblue.net/games/cs_...merblue_wad.zip (http://www.summerblue.net/games/cs_report/maps/summerblue_wad.zip)\n\n\n\nthese are teh .bsp and .wad files for a map that contains a hit sensitive wall, one that shows you the actual bullet hits the SERVER generates, not the ones your client displays (if you dont know what this means ur retarded and shouldnt play CS)\n\n\n\nsee for yourself....  other that the actual physical crouch itself moving your crosshair down slightly, there is no other recoil change while spraying.\n\n\n\nin other words, start spraying while crouched or standing and ur recoil will be the same, if u crouch AS you start to shoot ur first few shots will have some recoil control as you are physically moving the crosshair down teh screen.\n\n\n\n\n\ni dont know how many people are going to flame this or say "no duhh.."  or w/e... but ive had arguments with players from cal-i about this..\n\n\n\nanyway have a nice day', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(595065, 85250, 1005, 103131, 1072936800, '', 'LOL\n\n\n\n50+ views, 0 replies.  They have NO idea what you\'re talking about.  This isn\'t news I\'m afraid ;/.  Even in 1.5 and below, your recoil is the same in both the crouching and standing position (IF you\'re not moving/strafing at all), that\'s why the size of the crosshair (for the rifles) does not change when u go from the standing to crouching position (if you\'re not moving).', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(595089, 85250, 1005, 100106, 1072936800, '', 'nice topic btw', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(595602, 85250, 1005, 100206, 1072936800, '', 'Not to nitpick or beat a dead horse about aiming, but I can aim a pistol better standing up than I can if Im crouched down.. (real life, not cs pistols)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(595761, 85250, 1005, 101891, 1072936800, '', 'so what exactly are you trying to prove with this? fact is.. crouching shouldnt affect recoil too much because i mean honestly, its an assault rifle. how much more accuracy do you want while crouching?\n\n\n\nand to be completely honest, why WOULD you spray with an assault rifle when a burst to the face would be both much more accurate and safe. you shouldn\'t be rewarded for spraying while in a proned position, that just promotes newbs to rely more on controlling spray than aiming before they shoot.\n\n\n\nDENIED!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(595778, 85250, 1005, 101324, 1072936800, '', 'koala is pretty dumb tho', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(596504, 85250, 1005, 103132, 1072936800, 'abel', 'you sir are a nub. \n\n\n\nif you don\'t konw tha spray > burst then you\'re stupid.\n\n\n\nyou\'re just trying to be "1337" by saying you "burst to the face".  \n\n\n\ni wonder what leagues you are. \n\n\n\nyou\'re probalby one of those people that wanted the AWP change', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(596511, 85250, 1005, 100147, 1072936800, 'abel', 'quote:Originally posted by concept01 \n\nyou sir are a nub. \n\n\n\nif you don\'t konw tha spray > burst then you\'re stupid.\n\n\n\nyou\'re just trying to be "1337" by saying you "burst to the face".  \n\n\n\ni wonder what leagues you are. \n\n\n\nyou\'re probalby one of those people that wanted the AWP change  A lot of people wanted the AWP change (I don\'t care either way). And you\'re supposed to aim a bit lower than the face (with an AK, I prefer the upper torso).', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(596512, 85250, 1005, 103132, 1072936800, 'btw', 'he\'s not complaining taht the crouch is inaccruate.  he\'s complaining that you can spray standing up and it wouldn\'t differ.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
