(597151, 85250, 1005, 103098, 1072936800, '', 'actually it does change size with a rifle between crouching and standing. whoever told you it doesn\'t is just plain out wrong.\n\n\n\nit seems to me like the only thing steam forums are good for is spreading false information about cs.\n\n\n\nif i really need to i\'ll submit a video..... but you could all just go try it.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
