(629673, 88562, 1005, 103170, 1072936800, '', 'No, does not make any difference. Right now I assume this problem could be related to certain accounts. I got a CS:CZ serial with an extra account as well, where I can use offline mode. Right now I can\'T use it with my "normal" hl serial. Both accounts are installed on the same machine. One works while the other does not.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
