(629725, 88617, 1005, 103175, 1072936800, '', 'but ppl will enjoy the multiplayer version more\n\n\n\nvalve should come up with a standalone or addon mp version for ppl who got the ati package or who bought the single player version\n\n\n\ni know alot of ppl who got ati cards because of the game and was in great hopes for a full version', '127.0.0.1', 1),
