(632624, 88617, 1005, 100936, 1072936800, '', 'When it says "bundled with single player version of half life 2" at that site, it could just be their assumption.  It\'s a safe precaution they take.  They know that you are at LEAST going to get the single player, and they don\'t want to promise multi-player if they don\'t know if it comes with it.  I could be wrong...\n\n\n\n\n\nOn my ATI box or voucher it says nothing of "single player only".  Overclockers added that  (well they didn\'t say "only", but they only mensioned single play...).\n\n\n\n\n\nOnly time will tell.  Hell, even if I don\'t get multiplayer with this ati deal, I\'ll just go out and buy a boxed copy anyway.\n\n\n\n\n\nEDIT:  Oh and to anyone who ever posts a link to a site with information about the release of half life 2, how it will be released, or anything like that:  If they didn\'t get an official word from valve, their guess is as good as anyones.  \n\n\n\nI won\'t lose sleep over overclockers saying it\'s single player only.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
