(634284, 89603, 1013, 100220, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by veal_calf \n\nwtf????? i guess english is not your first language, i cant figure out what you were trying to say, take a semester of english and then come back.  \n\n\n\nNice evaluation, grammar queen.\n\n\n\n\n\nI think Gooseman (and some of the others from the original CS team) might have moved on to other things. Valve owns CS now; the original CS team might have disbanded while some of them (like cliffe) joined Valve.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
