(650538, 91414, 1013, 100168, 1072936800, 'Temporary Fix To "ERROR! Server Verification Failed"', 'For those of you getting the "Error! Server Verification Failed..." Error, here should be a temporary fix for you until VALVE comes out with a permanent one...\n\n\n\n<>[] CZ Users []<>\n\n\n\n1. Go into the game you want to play...\n\n2. Click on New Multiplayer Game ( This is only in CZ i beleive.. )\n\n3. play atleast one round of a game with bots there...\n\n4. and that should fix the problem\n\n\n\n<>[] CS Users []<>\n\n\n\n1. Go into the game you want to play...\n\n2. Click on New Game\n\n3. play atleast one round of your custom game there as terrist and bomb a place or do whatever..\n\n4. and that should fix the problem\n\n\n\n--------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\nThis will only work till you restart STEAM again, once you do that you have to do this all over again...\n\n\n\nI have only tried this with CZ ( Condition Zero )...\n\nIf it works with other GAMES\\MODS, post here so people will know []....\n\n\n\n\n\n--------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nA SOLUTION BY: jas\n\n\n\n\n\nMake sure steam is shutdown then delete this file\n\n\n\nC:\\Program Files\\Steam\\ClientRegistry.blob \n\n\n\nOpen steam and it will do another update which replaces the .blob file. After this all has benn working well again. I only play CS and CS WC3mod, so not sure about other games.\n\n\n\nHope it works you you.\n\n\n\nJas\n\n\n\n-------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nI hope this fixes your problems.\n\n\n\nPlease post back here if this works for please...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(650566, 91414, 1013, 101512, 1072936800, '', 'Nope, doesn\'t work, it still crashes during the loading process even when I start a single player game with bots!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
