(650641, 91414, 1013, 103219, 1072936800, '', 'Your "solution" (lol what a peice of ****) is useless to CS players (roughly 2 billion people). CZ is played about by 2 million people. This does little good for us.\n\n\n\nEdit: NO good.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(650694, 91414, 1013, 100168, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by NubWars \n\nYour "solution" (lol what a peice of ****) is useless to CS players (roughly 2 billion people). CZ is played about by 2 million people. This does little good for us.\n\n\n\nEdit: NO good.  \n\n\n\nfor CS, try "New Game" that worked for me, and just play a round of that with bots or with out just 1 round and it should work', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(650725, 91414, 1013, 103220, 1072936800, '', 'I have posted this elsewhere but this worked for me.\n\n\n\nMake sure steam is shutdown then delete this file\n\n\n\nC:\\Program Files\\Steam\\ClientRegistry.blob \n\n\n\n\n\nOpen steam and it will do another update which replaces the .blob file.  After this all has benn working well again.  I only play CS and CS WC3mod, so not sure about other games.\n\n\n\nHope it works you you.\n\n\n\nJas', '127.0.0.1', 1),
