(651406, 91414, 1013, 103223, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by NubWars \n\nYour "solution" (lol what a peice of ****) is useless to CS players (roughly 2 billion people). CZ is played about by 2 million people. This does little good for us.\n\n\n\nEdit: NO good.  \n\n\n\nUhm.. You must not realize how many people 2 billion is..That means about 1 out of every 3 people you see, play CS.\n\n\n\nYou must be retarded.\n\n\n\nLol, your post made my day.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(651462, 91539, 1013, 103224, 1072936800, 'Steam Error - Game Currently Not Availiable!', 'I have been having this error for the last 2 days.\n\nIf i try to go into ANY game, it says "This Game Is currently unavailiable" I have tried logging in, logging out, deleting clientregistry.blob and many other things!\n\n\n\nIt still says it, are there any other FIX\'es i can do, or is it just me and my computer is messed?\n\n__________________\n\n- RIFK', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(651531, 91539, 1013, 100466, 1072936800, '', 'Right click on the game in the menu, click Properties then make sure all of them say "Automatically update this game".\n\n\n\nDo that for all of them. That might be stopping you from playing.\n\n__________________\n\nHalfLife2.Net Staff\n\n\n\nComing Soon! - The HalfLife2.Net  Competition! Visit the link below!\n\nhttp://www.halflife2.net/index.php?page=compo', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(651553, 91539, 1013, 100054, 1072936800, '', 'Try uninstalling, reinstalling Steam.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
