(710996, 93743, 1013, 103241, 1072936800, '', 'i made a post about this, i guess no one mentioned, install anolder version for your router', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(711271, 93743, 1013, 103242, 1072936800, '', 'STEAM SUCKS! VALVE SUCKS AND IT HAS BEEN A MONTH AND NO FIX OR EVEN A WORD ABOUT THE PROBLEM.  I AM SO ANGRY I MUST TYPE IN CAPS.  MY LINKSYS WORKS LIKE **** ON THE OLD FIRMWARE AND YOU FAT ASSES AT VALVE NEED TO ADDRESS PROBLEMS INSTEAD OF MEMBERS BRINGING TEMP FIXES!!!! WTF IS THAT!!!!!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
