(676463, 94290, 1013, 101625, 1072936800, '', 'Cool, glad to see an update []\n\n\n\nI can\'t seem to get into CS or HL, but hopefully its just the servers being overloaded. The updates won\'t download, and the "always keep this game up to date" is defaulting to "do not automatically update this game".', '127.0.0.1', 1),
