(676495, 94290, 1013, 100003, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Nukeout \n\nnever knew this was coming  See this good. They dont let you know about the update so people dont post those stupid threads about what they want in the next update. LOL \n\n\n\n\n\nCould be the same way with HL 2. It could be out next tuesday for all we know.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(676507, 94290, 1013, 103252, 1072936800, '', 'cliffe, im not gonna lie. i hated you when you took my awp. however, i now love you more than ever. you fixed everything wrong with cs. shots connect, hitboxes are great. it feels like the game i fell in love with. cliffe, once again i feel like valve is a company that loves its gamers. i will support you and everything you do, i cant wait for hl2.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(676518, 94290, 1013, 100323, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by silvablade \n\ncliffe, im not gonna lie. i hated you when you took my awp. however, i now love you more than ever. you fixed everything wrong with cs. shots connect, hitboxes are great. it feels like the game i fell in love with. cliffe, once again i feel like valve is a company that loves its gamers. i will support you and everything you do, i cant wait for hl2.  \n\n\n\nVery glad to hear that, Silva. Let me know if you run into anything out of the ordinary.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
