(676835, 94346, 1005, 103257, 1072936800, 'Fix: Old CS Models for CZ Owners', 'Easy Way Out\n\n1. Download the ZIP file from here (http://www.ownforever.com/index.php?option=com_remository&Itemid=81&func=fileinfo&parent=category&filecatid=20).\n\n2. Make sure Use Folder Names is enabled (WinZip, dunno about other programs)\n\n3. Extract to your Steam\\SteamApps\\your@email\\Counter-Strike\\cstrike\\models\\player folder.\n\n\n\nOther, Technical Way\n\nEverybody knows that files in the actual game folder takes priority over those in the GCF file, right? Simply extract the old models from the Counter-Strike GCF (using a program like GCFScape (http://www.ownforever.com/index.php?option=com_remository&Itemid=81&func=fileinfo&parent=category&filecatid=21)) and place them in the correct spots in the Counter-Strike game directory.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
