(697777, 94910, 1005, 103117, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by cliffe \n\nAs an update, we\'re targetting this week for release of the first 3 "lost" DS missions.\n\n\n\nCliffe\n\nVALVe  \n\n\n\nAlso Cliffey baby... <ahem>\n\n\n\nAre you going to release the missing sounds to go with the maps??\n\n\n\nSuch as -\n\n\n\n\n\nMAIN MENU\n\n~~~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/weapons/syringe_use.wav (MISSING)\n\nsound/items/mapdown.wav (MISSING)\n\nsound/items/mapup.wav (MISSING)\n\n\n\nALAMO2\n\n~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/ARAB_OUTSIDE_WAR.wav (MISSING)\n\n\n\nBRECON03\n\n~~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/ambience/explode.wav (MISSING)\n\nsound/doors/brecon2.wav (FILE CALLED DOOR_BRECON2.WAV)\n\n\n\nBRECON04\n\n~~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/ambience/rain_undershelterlookingintorain_loop.wav (MISSING)\n\n\n\nDOWNED2\n\n~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/ambience/damage_sp_debris.wav (I HAVE DAMAGE_SP_DEBRIS2.WAV)\n\n\n\nLOSTCAUSE\n\n~~~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/sound/ambience/lost_walla.wav (ACTUALLY IN SOUND/AMBIENCE)\n\n\n\nRECOIL\n\n~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/ambience/mutter1.wav (I HAVE RADIOMUTTER1.WAV)\n\nsound/ambience/mutter2.wav (I HAVE RADIOMUTTER2.WAV)\n\nsound/ambience/door_metal_latch.wav (ACTUALLY IN SOUND/DOORS)\n\n\n\nRECOIL2\n\n~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/recoil/bsold_gl.wav (MISSING)\n\n\n\nSILO01\n\n~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/ambience/silo_truckdrive.wav (MISSING)\n\n\n\nSILO02\n\n~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/ambience/explosion_ceiling.wav (MISSING)\n\n\n\nTHINICE01\n\n~~~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/wind1 (NOT SPECIFIED AS WAV FILE, HAVE WIND1.WAV)\n\n\n\nTHINICE03\n\n~~~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/ambience/Vessel_sonar_loop.wav MISSING)\n\n\n\nTRAIN01\n\n~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/sound/turret/tu_active2 (NOT SPECIFIED AS WAV FILE, ACTUALLY IN SOUND/TURRET)\n\n\n\nTRAIN03\n\n~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/ambience/waterlap1.wav (ACTUALLY CALLED WATER_LAP1.WAV)\n\n\n\nTURNCRANK2\n\n~~~~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/turncrank/eldinero.wav (MISSING)\n\nsound/CITYSLUM (NOT SPECIFIED AS WAV FILE)\n\n\n\nTURNCRANK3\n\n~~~~~~~~~~\n\n\n\nsound/WOODCREAK (NOT SPECIFIED AS WAV FILE, HAVE WOODCREAK5, 6 & 7.WAV)\n\nsound/WOODSTEPS (NOT SPECIFIED AS WAV FILE)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBTW - I know that syringe_use.wav is missing from all maps and a couple of others are in more than one map, just didn\'t want to repeat myself :-)\n\n\n\nCheers for now\n\n\n\nPS - Isn\'t "rain_undershelterlookingintorain_loop.wav" the best name for a sound file ever!!??!!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
