(699041, 94910, 1005, 100416, 1072936800, '', 'Where do they take place, story?\n\n \n\nA simple description of them.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(699044, 94910, 1005, 100003, 1072936800, '', 'Well Maimi is a bank robbery. \n\n\n\nNot sure about Run.\n\n\n\nTruth takes place in a chinese style map. Im really not sure what is behind it.\n\n\n\nWe will know in a few days.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(699047, 94910, 1005, 100418, 1072936800, 'thanks for feeding back Cliffe', 'Miami sounds good, looking forward to all of them [] thanks for hanging around here and sorting out our troubles and woes, C-man. [Cliffeface]\\\\', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(704625, 94910, 1005, 100418, 1072936800, '', 'we need more stuff for DS. It\'s a 1gb mod that will be deleted by most if more doesn\'t happen to it. If it were patched more and some customisation documentation added, we would see more interest in this...MP with the tear gas would be fun. \n\n\n\nUPDATE IT AND WE WILL PLAY.\n\n\n\nthat\'s all i\'m saying, why are there lost maps in the first place. \n\nThey should be currently be on their way to our hard disks, not lost?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(704654, 94910, 1005, 103281, 1072936800, '', 'I\'m still waiting for that Co-op mode that was advertised on the box to show up (And still IS, might I add.)\n\n\n\nIf you look-up "Cooperative", you\'ll find that it does not describe game modes where two teams repeatedly slaughter each other.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
