(704755, 94910, 1005, 100238, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by cliffe \n\nWe\'ll be releasing some of the "lost" DS maps over time.\n\n\n\nCliffe\n\nVALVe  \n\n\n\n\n\nahahhaaha. over time eh?\n\n\n\nwell lets see, i got about a year before i grad from college. will they be released before that time? or will i have to go into my game design career without the new maps?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(704760, 94910, 1005, 103281, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by cliffe \n\nLooks like we may have to push this release a week or so. \n\n\n\nThat\'s fine, there\'s no rush.\n\n\n\nHowever, perhaps you could make use of Steam\'s streaming distribution capabilities? Release part of it now as small update - one of the lost missions or some such - and then release the rest of the update as you finish it.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(705050, 94910, 1005, 100399, 1072936800, '', 'Ok... guys... Actually the Multiplayer for CZ[]S is the ACTUAL CZ... so Cliffe I think u add Tear Gas and Gas mask to the ACTUAL CZ not CZ[]S because look... what is the point of making another multiplayer on CZ[]S? CZ Already has the most DS models... Just need alittle more stuff to put it in...\n\n\n\nJust ADD the Co-operative Mode on DS... in that way it will quiet down some people', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(705800, 94910, 1005, 103117, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by p0rkd0rk \n\nWhere do they take place, story?\n\n \n\nA simple description of them.  \n\n\n\nczeror_english.txt is your friend...\n\n\n\n"RUN_OVERVIEW"			"On this sniper mission you must\n\nfight to stay alive after successfully\n\nassassinating a powerful gang leader."\n\n\n\n"MIAMI_OVERVIEW"		"Desperate, heavily armed would-be\n\nrobbers are pinned down in a\n\nprominent Miami bank and are\n\nholding the employees at gunpoint\n\ninside the fortified building."\n\n\n\n"TRUTH_OVERVIEW"		"A homicidal cult is stockpiling\n\nsupplies of a deadly nerve gas\n\nwith plans to release it into a\n\ncrowded area.  Defecting cult\n\nmembers have tipped off the\n\nlocal authorities but are now\n\nbeing held as traitors by cult\n\nmembers."\n\n\n\nCheers for now\n\n\n\nPS Cliffe -\n\n\n\nHow about some more information "as it happens". It seems these are to be delayed. How about letting us know until when and why? Are the missing sounds for the existing missions going to be fixed? etc.... If you kept the masses informed a bit more then you wouldn\'t get so many people whining on the forums... me included...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(705833, 94910, 1005, 100185, 1072936800, '', 'and will we get to see miami and truth in CZ?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(681064, 94930, 1005, 103283, 1072936800, 'Round Timer Plz Fix', 'I\'m sure this has already been posted, but I didn\'t see it.  Plz fix the round timer so we can see it all the time until the bomb is planted.  Cause i just got done with a match and we lost in the final round cause we couldn\'t see the round timer to know how much time we had left.   If i knew i had 10 seconds left i would have gone around the corner and shot him, instead of waiting for him to pop out.  Its a really big pain so please fix it.  Thx', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(681083, 94930, 1005, 100048, 1072936800, '', 'There\'s a search button between Home and FAQ. If you click that, then type in "round timer" in the "search by keyword" textfield then press perform search you can find similar topics.\n\n\n\nThat\'s a tip for next time CHAMP!!!!!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(681367, 94930, 1005, 103284, 1072936800, '', 'if they do not do this, atleast the multiple post will alteast alert valve of its importance :]', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(684358, 94930, 1005, 103283, 1072936800, '', 'Thx c4t the multiple posts do help i think.  But anyways i did use the search button.  I just did so earlier in the day.  And all of the posts on this topic were made pretty much the same day, after i did the search.  I just didn\'t do so right before i posted the thread.  So i would aprriciate it if you didn\'t go assuming that i didn\'t know about the search function...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
