(683417, 95222, 1013, 100323, 1072936800, 'Scheduled Maintenance Downtime Tonight -->', 'Scheduled Maintenance Downtime\n\n \n\nTonight at approximately 6:00 pm PST Steam will be down for scheduled server maintenance. Steam games will not be available for a short time thereafter (probably about half an hour). News will be posted here as soon as the maintenance work is complete. Thanks for your patience.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
