(683429, 95222, 1013, 100775, 1072936800, '', 'Thanks for the notice Cliffe', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(683573, 95222, 1013, 100279, 1072936800, '', 'Is this in part to make sure all the servers update properly?  I heard some people claiming that something was borked with the server updates in regards to a new mp.dll or something.\n\n\n\nKinda funny: we were expecting another update, and instead it\'s a downdate.  []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
