(687673, 95654, 1013, 100115, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by UnKnOwNGuY \n\noh stop with the delay topic\n\n\n\nthat was an exploit just like bunny hopping cal people will have to get use to that\n\n\n\nur thoughts will only continue the constant flaming\n\n\n\nso shut up\n\n\n\npeople will have to get over it or play 1.5 or 1.3\n\n\n\na true cal can get use to anything but most of them whine  \n\n\n\nStop the hate, cut down on your bs. "a true cal can get use to anything" do you even know what CAL is?\n\n\n\nAlso there are a lot of top european cs players who quit because of it. Don\'t you think the admin will be able to administer the forum without your influence?\n\n\n\nStop trying to act like your opinion is worthy and putting down on other\'s perspective.\n\n\n\nThis is a FORUM where multiple opinions are likely to occur. If you don\'t like it, Don\'t participate in the FORUM.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
