(690183, 96003, 1005, 103276, 1072936800, 'Shield glitch is getting out of hand', 'At this point, I think it is safe to assume that Valve is actively ignoring the two latest glitches.\n\n\n\nBefore the last 2 updates, I assumed that they were working on them, but it was just taking  a lot of time.\n\n\n\nHowever, there have been 2 updates recently, and niether of them included a fix for the 2 shield glitches.\n\n\n\nThe latest glitch is especially bad, because it allows the player to use a rifle, and be covered by an invisible shield.\n\n\n\nAt the very least, Valve could tell us that they are being worked on, but to this point, they have been ignored altogether.\n\n\n\nI can\'t speak for everybody, but I think fixing these horrible glitches is more important than added CZ models.\n\n\n\nSo what is the story Cliffe?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(690275, 96003, 1005, 100032, 1072936800, '', 'dont count on cliffe giving you an answer,\n\nthere too busy to spend a few seconds to say what they are currently working on', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(690360, 96003, 1005, 101408, 1072936800, '', 'Well you can still randomly crash servers with the shield too, they never have completely fixed that.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(691812, 96003, 1005, 100323, 1072936800, '', 'We are looking into the shield issues.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
