(695610, 96483, 1013, 103321, 1072936800, '', 'Quicksilver, I have tried everything you have told me to do... run sandra etc. However, that didnt help because i know what im doing with computers...  So, I then tried your next suggestion, with the counter-strike_old folder...  This has also not worked for me...  CS did not update, all it did was make a NEW Counter-Strike folder for me...  Great idea!  Lets just make a NEW folder for the problem to persist!  Awesome...  Anyway, in my earlier post it says what i am running... and OBVIOUSLY hardware isnt a problem for all of the thousands of users who have this problem...  It is definately software and Steam (Valve) needs to fix it.  Before Steam, the world was a happy place.  I dont mean to sound like a hater, Steam is a good program and makes gaming more friendly to all users, including new...  But, It should at least work for 98% of these users...  Understanding that there is probably (at least i hope) 3-4 of the Steam programmers, or consultants working on this problem I would like a solution quickly...  I\'m sick of waiting...  I have been playing Counter-Strike for 3 years, and I am trying to succeed in league play, but how am i supposed to do it when I can\'t even play?  \n\n\n\nMy plea to you all (Valve) is to fix this problem so everyone might enjoy the game as it once was.\n\n\n\n                             Sincerely,', '127.0.0.1', 1),
