(718892, 99250, 1026, 102895, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Whisper \n\nWindows 2000 is pretty light weight.  \n\n\n\nI\'ll go with Server Entreprise 2003 demo. I already received the cd (w00t).\n\n\n\nThe problem with 2000 is the service packs... You\'ll need a service pack for TCP/IP scheduler, another for FireDaemon etc. \n\n\n\nPeople from my family work at Microsoft tech support and they acknowledge that the service packs are unreliable.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
