(733177, 101029, 1013, 100001, 1072936800, 'CZ players deserve CS:S free', 'it is my general belief that CS:Z players should not be left in the dust. We payed the money for a full priced game and with all do respect I will feel spat on if after CS:S releases CZ players are just forgotten. I think that at least somthing should come of paying for this full price game.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
