(733180, 101029, 1013, 100001, 1072936800, '', 'I tried to get this thread polite so please if you want to reply at least to so respectfuly. Bots were a welcome addition but they were already widely available on the counter-strike scene. The cz content was simply not somthing that should have been advertised and marketed as a full priced piece of software, this imo (giving us CS:S) would be a way or redeeming our purchases to give us this all new amazing experience. That is it however.. im not suggesting we deserve more then css.. just that cs port which would make most of us CZ players more then happy for paying for the game.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(733184, 101029, 1013, 100002, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by alb1221 \n\nI tried to get this thread polite so please if you want to reply at least to so respectfuly. Bots were a welcome addition but they were already widely available on the counter-strike scene. The cz content was simply not somthing that should have been advertised and marketed as a full priced piece of software, this imo (giving us CS:S) would be a way or redeeming our purchases to give us this all new amazing experience. That is it however.. im not suggesting we deserve more then css.. just that cs port which would make most of us CZ players more then happy for paying for the game.  \n\n\n\nYou could just do what I did and NOT BUY IT.!!!! OMG>!.  So just buy HL2 and you get CS:S for free.  So have fun.\n\n\n\n-- Steve Tauber', '127.0.0.1', 1),
