(733242, 101029, 1013, 100005, 1072936800, 'CZ players deserve CS:S free', 'quote:Originally posted by alb1221 \n\nit is my general belief that CS:Z players should not be left in the dust. We payed the money for a full priced game and with all do respect I will feel spat on if after CS:S releases CZ players are just forgotten. I think that at least somthing should come of paying for this full price game.  \n\nWhy? You bought a game, and you didn\'t like it. Your problem for not reading more reviews. You do not deserve a game free. But, according to VALVe if you buy HL2 you get CS:S free. (Not completly confirmed yet.). And if your not buying HL2, then.......', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(733293, 101029, 1013, 100006, 1072936800, 'CZ players deserve CS:S free', 'quote:Originally posted by alb1221 \n\nit is my general belief that CS:Z players should not be left in the dust. We payed the money for a full priced game and with all do respect I will feel spat on if after CS:S releases CZ players are just forgotten. I think that at least somthing should come of paying for this full price game.  \n\n\n\nYou made the choice of buying Condition Zero not us. They don\'t owe you squat.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
