(733359, 101029, 1013, 100008, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by alb1221 \n\nIm just suggesting what valve may want to do to be a respectable buisness. Deliver to there dedicated fans and such.  \n\nYou want VALVe to close their door because they gave their games and ran out of money? Would you want to spend MANY years on something and then, give it for free? Why do people think that VALVe deserve them something?\n\n\n\nIn CS : CZ, you have great models, great maps, NEW maps, awesome bots, and alot of small things like the location when you talk etc.\n\n\n\nAt first I thought it was a joke... sigh..', '127.0.0.1', 1),
