(755680, 103448, 1013, 100056, 1072936800, 'Friends list deleted fix', 'If you have lost your contacts on your friends list, here is what to do, make sure steam is closed before you attempt this!\n\n\n\nGo into your steam directory and look in the config directory. There should be some files like "friendsdata.vdf" and "userdata_*******.vdf" (where * is a number) Find that file, delete your "friendsdata.vdf" and rename the userdata to "friendsdata.vdf" (WITH .vdf or it won\'t work!) Start steam up. If you have more than 1 userdata, choose the one that is the biggest in size (mine was 4kb, the empty one was 1kb).\n\n\n\nGood luck to you!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(755736, 103448, 1013, 100057, 1072936800, '', 'it does work for once. But then i restarted steam and got the same problem.......it doesn\'t work twice though, cuz my friendsdata is set back to 1KB (used to be 7KB) and the filename with the number is gone (only have the empty one)......', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(755740, 103448, 1013, 100056, 1072936800, '', 'Try deleting the other userdatas you have remaining that arn\'t 7kb, and see if that works. Post back if it does or don\'t, and i\'l have a look into it.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(755743, 103448, 1013, 100056, 1072936800, '', 'Seems to work for me, closed steam and re-started it, without a problem I got my contacts still.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
