(755844, 103448, 1013, 100058, 1072936800, '', 'well here is what i did to fix the problem found this in anouther thread\n\n\n\n\n\nin the config folder i had two files named userdata_******.vdf\n\n\n\nall i did was switch the numbers on the files (ie renamed each file with the others name) and it worked no deleting involved.\n\n\n\nmight not work for everyone though not sure.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
