(755690, 103452, 1013, 100061, 1072936800, 'Friends List Gone FIX - By SKATOONY', 'Instead of everyone digging, here\'s a fix posted by this guy.\n\n\n\nSkatoony\n\nSenior Member\n\n\n\nRegistered: Oct 2003\n\n \n\n\n\nHe\'s right, here is what to do: (make sure steam is closed)\n\n\n\nGo into your steam directory and look in config. There should be some files like "friendsdata.vdf" and "userdata_*******.vdf" (where * is a number) Find that file, delete your "friendsdata.vdf" and rename the userdata to "friendsdata.vdf" (WITH .vdf or it won\'t work!) Start steam up. If you have more than 1 userdata, choose the one that is the biggest in size (mine was 4kb, the empty one was 1kb).\n\n\n\nHopefully this help!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(755720, 103452, 1013, 100062, 1072936800, '', 'Yeah the solution works apart from the fact that its not the biggest file thats yours. All those userdata.vdf files are friends lists of people that have logged into friends on that computer, you\'ll just have to find the friends that belongs to you.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
