(759475, 103739, 1013, 103466, 1072936800, '', 'Well there were still players in the database, but not all. Your friends list on your computers still has the data or id or something for all your friends, but steam couldn\'t find them in the database (which is probably not supposed to happen) so it just picked the first name it found...\n\n\n\nBit of a stretch, I know, but that\'s all I can guess at.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
