(766524, 104397, 1013, 100121, 1072936800, '', '#1\n\nBY PUBBERS YOU MEAN players whos limited abilities prevent them from being better players and improving themselves.\n\n\n\nor do you mean the noobs who claim to have \'ownzor\' skills with the old style awp, ,but readily sacrificing exciting new game content?\n\n\n\nor do you mean those where their hacks are working and because there is noone to really ban their keys they could do whatever?\n\n\n\n#2\n\n\n\nWHAT PEOPLE WANT:\n\n\n\nbetter gameplay-2 new weapons, new sounds, ,textures, improved hitboxes (CZ), shield, new maps, new potentials\n\n\n\nteamplay-unless you force people to cooperate like TFC does you cant do it otherwise.\n\n\n\n#3\n\n\n\nThe poll\n\n\n\nyou would expect the following results (from 100K votes sample)\n\n\n\ngive me back my awp-9%\n\nkill the shield-2%\n\ngive me CZ cheaper/cs source because i want more exciting gameplay!!!-50%\n\nimprove the damn hitboxes/physics-38%\n\nleave it alone-1%\n\n\n\nwhat do you like better:\n\npre 1.5-3%\n\n1.5-15%\n\n1.6-82%\n\n1.7(cz)-50%+++growing\n\nCS:source-droolzor-90%\n\n\n\n\n\nso to summarize:\n\nfor underaged the game means kill for fun\n\nfor adults the game means fun and skill\n\n\n\ngame gets better and people want it to get better\n\n\n\nmore and more people can afford it\n\n\n\nmore and more people love it\n\n\n\nhl and its mods is migrating bubba.. yes it is. on a new unhaxored engine you would expect to see better things that you never saw before.\n\n\n\njust because 10% does not want it.. well 90% do and the progress continues.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(766547, 104397, 1013, 100121, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Jac \n\n1.5 was a lot better than 1.6, we won\'t be able to play it soon because WON is being shut down. Please don\'t give me that \'1.5 for steam\' **** because it doesn\'t have VAC.\n\n\n\nMentality, I agree completely.  \n\n\n\nso what you are saying is like this:\n\nmommy i know you love the fridge and the tv you bought last year. daddy bought a new plazma tv to replace the old one. mommy oh mommy.. please dont let daddy take away my precious 9 inch black and white tv that been peed on by a doggy and it has a switch knob. \n\n\n\nin adult language:\n\n\n\nyou are asking the owner of the game to be kind enough to maintain the old 1.5 and loose thouthands and thouthands of dollars every year just because you want the 1.5 back? Because cs is a high demand game and because progress is pushing the game forward we are able to play better games every year. in other words if you want to not play PS2 because it got sweet graphics but play the "tanks" on atari go ahead noone is stopping you.\n\n\n\nget aserver for 90 dollars a month. load the 1.5+hl+admin stuff\n\n\n\npay, advertise, maintain it.. after a year tell me how many people you had per day and how much money you lost.\n\n\n\ngood luck', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(767561, 104585, 1013, 100122, 1072936800, 'Hand Cuffs in Counter-Strike', 'Ok, this idea is a little far fetched but I think it would be really cool. Also realistic, in that whole cop sense. This is it, the CT\'s should have "Hand Cuffs". They could sneak up behind a T and cuff him thus for getting him out off the round. Also on AMX mod you could add a sound file to it just liek "Headshot" but it would be from the cops theme". "Bad boys, Bad boys, what ya gonna do?" How cool would that be!! And if the T\'s think that unfair you can give them...err...rope. To tie the CTs hands. I don\'t want to start a war here it\'s just a idea. Ohhh it would also give you and your team money for I don\'t know "Good Policing"\n\n\n\nw3rd', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(767576, 104585, 1013, 100119, 1072936800, '', 'Most retarded idea ever. CT\'s aren\'t cops, they kill terrorists.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(767578, 104585, 1013, 100122, 1072936800, '', 'Dude, incase your didn\'y know or your just an idiot killing is a last resort. also have u never heard of terrorists taking hostiges? i mean Iraq.... jeez', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(767590, 104585, 1013, 100119, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by MaGoO99 \n\nDude, incase your didn\'y know or your just an idiot killing is a last resort.  \n\n\n\nOh yes, when terrorists are shooting at your buddies, killing is always a last resort. When was the last time you heard of a Counter-terrorist team taking armed assailents alive? Please just shut up, your idea sucks, you\'re obviously not a bright person so let\'s leave the thinking to people who are good at it.\n\n\n\n\n\nquote:Originally posted by MaGoO99 \n\nalso have u never heard of terrorists taking hostiges? i mean Iraq.... jeez  \n\n\n\nYou said this was for CTs, when was the last time a terrorist took an armed Counter-terrorist hostage? Your supposed realism immediately comes in conflict with several other realisms.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(767597, 104585, 1013, 100122, 1072936800, '', 'Hahahaha dude if your being shot aat then you shoot back, that being your last resort. You stupid idiot, so your saying if the Terrorist gives up the pull out there Socom and blow his head off? Nice way of thinking dumba*s', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(767611, 104585, 1013, 100119, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by MaGoO99 \n\nHahahaha dude if your being shot aat then you shoot back, that being your last resort. You stupid idiot, so your saying if the Terrorist gives up the pull out there Socom and blow his head off? Nice way of thinking dumba*s  \n\n\n\nI\'m sorry, I was under the impression that you play Counter-strike. Well in this game, Counter-Terrorists and Terrorists aren\'t given guns just so they can sit down and talk out their differences, they actually shoot at eachother. If you\'d like some help getting good, and figuring out how the game works, i\'d be more than happy to teach you.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
