(767653, 104585, 1013, 100119, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by MaGoO99 \n\nHaha, didn\'t I say I didn\'t want to start a war? \n\n\n\nWords are great, but actions are better. If you don\'t want to start a war than don\'t post insanely stupid ****.\n\n\n\n\n\nquote:Originally posted by MaGoO99 \n\nI just thought it would be kind of cool.  \n\n\n\nNo, it wouldn\'t be cool, as I said before: Leave the thinking to people who are good at it.\n\n\n\n\n\nquote:Originally posted by MaGoO99 \n\nYou however have to be a jack*ss for no reason. "If you don\'t have anything good to say, don\'t say anything at all." Didn\'t your mother ever teach you that?  \n\n\n\nWhen someone says something incredibly stupid and they happen to think it\'s the greatest thing since sliced bread, yes I will be a jackass and remind you why you failed third grade four years straight.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
