(767749, 104585, 1013, 100123, 1072936800, '', 'Hahahahha hand cuffs...\n\n\n\nVery bright ideas...\n\n\n\nCounter-Diplomacist ? []\n\n\n\nStop that I will smother cause of you []\n\n\n\nReally... a cool idea... it\'s counter-strike... a first-person SHOOTER... the most played multiplayer game all over the world. It has been the same kind of shooting game for 5 years and you would like to see CS becoming what ? a funny game for few pubbers who will have fun cuffing people ?\n\n\n\nCS is a competition E-sport with lots of teams, LANs, high-level players and so on...\n\n\n\nand you would like to have fun cuffing people and hear "bad boys, bad boys, what you gonna do ?" Stop that now before some people here die from laughing too much.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
