(782476, 106013, 1013, 100174, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by treeman \n\nChat? \n\nOf course not. You\'d be stupid to use AIM (one of the worst programs in history) for chatting when there are so many alternatives. Hell, you could use Trillian or Jabber if you\'re that desperate to chat over the AOL protocol.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
