(787086, 106328, 1013, 100144, 1072936800, '', 'next you\'ll want to take the swearing out of cz because it\'s mean.  L34V3 L337 $p34K 4l0|\\|3\n\n\n\n(this will undoubtly get me flamed, but that means nothing, because I\'ll just pwn you in cs anyway)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(787101, 106328, 1013, 100141, 1072936800, '', 'AH HA!, we got one here ^\n\n\n\nHave you got your haxor t-shirt on?\n\n\n\nAnd I don\'t want to filter swearing as it doesn\'t offend me but words like \'pwned\' just makes the game embarassing to play. \n\n\n\nAnd remember man, school sucks! and hate your parents! and find your inspiration from blink 182 then take your skateboard down to the local park and copy stuff from Jackass. yeah, you\'re pwning those swings man.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(787110, 106328, 1013, 100012, 1072936800, '', 'hmmm. . .yes, because everyone I know who says pwn LOVES Blink 182, and has a haxor t-shirt, and so on. . .\n\n\n\noh, wait, all of that was untrue.\n\n\n\nmaybe you guys should either\n\na)stop crying\n\nb)get your own server, get a filter for it, and be happy\n\n\n\n\n\nseriously, guys, this is sad. . .I personally don\'t care what anyone says to/about me ingame, because *gasp* it\'s a game! you know, that thing that isn\'t directly connected with real life?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(787206, 106328, 1013, 100201, 1072936800, '', 'who ever says pwned gets banned  :P', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(785666, 106347, 1013, 100103, 1072936800, 'it cant be...', 'im the computer geek around my area, and two of my freinds have come to me because they have been banned.\n\ni believe in vac. i was skeptical. however im a man of reason and decided to listen to them.\n\nthey both got banned under the exact same circumstances.\n\ni tried what they did, and got banned myself, yes i sacrificed my own account (its ok i have 6).\n\nhere is what happened:\n\n1. set up 2 comps on a lan.\n\n2. log into one comp using account x.\n\n3. join this server-its the one we all got banned on. (play 4 a min or 2)\n\n66.103.151.18:27015\n\n4. exit that server, dont exit cs, leave it running.\n\n5. log into another comp using the same account x.\n\n6. log into that server. (66.103.151.18:27015)\n\nit doesnt always work, keep trying though. i wasnt succesful until i tried my 3rd account (total tries, like 20)\n\nthat server has vac running, however they may not have updated steam in awhile, its a 24/7 server, i can tell they have an outdated version of some of their 3rd party plugins.\n\n(i dont know, but if you have client side c-d running and you join a vac server does c-d still stop you from cheating? i, not my freinds, was running this during my expirement.)\n\nif anyone is willing to try this, plz do. post back if you get banned. i want to know if this is a one-in-a-million thing, or if something else is at fault.\n\ni think there was a virus or something else was at fault here that caused this, and we are at fault.\n\ni have always believed in vac, however there was the winamp bug...so there is a very VERY small chance, but a chance none the less, there is a bug.\n\nthx. \n\nnote: test my theory at ur own risk. i will not provide cd-keys for those who get banned.\n\n\n\non a(nother) note- when we got the ban error, we had just joined, we were still downloading the security module.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(785703, 106347, 1013, 100103, 1072936800, '', 'look, im not saying "OMFG VALVE U SUC VAC DOESNT WORK, I WASNT CHEATING" but maybe sometimes people arent. there are literally countless appplications out there on our systems, running in the background. i know that one of them could be a false positive, just as hlamp was.\n\nif i had the time and resources, i would run every application combo imaginable, and i ASSURE you that something will turn up. however, most people dont know which ones were running when they got banned. \n\n\n\nall im saying is...look  for common problems, or how about this idea that popped in my head when i was writing that last scentance (and this one).....\n\ncreate a poll-like thing, if you were banned by vac, you fill it out.\n\nit would include:\n\nwhat apps were running?\n\nwhat isp/connection was running\n\nwhen it happened\n\nwere there multiple ppl logged in this account\n\nect.\n\nfilter out all the similarities if more than o say..10? 20? 50? ppl reply with the SAME problem and look into it, test it ect.\n\ni still believe in vac, and that the bans on me and my freinds werent just, we will accept it and move on. \n\nwe all decided to post this, so you dont have all 3 of us spamming the boards and not using the search button, to look for posts on the same topic []\n\n\n\nwith my best regards\n\n  -|Veni_Vidi_Vici*-\n\n\n\n(say can we get a signature font for our signature on these boards? like [sig]blah[/sig], italics just doesnt cut it...)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(785734, 106347, 1013, 100148, 1072936800, 'it cant be...', 'quote:Originally posted by Veni_Vidi_Vici \n\nim the computer geek around my area, and two of my freinds have come to me because they have been banned.\n\ni believe in vac. i was skeptical. however im a man of reason and decided to listen to them.\n\nthey both got banned under the exact same circumstances.\n\ni tried what they did, and got banned myself, yes i sacrificed my own account (its ok i have 6).\n\nhere is what happened:\n\n1. set up 2 comps on a lan.\n\n2. log into one comp using account x.\n\n3. join this server-its the one we all got banned on. (play 4 a min or 2)\n\n66.103.151.18:27015\n\n4. exit that server, dont exit cs, leave it running.\n\n5. log into another comp using the same account x.\n\n6. log into that server. (66.103.151.18:27015)\n\nit doesnt always work, keep trying though. i wasnt succesful until i tried my 3rd account (total tries, like 20)\n\nthat server has vac running, however they may not have updated steam in awhile, its a 24/7 server, i can tell they have an outdated version of some of their 3rd party plugins.\n\n(i dont know, but if you have client side c-d running and you join a vac server does c-d still stop you from cheating? i, not my freinds, was running this during my expirement.)\n\nif anyone is willing to try this, plz do. post back if you get banned. i want to know if this is a one-in-a-million thing, or if something else is at fault.\n\ni think there was a virus or something else was at fault here that caused this, and we are at fault.\n\ni have always believed in vac, however there was the winamp bug...so there is a very VERY small chance, but a chance none the less, there is a bug.\n\nthx. \n\nnote: test my theory at ur own risk. i will not provide cd-keys for those who get banned.\n\n\n\non a(nother) note- when we got the ban error, we had just joined, we were still downloading the security module.  Interesting find, gj.\n\n\n\nI\'m still sticking by VAC though []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(786581, 106347, 1013, 100103, 1072936800, '', 'im sticking by them too (i have it on all my servers []), im just trying to  make sense of what happened.\n\ni think its juust a random glitch that noone cares about or has ever heard of (in that case im ignoring it now)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(786601, 106347, 1013, 100185, 1072936800, '', 'ok im still reading your 1st post ( 3rd read now [] ) wanna undertand this fully..\n\nok you say you log onto your steam account on more than 1 pc and join the same server? \n\nif so that shouldnt be. yes you can have your steam account on more than 1 pc but i didnt think you could use your the same  account on 2 or more pc\'s at the same time and on the same server aswell maybe im reading your post wrong ?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(786739, 106347, 1013, 100103, 1072936800, '', 'no not on the same server at the same time...read step 4, it applies to the 1st computer.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(786914, 106347, 1013, 100524, 1072936800, '', '"4. exit that server, dont exit cs, leave it running.\n\n5. log into another comp using the same account x."\n\n\n\numm, I doubt you can be logged on the same steam account on 2 different computers....', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(786917, 106347, 1013, 100103, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by ChiGoku \n\n"4. exit that server, dont exit cs, leave it running.\n\n5. log into another comp using the same account x."\n\n\n\numm, I doubt you can be logged on the same steam account on 2 different computers....  \n\nyou\'ve obviously never tried it then.\n\ntry it.\n\nit will work.\n\ni do it all the time.\n\nbut under those EXACT circumstances it gets you banned.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
