(788528, 106347, 1013, 103474, 1072936800, 'it cant be...', 'quote:Originally posted by Veni_Vidi_Vici \n\nim the computer geek around my area, and two of my freinds have come to me because they have been banned.\n\ni believe in vac. i was skeptical. however im a man of reason and decided to listen to them.\n\nthey both got banned under the exact same circumstances.\n\ni tried what they did, and got banned myself, yes i sacrificed my own account (its ok i have 6).\n\nhere is what happened:\n\n1. set up 2 comps on a lan.\n\n2. log into one comp using account x.\n\n3. join this server-its the one we all got banned on. (play 4 a min or 2)\n\n66.103.151.18:27015\n\n4. exit that server, dont exit cs, leave it running.\n\n5. log into another comp using the same account x.\n\n6. log into that server. (66.103.151.18:27015)\n\nit doesnt always work, keep trying though. i wasnt succesful until i tried my 3rd account (total tries, like 20)\n\nthat server has vac running, however they may not have updated steam in awhile, its a 24/7 server, i can tell they have an outdated version of some of their 3rd party plugins.\n\n(i dont know, but if you have client side c-d running and you join a vac server does c-d still stop you from cheating? i, not my freinds, was running this during my expirement.)\n\nif anyone is willing to try this, plz do. post back if you get banned. i want to know if this is a one-in-a-million thing, or if something else is at fault.\n\ni think there was a virus or something else was at fault here that caused this, and we are at fault.\n\ni have always believed in vac, however there was the winamp bug...so there is a very VERY small chance, but a chance none the less, there is a bug.\n\nthx. \n\nnote: test my theory at ur own risk. i will not provide cd-keys for those who get banned.\n\n\n\non a(nother) note- when we got the ban error, we had just joined, we were still downloading the security module.  \n\n\n\nWhoever logs onto 3 different units and connects to the same server twice is one-in-a-million and deserves to be banned for hammering steam and being a super-nerd =)\n\n\n\nLol, but anyway, the hell if i would try that, not gettin this 4 digit ID banned! Id like to try it tho.. But I still believe in VAC =/', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(788710, 106347, 1013, 101107, 1072936800, 'Re: it cant be...', 'quote:Originally posted by Dmasjz45 \n\nWhoever logs onto 3 different units and connects to the same server twice is one-in-a-million and deserves to be banned for hammering steam and being a super-nerd =)\n\n\n\nLol, but anyway, the hell if i would try that, not gettin this 4 digit ID banned! Id like to try it tho.. But I still believe in VAC =/  \n\n\n\nTried it at the lan centre using my cousins acct, and it did not get banned, the only result was the other acct getting logged out.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
