(813103, 108860, 1013, 103481, 1072936800, '', 'Yeah that\'d be hilarious haha...\n\n\n\nI also find it amusing how others are posting the same damn problem... find a god damn thread and stay on it, three or four people have posted the exact same thing it\'s hilarious []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(813179, 108860, 1013, 103486, 1072936800, '', 'I\'m getting it too but I can\'t imagine it has anything to do with which weapons are being fired...first time I didn\'t even fire my weapon, I was just running.\n\n\n\nIts funny how I keep finding myself searching these forums for answars to my problems - a bit too often!\n\n\n\nAs I was updating I had a quick glan to which fixes the update had to offer this time, and I really had my hopes up high when I saw that the hitboxes for the shield had been fixed...once again.\n\nAnywho, once again this turned to be bogus, as I watched a guy being shot at from several enemies while shooting, reloading and running (clearly being hit on this exposed side) without taking any damage at all! sooo disapointing!\n\n\n\ndon\'t we love it?!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(813182, 108860, 1013, 103487, 1072936800, '', 'yeah... likewise i\'m getting the same memory dump errors too... and it\'s the same location everytime. so it can\'t be my ram.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(813229, 108860, 1013, 103486, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by US-HeadHunter \n\nYeah that\'d be hilarious haha...\n\n\n\nI also find it amusing how others are posting the same damn problem... find a god damn thread and stay on it, three or four people have posted the exact same thing it\'s hilarious []  \n\n\n\nbtw US-HEADHUNTER (niiice nick bro lol) just maybe, having multiple threads on this issue would make it more visible to the Valve staff, and just maybe this would cause the issue to be fixes a little sooner?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
