(818303, 108982, 1005, 100305, 1072936800, '', 'My 10 cents.\n\n\n\nGraphics problem. No idea what exactly, but it\'s not a rates issue, fact. I have been using the same rates for ages and have only noticed this problem recently, as I said about 3 weeks ago. After you fire either a colt or AK, where as ost peoples xhiar shrinks back down to normal size rapidly, mine just shrinks back down in stages, taking (random guess) about a second longer than most. \n\n\n\nI guess it\'s not OS (XP) or drivers - I have done nothing major to my system in that time, I also have a ghost image of my pc when CS was working perfectly, and restored that, still the same problem. I give up because I know this wont be fixed. \n\nNew game maybe. All gets a bit to much when all you want to do is play the same as others. (violin)\n\n\n\nBam\n\n\n\n[]', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(814490, 109060, 1013, 100332, 1072936800, 'new update crash bug solution!', 'from what i can seen so far, the bug only effect on those client with new update and the server without update, the lastest server version is 2770, after u join a server, type status, and u will see somethings like this.\n\nversion :  47/1.1.2.5/2.0.0.0 2770 secure\n\n2770 mean the server was with the lastest update, so no more crash bug.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
