(815093, 109060, 1013, 103489, 1072936800, '', 'YES IT IS THE SOLUTION... HOW MANY TIMES DOES IT TAKE B4 PEOPLE UNDERSTAND?! sry for my caps but I just don\'t think anyone in here is willing to say anything but gg valve.. I\'ve ONLY had the crash bug problems on servers that we\'re not updated. A problem like this is entirely out of valve\'s hands if it is only because some servers aren\'t updated and it\'s causing people to crash. He is trying to give the solution by stating that only join updated servers if you don\'t want to crash.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
