(819539, 109505, 1013, 100321, 1072936800, 'ya', 'white hawk just so you know, if you have played cs since the update, it will crash on you.  There are a couple symptoms I have heard.  The one I get is screen goes black, when I alt tab my taskbar is in the middle of my screen and at the bottom(2 of them).  When you ctrl alt delete for task manager, it sasy cs is not responding.  When you end task, it does nothing.  You can wait forever and it will do nothing so you have to reboot.  I have had a few friends who have had to do hard shutdowns becasue they couldn\'t bring up the task manager at all.\n\n\n\nAt any rate, you have no right to tell him its his computer, when obviously it is steam\'s fault.  You are wrong, he is right.  I\'m sure the problem is being fixed, but it has made cs unplayable the past couple days.   Oh well.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
