(822201, 109802, 1005, 100341, 1072936800, 'All custom _cz maps found here!!!', 'This thread will be dedicated to the search of all custom _cz maps.\n\n\n\n\n\nSo far I have found many custom _cz maps for download on websites:\n\n\n\nhttp://czero.kaetemi.be/ (http://czero.kaetemi.be/)\n\n- Custom _cz maps\n\n- Nav file collection\n\n- Forums\n\n\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/ (http://www.czmaps.com/)\n\n- Custom _cz maps\n\n- Forums\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThese are the maps that I have found out there on-line:\n\n\n\n\n\naim maps:\n\n\n\naim_57_cz - custom map by sH!Ne\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=16 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=16)\n\n\n\naim_ak-colt2_cz - custom map by sH!Ne\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=15 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=15)\n\nhttp://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=27804 (http://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=27804)\n\n\n\naim_ak-colt_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\naim_aztec2004_cz - ???\n\n\n\naim_aztecarena_cz - custom map by "Deletable_Man of the Can i Get Paid? Clan"\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=27805 (http://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=27805)\n\n\n\naim_aztez_cz - custom map by sH!Ne\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=18 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=18)\n\n\n\naim_chateauarena_cz - custom map by "Deletable_Man of the Can i Get Paid? Clan"\n\n-review coming soon!\n\n\n\naim_dust_desert_cz - ???\n\n\n\naim_dust2003_cz - ???\n\n\n\naim_grassland_cz - custom map by Kaetemi\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm (http://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm)\n\n\n\naim_m3coltd_cz - custom map by sH!Ne\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=23 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=23)\n\n\n\naim_perfect2k4_cz - custom map by Kaetemi\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm (http://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm)\n\n\n\naim_perfect_cz - custom map by Kaetemi\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm (http://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm)\n\n\n\naim_pistols_cz - ???\n\n\n\naim_taliban_cz - custom map by Holmen\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\n\n\ncs_ maps:\n\n\n\ncs_1943_cz - custom map by "tapo [+1943+]TnT"\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=9 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=9)\n\n\n\ncs_assault_cz - custom map by Oi!\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://oimapping.tripod.com/maps/index.htm (http://oimapping.tripod.com/maps/index.htm)\n\n\n\ncs_assault_nod_cz - ???\n\n\n\ncs_assault2004_cz - ???\n\n\n\ncs_assaultoi_cz - same as cs_assault_cz???\n\n\n\ncs_bloodstrike_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\ncs_castle_cz - custom map by Wojjie\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=14 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=14)\n\n\n\ncs_facility_cz - do not have this map, have only seen it on a password protected server.\n\n\n\ncs_mesa_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\ncs_paintball_[dv8]_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\ncs_reflex_cz - ???\n\n\n\n\n\nde_ maps:\n\n\n\nde_black_hawk_cz - custom map\n\n\n\nde_daba_cz - ??? asian author (non-english website)\n\n- I don\'t actually have this map, I just have the txt file for it, don\'t know how that happened.?.?.?\n\n\n\nde_dead1st_cz - custom map by Dead_Bwoy\n\n- This is my first released map.  Arena style bomb/defuse map with 3 floors and plenty of nades around the map for your nading pleasure.\n\nhttp://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=28046 (http://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=28046)\n\n\n\nde_dustr_cz - ???\n\n\n\nde_lluvia_cz - custom map by [Pfeffer]Donkey\n\n- Brilliant custom map for czero!  My favorite by far!\n\n- Classic bomb/defuse style map with excelent textures and brushes.  Two bombsites, water, great angles, sniper camps, you get everything with this map!\n\nhttp://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=27833 (http://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=27833)\n\n\n\nde_mill_cz - custom map\n\n\n\nde_pacman_cz - custom re-texture?\n\n- I believe the only difference from de_pacman, is barely noticable new textures.\n\n\n\nde_tribute_cz - custom map by [WP]IceCube\n\n- Huge map here!  Inferno/Dust/Aztec combo map.\n\n- Two bombsites, one in dust textures and the other in aztec textures.  Great map for 32 player server.\n\nhttp://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=27801 (http://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=27801)\n\n\n\n\n\nfy_ maps:\n\n\n\nfy_buildings_cz - custom map by Kaetemi\n\n- fight yard map where you can own the rooftops, or camp in the shadows on the ground.\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=1 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=1)\n\nhttp://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm (http://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm)\n\n\n\nfy_crazy_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\nfy_dust_cz - custom map y Oi!\n\n- iceworld style fight yard map using dust textures.\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=20 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=20)\n\nhttp://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=27798 (http://www.csczfiles.com/file.info?ID=27798)\n\n\n\nfy_gladiator3_cz - custom map by Wojjie\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=6 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=6)\n\n\n\nfy_glass_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\nfy_grid2_cz - custom map by Wojjie\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=5 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=5)\n\n\n\nfy_houses_cz - ???\n\n\n\nfy_iceworld2k_2_cz - custom map by Kaetemi\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm (http://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm)\n\n\n\nfy_iceworld_arena_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\nfy_iceworld_cz - custom map by Kaetemi\n\nhttp://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm (http://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm)\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=2 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=2)\n\n\n\nfy_iceworld_xxl_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\nfy_oasis_cz - custom map by -SDc-Audigy\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=12 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=12)\n\n\n\nfy_oasisx_cz - custom map by -SDc-Audigy\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=13 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=13)\n\n\n\nfy_ourworld_cz - custom map by "H u m i ! i a t i o n"\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=17 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=17)\n\n\n\nfy_pool_day_cz - ???\n\n\n\nfy_repub_cz - ???\n\n\n\nfy_sewers_cz - custom map by Josh Simmons\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=8 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=8)\n\n\n\nfy_snow_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=3 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=3)\n\n\n\nfy_stoneworld_cz - custom map by Dr.~Z~Mantis\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=19 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=19)\n\n\n\nfy_woodland_cz - custom map by Kaetemi\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=11 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=11)\n\nhttp://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm (http://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm)\n\n\n\n\n\nmisc maps:\n\n\n\nae_bloodbowl_cz - custom map by "Jimmy Shaw aka [AE]Junk in the Box"\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\nawp_bunkier_cz - custom map by BlackGhost\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\nawp_map_cz - custom map by Kaetemi\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm (http://czero.kaetemi.be/maps.htm)\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=4 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=4)\n\n\n\nawp_map2_cz - custom map by Wojjie\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=7 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=7)\n\n\n\nbattlefield_rush2_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\nes_cell_cz - custom map\n\n- Great concept on this map.  T\'s start off in jail cells and have to get guns and escape the prison.\n\n\n\nhe_poolnight_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\nm3_glock_cz - custom map by Dr.<~Z~>Mantis\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=21 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=21)\n\n\n\nmini_dust2_cz - custom map\n\n- Great little map here.  Iceworld style on a hill, spiral stairs, hallway, bridge, and even a small open field.  Perfect for fast raw action!\n\nhttp://cscz.filefront.com/file.info?ID=27803 (http://cscz.filefront.com/file.info?ID=27803)\n\n\n\nmp5_world_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\nscoutzknivez2_cz - custom map by TREDOG\n\n- review coming soon!\n\nhttp://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=10 (http://www.czmaps.com/viewmap.php?m=10)\n\n\n\nstarwars_cz - custom map\n\n- review coming soon!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease post any _cz maps you know of for the database!  And if you know the author or where to dl the map itself from, that would be a big bonus!\n\nWe\'re adding staff over at www.csczfiles.com (http://www.csczfiles.com) so look out for constant updates as well as the upcoming _cz map database!!!  Also for all you developers, modders, modelers, mappers, etc. www.csczfiles.com (http://www.csczfiles.com) offers free website hosting for your projects/mods with free file storage on our csczfiles server.  For more info visit us @ www.csczfiles.com (http://www.csczfiles.com)\n\n\n\nLet\'s make it easier for all of us!\n\nThank you!\n\n\n\nDead_Bwoy\n\naka pepe7373\n\nwww.csczfiles.com (http://www.csczfiles.com) - site manager', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(822598, 109802, 1005, 100342, 1072936800, '', 'wow cheers\n\n\n\ntime to start downloading some maps!\n\n\n\n~PeTr|DeS', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(822826, 109802, 1005, 100343, 1072936800, '', 'do you know where do get cs_deagle5_cz?? it on that website but the link is broken', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(823480, 109802, 1005, 100341, 1072936800, '', 'cs_deagle5_cz, that\'s why I didn\'t post that one on the list.  Google found it contained in a Warez map-pack that had been removed or could not be found.  I\'ll be looking for this one on servers, and someone has already made a post in Keatemi\'s forums.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(823682, 109802, 1005, 100344, 1072936800, '', 'Nice, I\'d like to get my hands on it also. I found the warez pack you were talking about. I already have all those maps for CZ so it\'d be a waste of my bandwidth which is ready to go over. If anyone wants to download that real fast and get deagle5_cz from it I\'d be very greatful.\n\n\n\n/edit missed the part about it being removed, sorry.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(823734, 109802, 1005, 100341, 1072936800, '', 'I don\'t want to start another aztec2 thread here, but I found de_aztec2_cz today running on a server with the password right in the server name: "|pass:dragon" nice name!  It\'s the one with the stone bridge, i think someone may have just renamed de_aztec2 with a _cz extension.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(826263, 109802, 1005, 100345, 1072936800, '', 'Bump.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(826666, 109802, 1005, 100341, 1072936800, '', 'does no-one have any additions to this list?\n\nI don\'t think I\'ve found them all...\n\nI know I havn\'t!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
