(828618, 109802, 1005, 100341, 1072936800, '', 'some new additions I\'ve found today:\n\n\n\nfy_iceworld_forever_cz: custom map\n\n- very basic, just a bigger duller iceworld.\n\n\n\nfy_iceworld_[dv8]_cz - custom map\n\n- acrtic arena much more detailed than the regular iceworld.  Changed the entire layout as well.\n\n\n\nvl_dahaz_cz - custom map\n\n- Be on the lookout for this one.  Kind of small but very detailed.  I got a chance to speak with the author on his server and it is not quite finished yet, but very close.\n\n\n\ntir_o_pigeon_cz - custom fun map\n\n- This is basically a clay pigeon shooting range.  T\'s get shot through the air into the murky pond.  All get AWPs to try to shoot the pigeons.  Fun map!!!\n\n\n\nde_italystreets_cz - custom map (WC3)\n\n- Very basic map using the italy textures.  Mostly striaght streets, with random boxes thrown around the map.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829477, 109802, 1005, 100347, 1072936800, '', 'Are there any good cz maps?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(831957, 109802, 1005, 100341, 1072936800, '', 'I think the following are the best _cz maps out to date:\n\n\n\nde_lluvia_cz\n\nde_tribute_cz\n\naim_chateauarena_cz\n\ncs_assault_cz\n\ncs_paintball_[dv8]_cz\n\nmini_dust2_cz', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(832986, 109802, 1005, 100341, 1072936800, '', 'Maps I\'ve found today:\n\n\n\ncl_elevated_cz - custom map\n\n- Arena style map using sniper rifles.\n\n\n\nfy_castles_cz - custom map\n\n- Fight Yard map based on two castles and a battlefield in between.\n\n\n\n\n\nI plan on making a map pack including some of the best custom _cz maps out there right now.  Post your suggestions for maps to be included in the pack, excluding warez maps of course.  Also, I\'ll have to contact the authors and make sure it\'s ok with them to include their map in the pack.  This map pack will be available exclusively at www.csczfiles.com (http://www.csczfiles.com)!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(835828, 109802, 1005, 100341, 1072936800, '', 'cz map hoaxes?\n\n\n\ncs_office_cz2 - hoax?\n\n- This map has a box with trees in it right outside the CT Spawn garage in front of the front entrance.  Only difference I saw...\n\n\n\ncs_italy_cz2 - hoax\n\n- I found absolutely nothing different about this map.  Maybe different lighting, but that\'s it.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(836014, 109802, 1005, 100348, 1072936800, '', 'Hmm, what about the \'missing\' maps\' like cs_miami_cz. Classified as warez, but downloaded after the last update for deleted missions. Why can\'t I use the map for our multiplayer-server? I like the map very much, as the other cz-maps which came for deleted missions ......\n\n\n\nEDIT:\n\n\n\nWhen I try de_kaetemi_rc3, he misses de_kaetemi.wad, the wad isnt included, where to find?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(824735, 110094, 1013, 100349, 1072936800, 'Steam being down today (Sunday)', 'There has been an external network event causing some pretty bad network problems for Valve today.  The source is not clear at this time, however it is external to Valve\'s network.  It\'s being worked on with our outside connectivity people to fix/shut down the problem.\n\n\n\nSorry for the inconvenience of it all.  We\'d love to flip a switch and fix it, but like I said, it\'s coming from the outside.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(825181, 110094, 1013, 100349, 1072936800, '', 'Update.\n\n\n\nLooks like it\'s been stopped.  Keeping our eye on it though.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829690, 110094, 1013, 100349, 1072936800, '', 'Heads Up! \n\n\n\nNew one just started, which will perhaps cause some forum and Steam issues.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(827531, 110442, 1013, 100350, 1072936800, 'ATi HL2 Key, how to input?', 'Hearing the new that people with ATI Half-Life 2 keys would be able to get teh CounterStrike: Source beta, I decided to go ahead and pop the key into Steam, only, I can\'t figure out how to put it in.\n\n\n\nI\'ve already got the Premier Pack, by virtue of my original Half-Life purchase, so where do I put the key in to make sure I can get the CounterStrike: Source beta, not to mention Half-Life 2?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(827540, 110442, 1013, 100351, 1072936800, ':)', 'goto www.ati.com/online/hl2 (http://www.ati.com/online/hl2) \n\nthen follow instructons...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(827543, 110442, 1013, 100351, 1072936800, 'oops... lol', 'oops, sry.. didnt read it all [] you gotta re-install steam or a new account or summat like that', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(827771, 110442, 1013, 100350, 1072936800, '', 'It seems kind of silly that I\'d have to set up a whole new Steam account just to do this.  I _like_ my Steam username, I don\'t want to have to change it.  []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(827862, 110442, 1013, 100352, 1072936800, 'Good Question', 'I read that you can combine multiple CD-keys to one steam account.  (FAQ)\n\n\n\nSo I assume/hope that it works like CZ.  The game shows up in menu, we put in key from ATI, and can download to the existing steam account.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(827874, 110442, 1013, 100027, 1072936800, '', 'Yup - just hang on to it until HL2 is available on Steam. Then enter it to your current Steam account and voila. []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(828529, 110442, 1013, 100350, 1072936800, '', 'Hanging on to it until Half-Life 2 is out would be fine, Taylor, if not for the fact that I could use it to get the CounterStrike: Source Beta, which was the entire point of this post.\n\n\n\nBasically, I want to get this key entered into Steam now, because as time goes on, Murphy\'s Law dictates that I\'m going to lose this little coupon ... []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(828850, 110442, 1013, 100027, 1072936800, '', 'Oops - Sorry for not noticing that. RIght now, it looks like you\'d have to create a new account. I\'ll see if we can arrange things so that you can enter the ATI key at the time of the CS:S beta, but for now I don\'t think that will happen.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(828926, 110442, 1013, 100027, 1072936800, '', 'Edit: update -- The next Steam update (which will happen before the CS:S Beta) will enable Steam to accept your ATI keys ahead of time, so you shouldn\'t have to create a new account. []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829122, 110442, 1013, 100350, 1072936800, '', 'Great, thanks for that update, Taylor!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829207, 110442, 1013, 100148, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Taylor Sherman \n\nEdit: update -- The next Steam update (which will happen before the CS:S Beta) will enable Steam to accept your ATI keys ahead of time, so you shouldn\'t have to create a new account. []  Sweet [] (For other ppl anyways []) I still need to get a new comp first, heh []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829257, 110442, 1013, 100353, 1072936800, '', 'Taylor,\n\n\n\nI had an existing Steam account from my original HL CD Key. I created a new steam account with my ATI/HL2 voucher code already. With this upcoming change to Steam, I would much rather have my HL2 activated on my original Steam account. Can I still do this? or am I stuck with two accounts, because I have already attached it to a new account? \n\n\n\nThanks.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829284, 110442, 1013, 100354, 1072936800, '', 'Its a shame I already emailed Greg about this []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829373, 110442, 1013, 100027, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by quiv \n\nTaylor,\n\n\n\nI had an existing Steam account from my original HL CD Key. I created a new steam account with my ATI/HL2 voucher code already. With this upcoming change to Steam, I would much rather have my HL2 activated on my original Steam account. Can I still do this? or am I stuck with two accounts, because I have already attached it to a new account? \n\n\n\nThanks.  \n\n\n\nSorry, you\'re stuck that way (and that\'s not going to change anytime soon).', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829431, 110442, 1013, 100353, 1072936800, '', 'Understood, and I kind of figured as much. Please console/humor me here then... I may as well ditch my original account at this point and only log into the one with the HL2 key. Any chance that my Friends contact list can be ported to my second account? \n\n\n\nCould this be as easy as copying a file from one Steam account directory path to the other? or are Friends contact lists stored server-side? If so, is this something Valve Tech Support/Customer Service could do?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829486, 110442, 1013, 100027, 1072936800, '', 'Sorry, we don\'t have a way of transferring Friends lists over either (it\'s a server-side thing).\n\n\n\nThe ATI Bundle includes everything that a WON-key enables, so then yes your old account doesn\'t have anything that your new account doesn\'t.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829496, 110442, 1013, 100112, 1072936800, '', 'Umm...I bought an ATI 9600xt video card a little while back and got the HL2 voucher and signed up for it on the registration site and had forgotten to mail everythign in. Now trying to look for the HL2 voucher I cannot find it.\n\n\n\nI still have the email saying \n\nquote:Once we receive your\n\ncompleted submission, your information will be updated, and you will be\n\nnotified by email when Half-Life� 2 becomes available..\n\n\n\nWhat am I to do now?\n\n\n\nEdit: HA HA! I found it! My 45 minute search is complete and my stomach is now back down from my throat.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829779, 110442, 1013, 100355, 1072936800, '', 'Taylor, what about for all of the people that already went through the hastle of creating a new account. (for multiple reasons:\n\na) dont lose the key\n\nb) somebody doesn\'t randomly generate the key and use)\n\n\n\nIs there any way that I will be able to delete the current steam account using the key, and then start from scratch with the update?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(829818, 110442, 1013, 100112, 1072936800, '', 'I have a question since I already found my voucher.\n\n\n\nDo I still need to send in all the necessary things to get HL2 to work with Steam using the HL2 voucher. \n\nOr can I just wait for HL2 to be in the Games list and input my HL2 cd key that way and receive the game?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(830174, 110442, 1013, 100356, 1072936800, '', 'the real question Taylor... \n\n\n\nWhen CS:S goes live will it be included in my ATI voucher activated account? Or will it only give me the oportunity to participate in the beta ?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(830967, 110442, 1013, 100357, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Taylor Sherman \n\nEdit: update -- The next Steam update (which will happen before the CS:S Beta) will enable Steam to accept your ATI keys ahead of time, so you shouldn\'t have to create a new account. []  \n\n\n\nCool info.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(830987, 110442, 1013, 100358, 1072936800, '', 'Hi, ive got a Problem with the Registration of my ATI Voucher. I followed the instructions on the ATI Page but if i choose a game to enter my code, the software doesn\'t accept the Key. The key is formatted like XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX just like the CS:CZ keys, i tried to enter it in the HALF-Life field and in the CS:CZ field, but nothing works, it says Enter a Correct key, i doesn\'t asks the Server. Please Help, thanks for reply', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(831996, 110442, 1013, 100359, 1072936800, '', 'OK,\n\n\n\nI have had STEAM installed for some time.\n\n\n\nI then bought an ATI card with the voucher deal.\n\n\n\nSo now when I want to use my voucher do I have to create a new account? I\'ve just been sitting on the voucher till HL2 or CZ scource beta came out.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(832038, 110442, 1013, 100360, 1072936800, '', 'What if the Voucher was lost but I did log into the Steam account with the CD-Key. Is there any possibilities that I can find my CD-Key number when im logged in? Well, it has been six long months.....', '127.0.0.1', 1),
