(838808, 110442, 1013, 100363, 1072936800, '', 'sorry', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(838926, 110442, 1013, 100027, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by oldfaq \n\nare you joking Valve? we waiting another F*cking year and you\'re trying to tell me I get one or the other and I bought my graphics card for the game last september? you are PATHETCI that\'s all I can say, Im getting extremely sick of valve.... ahhhhh\n\noldfaq  \n\n\n\nI don\'t think you understood. The offer always was: you\'ll get HL2. The question is, will you also get CS:S, as an added bonus. At this time, I don\'t know.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(839040, 110442, 1013, 100363, 1072936800, '', 'so you\'re saying that if we get HL2 you\'re not sure if we are able to get CS:S when HL2 coes out? ok sorry man I misunderstoood [] sorry\n\noldfaq', '127.0.0.1', 1),
