(839861, 110442, 1013, 100364, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by moussaka \n\ni went here: http://www.atihl2offer.com/ (http://www.atihl2offer.com/)\n\nthen ended up here: https://www.atihl2offer.com/halflif...asp?type=single (https://www.atihl2offer.com/halflife2Notify.asp?type=single)\n\n\n\nsays i need this:\n\nRequirements for Half-Life� 2 Promotional Offer:\n\n\n\nComplete the fulfillment order form and mail it along with the following: \n\n\n\n-Photocopy of the Half-Life� 2 Coupon showing your activation key code - exposed \n\n-Original UPC (bar code) or the full product name cut from the ATI or Partner product package (Photocopies will not be accepted) \n\n-Photocopy of sales receipt with the qualifying ATI or ATI partner 3D graphics board purchase circled \n\n-Completed Fulfillment Order Form Confirmation Page \n\n\n\nok i have everything except the receipt.  i got my 9800xt from newegg so what do i do for a reciept?  \n\n\n\n I sent all this stuff to Ati headquarters in Canada but I didn�t get any response from there  > Is this normal or maybe postal workers lost my mail []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
