(850103, 110442, 1013, 100367, 1072936800, 'A Q for Tylor', 'Hi, i have purchased 9600XT and i am currently using Steam with my ATI-Cd-Key, what do i need 2 do in order to play CS:S Beta? is CS:S Beta out for ATI users yet? Plz explain the procedure.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(851585, 110442, 1013, 100368, 1072936800, 'to my understanding...', 'im going to clear things up to my understanding, pardon me if im wrong...\n\n\n\n\n\nThe ATi vouchers CDkey gives you access to the Premier Pack, but you can only download these games BEFORE HL2s release. After HL2 is realeased, you can still play them but not download them if you havent before. When CS:S Beta is launched (Aug. 5th?), everyone will see CS:S Beta pop into Steam Games list. Only people with CS:CZ keys or ATi voucher keys can access it. (Cyber Cafes will get the Beta a week or so beforehand). Once HL2 is relesed, the beta may or may not dissappear, but you will be able to get HL2 and CS:S Full, because the full version of HL2 includes CS:S. So in the end you will own/ be able to play HL2, CS:S, and the Premier Pack, and you can participate in the CS:S Beta.\n\n\n\nThis is what i know, correct me if im wrong.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(855823, 110442, 1013, 100369, 1072936800, '', 'Hmm, I used my vouche to download the Premier Pack just a couple of days ago since I thought I would still get HL2 and the CS:S BETA anyway. Now I don\'t feel sure about that anymore, have I just done a big mistake here or will I still get HL2 & CS:S?\n\n\n\nSorry to ask, but I felt that I just have to check this here to be sure. []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(856230, 110442, 1013, 100367, 1072936800, '', 'Zlaxzzor - Yes u will get HL2 and CS:S\n\nand it\'s 100% sure', '127.0.0.1', 1),
