(856876, 110442, 1013, 100370, 1072936800, '', 'I have a question. About a year ago, I bought the Platinum Pack before Steam was released. I then used it to set up my Steam account, like many did. Then I purchased a 9600XT, and recieved the voucher. After that, I purchased CZ over Steam. I still have the voucher, but have not used it. Recently, I built a computer for my brother, who would also like to have Steam.\n\n\n\nMy question is, since I have not used the voucher yet, is it possible for my current games to be transferred from my account to my brothers account (the ones from the Plat pack), then I can input the HL2 key from the voucher into my account? I don\'t want to give him the voucher, because I want HL2. The reason I dont want to give him my account, and start a new one is because I have CZ on this account.\n\n\n\nThanks.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(856951, 110442, 1013, 100366, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by FireKingX \n\nIf i get the CS beta from steam by inputing my key would i still be able to get the original box from ATI?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
