(868143, 110442, 1013, 100371, 1072936800, '', 'Taylor. If you let the voucher owners get CS:Source. I, myself, will personally give you a foot massage. \n\n\n\nAND IM A GUY.\n\n\n\nso this is a really big offer from me, im not usually down with giving guys foot massages, but after seeing the videos of CS:Source. Im willing to do whatever it takes for this game. \n\n\n\nI AM COMMITTED.\n\n\n\nso consider the offer and let me know.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
