(848397, 112456, 1005, 100399, 1072936800, '', 'If you haven\'t seen this kind of hack. Look at this!\n\n\n\nHacker name: ____________HI! :P\n\nDemo: Click here to download (http://peterchen620.orcon.net.nz/hacker.zip) (SAVE TARGET AS)\n\n\n\nThis guy call me a fricken n00b! I\'m on a 56K and been playing for 4 years now... I am really pissed.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
