(849609, 112456, 1005, 100397, 1072936800, '', 'lol hey careen, I didn\'t expect you to reply.  Ya, he is full of BS, and all his clan mates stand up for him.  It\'s annoying.  But know, trust me, he started picking people off through the roof, the back door, and the bottom of the bridge when people were on top of it.  Everyone was getting pissed and we all vote kicked him out about 10 times.  But he kept coming back.  He does hack.  But it\'s your choice, you can believe what you want to believe.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
