(849900, 112456, 1005, 100400, 1072936800, '', 'send me a demo relentless and i will gladly look it over for anything suspicious ok? and if it looks bad than i will talk to Justin and Ajax and get him banned alright? just sign on sometime under a different name and spectate him for 5 minutes or so. record for a while.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
