(850319, 112456, 1005, 100004, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Due to the fact that demos/Steam ID\'s can be faked, please dont post on how to get a specific player banned because you have a demo of them cheating. VALVe uses VAC for its bans only.\n\n\n\nThe recommendation is that you contact the server owner where you saw the possible cheater and discuss it with the admin. You can also contact www.thebanlist.com (http://www.thebanlist.com). they are a group, not afiliated with VALVe, that can ban across all Banlist enabled servers only, given enough proof.\n\n\n\nWhile we appreciate you wanting to rid the games of cheaters, VALVe lets VAC do its banning. However, if you know of a new cheat, especially private cheats (ones that arent on a public website), and can provide the links or the actual binaries, please PM a moderator and we\'ll pass it along to the VAC team.\n\n\n\nThanks.\n\n\n\nUpdate:\n\nUnited Admins has teamed up with SteamBans.com in the latest release of HLGuard. Soon the ban lists will be combined and future bans will happen across both networks.\n\n\n\nBTW www.steambans.com (http://www.steambans.com) is a great place to send demos.\n\nquote:Please do NOT post Hacker SteamIDs in the forums.\n\n\n\nValve / Steam / VAC does not Ban players by other players say-so\n\nespecially since it can be used maliciously against innocent individuals.\n\n\n\nThe issue here is not the SteamID itself which is basically public information. The issue is you, the player or server operator relaying information which cannot be verified and can easily be faked.\n\n\n\nI\'m not interested in seeing any discussion about this issue, just accept it as fact and move on.\n\n\n\nAny existing posts with IDs in them will just be ignored, I just don\'t want to see any new posts with SteamIDs in them.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(850341, 112456, 1005, 100405, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by peterchen620 \n\nIf you haven\'t seen this kind of hack. Look at this!\n\n\n\nHacker name: ____________HI! :P\n\nDemo: Click here to download (http://peterchen620.orcon.net.nz/hacker.zip) (SAVE TARGET AS)\n\n\n\nThis guy call me a fricken n00b! I\'m on a 56K and been playing for 4 years now... I am really pissed.  man that forum video is old like 2 weeks i saw it knife hack when he press fire button he is almost flying aimbot that really looked stupid', '127.0.0.1', 1),
