(890283, 116658, 1005, 100307, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by SocialDem \n\nIf you\'re still "considering" additions to the game does this mean that CS:S BETA is the same thing as CS 1.6 with updated graphics and less maps?  Or is CS:S Beta just a hoax?  \n\n\n\nCS:S is CS 1.6 on the Source Engine (If you don\'t know what that is then search for it).  No fewer maps...  The Beta has fewer (One map) but the retail won\'t.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
