(908086, 118318, 1005, 100180, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by smash \n\nMedium Detail w/ steady FPS.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nWell in that case yes...  \n\n\n\nI want to know how you know what level of detail and FPS everybody will get for an unreleased game.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(908089, 118318, 1005, 100507, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by theheavydrinker \n\nWIll my Pentium 3 840 mhz processor with\n\n\n\n384 ram\n\n128 geforce fx 5200 ddr pci video card\n\n\n\nrun hl2, and css on the lowest setting possible? I don\'t care about the "eye candy" I just want to play css..:/  \n\n\n\nActually, no, it won\'t.  Did you read the MINIMUM SPECS??\n\n\n\nRead the friggin topic.  Anything under that will BARELY be able to run it, if at all.\n\n\n\nI still wonder why so many people have fx5200s here, then i realize they all went to best buy to purchase their graphic cards..', '127.0.0.1', 1),
