(908106, 118318, 1005, 100307, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by JeffM \n\nI want to know how you know what level of detail and FPS everybody will get for an unreleased game.  \n\n\n\nWell easy.  Common sense.  And I\'ve been studying Computer Arts and 3D Design so I know some things lots of others don\'t.  And I know people.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(908113, 118318, 1005, 100506, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by redragon525 \n\nActually, no, it won\'t.  Did you read the MINIMUM SPECS??\n\n\n\nRead the friggin topic.  Anything under that will BARELY be able to run it, if at all.\n\n\n\nI still wonder why so many people have fx5200s here, then i realize they all went to best buy to purchase their graphic cards..  \n\n\n\nI read the min specs... but I can play farcry without lag on the lowest setting, and the min reqs for that are higher than my comp...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
