(909891, 118409, 1013, 100513, 1072936800, '', 'Yeah sorry about that guys. I was tired.\n\n\n\nOk what i\'m saying clearly is,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPeople who dont have anything to do with HL2 shouldn\'t be able to Pre Load it.\n\n\n\nFor example,\n\n\n\nIf you have a ATI HL2 CD-KEY, Then you can preload because you will get the game.\n\n\n\nWhen they start Preloading, they will allow you to pre-order it though steam. If you pre-order it though steam and put in your Credit Card number and actually go though all that purchase stuff then thats ok. You can Preload.\n\n\n\nBut if you just plan to Get it retail, then just get the GCF files off the Retail box and dont waste STEAM bandwidth and make it bad for everyone.\n\n\n\nRemember CS:CZ? People preloaded just for fun and deleted the GCF after that. My brother didn\'t get the Preload in time. He was delayed for a few hours. It took me 5 days to get it to work.\n\n\n\nAnd the Entire Steam Network was lagging because every could preload if they wanted to.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
