(910477, 118409, 1013, 100145, 1072936800, '', 'No offence to Gabe or anything, but...\n\n\n\nUNTIL YOU SEE AN OFFICIAL ANNOUNCEMENT ON THE NEWS PAGE OF THIS WEB SITE THEN PLEASE THINK OF THE DATES PROVIDED BY GABE AS ESTIMATES ONLY.\n\n\n\nThe dates provided are part of an internal schedule that may be prone to slippage, please do not be dissapointed if the HL2 pre-load does not start on Aug 17th.\n\n\n\nThanks.\n\n\n\n[]', '127.0.0.1', 1),
