(928809, 119103, 1040, 100552, 1072936800, '', 'i played for 40minutes so there are my impressions which i think hasnt been talked..\n\n\n\n] you\'ve the scum on the scope\n\n] there is some insect flying in tunel\n\n] bomb is unmoveable\n\n] dead bodies are like ghost..they\'re falling to each other and ppl can run through them\n\n] you\'ve \'duck\' speed for some time since you stand up (maybe bug, i hope, but it looks realistic)\n\n\n\nmy PC:\n\nxp1.6\n\n256ram\n\nmx440\n\ni had ~40fps and it looks that i had cutted a lot of effects\n\n\n\nbugs:\n\ncapslock affect the chat, its good until you havent jumping on it\n\nascii chars in names etc.\n\nroom_type doesnt change back to 0 sometimes\n\nbuy aliases (flash,hegren..) are unknown\n\nweapon_* aliases doesnt work\n\nmy english\n\n\n\n_over', '127.0.0.1', 1),
