(917466, 119215, 1013, 100511, 1072936800, 'Calling all bug reporters!', 'ATTENTION ATTENTION ATTENTION\n\n\n\nWith the current and upcoming stages of the CS:S beta, participants will be able to report bugs directly through Steam.  But what about everyone else?  And what about after the beta?  And what about bug in the other games?  Fear not!  The answer is here.\n\n\n\nProject Boil (http://projectboil.pixel10.co.uk) is a community initiative to create a database of professional quality bug reports for Steam and its games.  We currently sport a repository of over 60 bugs in Steam, CS and CZ and we are expanding it every day.  But we need your help.  The more community input we get, the stronger the project becomes.\n\n\n\nSo if you�ve found a bug in Steam or one of its games, head over to Boil (http://projectboil.pixel10.co.uk) and submit it!\n\n\n\n[UPDATE]  The site is down at the moment.  Will notify when fixed.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(917601, 119215, 1013, 100563, 1072936800, '', 'I have some suggestions for that site.\n\n\n\n* Fix duplicate reports.\n\n* Different pages for Enhancements and Bugs.\n\n* Sorting for severity of bug.\n\n\n\n[] It\'s a nice page. I will be adding some of my own errors.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
