(924627, 119505, 1005, 100622, 1072936800, '', 'Placeholder post 5/start of discussion\n\n\n\nWhew, adding CS:E 1.3 took a long time.\n\n\n\nfoxmask, you got your list so you can see what\'s just been updated ^^^\n\n\n\nEDIT: Noooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo!\n\nI spent hours updating to CS: E 1.3, only for it to delete itself on me! I pressed backspace to delete something, and instead it went back a page! Noooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo!\n\n\n\nEDIT: Redone it! Damn am I annoyed though []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
