(924901, 119505, 1005, 100622, 1072936800, '', 'Yup, just that post.\n\n\n\nI\'ve done Extended Duty! Good pack, btw, BigDaddyK.\n\n\n\nEDIT: Two ours ago, CS BANANA also released an Overview.vdf generator and a HexColor to RGB Converter tool to aid in the creation of mission packs. I\'m essentially gonna bundle these two new tools as part of their existing CZ Mission Pack Creator, when I do it\'s section later...\n\n\n\nAs for the links not working, I\'ve looked into them:\n\n\n\nCS Evolutions 1.3, I just got the wrong link for :S\n\n\n\nT Balancing DOES work. I dunno why it wouldn\'t work for you.\n\n\n\nWorst Case Scenario I know about, if you read it there\'s a fix: \'You need to copy the 2 links, paste them into your browser and replace the stars with geocities...\' I\'ve editted it to make it a little bit clearer now though []\n\n\n\nTony-Strike works. The only thing that doesn\'t is it\'s website :S Remember that on some files you must right-click and go \'Save target as...\' with that pack.\n\n\n\nAs for Terrorists Missions, you\'re right... I need to talk to SteelV on this one. Last time this happened, he kindly agreed to host it. This is a small pack, so I reckon he\'ll agree again []\n\n\n\nAnd that\'s yer fill. You got 2/5 :P', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(926516, 119505, 1005, 100624, 1072936800, '', 'my training pack is going through the phase right now where i keep the basic idea, but i completely rewrite the pack.  i wouldn\'t consider it coming "soon" but it\'ll be here eventually.\n\n\n\nerror was with repeating maps...so now its shortened to 5 tours, all de maps.  supposed to train myself up for leagues, if my friend ever gets a clan going that doesnt break up in a week or two (like his always do)\n\n\n\nEDIT\n\n\n\ncan anyone guess what\'s wrong with this task line?\n\ni used it on aim_ak-colt\n\n\n\n"\'headshotwith 4 ak47 inarow\' \'headshotwith 4 m4a1 survive\' \'killwith 4 pistol\' \'killwtih 8 m4a1\' \'killwith 8 ak47\' \'kill 18\'"\n\n\n\nif you can tell me, good job.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
