(929711, 120359, 1013, 100636, 1072936800, 'Wow Still happening odd spike/lagouts', 'Its been like 2 months now iv had this problme i even went on vecation for 2 weeks i come back and it still happends iv tryied every thing from reinstalling steam to defragmenting to reformating to pritty much about the beaqt msteam with a hammer. Ill be playing and bam ill just lag out for like 10-20 seconds says connection error then flush entity packet once every lagout and on the spike it doesnt effect any of my other stuff that suses internet like mIRC, msn, aim or ie And its not my cable company i even switched ip\'s. So "STEAM YOU REALLY NEED TO FIX THIS PROBLUME BEFOR IT GETS EVEN MORE RETARTED THANKS" P.S iv been playing hl since first beta release so this problume just tiks me off real bad...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(931264, 120359, 1013, 100637, 1072936800, '', 'hey i know how u feel the weirdest thing happened tho\n\n\n\nive hadthe lagspikes since 5/19 right\n\n\n\nmy windows 2000 crashed so i instaleld xp\n\n\n\nWALA! problem fixed...... but the weird thing is, it wasnt lagging and i was still updating like counter-strike wasnt at 100 neither was half life\n\n\n\nas soon as it finished BOOM lag everywhere.... please steam fix this...... it\'s been getting worse...... and verizon sed nothings going on ::sigh::', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(931307, 120359, 1013, 100638, 1072936800, 'Wow Still happening odd spike/lagouts', 'quote:Originally posted by TheRealRazieL \n\nIts been like 2 months now iv had this problme i even went on vecation for 2 weeks i come back and it still happends iv tryied every thing from reinstalling steam to defragmenting to reformating to pritty much about the beaqt msteam with a hammer. Ill be playing and bam ill just lag out for like 10-20 seconds says connection error then flush entity packet once every lagout and on the spike it doesnt effect any of my other stuff that suses internet like mIRC, msn, aim or ie And its not my cable company i even switched ip\'s. So "STEAM YOU REALLY NEED TO FIX THIS PROBLUME BEFOR IT GETS EVEN MORE RETARTED THANKS" P.S iv been playing hl since first beta release so this problume just tiks me off real bad...  \n\n\n\nAre you running mIRC, msn, aim while playing?  Do not run any prog that uses bandwidth, close all.  Scan your rig using Spybot and Ad aware.  The flush entity packet error is typical of dial-up.  What is your connection type?  Make sure your Steam internet connection is set to your actual speed, do not overload like running LAN/T1 when you got dsl.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
