(930764, 120471, 1005, 100238, 1072936800, 'The Ultimate CS:S Review [35 Screenshots!]', 'quote:Originally posted by tricab \n\n\n\n\n\ncom specs:\n\n2.66ghz p4 processor with no HT\n\n512mb SDRAM\n\n128MB ATI Radeon 9600XT\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nhey what kind of framerate did you get while playing (no one around, people, smoke, lots of people+smoke, stuff like that)\n\n\n\nalso at resolution did you play at? \n\n\n\ngreat screens *claps*\n\n\n\nmy comp specs are basically yours\n\n\n\n2.53ghz no HT\n\n512 ddr333\n\nand an asus radeon 9600xt 128mb', '127.0.0.1', 1),
