(930773, 120471, 1005, 100632, 1072936800, '', 'i played at the resolution that the screenshots were taken at... 1024x768.\n\n\n\nwith 4x AA, my FPS can drop between 30-60 during large firefights.averaging out to about 40-50fps during normal times. Smoke does not affect the fps at all, unlike the old game.\n\n\n\nWithout AA (not much difference) i can get up to 80 FPS without any people around.\n\n\n\nhope that helps [] i was hoping i could take screenshots with the fraps counter at the top left hand corner of the screen, but it seems that the fraps FPS counter is an overlay, so it isnt included in the screenshots, sadly.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
