weapon23.jpg)\n\n\n\n-Sniping Rifles-\n\nhttp://img69.exs.cx/img69/1204/weapon14.jpg (http://img69.exs.cx/img69/1204/weapon14.jpg)\n\nhttp://img69.exs.cx/img69/8901/weapon18.jpg (http://img69.exs.cx/img69/8901/weapon18.jpg)\n\n\n\n-Auto Snipers-\n\nhttp://img69.exs.cx/img69/719/weapon17.jpg (http://img69.exs.cx/img69/719/weapon17.jpg)\n\nhttp://img69.exs.cx/img69/7632/weapon25.jpg (http://img69.exs.cx/img69/7632/weapon25.jpg)\n\n\n\n-Machine Guns-\n\nhttp://img69.exs.cx/img69/781/weapon19.jpg (http://img69.exs.cx/img69/781/weapon19.jpg)\n\n\n\n-Others-\n\nhttp://img69.exs.cx/img69/1157/weapon12.jpg (http://img69.exs.cx/img69/1157/weapon12.jpg)\n\nhttp://img69.exs.cx/img69/470/weapon24.jpg (http://img69.exs.cx/img69/470/weapon24.jpg)\n\nhttp://img69.exs.cx/img69/377/weapon26.jpg (http://img69.exs.cx/img69/377/weapon26.jpg)\n\nhttp://img69.exs.cx/img69/6099/weapon27.jpg (http://img69.exs.cx/img69/6099/weapon27.jpg)\n\nhttp://img63.exs.cx/img63/1613/c16.jpg (http://img63.exs.cx/img63/1613/c16.jpg)\n\n\n\nalso i noticed alot of people tend to spoil the weapon pictures because of horrible compression. these really do the game justice with 4X aa on.\n\n\n\nMy FPS might be affected by me starting a server, might affect the CPU and thus hurt the FPS a little.\n\n\n\n For a full review of the game plus screenshots, check my other thread : /forums/...threadid=120471 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=120471) \n\n\n\nshots were taken on\n\ncom specs:\n\n2.66ghz p4 processor with no HT\n\n512mb SDRAM\n\n128MB ATI Radeon 9600XT\n\n\n\nTop left is the framerate. with 4X AA on.\n\n\n\nUPDATE\n\n\n\nSeems i forgot about the Mac-10! sorry about that. added it in with the c4.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
