(969494, 123937, 1005, 100725, 1072936800, 'aahhk', 'I get the one where it sais \n\n\n\n"Unable to set mode. This may be a known beta bug with antialiasing. We have reset your antialiasng settings. Please try running again"\n\n\n\nAnd ive fooled with the settings and tryed loading to no avail.... my settings are at application preference..\n\n\n\nMy card has the 4.8cats with dx9c and its a 9600xt 256mb.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(969513, 123937, 1005, 100726, 1072936800, ':(', 'i get the same engine error, and i know that valve recieved this error, but i just wanted to be amoung the many that are having this problem.  I was able to start the game, and then run the stress test, and then raised the antialiasing to 4x.  upon doing so, cs:s froze and i closed and restarted steam.  once i did this, i was able to get back into cs:s and i tried to connect to a server that was full, and after 10min of not being able to get in, i closed cs:S and went to dinner.  came back and tried to run cs:s, and i got the error. i just hope valve fixes this problem soon, cause i just want to mess around with the new cs.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
