(973080, 124566, 1040, 100742, 1072936800, 'config ...  binds the right way', 'im sick for all the half [color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color][color=pink][font=symbol]©[/font][/color] alias autoexec BS  binds \n\n\n\nhere is the right way that works \n\n\n\njust like CZ and 1.6 you can just add binds to your config \n\nbut its been changed a bit in CSS\n\n\n\nJUST ADD BUY TO ALL THE ITEMS IN YOUR BIND \n\n\n\nso \n\nbind "x"  "buy m4a1; buy primammo; buy vesthelm\n\n\n\nthe nades have changed a bit you now need the full name \n\nflash has changed to flashbang\n\nand hegrenade for frag nade \n\nand smokegrenade for smoke\n\n\n\nalso the quick switch still works just add use to the bind like \n\nbind "x" "use weapon_knife"\n\nbind "x" "use weapon_hegrenade"\n\nbind "x" "use weapon_flashbang"\n\nbind "x" "use weapon_smokegrenade"\n\n\n\nand so on here is the full list of name enjoy\n\n\n\nps find any problem or need help post here\n\n\n\none more thing ive been gettin some problems with \n\nslot 1-4 will stop workin  so i cant change weapon\n\nto fix just exec config  in console\n\nbut this may be just me \n\n\n\n \n\nOk, here are the names for buying.\n\npistols\n\n=======\n\nglock\n\nusp\n\np228\n\ndeagle\n\nelites\n\nfn57\n\n\n\nshotguns\n\n========\n\nm3\n\nxm1014\n\n\n\nsmg\n\n===\n\nmac10\n\ntmp\n\nmp5\n\nump45\n\np90\n\n\n\nrifles\n\n======\n\ngalil\n\nak47\n\nscout\n\nsg552\n\nawp\n\ng3sg1\n\nfamas\n\nm4a1\n\naug\n\nsg550\n\n\n\nmachine gun\n\n===========\n\nm249\n\n\n\nammo\n\n====\n\nprimammo\n\nsecammo\n\n\n\nequipment\n\n=========\n\nvest\n\nvesthelm\n\n flashbang\n\nhegrenade\n\nsmokegrenade', '127.0.0.1', 1),
