(973254, 124566, 1040, 100742, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Ninjia^ \n\nHow do I bind two keys to the same function??\n\n\n\nfor example I want this\n\n\n\nbind "V" "slot2"\n\n\n\nbut as soon as I do this I lose the ability to use the "2" key to select slot2 or radio commands using the "2" key []  \n\n\n\nok bind "2" slot2 \n\nand bind "V" slot2 \n\n\n\nif it stops workin mid game  \n\n\n\nexec config in console to fix \n\n\n\nPS put your config to read only  so steam doesnt over wight it\n\n\n\ni dont know why they took out  alt keys  for buttons ?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
