(980836, 124566, 1040, 100307, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by bozer \n\nHow do I bind "K" so that I can buy either the AK or the M4A1 depending on which team Im on.  \n\n\n\nbind "k" "buy m4a1; buy ak47"\n\n\n\nIt will buy whatever gun is available on your team.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
