(980886, 124566, 1040, 100745, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by smash \n\nbind "k" "buy m4a1; buy ak47"\n\n\n\nIt will buy whatever gun is available on your team.  \n\n\n\nIm pretty sure I tried that and it didnt work. Will try again now and report back, but Im guessing it wont =*(', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(980913, 124566, 1040, 100747, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by smash \n\nbind "k" "buy m4a1; buy ak47"\n\n\n\nIt will buy whatever gun is available on your team.  \n\n\n\n\n\nbind "k" "buy m4a1; buy ak47;"\n\nforgot the semicolon at the end\n\nwhy not threw in primammo \n\n\n\nBind "key" "buy m4a1; buy ak47; buy primammo;"\n\n\n\nIf you need a more in depth guide try mine\n\n\n\n/forums/...7699#post977699 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&postid=977699#post977699)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(980992, 124566, 1040, 100748, 1072936800, '', 'The "autoexec BS" you claim to know so much about actually WORKS and does what it is supposed to:\n\n\n\nIt saves your binds because each and every time CSS starts up, the Config.cfg is OVERWRITTEN. This is done so you can change settings on the fly like your command rate and updaterate among others.\n\n\n\nPut all of your key binds in an autoexec.cfg and put that into the following folder:\n\n\n\nC:\\<steam install>\\<e@mail.com folder>\\counter-strike source beta\\cstrike\\cfg\n\n\n\nYou may have to create it if it doesn\'t exist.\n\n\n\nThe reason the autoexec.cfg is activated is because of the valve.rc file (in the CS games cache file).', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(981428, 124566, 1040, 100742, 1072936800, '', 'autoexec didnt work for me in CSS\n\n\n\nput your config to read-only and it wont get OVERWRITTEN', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(973230, 124589, 1040, 100749, 1072936800, 'For the dedicated community', 'I dont know about a lot of other cs players but me and my friends were appauled wen we heard we werent able to get the source beta, ur basically forcing all the dedicated players who want to play the beta to buy a new vid card or buy a copy of one of the easiest/crappest games i have ever played. nothing would plz u guys more than to kill cs by the looks of it.\n\n\n\nAs for who is deserving of it, some kiddy goes out and buys cz and they are deserving, i on the other hand have been a supporter of cs ever since it was made and would never leave it for another game am not deserving.\n\n\n\nI will "NOT" submit to your cruel torture and money hungry ways\n\n\n\n\n\nPS SIF NOT GIVE THE REAL PLAYERS SOURCE!!!!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(973358, 124589, 1040, 100749, 1072936800, '', 'bump\n\n\n\nreply steam, or are u too busy counting bills', '127.0.0.1', 1),
