(1011618, 128840, 1005, 100589, 1072936800, 'NVIDIA 66.00 & CS:S - Smoooth', 'Got my hands on 66.02 - they are not publically available but 66.00 were leaked last night and I would guess those are close enough. They are available here:\n\n\n\nhttp://www.osnn.net/comments.php?shownews=10882 (http://www.osnn.net/comments.php?shownews=10882)\n\n\n\nFirstly I ran the VST and got the following:\n\n\n\nHalf-life 2 VST @ 1280x960 AA2 AF2:\n\n61.77 - 45.345448 fps\n\n66.02 - 72.021233 fps\n\n\n\nRan dust itself and it was so smooth!\n\nWill be doing more extensive testing tonight', '127.0.0.1', 1),
