(1048108, 132227, 1005, 100894, 1072936800, 'Your Gabe Newell post was a fake.', 'After a close scrutiny of Gabe Newell�s account history on the forums, we\'ve come to the conclusion that the gold post is a fake. While we can\'t be 100% certain at this stage, all indicators point towards someone hacking the forum account. That said, all Gabe\'s previous posts on these forums are quite legitimate.\n\n\n\nWe apologize for the confusion and will be investigating further. Theoretically, an IPB forum account should be very difficult to hack. Well, that was the theory at least. We\'ll keep you updated. \n\n\n\nSource: http://www.hl2fallout.com/ (http://www.hl2fallout.com/)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1048121, 132227, 1005, 100876, 1072936800, '', 'ya like I posted ( or tried to ) on hl2fallout \n\n\n\nI hope this doesn\'t hurt Gabe\'s or anyone from valve\'s posting on community boards.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1048142, 132227, 1005, 100895, 1072936800, '', 'I think in future it would be wise for Gabe to personally email the staff at HL2Fallout and get them to post the news on the front page, THEN create a forum thread to discuss it, because everything he says gets posted on the news anyway, and at least it can be better trusted.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
