(1048122, 132230, 1005, 100900, 1072936800, 'HL2 Going gold - Hoax??????', 'If u look on csnation it says that it\'s prolly a hoax. I honestly dont see what this person was thinking when he hacked gabe newall\'s account. Must be an attention seeker.\n\n\n\nDamn u hackers!!!!\n\n\n\nComments????', '127.0.0.1', 1),
