(1048155, 132230, 1005, 100903, 1072936800, '', 'Maybe he posted it from home. After all, it\'s Friday night...\n\nOr maybe that\'s just my wishful thinking...\n\n\n\nBut it is kinda odd to announce that it will be gold on Monday. Are they so certain it will be finished by Monday? If it\'s already finished by now, why not just say it\'s already gold?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1048171, 132230, 1005, 100002, 1072936800, '', 'His home account is on speakeasy and they know the ip of that.\n\n\n\n-- Steve Tauber', '127.0.0.1', 1),
