(1062191, 133443, 1013, 100852, 1072936800, 'About Half-Life 2 Gold / Release Date Posts ...', 'quote:Originally posted by Chris Bokitch \n\nThere have been several fake "Half-Life 2 Gone Gold!" posts made in forums across the community by people masquerading as Gabe.  When Half-Life 2 goes gold, it will be announced via a wide-spread press release.  It will be posted many, many places, including the news here and at half-life2.com (http://www.half-life2.com/).\n\n\n\nYou\'ll also hear a collective cheer rise up from the Bellevue area, if you\'re within a few hundred miles.  \n\n\n\nOk, so in another week? cool. j/k If not, why was a 1gig file pushed to us? was there a reason other than the obvious one but very undetailed explanation?\n\n\n\nAlso, wouldn\'t this have been better addressed in the HalfLife forums as opposed to General? Sorry I don\'t cruise every single forum category here. Maybe get a Global Announcement mod for your forums so it\'s posted right across.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1062324, 133443, 1013, 100918, 1072936800, 'About Half-Life 2 Gold / Release Date Posts ...', 'quote:Originally posted by Chris Bokitch \n\nThere have been several fake "Half-Life 2 Gone Gold!" posts made in forums across the community by people masquerading as Gabe.  When Half-Life 2 goes gold, it will be announced via a wide-spread press release.  It will be posted many, many places, including the news here and at half-life2.com (http://www.half-life2.com/).\n\n\n\nYou\'ll also hear a collective cheer rise up from the Bellevue area, if you\'re within a few hundred miles.  \n\n\n\n\n\nm sorry to say but you guys are just sad, i mean ID software gave us more detail on the release date for Doom 3 than you guys are giving us on HL2. I just hope you have a good anti piracy program cuase the way you guys are cutting it, seems lke no one will buy your single player game and just pay $10-20 for CS:source. You guys need to get your act togeather and stop using "market stratagies" which by the way have disapointed more than half the world.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1059677, 133472, 1005, 100919, 1072936800, 'HL2 Date???  Is this the GOSPEL?', 'OMFG!!!!\n\n\n\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...04-08-30001.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v461/sid24/2004-08-30001.jpg)\n\n\n\nThis could be it and YES i know that the correct way to spell that would be "It\'s" not "ITS".  Have fun with it....discuss', '127.0.0.1', 1),
