(1059720, 133472, 1005, 100919, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Hampster \n\nRead the stickies.  :/  Like the first thread in this forum.  \n\n\n\nI did and I\'m not "acting" like any Valve rep.  He specifically states that.  I know what Chris said, as well as other Valve reps.  Just thought it was cool to see this.  Interesting non the less', '127.0.0.1', 1),
