(1059763, 133472, 1005, 100482, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Waldo \n\nWhen it comes out, you won\'t be seeing some picture from some magazine posted by a stranger to let the world know.   It will be announced all over (including here).  Chris made it pretty clear in /forums/show...threadid=133443 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=133443)  \n\n\n\ni guess that means september 22 isn\'t the release date []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1059768, 133472, 1005, 100919, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Waldo \n\nWhen it comes out, you won\'t be seeing some picture from some magazine posted by a stranger to let the world know.   It will be announced all over (including here).  Chris made it pretty clear in /forums/show...threadid=133443 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=133443)  \n\n\n\nzzzzzzzzz\n\n\n\n\n\nNot to be rude, but this was not to post all over the web a date or confirmation, or start a rumor.  I think it\'s funnier to see these things and nobody disputes it... like Valve.  Explaining the above photo, or why it may be.\n\n\n\nWe will have many and have seen many fakes run amok.  Now soon it will be time to see a virus or worm using a name from HL2.  Like Combine.W32 or the Strider worm.  That\'s how I\'d do it....not.  This place indeed is one place to start a rumor, but you know to be keener than that.  OH OH and will we get PGP key from gabe now that his accounts have been had?  You know, just so we know it\'s him.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
