(1080050, 135568, 1013, 100946, 1072936800, '', 'first of all, you and your buddy were being complete jerks and obscenely badmouthing ppl on the server and the clan members as well as the server.  That server is run by a very experienced group of people who promote a friendly environment without hackers for you and your friends to play on.  You were asked to quiet down and keep your opinions to yourself, failing that you were llama\'d.  After that you were kicked and banned by myself a little later on.  Simply reinstall steam to fix your problems if you\'re still having any...and it\'s not that much trouble, I\'ll be doing it myself in a few days, so i\'m sure you can handle it...as to anyone else who reads this post, I wish to thank FJTJ for the free advertising, you can try out our server at the ip he posted and see for yourself how the server is kept up.  Peace.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1081331, 135568, 1013, 100945, 1072936800, '', 'You and your admin still have no right to hack a persons PC because they feel like it.  Why should I have to reinstall STEAM because I complained about being spawn camped.  I told them I did it to distact them, so that others could get out, and it worked.  But when they hacked the first computer, and I questioned it, they laughed and then did it to mine.  You have a problem, kick or ban someone from YOUR server, you are not in charge of STEAM / VAVLE, you do not have the authority to make those choices to keep someone off the game, just your server.\n\n\n\nAnd it doesnt matter how much trouble it is to fix, you still have not got that right, you are not that important that you can make people have to reinstall steam because they bothered you....  Thanks for openly admitting you did hack my PC, and the other one, at least it warns people about how you are.\n\n\n\nAs far as the frienldy enviroment, I played your server a few times, I wont argue that, as long as people dont say anything that makes you upset?  The hack free, I will, cause you didnt kick the hackers that were on when I was, just laughed about it.\n\n\n\nYou and your admins might think highly of yourselves, but to me that is just some little 7 year old kid doing the "gimme my ball im leaving" BS cause they are having a power trip.\n\n\n\nYeah, free advertising, go play the server, just dont complain or do anything they dont like, or they will mess up your PC / game, not just playing on their server.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
