(1081440, 135568, 1013, 100905, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by FJTJ324 \n\nYou and your admin still have no right to hack a persons PC because they feel like it. They don\'t and VALVe won\'t do anything to prevent "slow hacking", as this is called.\n\n\n\nDelete your config files (*.cfg) and try again. They proably messes your timeout setting. Before you delete the files, you can check if they changed your timeout value by entering "cl_timeout" in your console.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1081447, 135568, 1013, 100947, 1072936800, '', 'look kid just be lucky they didnt decide to really f*ck you-if they got inside you that easily...think what they could have done if they wanted to?\n\n\n\n....deltrees anyone?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1081524, 135568, 1013, 100945, 1072936800, '', 'nope, did not say anything about complaining, just hacking/cheats.\n\n\n\nI admitted I was doing it to distract them, thats when they got mad, cause it worked.\n\n\n\nAs they said, by any means necessary, and I was using the only one I could, cause everytime I spawned a nade would kill me, and yeah, when I spawned, not as I came out of spawn.\n\n\n\nI already fixed the problem, but they still are not the STEAM almighty \'I pick you to play the game, but not you\'.\n\n\n\nAnd they did do something to the first PC, but I got that fixed to.  The antivirus detected it, just a little to late, but thats what restore is for.\n\n\n\nGuess how bad they hack you is based on how mad you make them.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1081541, 135568, 1013, 100824, 1072936800, '', 'He did the right thing. I do that to annoying people as well. If you dont like it, reinstall if you dont know what to do. I myself dont want idiots on my server, and are glad that other admins are there to keep them off. Notice on the server, it says something like "By joining this server, an admin is allowed to exec commands on your PC"\n\n\n\nYour responsible. Not him.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1081603, 135568, 1013, 100948, 1072936800, '', 'Why not just ban him, and not mess with his files? I have a problem with this. It just makes the admin. as bad as the guy that gets kicked imo. I know people act dumb at times and if it\'s your server you have the right to kick or ban anyone, but to go this far imo is just as dumb.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1081784, 135568, 1013, 100236, 1072936800, '', 'Wow People who run that server are definetly idiots if they messed around with your files thats completely wrong thats just retarted if you dont want him in your server kick him out dont make him go through the hassle of reinstalling Stupid little Kid Admins', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1081863, 135568, 1013, 100949, 1072936800, '', 'I agree, you run a server and implement your own rules fine,but for you to malishusly destroy or corrupt someones computer because they piss you off is completly childish,thats what kick /ban is for,but you go one step farther which makes you a f|_|cking idiot.As for promoting your server ,i wouldnt say he promoted anything.I\'d say he warned ppl of a childish nub who thinks he can do whatever the f|_|ck he want to ppls computers.I myself would like to come to your server and poon you and your admins asses and i know i could, but for the simple reason that you are doing this to ppl cuz they piss you off well me owning you would piss you off,so.....I myself am going to promote your server,and everyone will know that you and your admins are childish hacking f|_|cks,and i promise you ,your server will not be too popular by the time im done.and for the guy who says that this guy has the right to run client commands on the connecting puter,thats bull hacking someones computer and destroying files is NOT a client command,and is illegal and punishable and i hope you get whats coming to you nub.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1082131, 135568, 1013, 100946, 1072936800, '', 'how great responses guys, I completely agree with most of you.  Here\'s the facts:  \n\n\n\n(...apparently i can\'t use quotes here...oh well, i\'ll still try...)\n\n\n\n\n\n[quote="FJTJ324"]Why should I have to reinstall STEAM because I complained about being spawn camped. I told them I did it to distact them, so that others could get out, and it worked.[\\quote]\n\n\n\nOh, is that what you were saying?  We couldn\'t make it out between the F*** this and F*** that\'s...\n\n\n\n\n\n[quote="FJTJ324"]Thanks for openly admitting you did hack my PC, and the other one, at least it warns people about how you are.[\\quote]\n\n\n\nI did nothing of the sort...with the other one i have a vague idea of what\'s wrong, and I would probably have told you what I would do in your situation...but you\'ve been telling me to screw off lately...so,...yeah...and your computer that was "hacked" or whatever i have no idea...i would suggest getting a firewall...possibly an antivirus program...but i honestly have no idea what\'s wrong with it.\n\n\n\n\n\n[quote="Mr.Buzbuz]did the server rules ask you not to complain?[\\quote]\n\n\n\n[quote="FJTJ324"]nope, did not say anything about complaining, just hacking/cheats.[\\quote]\n\n\n\nYou obviously didn\'t read all of the rules, among them are the following:\n\n\n\n[quote="server rules"]\n\n3. Do not spam any channel, voice or text. \n\n4. Give proper respect to -}KSA{- clan members. This is their home.\n\n[\\quote]\n\n\n\nof which you violated both and were asked multiple times to please stop which you decided to ignore.\n\n\n\n\n\n[quote="Moe_FuGGeR]I myself would like to come to your server and poon you and your admins asses and i know i could,[\\quote]\n\n\n\nPlease do, it sounds like you might be skilled...I\'d enjoy playing against you and would definitely give you props if you can beat me...you can go ahead and pwn the other clan members though, i\'ll laugh at them along with you [].  seriously though, we have a wide range of skill in the clan, and I think you would receive a challenge if that\'s what you\'re looking for.\n\n\n\n\n\nAnyways, enough of this essay, I\'ll tell you right now, we try to run a respectable server, but don\'t take my word for it...and certainly don\'t take his.  Make up your own mind and your own opinion.  Come on our server and play, and we\'ll tell you what we tell everyone else: If you don\'t like our server, you can leave, it\'s there for those who enjoy having a good time not having to worry about hackers, racists, or people who swear too much...that\'s right folks, it\'s a kid friendly environment, so bring your children. (and don\'t worry, if you like swearing, go ahead, just don\'t use capslock too much, or you MIGHT be asked by admin to settle down a little).  Peace.\n\n\n\n-Arakus', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1082523, 135568, 1013, 100378, 1072936800, 'To FJTJ324', 'To FJTJ324:\n\ntotal pwnage....grow up and buy norton. its people like you that whine about things all the time but never do anything. besides complain and whine, that is', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1085659, 135568, 1013, 100945, 1072936800, '', 'Actually, I wasnt the one swearing that much until they hacked the first PC, then I did, I was angry, as I had every right to be.\n\n\n\nThe PC does have a firewall and antivirus, but that is pointless if the admin has access to run "hack" cients on your PC.  And since I had been on the server numerous times, did not know they would hack me, especially the second PC when I went back to ask them what they did and how to fix the first one.  But it is fixed and I wont be back, dont like little punks that are that childish to begin with, and for sure dont want my PC hacked by someone on there again.\n\n\n\nAnyway, there are many server out there, and I\'m sure some are run by adults, not little kids.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1085721, 135568, 1013, 100950, 1072936800, '', 'Arakus [or to whom it may concern]- Grow up pal. You should know the only gamers that get exec cliented or rcon client [aka slow hacked] are newbies! They are the only ones that dont know how to defend themselves so they are the least of your worries.\n\n\n\nA simple kick/ban is all you need! If the player is soo offensive, ban him and you will never see him again.\n\n\n\nWhat you did is 100x worse than anything any client could do to you -- cheating, cussing, profanity -- it doesnt matter.\n\n\n\nYou exploited another persons game for your own personal benefit.\n\n\n\nThere isnt 1 good reason why you should do what you did.\n\nquote:it\'s a kid friendly environment\n\nIs it now? So fake violence is better than fake swearing?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
