(1103302, 137752, 1013, 100958, 1072936800, '', 'Exit steam, and delete your "clientregistry.blob" from your steam folder.  restart steam and it will update and fix your problem\n\n\n\n[edit] actually ive jus realised this will not solve your problem at all.  it solves the steam ticket expiration, but not logging in.  try it anyhow', '127.0.0.1', 1),
