(1114998, 138796, 1013, 100963, 1072936800, 'Did I get banned?!', 'Okay, I was trying to log onto my account a few minutes ago and I get \n\n\n\n"Steam-Error\n\n This Steam account has been disabled"\n\n\n\nNow I\'m thinking, wtf did I do, I just play ns on the damn thing..', '127.0.0.1', 1),
