(1141196, 141033, 1005, 100970, 1072936800, '', 'you guys are spoiled ([]) (jk)\n\n\n\ni play with 30-60 fps (my monitor is a pos, locked at 60hz)\n\nand i still ownz p33pz left and rightz.\n\n\n\nif you have 60 fps youll be fine', '127.0.0.1', 1),
