(1172186, 143656, 1005, 101017, 1072936800, 'Top 10 reasons HL2 will not be released this year!', '10: Delaying HL2 after STALKER is released.\n\n9: Reworking network code for IP v6.\n\n8: Delayed untill ATI PS 3.0 cards are available.(since they invested 6Mil)\n\n7: Must redo graphics so that Vampire: The Masquerade won\'t be better.\n\n6: Won\'t make gold untill Release Canidit 17.\n\n5: Coverting HL2 to MMORPG only game.\n\n4: License problems with HAVOK (game engine usage).\n\n3: Stall tactic.\n\n2: Not wanting to change taxable earnings for 2004.\n\n1: Cease and Desist from VU on HL2 untill final court date 22 March 2005\n\n\n\n\n\nX', '127.0.0.1', 1),
