(1174298, 143845, 1013, 101021, 1072936800, 'Latest Patch 9/21', 'In the server browser, when I double click a CS game, it says "Preparing to Play CS:Source Beta," then when I\'m in game, and it gets to the final loading bar in game to join the server, it just crashes.  By the way, I\'m loading NORMAL CS servers, and it says that it\'s preparing the Source Beta.\n\n\n\nI can only assume this is the patch\'s fault, as this has never happened to me; it\'s forcing me to update the Beta for some reason, and I can\'t join servers...all right after the new patch was released and I took the hardware survey.\n\n\n\nIt just quits with no message.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
