(1174690, 143890, 1005, 100307, 1072936800, 'Crash to Desktop after Update?  Look here for possible Fix!!', 'Delete your counter-strike (Not cstrike) folder.  Make sure to backup your neccisary files like models, configs, etc...\n\n\n\n\n\nScratch that:  Seems to be the Models folder and Custom Sounds.  Might be the Restoration Pack or just anything in the folder.\n\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get The "purchase Pending" Error... (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=143947)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
