(1176502, 144060, 1013, 101044, 1072936800, 'A FIX to 21/9 steam update!', 'Hello\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nI was getting exits as I went to play cs.... and I couldn\'t get into a server. \n\n\n\n\n\nThe Fix:\n\n\n\n\n\nThis is what I did.... I went into my cs folder:\n\n\n\ni.e myaccount@hotmail.com (mailto:myaccount@hotmail.com) and under that folder there\'ll be a counter-strike folder:\n\n\n\n\n\ni.e C:\\Games\\cs1.6\\SteamApps\\myaccount@hotmail.com\\counter-strike\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRENAME that counter-strike folder to say : backup_counter-strike\n\n\n\n\n\nRun steam again.... and now try to play a game..... []\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVoila!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1176604, 144060, 1013, 101045, 1072936800, '', 'that will get the game to play, but that is no fix. why valve would not allow people to use custom models or sprites with no explanation is beyond me.\n\n\n\nit would be nice to have a list of what was changed. or what was broken in the last update\n\n\n\n\n\nedit: \n\n\n\n"Improved pre-loading behavior (will no longer pause)"\n\n\n\nya it crashes to the desktop with no error message. //end disapointment', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1176715, 144060, 1013, 101044, 1072936800, '', 'Yes it\'s a temporary fix for now []\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nInstead of complaining about it, I went to see if anything was able to be done.... I hope some people find this useful.\n\n\n\n\n\nAt least it let\'s us play for now right? []\n\n\n\n\n\nedit: the answer to you\'re question I thought was obvious? people are using model/sprite cheats..... I think it was a step in the right direction but it created more issues.... at least their heart was in the right place.... haha', '127.0.0.1', 1),
