(1176903, 144060, 1013, 101048, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by mikeymuffin \n\nedit: the answer to you\'re question I thought was obvious? people are using model/sprite cheats..... I think it was a step in the right direction but it created more issues.... at least their heart was in the right place.... haha \n\n\n\nw00t are u talkin\' about, dude?\n\n\n\nDefine model/sprite cheats for me, plz... I\'ll give u an example of how complicated this issue might be:\n\n\n\nI have installed CS:CZ and it changed my models in CS 1.6 to those from CZ (it\'s due to another bug, oh well....), so... i dload original models and put them in cstrike/models/player, but after this MARVELOUS update, all my games crash cause of that... Not to mention, that they also crash cause of the custom Steam background. SUPERB!!!\n\n\n\nSo now I\'m a cheatz0r! n1 n1 n1! :X\n\n\n\nAnd plz, don\'t tell me that Valve did all that on purpose, cause that\'s BULL****. They made another mistake, hope they\'ll fix it soon. And as for u, don\'t mix any sick theories of yours with this. :O', '127.0.0.1', 1),
