(1199443, 146459, 1040, 101066, 1072936800, 'Points per hit - Not kill', 'Hey all, \n\n\n\nJust a suggestion really - In publics you notice alot of "kill stealing" whether your at the recieving end of actually stealing the kill. \n\n\n\nSo heres the suggestion. \n\n\n\nPoints added to score board (so you have your kills and you have your deaths but you also have your POINTS) \n\n\n\nYour rank (height in score board) will be linked to your POINTS rather than kills.\n\n\n\nYou will get points by giving damage. \n\n\n\nthis means if you shoot someone down to 1% health you will get say 9 points... \n\n\n\nthe guy who kills him with get 1 kill but 1 point due to only giving tiny ammount of damage. \n\n\n\nthis will: \n\n\n\nReward the guys who do the damage\n\nReduce fustration from "kill stealing"\n\nget a better ranking system going\n\n\n\n\n\nWhats your thoughts? \n\n\n\n(ps a mate brought this up, I just added to it and now posted here so maybe valve can consider it).', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1199450, 146459, 1040, 100405, 1072936800, '', 'and what happens with the money idea is good but you get money when you kill does that get say 9 point mean 270 quid or dollar and 1 point means 30 quid or dollar? because to make a kill needs a gun by killing you get money for the guns you buy i hope you know what i mean but its a good idea', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1199455, 146459, 1040, 101066, 1072936800, '', 'you have lost me there mate lol sorry . \n\nyou would get percentage of money! \n\n\n\nSo if you get say 1000 for a killl you would say get 900!\n\n\n\nthe guy who got last hit ( say 10 damage) would get  �100.\n\n\n\nI mean after all... he killed the guy you didnt so he must get money!\n\n\n\nBut then again you did most damage so you get most cash!\n\n\n\n\n\niNsChris', '127.0.0.1', 1),
