(1199507, 146459, 1040, 101068, 1072936800, '', 'Kill stealing is what happens when you arent good enough to kill the person you\'re shooting quick enough.\n\n\n\nStupid idea.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1199508, 146459, 1040, 101069, 1072936800, '', 'That would be stupid for matches and scrims, say you\'re trying to kill someone with your team and you yell out "yo i did alot of damage to the guy in rafters!" and then all you have to do is hit tab to figure out EXACTLY how much damage you delt. Kinda takes away from the game. Bad idea.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1199521, 146459, 1040, 101070, 1072936800, '', 'LMFAO shut up chris ya noob', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1199544, 146459, 1040, 101071, 1072936800, '', 'As frustrating as kill stealing is, I\'m not really keen on this idea. It\'s not like some rampant problem that needs immediate attention, and even if this system was implemented I don\'t think it would help with the frustration much. I think alot of people are like me, I prefer the satisfaction of actually making the kill, rather than having my kill count jump up one. I don\'t care about my score at all.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1199662, 146459, 1040, 101072, 1072936800, '', 'suck it up if someone steals your kill.  if you are not good enough to get more, you need better skills.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1199673, 146459, 1040, 101070, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by rivercityskater \n\nsuck it up if someone steals your kill.  if you are not good enough to get more, you need better skills.  \n\nhehehe well said that chris dude has no skill at all he sucks hard and thats why he crys bc ppl are faster then he is to take the kills', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1199730, 146459, 1040, 101073, 1072936800, '', 'You guys are foolish... "Learn to kill your enemies" that\'s bull and anyone who has actually played a decent match knows that.  If you run out and focus all of your effort on killing one opponent at a time you\'ll get mowed over.  I\'ll assume most of the people using this argument are either retarded or just don\'t have much play experience.  You take pot shots, hit and run, you use grenades and suppressing fire.  If I throw a grenade and take three guys down to 30 health or I take a shotgun and pepper a group of enemies doing 300+ damage and getting one or no kills I still want credit.  This isn\'t Quake 3, it\'s about teamwork, so any damage you do should be credited to you in some fashion.\n\n\n\nHow about a variation on this idea:  How about you list kills and damage seperately on the scoreboard?  Action Quake did this, it worked out pretty well.  Just list frags on the left, you can still use that to determine who has the highest score, and damage on the right, equalling the total point damage you did each round.  You can cap it to 100 per person or keep in the ridiculous amounts of damage you get from AWPing people in the head.  It\'d just give you a read out of who is doing more work for his team.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1199755, 146459, 1040, 101074, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by hoe-bag \n\nThis is what they did in Quake Clan Arena  \n\n\n\nquote:Originally posted by Sonic Boyster \n\nAction Quake did this \n\n\n\nThis is not Quake Clan Arena. This is not Action Quake. This is COUNTER-STRIKE\n\n\n\n\n\nThis is a terrible idea.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1199822, 146459, 1040, 101068, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Sonic Boyster \n\nIf I throw a grenade and take three guys down to 30 health or I take a shotgun and pepper a group of enemies doing 300+ damage and getting one or no kills I still want credit.  This isn\'t Quake 3, it\'s about teamwork, so any damage you do should be credited to you in some fashion. \n\n\n\nIf it\'s all about teamwork your should be happy with the team score to show how well you worked as a team.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
