(1253878, 151333, 1005, 101136, 1072936800, '', 'Yeah, you can\n\n\n\nIf your an ATI customer you can apply to receive the game on dvd (if you live in UK, CD\'s for europe & USA) ASWELL as the free download!!!\n\n\n\nTo do this you must have the following;\n\n\n\n1)Receipt from shop/vendor of Original ATi Product (with product circled)\n\n2)Photocopy of the ATI voucher, clearly showing the serial number\n\n3)Original (Photocopies not accepted) serial number from the card of the ATi product e.g. its on the side of the box from your gfx card\n\n\n\nYou got to go to the ATi site to find out the mailing address.. oh and a small delivery charge may apply []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
