(1262342, 152420, 1040, 100418, 1072936800, 'CS:S is still BETA!!! proof!', 'quote:Originally posted by Vlad_Attack \n\n****ing bs this game is still beta, I dont know why they needed to change the damn name. Try adding bots. The game will tell u no bots available in beta! LOL. Valve can fool some1 else.  \n\n\n\nIt\'s not really a beta...consider that HL2 is a whole new engine, and CS has awesome gameplay - they are trying to not perturb the gameplay while perfecting the engine. That\'s a razor fine line..\n\n\n\nThey released it now instead of with HL2 so that you have another map than DUST to play!!! I mean seriously, how long had people been whinging for new maps?\n\n\n\nIf they had\'ve given us new maps during the beta, we would have had at least 15% / 20% of the total map count so far, so then we would basically have most of the game.\n\n\n\nSo now we are still beta testing to an extent, as so many games/mods etc will be based off of the HL2 engine, and it\'s still in teething stages.\n\n\n\nCS wasn\'t built in a day! Neither will CS:S...\n\n\n\nIt is basically a whole new game that plays exactly the same (or so they want). It\'s going to take a while for it to be perfect. Just wait. Soon there will be everything we dream of, SDK/fgd, models, custom everything and less bugs. Soon. I assume. They aren\'t going to just sit on their thumbs and snooze in court, they have to bust *** to get this game finalised and ultimate. \n\n\n\nHL2 story/gameplay is gonna be awesome, we already know that. But is the game even going to run for many? That\'s why we are still beta to an extent. BUT WE HAVE A FULL GAME TO PLAY. So it\'s okay. Time - patience - life.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
