(1288454, 152981, 1040, 101211, 1072936800, '', 'Well, I hope that the post about the NForce drivers going to fix this issue are correct, but from past experience with my NForce2 motherboard, the drivers probably haven\'t been updated since the original predicted release date for HL2. \n\n\n\nMaybe thats an exaggeration, but seriously, the NForce drivers seem to be updated every 6 months or so.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
