(1309287, 152981, 1040, 101212, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Punisher!|ITA \n\nI have RealTek ALC650 like thousands of people, Surround works in all the games except for CS:S... what about us? \n\n\n\nSame here.... apparently if you switch back down to 3.55 drivers it works fine, but I\'m not doing that just for one game!!  What board and speakers are you using?\n\n\n\nCheers,\n\n\n\nSuman', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1309327, 152981, 1040, 101213, 1072936800, '', 'What did we do wrong in a past life to deserve this...\n\n\n\nOne of the most anticipated games of all times, and my 5.1 soundstorm is incompatible with it.\n\n\n\nIf I am not mistaken, if its broken in CS:S, it\'ll be broken in HL2?\n\n\n\nThis is my own sort of personal hell.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1268826, 153187, 1040, 100913, 1072936800, 'High Resolution CS:S Screenshots', 'High Resolution Counter-Strike: Source Screenshots and Videos\n\nLast Updated: October 10, 2004\n\n\n\nHere is a photo album of some amazing Counter-Strike: Source screenshots. \n\n\n\nIf you have high resolution images, post a link to them. I\'ll update this photo album often. Remember, only high quality screenshots will be showcased. []\n\n\n\nTo report broken hyperlinks, please send me a private message.\n\n\n\nCS_HAVANA\n\nLook how the sun reflects off the tiles on the right. (http://img76.exs.cx/img76/7150/cs_havana0013.jpg)\n\nGlare of sun behind the hostages. (http://img78.exs.cx/img78/6678/cs_havana0014.jpg)\n\nHostage Rescue Zone (http://img29.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img29&image=cs_havana0023.jpg)\n\nHostage Rescue Zone #2 (http://img2.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img2&image=cs_havana0026.jpg)\n\nWow, what a sunset (http://img29.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img29&image=cs_havana0015.jpg)\n\nTaking off from the terrorist spawn (http://img4.exs.cx/img4/1148/Chateau01.jpg)\n\n\n\nCS_ITALY\n\nCTs in buy zone (http://img2.exs.cx/img2/3635/cs_italy0007.jpg) (2048 x 1536 pixels)\n\nExploding fruit in the market. (http://img78.exs.cx/img78/7359/cs_italy0006.jpg)\n\nTerrorist Spawn (http://img16.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img16&image=cs_italy0100.jpg)\n\nShooting some Fruit(s) on Italy (http://img4.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img4&image=cs_italy0027.jpg)\n\nBuildings in Italy are made of brick (http://img2.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img2&image=cs_italy0031.jpg)\n\n\n\nCS_OFFICE\n\nDemonstrating the finer points of online gaming to hostages (http://img29.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img29&image=cs_office3.jpg)\n\nHostages drink Cool Breeze (http://img29.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img29&image=cs_office4.jpg)\n\nBroken Computer (http://home.comcast.net/~pinnapple/oops.jpg)\n\nCounter-Terrorist Spawn (http://img37.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img37&image=cs_office0042.jpg)\n\n3D skybox (http://img2.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img2&image=cs_office0005.jpg)\n\nCT spawn looking toward the main building (http://img2.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img2&image=cs_office6.jpg)\n\nGlass now shatters (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0004.jpg)\n\n\n\nDE_AZTEC\n\nView of the pryamid from the ramp. (http://img29.exs.cx/img29/537/de_aztec0011.jpg)\n\nView of water from Bombsite B. (http://img56.exs.cx/img56/2220/de_aztec1.jpg)\n\nFrom under the bridge. (http://img56.exs.cx/img56/6082/de_aztec0009.jpg)\n\nView of the sky just past the terrorist spawn. (http://img16.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img16&image=de_aztec0102.jpg)\n\nWatching for Mayan bridge crossers on Aztec (http://img29.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img29&image=de_aztec0043.jpg)\n\nCT Spawn (http://img37.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img37&image=de_aztec0116.jpg)\n\nOn bridge looking at water (http://img37.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img37&image=de_aztec0124.jpg)\n\nWater from the bombsite (http://img37.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img37&image=de_aztec0109.jpg)\n\nThe wooden bridge (http://img2.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img2&image=de_aztec0044.jpg)\n\nBombsite A (http://img2.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img2&image=de_aztec0041.jpg)\n\nNew water effects (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/aztec/de_aztec0034.jpg)\n\n\n\nDE_CBBLE\n\nTerrorist Spawn (http://img37.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img37&image=de_cbble0134.jpg)\n\nCounter-Terrorist Spawn facing bombsite (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0058.jpg)\n\nCT spawn facing door to bombsite B (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0059.jpg)\n\nHallway between bombsite A and bombsite B (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0060.jpg)\n\nBombsite (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0061.jpg)\n\nCbble Screenshot (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0062.jpg)\n\nInside Building 1 (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0063.jpg)\n\nInside Building 2 (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0064.jpg)\n\nInside Building 3 (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0065.jpg)\n\nCourtyard (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0067.jpg)\n\nDistant view of terrorist spawn (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0068.jpg)\n\nUnderpass near CT spawn (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0069.jpg)\n\nLadder at underpass near CT spawn (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0073.jpg)\n\nCounter-Terrorist snipper tower (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0074.jpg)\n\n\n\nDE_CHATAEU\n\nFacing Terrorist Spawn (http://img76.exs.cx/img76/5020/de_chateau0004.jpg)\n\nFacing Terrorist Spawn (farther away) (http://img76.exs.cx/img76/6287/de_chateau0002.jpg)\n\nBombsite A (http://img29.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img29&image=de_chateau0014.jpg)\n\nNear Bombsite B (http://img37.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img37&image=de_chateau0026.jpg)\n\nThat\'s a big hole in the floor (http://img2.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img2&image=de_chateau0011.jpg)\n\nOn the way to bombsite B (http://img2.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img2&image=de_chateau0009.jpg)\n\nLooking through windows to bombsite A (http://img2.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img2&image=de_chateau0013.jpg)\n\n\n\nDE_DUST2\n\nScreenshot 1 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20022.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 2 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20021.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 3 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20020.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 4 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20019.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 5 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20018.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 6 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20017.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 7 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20016.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 8 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20015.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 9 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20014.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 10 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20013.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 11 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20012.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 12 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20011.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 13 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20010.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 14 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20009.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 15 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20008.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 16 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20007.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 17 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20005.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 18 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20004.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 19 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20003.jpg)\n\nScreenshot 20 (http://img75.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img75&image=de_dust20002.jpg)\n\n\n\nDE_DUST\n\n\n\nDE_PIRANESI\n\nBombsite B (http://img37.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img37&image=de_piranesi0175.jpg)\n\nAn inside shot (http://img29.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img29&image=de_piranesi0000.jpg)\n\nThe boat at terrorist spawn (http://img4.exs.cx/img4/4316/Chateau02.jpg)\n\nPiranesi Screenshot (http://smash.lurkcorp.com/CSSpics/de_piranesi0194.jpg)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1268830, 153187, 1040, 100913, 1072936800, '', 'COUNTER-TERRORIST\n\nCT vs. T (http://img81.exs.cx/img81/5301/cs_office0000.jpg)\n\nCT vs. T 2 (http://img81.exs.cx/img81/8598/cs_office2.jpg)\n\nCT vs. T 3 (http://img81.exs.cx/img81/3073/de_chateau0007.jpg)\n\nCrouched CT with M4 (http://img63.exs.cx/img63/6499/CrouchedSealM4.jpg)\n\nCT holding AK (http://img55.exs.cx/img55/8559/SealAK.jpg)\n\nDeath row (http://img63.exs.cx/img63/1967/DeathRow.jpg)\n\n\n\nTERRORIST\n\nDead Terrorists (http://img63.exs.cx/img63/6186/DeadComrades.jpg)\n\n\n\nHOSTAGES\n\nHostage (http://img8.exs.cx/img8/3632/cs_office3.jpg)\n\nHostage Screenshot 2 (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0010.jpg)\n\nRag doll hostages (http://img29.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img29&image=cs_office0004.jpg)\n\nInjured Hostage (http://img29.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img29&image=cs_havana0020.jpg)\n\nInjured Hostage #2 (http://img13.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img13&image=cs_office0002.jpg)\n\nInjured Hostage #3 (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0018.jpg)\n\nHostage at 28% health (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0019.jpg)\n\n\n\nEYE CANDY\n\nBarrels (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/cbble/de_cbble0075.jpg)\n\nBullet holes in glass (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0009.jpg)\n\nBeefy Computer Corporation (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0011.jpg)\n\nInside of a Beefy Computer (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0013.jpg)\n\nBeefy Computer in many pieces (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0014.jpg)\n\nThe motherboard (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0016.jpg)\n\nHard Drives (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0015.jpg)\n\nFire extingusher (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0020.jpg)\n\nCracked LCD computer display (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0021.jpg)\n\nBroken mug and keyboard (http://212.48.100.124/cs_source/office/cs_office0022.jpg)\n\nCool Breeze Drink Machines (http://img81.exs.cx/img81/3117/cs_office0003.jpg)\n\nCamping Photo (http://img81.exs.cx/img81/1092/cs_office0002.jpg)\n\n!Ping Me Photo (http://img81.exs.cx/img81/7351/cs_office0008.jpg)\n\nSpamming Photo (http://img81.exs.cx/img81/7643/cs_office0009.jpg)\n\n\n\nOTHER SCREENSHOTS\n\nFlashing lighting a dark corner in cs_havana. (http://img78.exs.cx/img78/1850/cs_havana0017.jpg)\n\nHow a fish would see T Spawn (from under water in de_chateau) (http://img81.exs.cx/img81/1449/de_chateau0005.jpg)\n\nBomb go BOOM! (http://img81.exs.cx/img81/2585/de_chateau0006.jpg)\n\nOffice blood bath (http://img55.exs.cx/img55/480/OfficeBloodbath.jpg)\n\n\n\nOTHER SCREENSHOT THREADS\n\nMore Screenshots (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=151622) (by Raziel1Slipknot)\n\n\n\n\n\nA special thanks to these forum members for submitting the screenshots:\n\nVudash, smash, Montresor, bl4cks1d3, gasto, TheSkaBoss, qayne, Sightless, Raziel1Slipknot,', '127.0.0.1', 1),
