(1276511, 153187, 1040, 100913, 1072936800, '', 'Counter-Strike: Source Videos\n\nLast Updated: October 10, 2004\n\n\n\nIf you have CS:S videos, post a link to them. I\'ll update this often.\n\n\n\nCS_OFFICE VIDEOS\n\nShooting cs_office props (http://home.comcast.net/~cs_player89/cs_officeprops.wmv) (size 3.71 MB)\n\nSource Physics in slow motion (http://skdr.dodfi.net/source/source_physics.avi) (size 10.4 MB) \n\n\n\nOTHER VIDEOS\n\n! WARNING ! - These videos contain foul language!\n\nCS:S Video #1 (http://www.bat420.com/CSSGamePlayVid1.wmv) (size 29.9 MB)\n\nCS:S Video #2 (http://www.evilmike.info/CSSGamePlayVid2.wmv) (size 29.6 MB)\n\n\n\n\n\nA special thanks to these forum members for submitting the videos:\n\nsirplayalot, PIT2, FrozenBacon', '127.0.0.1', 1),
