(1269456, 153257, 1013, 101218, 1072936800, 'Can\'t buy 2 copys of HL2 with same CC??', 'Ok I got my pre-order for HL2 done and all is fine (did it yesterday at 12 PST) and now today (friday) i wish to buy one for my friend becuse he has no access to a credit card, but i have made "to many" steam purcheses on this card and i can\'t do it at this time. (it goes on to say becuse of fraud issues) \n\n\n\nWell i don\'t see why buying it 2 times in 2 different days would be banned, i can see maybe 3 or more times in 2-3 days then locking it down but why one.\n\n\n\nIf this is how it is meant to be then they should change the wording on the "error" message from "to many" to " another steam pucrahse has been made on this card in the past <some many days>. So that we know how long we must wait and also that you can only make one.\n\n\n\n-Xqnine\n\n\n\nEDIT: Yes i did do a Support and forum search with no luck on this subject, yes there is one about not being able to buy 2 copys but it was already dealth with in a different manner.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1269515, 153257, 1013, 100513, 1072936800, '', 'Give it some time. Valve aren\'t the only ones to do this. Yahoo online store does the same time.\n\n\n\nIt has to process the order 100% i believe. Give it a week at the most dude.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1269524, 153257, 1013, 101218, 1072936800, '', 'it has to be already prossessed it is already totaly debited from my account (as it was a debit card) which can only be done at the end of the prosses', '127.0.0.1', 1),
