(1297229, 156086, 1040, 100809, 1072936800, '', 'i think you only got a part of good points..and mostly bad once..\n\n\n\nlike bunny hoping is dead..i can even bunny hop in1.6 with out loseing speed. same gose for CZ.\n\n\n\nThw AWP/Scout scoopes are made to redose the time to reaload and scope back..sens ppl keep bashing "damn awper" and we got a shild and ppl like the idea then all hate it..well SHOT THE DAMN FEETS!!!(work best for CZ players.)\n\n\n\nand i think recoil on the guns sux..i feel like a noob one more time on cs..\n\n\n\ni like the way you walk but the runnig sux..\n\n\n\nyou die faster so playing rambo is out and thats goos more teamwork as the game was made for.\n\n\n\npluse i know there are ton of bugg and that ovius sense ITS NEW!!.. and will get better..\n\n\n\nso there are new skills to learn and it dont take that long...i had a very bad score yesterday and today i had a good score.. just need to relearn the skills. like if you get a new gun in cs like fams ex..new wep new skills...\n\n\n\nall i have to say to you is yo have some goos point and give the game a hange you will get the skills back faster then you think...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
