(1302788, 156580, 1013, 101276, 1072936800, 'Banned, When upgrading to Silver Package.', 'My god,\n\n\n\nThis morning i decided i would go ahead and upgrade my ATI voucher to silver, so i could give Condition Zero a chance. As quite frankly Source is terrible. \n\n\n\nSo i purcahse it.. $11.75 .. my proof of purcahse email showing it.\n\n\n\nEvidence of purcahse (http://www.eevee.fast24.co.uk/evi.JPG)\n\n\n\nSo i instantly start downloading the contents, Soon it\'s downloaded and i decided i would give DoD a go, as i\'ve purcahsed DoD:S.\n\nSo while i go off and play the Condition Zero single player missions DoD is downloading.\n\n\n\nI soon get bored of Condition Zero\'s bots and go to check on DoD, It\'s done.\n\nI go to play DoD online and when i try to join a server im to find...\n\n"Banned for past cheating violations"\n\nYepp, seeing as i\'ve never played it before it must be a mistake i thought, well 113 servers all said the same.\n\n\n\nSo, a bit annoyed i go to play Condition Zero online, to find..\n\n"Banned for past cheating violations" from all 70+ servers tried. \n\nI just got the DAMN THING, and i\'m banned?!\n\n\n\nBanned Screenshot (http://eevee.fast24.co.uk/banned.JPG)\n\n\n\nSo i\'ve now tried.. HL, HL deathmatch, Condition Zero, Team Fortress Classic, Day Of Defeat, and (Counter-Strike - Which WAS NOT, Banned).\n\n\n\nAll giving me Banned for Past chgeating Violations. \n\n\n\nWell, I tell you what its a damn good thing you live in the U.S or else i\'d royally kick your ***.\n\n\n\nSeeing as people who are banned are not unbanned, theres pretty much **** all i can do, other than say if this is some sort of sick joke to make me play Counter-Strike Source.. i\'d rather take Death row.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1302823, 156580, 1013, 101277, 1072936800, '', 'Damn, unlucky []\n\n\n\nYou must have some sort of trace of a cheat on your system (and running), and if your SURE you diddnt do it, it was probably somone else who uses your comp or sombody has a trojan on your comp and doesent like you much :/\n\n\n\nIt\'s impossible to prove that you diddnt cheat, so your account isnt going to be unbanned.\n\n\n\n[]', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1302845, 156580, 1013, 101278, 1072936800, '', 'This doesnt quiet make sense though.  All of your other games except CS were banned.  It doesnt make sense because if VAC bans you from one game it bans your entire account thus causing your entire STEAM account to be banned.  Something went wary here and i dont believe you, nothing against you its just we have seen some pretty crazy stories here.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1302893, 156580, 1013, 101279, 1072936800, '', 'It\'s the same ban you got when u posted here\n\n\n\nquote:Originally posted by swe.KnoX \n\nI was randomly banned on my ATI/HL2 voucher.. (woke up to find "Banned for past cheating violations" only used the voucher for 6 days rofl :/\n\nSource has preloaded, but i doubt i\'ll be able to play online... \n\n\n\nDon\'t matter tho i got Condition Zero, and another voucher so whatev, buy another.  \n\n\n\nThe ban applies to all games on your Steam account. Seeing as you\'ve had 8 HL accounts in the past I\'m sure you are well aware of how steam and cd-keys work.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1302938, 156580, 1013, 101276, 1072936800, '', 'Well, Source still works.. Sadly.\n\nAnd just found i can play all the other games but only in insecure servers. Oh grand.\n\n\n\nTell you what its a good thing i didn\'t upgrade to gold, Ill be buying the Collectors Edition from the shop anyway thank you. \n\n\n\nStill, annoys me as Condition Zero reg\'s like a dream on bots, online its the same. Unlike Source and CS original. \n\n\n\nEdit: And i use to play in Jolt.co.uk servers which are VAC enabled before upgrading to silver.. so how\'s that work?\n\nAnd the post where i said i was banned for the same reason 3 weeks later i was no longer banned.\n\nAsk jolt servers for the server record.. it will show the steam_id for this voucher when i played there sunday.\n\n\n\nI can\'t say i care to much as i have a plain HL cdkey, but it\'s a tad of a annoyance to keep logging in and out, to play different games. \n\n\n\nAnyway, You can ban me all you like Valve, but i WILL NOT play Source.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
