(1307525, 156580, 1013, 101287, 1072936800, 'Banned, When upgrading to Silver Package.', 'quote:Originally posted by swe.KnoX \n\nMy god,\n\n\n\nThis morning i decided i would go ahead and upgrade my ATI voucher to silver, so i could give Condition Zero a chance. As quite frankly Source is terrible. \n\n\n\nSo i purcahse it.. $11.75 .. my proof of purcahse email showing it.\n\n\n\nEvidence of purcahse (http://www.eevee.fast24.co.uk/evi.JPG)\n\n\n\nSo i instantly start downloading the contents, Soon it\'s downloaded and i decided i would give DoD a go, as i\'ve purcahsed DoD:S.\n\nSo while i go off and play the Condition Zero single player missions DoD is downloading.\n\n\n\nI soon get bored of Condition Zero\'s bots and go to check on DoD, It\'s done.\n\nI go to play DoD online and when i try to join a server im to find...\n\n"Banned for past cheating violations"\n\nYepp, seeing as i\'ve never played it before it must be a mistake i thought, well 113 servers all said the same.\n\n\n\nSo, a bit annoyed i go to play Condition Zero online, to find..\n\n"Banned for past cheating violations" from all 70+ servers tried. \n\nI just got the DAMN THING, and i\'m banned?!\n\n\n\nBanned Screenshot (http://eevee.fast24.co.uk/banned.JPG)\n\n\n\nSo i\'ve now tried.. HL, HL deathmatch, Condition Zero, Team Fortress Classic, Day Of Defeat, and (Counter-Strike - Which WAS NOT, Banned).\n\n\n\nAll giving me Banned for Past chgeating Violations. \n\n\n\nWell, I tell you what its a damn good thing you live in the U.S or else i\'d royally kick your ***.\n\n\n\nSeeing as people who are banned are not unbanned, theres pretty much **** all i can do, other than say if this is some sort of sick joke to make me play Counter-Strike Source.. i\'d rather take Death row.  \n\n\n\nLOL!!!! Dude are you 100% sure u never dl a hack be4 on ur pc or have some1 else ur ur account? And did see my Thread :/forums/show...hreadid=154123, (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=154123,) I\'ve been testing the VAC detection with hacks all week and not banned yet. How did u get banned??? I want to know, were u using some uber hack or what???\n\nLOL i can\'t believe this i really real sorry for u.........................LOL still laughing..........tears......stopped. =)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1304573, 156758, 1026, 101288, 1072936800, 'Tutorial : How To Install Cs:Source On Linux Debian', 'This is a little tutorial to help with cs:source on debian, thanx to person wich help me on this forum\n\n\n\n1�) edit /etc/apt/sources.list\n\n\n\nmodify version :\n\n\n\nwoody or stable or other to sarge\n\n\n\n       exemple :\n\n            deb ftp://ftp.fr.debian.org/debian/ (ftp://ftp.fr.debian.org/debian/) sarge main non-free\n\n            deb-src ftp://ftp.fr.debian.org/debian/ (ftp://ftp.fr.debian.org/debian/) sarge main non-free\n\n            deb http://non-us.debian.org/debian-non-US (http://non-us.debian.org/debian-non-US) sarge/non-US main non-free\n\n            deb-src http://non-us.debian.org/debian-non-US (http://non-us.debian.org/debian-non-US) sarge/non-US main non-free\n\n           deb http://security.debian.org/ (http://security.debian.org/) sarge/updates main non-free\n\n\n\nThen do :\n\n\n\napt-get update\n\napt-get upgrade\n\n\n\nthen \n\n\n\napt-get install libc6  gdb\n\n\n\nwhen asking updata to glic to new version say : Yes\n\n\n\nthen your cs:source server will work with command line :\n\n\n\nthen make a linux user called steam (or other name or use an existant user)\n\n\n\nexemple : useradd steam\n\n\n\nthen : su steam\n\n\n\ncd\n\n\n\nmkdir hl2ds\n\n\n\ncd hl2ds\n\n\n\nwget http://www.servmcs.com/serveurs/steam.tar.gz (http://www.servmcs.com/serveurs/steam.tar.gz)\n\n\n\ntar xvzf steam.tar.gz\n\n\n\nrm steam.tar.gz\n\n\n\n./steam (steam client will upgrade to version 10)\n\n\n\n** if you don\'t have a steam account do : \n\n**  ./steam -command create -username YourUsername -email you@isp.com (mailto:you@isp.com) -password YourPassword -question "who is servmcs ?" -answer myhoster\n\n\n\n** exemple : ( ./steam -command create -username SteamServmcs -email steam@servmcs.com (mailto:steam@servmcs.com) -password steam4servmcs -question "who is servmcs ?" -answer myhoster )\n\n\n\nNow you have to download your cs:source server using your steam account :\n\n\n\nexemple :\n\n\n\n./steam -command update -game "Counter-Strike Source"  -dir /home/steam/hl2ds/ -username SteamServmcs -password steam4servmcs\n\n\n\n\n\n** NOW Cs:Source Is installed **\n\n\n\ndon\'t forget to put a server.cfg to your cstrike/cfg/ directory\n\n\n\nthen launch server like this :\n\n\n\n./srcds_run -game cstrike +ip XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX +hostport 270XX +maxplayers 14 +map de_dust2\n\n\n\nif you\'ve got some error like :\n\n\n\nmany :\n\n\n\n free(): invalid pointer 0x401c7d00!\n\n\n\nand other :\n\n\n\n Executing dedicated server config file\n\nCMaterial::GetNumAnimationFrames:\n\nno representative texture for material sprites/zerogxplode\n\n\n\nserver will work !\n\n\n\ndon\'t forget to update hlsw to v1.0.0.31 beta or newer to see cs:source server up\n\n\n\nif you\'ve got any problem post here, i will help you []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1309863, 156758, 1026, 101289, 1072936800, '', 'Cheers, this worked perfect for me, finally got a source server up []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
