(1314392, 157641, 1040, 101300, 1072936800, 'Phase 6 Secretly More Than Just Maps...', 'Howdy everybody, I was just looking at the new phase 6 update files, and just thought id let everyone know that the new file Half Life 2 Base shared .gcf file contains more than just maps for HL2It also contains the client, server, and engine dll files among more sound files and some cutscenes in vcd format,  And some files that have something to do with the AI in certain maps, could Valve be trying to get us all ready to release , but decide tokeep it on the down low so everyone doesnt get excited? Thats what I think  but who knows, i could be wrong, I just thought id throw that out there, after all, thats what forums are for right? Thoughts on the subject are appreciated.\n\n\n\ncarpe_noctem\n\n\n\n"Do not meddle in the affairs of carpe, for you are crunchy and taste good with ketchup."', '127.0.0.1', 1),
