(1332052, 159172, 1026, 101318, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by poohiebear \n\nI would like a sticky with steam ids gotten off logs of people doing this - easily forged, but I wouldnt mind.  \n\n\n\nI wouldn\'t suggest that. The mods and Valve have on numerous occasions asked that we don\'t do this. If you take the time to do the above, that will keep the problem somewhat at bay until Valve fixes it. Once the script kiddy community gets wind of the loss of internet access, a possible fine and at the worst, a confiscated PC, they\'ll curtail their activities. But it takes work from the admin community to make sure this happens. Hopefully Valve issues a fix for this on Monday.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1332659, 159172, 1026, 101270, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by MMAzrael \n\nI wouldn\'t suggest that. The mods and Valve have on numerous occasions asked that we don\'t do this.  \n\n\n\nSorry mods - I missed that post - will edit my posts.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
