(1346840, 160394, 1005, 101374, 1072936800, '', 'found this at\n\nhttp://www.thezreview.co.uk/comingsoon/h/halflife.htm (http://www.thezreview.co.uk/comingsoon/h/halflife.htm)\n\n\n\ntidbit\n\n__________________________\n\n And the next video game which looks like being turned into a movie\n\nis�..Half-Life. Word has it that the game is currently being shopped around\n\nHollywood as a potential feature film. Described by one magazine as the best\n\nPC game ever, a movie is regarded as being a way of broadening the\n\nfranchise\'s audience.\n\n_________________________', '127.0.0.1', 1),
