(1353674, 161006, 1040, 101385, 1072936800, '', 'I knew something was downloading when my ©©©©ing computer locked up and I had to reboot. I was @ 300Mb\'s of a file that was 410Mb from a slow ©©© HP network.\n\n\n\nDamnit!\n\n\n\nAll this for three updates? Save the BW and give more updates in the updates.\n\n\n\nI feel better. Whinning over.\n\n\n\n*Edit*\n\n\n\nValve dude. I wouldn\'t have cried if I knew it was someone with power on this board. Sorry.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
