(1372060, 162488, 1026, 101399, 1072936800, 'VALVe: Serious Logging Issue in CS:Source since BETA!', 'Hello !\n\n\n\nMany of you dont know it... but many people are already beginning with some kind of stats logging. I just wanted to inform you, that the current state of the cs:s dedicated server version does not allow accurate log parsing ala PsychoStats, HLStats...!\n\n\n\nThe Log Output of CS:S sometimes misses connect lines as well as entered the game lines.  Well this wouldnt be much of a problem if there were not the problem that sometimes KILLS get logged as suicides! (Log_level 15 does not help!)\n\n\n\nI got log files even from servers all over the world and tried it (I guess this were all windows servers) and I could verify the missing log lines.\n\n\n\nYou can also track when this happens. Just open the Server in VGUI mode and look at the Players TAB -> You will see that sometimes players are playing on the server but not showing up in this tab! Exactly when this happens -> Everyone who kills a player not in this players list get logged as being suicided!\n\n\n\nI tested it with standard configs, log_levels, console mode, VGUI mode, I got logs from different servers -> everywhere the same problem! We really have to  push this to valve so they will know it. I reported this problem since the BETA but it always got ignored!\n\n\n\nKind regards and plz help us fix this,\n\nLD', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1379078, 162488, 1026, 101399, 1072936800, '', '*BUMP*', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1382263, 162488, 1026, 101400, 1072936800, '', 'log_level 15 works fine thanks', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1382669, 162488, 1026, 101401, 1072936800, '', 'Not really', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1385411, 162488, 1026, 101399, 1072936800, '', 'Nope Log_Level 15 doesn\'t help a bit.... I just looked at your hlstats statistics Croakert -> sorry you have the same bugs as we all []\n\n\n\nVALVe hast to fix this otherwise we can never do any serious or accurate log parsing...\n\n\n\nKind regards,\n\nLD', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1388413, 162488, 1026, 101402, 1072936800, '', 'Same problem. Please mark it down as a bug!', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1393247, 162488, 1026, 101403, 1072936800, '', '*bump* please pay attention to this issue', '127.0.0.1', 1),
