(1398093, 162488, 1026, 101405, 1072936800, '', 'Same story for me. It does log "something", but not all the kills and connections. What\'s worst is that it even logs some kills as suicides and that really screws up the purpose of generating stats from the logs IMHO.\n\n\n\nI hope this issue is pretty high on Valve\'s TOFIX list.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
