(1431091, 162488, 1026, 101408, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by DaSoul \n\nsubmit it via a bug report not the forums.  \n\n\n\nI believe the correct response is to ask if it has been logged as a bug via the correct channels.  There is no harm in reporting it on the forums either.  But it may help if you haven\'t yet to report it as a bug via CS S.  That may bring it to the correct people\'s eyesight a bit faster.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
