(1376630, 162840, 1013, 100027, 1072936800, 'HL2 preload "Stuck" at 88%', 'If this is happening to you, please just leave it that way for now. You\'ve likely got all the data, and it is just reporting it incorrectly. We\'re working on an update to fix that, but in the meantime, please don\'t delete your cache files just to make it go up to 100% []\n\n\n\nthanks,\n\n\n\nTaylor', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1436640, 162840, 1013, 100027, 1072936800, '', 'Also, If yours is stuck at 69% or some other percentage, please hang tight until the next Steam client update, and see if that takes care of it.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
