(1412088, 165841, 1040, 101429, 1072936800, '', 'They movies are alright but not yet up to the RvB standards.\n\n\n\nBut keep working on them as they are no doubt going to improve with time.  One thing that may help as you can see in RvB is that they characters are never standing completely still when talking, their bodies have motions and are always expressing something which could help out alot in your movies.\n\n\n\nNice work though and keep working on them!  \n\n\n\nAlso might want to add in more transition/dialoge scenes between major events.  More character interaction about the inner lives to give the different "actors" more traits that the user can identify with.  You want to make them more human in emotion and spoken dialog to add to the humor of their surroundings and experiences.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
