(1426147, 166482, 1005, 100254, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by P-Wolf \n\nYou sir, are insane.  By that logic, any team that was LANing would also be cheating.  Ventrilo simply gives online teams the "LAN advantage".  \n\n\n\nExactly, an unfair lan advantage. I think Valve should come up with someway to detect it and cause the user to be disconnected', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1427102, 166482, 1005, 100222, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Macaroni \n\nExactly, an unfair lan advantage. I think Valve should come up with someway to detect it and cause the user to be disconnected  \n\nVent is being used for all games. Take Return to Castle Wolfenstein and Warcraft 3 for example. It is not a form of cheating, just a form of team communication.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
