(1477906, 171740, 1013, 101453, 1072936800, 'Warning: Do Not Purchase Steam Accounts On Ebay', 'There are a number of people selling Steam Accounts (HL2, Bronze, Silver, Gold) on EBay. DO NOT PURCHASE THEM:\n\n\n\n1. It is against our EULA to sell Steam Accounts\n\n2. They are either Stolen accounts or opened with stolen credit cards.\n\n3. The accounts will be closed and we have been informed that PayPal / EBay will *NOT* help since no merchandise physically changed hands.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1480292, 171949, 1040, 101526, 1072936800, '!Spoiler! Pics: Gold Package Goodies - 56k\'s BEWARE', 'So I received my Gold package goodies. Excellent. Had to pay FedEx at the door because of canadian customs, then I opened the FedEx cardboard box to find a VERY DAMAGED HL2 box. Here\'s the content:\n\n\n\nhttp://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_1.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_1.jpg)\n\nYou can see the entire content of the package.\n\n\n\nhttp://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_2.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_2.jpg)\n\nDamaged box. So much for "collector\'s box" eh. The trash can will collect it. Wow I really need to trim my nails, that\'s horrible. Moving on... \n\n\n\nhttp://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_3.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_3.jpg)\n\nAgain, the box. Cheap paper. Fold and collect!\n\n\n\nhttp://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_4.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_4.jpg)\n\nHigh quality HL2 cap. Nice stuff and I was surprised how it widens quite a lot to fit my oversized head.\n\n\n\nhttp://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_5.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_5.jpg)\n\nInside of the cap.\n\n\n\nhttp://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_6.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_6.jpg)\n\nCover of Prima book. Great quality.\n\n\n\nhttp://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_7.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_7.jpg)\n\nBackside of Prima book. I didn\'t take a pic inside so to not spoil anything.\n\n\n\nhttp://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_8.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_8.jpg)\n\nThickness. It\'s thick, 300 pages.\n\n\n\nhttp://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_9.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_9.jpg)\n\nCity 17 postcard, HL2 sticker (remove paper in the back and stick), HL2 soundtrack which I haven\'t listened to (yet).\n\n\n\nhttp://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_10.jpg (http://www.jf3d.com/stuff/hl2_10.jpg)\n\nPosters. Disappointed that they were folded, a small tube would have been better. Nice print, somewhat blurry but good stuff.\n\n\n\nThat\'s it, pretty nice package overall []\n\n\n\nEdit: Bleh, img tag doesn\'t seem to work. Bummer.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
