(1492558, 172902, 1040, 101563, 1072936800, '[Stick]Please report nationally who is selling HL2!', 'quote:Originally posted by yankeeabe \n\n11/11 3:52 :  I was told by EB manager that it installs with an offline mode. You will be able to play it without internet  \n\n\n\nThe EB manager you spoke to is wrong. \n\n\n\nHL2 requires activation and decryption through Steam before you can play. He may have been able to register his cd key in Steam, but he will not be able to play until we have turned on HL2.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
