(1497351, 173294, 1005, 101535, 1072936800, '', '*In a nutshell*\n\n\n\n1. you are gordon freeman. You work for black mesa. you are a scientist who tests specimins in this crazy wierd machine.\n\n\n\n2. while getting ready for your job, you overhear other scientists talking about an unstable test subject.\n\n\n\n3. while testing the subject, a resonance cascade occurs (crazy flashing lights and other dimensions open up). The dimension opened up a portal to the world of Xen, an alien race. \n\n\n\n4. You try to get the hell out of black mesa, and while doing so a man in a blue business suit and a grey face is constantly following you. (We call him G-man)\n\n\n\n5. about halfway you realize that the government wants you dead.  (they get assassins to try and kill you)\n\n\n\n6. After a crapload of fighting and zombie killing, you meet up with a scientist who transports you to xen in order to close the portal.\n\n\n\n7. You fight this big spider thingy with an eggsack and you kill it.\n\n\n\n8. You fight this crazy big baby thing called the nihilanth. \n\n\n\n9. You kill it and go through a portal\n\n\n\n10. G-man is waiting for you and tells you that you have done a good job, and that he may have further use for you. You go into a portal and the game ends.\n\n\n\nHL2 is supposed to take place after this. Apparantly the Xen aliens took over the world. And now these new aliens called the Conbine control the cities. We still don\'t know anything about g-man. We are assuming that Gordon has been chryogenically frozen or something and has awakened. And now G-man wants you to go and kick some ©©©. And you proceed to do so, with much pleasure.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1497392, 173294, 1005, 101568, 1072936800, '', 'tylerron: Well thank you about this [] But if someone could find some more specific story, please post it in here.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1497676, 173294, 1005, 101569, 1072936800, '', 'just play the game, you can have it done in time for hl2 even if you have never played it before, just cheat.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1499957, 173294, 1005, 101535, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by highlndr \n\ntylerron: Well thank you about this [] But if someone could find some more specific story, please post it in here.  \n\n\n\nThat\'s about as specific as ur gonna get. They never give any names of the scientists, all the game consists of is shooting anything that is not in a white coat. Just play through the first 3 levels of the game to get a feel of the story. Or just watch that crazy guy that beat the game in 45 minutes.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
