(1538445, 177559, 1040, 101649, 1072936800, '', 'i had alot of trouble with the ending too - i just thought i stood there watching it []\n\n\n\nSpoiler:exactly what does happen with Mossman, is she a goodie or a baddie i never decieded. What happens with alex, does Breen die? as you dont see a body, and all he did was fall down a few meters, and what happens with father Gregory?\n\n\n\nbut still a great game []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1538693, 177559, 1040, 101650, 1072936800, '', 'Spoiler:GMan = Gordan Freeman, hence Gordan Freeman. Alyx dies.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
