(1563362, 180793, 1040, 101692, 1072936800, '', 'Look\'s like Gordon\'s out of work.\n\n\n\nYeah, it\'s a bug but I think everyone has secretly wanted a chance to kill the G-Man in single player. I know I have.\n\n\n\nBut what will happen to Shephard?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
