(1572865, 182013, 1040, 101700, 1072936800, 'Hl� mutiplayer menu download!', 'Read this if you create a server!\n\n1)Give the ip\n\n2)Say if Sv_cheats is 1 or 0\n\n3)Say what Multiplayer version you use! #1 or #2\n\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------                       Multiplayer #1\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFirst, a new Hl�multiplayer mod is available you can download it by this link\n\nSelect a server\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nServer: Create and give an ip!\n\nPs: This 127.0.0.1:27015 is not a good ip!\n\n\n\nServer 1: 213.202.216.10:27015 Maps (http://uploads.savefile.com/redir_show.php?file_name=hl2mpmappack.rar)\n\nGreen=Online\n\nRed=Offline\n\n\n\n""To add a server go in Half-life2>Server>Favorite>Add a server\n\nOr by Steam, go in Steam>Server>Favorite>Add a server""\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nNo console command needed!\n\n\n\nReadme: To play whit this Multiplayer-Mod\n\n\n\n1.Extract the hl2mp_11a_full.zip in\n\nX:\\Steam\\SteamApps\\accountname\\half-life 2\\\n\n\n\n2. Add to your Half-life2 shortcut : -applaunch 220 -game hl2mp -console\n\n\n\n3.Now start the shortcut\n\n  and have fun []\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIf you need help for this mod, Visit me (http://www.hl2mp.tk/) German\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nHalf-life� Multiplayer Radio!\n\nClik on "mp3 listen"\n\nGreen=Online\n\nRed=Offline\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------                               Multiplayer #2\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nHere to play in multiplayer! You can Join/create server and play!\n\n\n\nDirect download! Clik me! (http://perso.wanadoo.fr/diablo150/HL2_multi.rar)\n\n\n\nPs: The readme is in french and english!\n\n\n\nScreen *in french*: \n\nScreen1 (http://img60.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img60&image=creerserveur01.jpg)\n\n\n\nScreen2 (http://img61.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img61&image=creerserveur02.jpg)\n\n\n\nScreen3 (http://img61.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img61&image=partie01.jpg)\n\n\n\nScreen4 (http://img95.exs.cx/my.php?loc=img95&image=multi.jpg)\n\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nAll maps here (http://homepage.ntlworld.com/sebastian.birlet/hl2mp_mappack_v2.rar)\n\n\n\nExtract the maps in X:\\Games\\Valve\\Steam\\SteamApps\\hotmail.com\\half-life 2\\hl2\\\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nServer: Create and give an ip!\n\nPs: This 127.0.0.1:27015 is not a good ip!\n\n\n\nServer 1: 24.201.100.122\n\nServer 2: 4.5.29.12\n\nServer 3: 212.84.153.132\n\nGreen=Online\n\nRed=Offline\n\n\n\n""To add a server go in Half-life2>Server>Favorite>Add a server\n\nOr by Steam, go in Steam>Server>Favorite>Add a server""\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nNo console command needed!\n\n\n\nReadme: To add multiplayer menu in Half-life 2\n\n\n\nGo to this folder:\n\nC:\\Valve\\Steam\\SteamApps\\xxx\\half-life 2\\hl2\\resource\\\n\nAnd add the file "GameMenu.res" (he is in this package).\n\n\n\nGo to C:\\Valve\\Steam\\SteamApps\\xxx\\half-life 2\\hl2\\cfg\\\n\nAdd the file "settings.scr" (make copy of original file, for security)\n\n\n\nEnjoy, you can create a multiplayer game with Half-life 2 interface.\n\n\n\nIf any folder don\'t exist, create it!\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nAlso visit The shibby zed-hl2 (http://www.theshibby.com/zed/hl2/hl2.php) for usefull command!\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nClik me for some Ip (http://hl2world.com/bbs/viewtopic.php?t=15708)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
