(1615652, 184741, 1040, 101753, 1072936800, '', 'This problem seems to be caused by the older amd  cpu`s as it still remains despite updating glibc for users running the amd cpu.\n\nAs posted in threads elsewhere  it seems we will have to wait for valve to update the amd srcds files.\n\nFor your info I too have the same errors of players falling through the map floor  or being "clamped"\n\nMy box runs whitebox enterprise (ie redhat enterprise in all but name) with a AMD Athlon Thunderbird 1ghz cpu and ABIT KT7A mobo etc', '127.0.0.1', 1),
