and I didn\'t get a debug file.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1644055, 184741, 1040, 101752, 1072936800, '', 'Yeah I also had the same problem with the debug command. It has worked before, when I had freebsd installed.\n\n\n\nIt must be another bug with the AMD binary. I hope valve notices and fixes it soon. I have got a temp windows box up at the moment. I get the same kinda errors in regards to the map errors. So the problem must be with the invalid pointers.\n\n\n\nNossta\n\n\n\nwww.clan-moss.co.uk (http://www.clan-moss.co.uk)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
