(1605501, 185180, 1040, 101774, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by ShyGuy \n\nI seriously doubt a cs2 is coming out cs:s is basically cs2.  And why would they bring another cs game out that be silly :O maybe it was tfc2 lol []  \n\n\n\nFor the 17567512th time, CSS is NOT CS2. It\'s a port of the original to the source engine.  CS2 will be completely different to CSS.  It\'ll still look good but it will have new weapons and new maps\n\n\n\nCS2 will be in production as the code the developers will need is available and that\'s what they\'ll be concentrating on now\n\n\n\nAs stated earlier, it could be a very early alpha of CS2 that they are testing out', '127.0.0.1', 1),
