(1607655, 185456, 1013, 100464, 1072936800, '', 'so what undercover police do is illegal?  Ya know....example []\n\n\n\npolice - "Hey i wanna buy drugs."\n\nloser - "Ok, what you want."\n\npolice - "crack."\n\n\n\nloser gets out drugs.  Police, smash his face into the ground and cuff him.\n\nBasically the same thing Valve is doing right?...undercover work []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1607664, 185456, 1013, 103398, 1072936800, '', 'What do you mean by saying I can reactivate my game? I registered valid hl2 key to disabled account. Also, I tried that illegal key only because I\'ve got some problems with legal key. There was no \'pirate download\', \'using cracked version\' bs.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
