(1658480, 190391, 1013, 101898, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by LGB \n\nif i ask for my password to be sent to that account it says the e-mail address is invalid. \n\n\n\nWHICH IS CORRECT\n\n\n\nmy steam account != steampowered.com account\n\n\n\n*2 diff e-mail addresses*\n\n\n\ni know which is which\n\n\n\nppls steam accounts are NOT at all associated to the steampowered.com accounts.\n\n\n\nif they were, we wouldn\'t even be having this conversation, because i can login to steam with that e-mail address fine', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1658491, 190391, 1013, 101898, 1072936800, '', 'This is going to have to be handled by a moderator or something.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1658550, 190391, 1013, 101900, 1072936800, '', 'You\'re the one who brought up forum accounts and passwords. We\'re the only ones talking about the contact e-mail address in Steam. So, are you saying your Steam contact address is invalid or not? If it is, then you should have changed it to a valid e-mail address when you had the chance. Otherwise, dig up the original e-mail containing your username and password from when you first registered for a STEAM account (not steam forum account).', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1658787, 190391, 1013, 101898, 1072936800, '', 'I dont understand how this is so confusing\n\n\n\n1. I have *2* e-mail addresses \n\n\n\n2. One for the steampowered.com \n\n3. One for the actual STEAM account for playing games\n\n\n\n*2 DIFFERENT E-MAIL ADDRESSES*\n\n\n\nBoth are valid, both are functioning, and i know the password for both e-mail addresses and check my e-mail on both of them regularly \n\n\n\nThe e-mail address associated with the STEAMPOWERED.COM account. Is the one i\'m trying to retrieve the password for.\n\n\n\nThere is absolutely nothing confusing about this.\n\n\n\n4. Just because you use the same e-mail address for both your steampowered.com account and your actual STEAM account doesn\'t mean i do.\n\n\n\n5. There is ABSOLUTELY no association between the 2\n\n\n\n6. Steampowered.com account != STEAM account\n\n\n\n*2 different accounts*\n\n\n\nWhen you made your STEAM account to PLAY GAMES you didn\'t automatically get registered for the FORUMS did you? Thats because there\'s absolutely NO ASSOCIATION between the 2.\n\n\n\nTelling me to check my settings and whatnot for my STEAM account in the steam application is absolutely pointless because THEY ARE NOT ASSOCIATED\n\n\n\n*2 different e-mail addresses*\n\n*2 different accounts*\n\n\n\nSTEAMPOWERED.COM account != STEAM TO PLAY GAMES ACCOUNT\n\n\n\nSTEAMPOWERED.COM/FORUMS ACCOUNT = One E-mail address\n\nSTEAM ACCOUNT TO PLAY GAMES = ANOTHER e-mail address\n\n\n\nI don\'t know how to make this anymore clear.\n\n\n\nTHEY ARE NOT ASSOCIATED.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1658808, 190391, 1013, 101900, 1072936800, '', 'I think we\'re confused because...you\'re posting on the steampowered.com forums. So, if you can\'t get your password...how are you posting?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1658818, 190391, 1013, 101898, 1072936800, '', 'What this comes down to is actually quite simple and THANK YOU FOR MAKING THIS EXCESSIVELY CONFUSING\n\n\n\nwhen i enter an e-mail address to retrieve my password for my STEAMPOWERED.COM/FORUM account it says "Ok we\'re sending you your password right now!" and i say GREAT\n\n\n\nAND IT NEVER SHOWS UP\n\n\n\nTHIS IS NOT CONFUSING, YOUR MAKING IT CONFUSING.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
