(1682733, 192446, 1040, 101929, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Simon Charles \n\nI\'ll be fooking damned!  It works!  That heapsize command made the system freeze but once I removed that, it worked!  I have full DX9 water reflections with my FX card!  Unbelievable!  I used to suffer from the infamous Nvidia bug (no water at all) but now I have all the water, all the effects, everything!!\n\n\n\nInûûûûingcredible.\n\n\n\nAthlon XP 3000+ (2.2 ghz)\n\n512 mb ram\n\nGFX 5900 XT  \n\n\n\nI also have a 5900XT card. So, the above settings worked?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
