(1686198, 192821, 1040, 101936, 1072936800, 'DX8 Water Reflection Patch [WIP] CSS Beta now Available!', 'I have found a way to make Fully reflective water for DX8 I am now making a patch that will let all Nvidia and DX8 users have full reflective water in HL2. I am still ironing out the bugs and the quality isnt like DX9 but its a heck of alot better than a cubemap.\n\n\n\n\n\nOnce I get this dont there will be 2 versions a HL2 one and a CSS one here\'s some screens\n\n\n\n---Test Screens----\n\nThese are from a test map I made to test the power of the DX8 reflections\n\n\n\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0000.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0000.jpg)\n\n\n\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0001.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0001.jpg)\n\n\n\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0002.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0002.jpg)\n\n\n\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0003.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0003.jpg) \n\n\n\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0004.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0004.jpg)\n\n\n\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...tertest0005.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/dx8_watertest0005.jpg) \n\n\n\n---Patch Screens---\n\nAnd here are some from the patch \n\n\n\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...nals_060000.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/d1_canals_060000.jpg)\n\n\n\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...nals_060001.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/d1_canals_060001.jpg)\n\n\n\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...nals_060004.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/d1_canals_060004.jpg)\n\n\n\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v...nals_060002.jpg (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v124/JoshuaC/d1_canals_060002.jpg)\n\n\n\nI have tested with a few people with