(1718938, 196071, 1040, 101967, 1072936800, 'disable the Gravity gun', 'hahah server admins, start dsiabling the gravity gun! everywhere noobs throwing stuff at eachother. my 1st game on HL2DM was 116/67  finishing #1 in a 14 player server. yes i also used the GG and i did get many kills using it, but i got even more with the pistol or the crossbow or the machingun cuz i actually got some aiming skills and i hate getting killed by noobie players throwing a desk at me. i predict all the ladders will be disabling the GG cuz its such a waste lol no skill required whatsoever. and for the GG noobs out there, plz go for the smaller objects, u can throw em further, are more accurate and require less energy from the GG. now go and use it some cuz that thing will be banned soon ahahha', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1718978, 196071, 1040, 101968, 1072936800, '', 'If there\'s no skill required whatsoever, then why do people miss a lot with the gravity gun? Huh smart guy?\n\n\n\nIt takes skill because the freakin object blocks your view so you can\'t see where you\'re aiming, and also you have to lead running players off in order to hit them so you gotta have some good prediction skills to hit people off in the distance.\n\n\n\nIf you don\'t want to be hit so much with objects, then try playing in an 8-12 player server rather than a 32 person server.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719000, 196071, 1040, 101969, 1072936800, '', 'It can be a useful tool in the upcoming mods.  As for the style of gameplay that is currently offered for Hl2DM its pointless.\n\n\n\nalso we could just lessen the damage, id like to see it respect the ut2k4 telefrag, which takes skill and aim -=]', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719007, 196071, 1040, 101967, 1072936800, '', 'read my post again, i guess ur 1 of the novice players that need help and tips. i said "use the smaller objects with the GG" that way aiming and view and prediction and all the rest r just as using a machingun or pistol.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719009, 196071, 1040, 101970, 1072936800, '', 'I reckon there\'s a link between people who spell their name in upper case and silly posts.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719012, 196071, 1040, 101971, 1072936800, '', 'wht\n\n\n\nthe GG rocks, its just so cool\n\n\n\nwe just need something to control the grav gun\n\n\n\nhere are some exemples:\n\n\n\n-less objects (to twrow) on the map;\n\n-rejargeble (did i spell it right?) Grav Gun (what i mean is, you can throw like 3 things, then you need to w8 X sec until you can throw another one, this will make these n00bs learn to use a shotgun or other weapon;\n\n\n\n\n\nthis can be done really fasty, petty i only know how to make maps :P but i think my friend can make a mod for my 2� opinion, just gotta ask him...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719022, 196071, 1040, 101047, 1072936800, '', 'i luv it when lob somthin at you and you lob it back and kill em []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719074, 196071, 1040, 101972, 1072936800, '', 'When I join a server I always blap a few noob Ggun whores and leg it to the part of the map where people are using pump shottys, smgs, pistols and rocket launchers.\n\n\n\nSo much more fun than the furniture fiendings...although it is fun at times.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719077, 196071, 1040, 101973, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by [THEFORCE] \n\nread my post again, i guess ur 1 of the novice players that need help and tips. i said "use the smaller objects with the GG" that way aiming and view and prediction and all the rest r just as using a machingun or pistol.  \n\n\n\ncan you please write in correct english instead of phone text/AOL speech.  SMS language was created because there was a limited number of characters allowed in each message you could send to a recipient, welcome to the internet where such a limitation doesn\'t exist and makes you look like a clown when you use it.  \n\n\n\nAs for the way you come across, you sound about 12 and so your integrity leaves a lot to be desired.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719107, 196071, 1040, 101974, 1072936800, '', 'I gotta say, all these people who complain about the gun generally fall in to 2 catogories. \n\n\n\n1.) They cannot use it for themselves very easily and so are fustrated when they get killed by it\n\n\n\n2.) they cannot use english, CAPITAL LETTERS seem to be attracted to them, and they talk lik\' diz cus it da bomb.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719130, 196071, 1040, 101610, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Mcsh[]t \n\ni luv it when lob somthin at you and you lob it back and kill em []  \n\n\n\nMe 2, the big thing about HL2 DM is the GG. It\'s so fun, both small as big objects. I lobbed a filecabinet about 8 times back and forth to the enemy [] GG pwnz ^^', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719133, 196071, 1040, 101013, 1072936800, 'disable the Gravity gun', 'quote:Originally posted by [THEFORCE] \n\nhahah server admins, start dsiabling the gravity gun! everywhere noobs throwing stuff at eachother. my 1st game on HL2DM was 116/67  finishing #1 in a 14 player server. yes i also used the GG and i did get many kills using it, but i got even more with the pistol or the crossbow or the machingun cuz i actually got some aiming skills and i hate getting killed by noobie players throwing a desk at me. i predict all the ladders will be disabling the GG cuz its such a waste lol no skill required whatsoever. and for the GG noobs out there, plz go for the smaller objects, u can throw em further, are more accurate and require less energy from the GG. now go and use it some cuz that thing will be banned soon ahahha \n\n\n\nhow about no, and you ûûûû off and play one of the 10,000 other FPSs that don\'t have the gravity gun, and leave us to enjoy the only one that does, you selfish prick.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719162, 196071, 1040, 101413, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by TheGunslinger \n\nI gotta say, all these people who complain about the gun generally fall in to 2 catogories. \n\n\n\n1.) They cannot use it for themselves very easily and so are fustrated when they get killed by it\n\n\n\n2.) they cannot use english, CAPITAL LETTERS seem to be attracted to them, and they talk lik\' diz cus it da bomb.  \n\n\n\nagreed.  last time I checked, you could catch objects with the gravity gun, so I would think someone with such amazing skillz could avoid getting killed by n00bs throwing desks just by doing that...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719183, 196071, 1040, 101975, 1072936800, '', 'The Gravity Gun Rocks!\n\n\n\nWhat I really hate is when you are in the middle of a gravity gun fight with someone, throwing objects at each other is when someone else sneaks up behind you and kills you with the Sub Machine gun or pistol.\n\n\n\nA cheap way to score kills I say []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1719201, 196071, 1040, 101677, 1072936800, '', 'as stated before, why would you want to take out the gravity gun... then it would just be the same old typical deathmatch and wouldn\'t be nearly as fun', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1724933, 196713, 1040, 101976, 1072936800, 'New HL2DM Maps Page - Get Your Maps Here!', 'I just put up a page for HL2DM custom maps at http://hl2dm.darkrealmhosting.com (http://hl2dm.darkrealmhosting.com)\n\n\n\nIt only has like 28 maps as of right now, but if anyone has a map they want on there, just send it to me at tristan@darkrealmhosting.com (mailto:tristan@darkrealmhosting.com)\n\n\n\nIt\'s a lot faster to download maps from there than it is to get it from the servers.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1725060, 196713, 1040, 101977, 1072936800, '', 'Got some screenshots of any of them?', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1725095, 196713, 1040, 101976, 1072936800, '', 'I\'ll put some screenshots up tomorrow, it\'s getting a bit late tonight.  Again, if anyone has any maps they want up, just e-mail them to me, and I\'ll put them up.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1725166, 196713, 1040, 101976, 1072936800, '', 'There, I got it all set up to support screenshots.  I really don\'t have the best computer for taking screenshots (It has a GeForce2...), but I\'ll see what I can do.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
