(1725594, 196713, 1040, 101976, 1072936800, '', 'Added a couple of maps, screenshots, and comments.  There are now 28 maps on the page, and I\'m trying to get more.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1725784, 196713, 1040, 101976, 1072936800, '', 'Alright, my e-mail is being funky, so if anyone has any maps that they want on the page, just login anonymously to ftp://ftp.darkrealmhosting.com:2020 (ftp://ftp.darkrealmhosting.com:2020)\n\nYou can\'t read anything in that directory, but you have upload privelages to a directory that I\'ll be watching for new maps.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1725870, 196713, 1040, 101979, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by cortex \n\ncrossfire looks great [] I really want to play it  \n\n\n\n\n\nit\'s cool and all, but 3 things...  \n\n\n\n1. the airstrike is all talk, and no action...   Basically just a light show... \n\n\n\n2. the Combine vehicle is whacked.. when you drive it you can see through the floor of the map... \n\n\n\n3. since Source can handle much more detail in maps the person who remapped this old favorite should have spiced it up just a bit more with some nice eyecandy, and decorations... \n\n\n\n\n\nI haven\'t tried Crossfire 2 yet though... is that any better?\n\n\n\n\n\nOh yeah... tristan_sbs ...  I noticed your comment about the missing textures on Bounce... I do have working textures... Do you want the file I downloaded...  \n\n\n\n\n\n...', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1726302, 196713, 1040, 101976, 1072936800, '', 'Yeah, that would be awesome!  It\'s sort of odd playing in a world that\'s all pink and black.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1726916, 196713, 1040, 101976, 1072936800, '', 'So far, I\'ve only had one map submitted!  If people would upload some more maps, that would be awesome!  The page is getting quite a number of downloads now, it would be better to have more maps.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
