(1731649, 197418, 1040, 101936, 1072936800, 'DX8 Water reflection patches', 'Well I finally got all the bugs out and now its ready\n\n\n\nThis is for DX8 users ONLY if you have a DX9 card that can render DX9 well DO NOT use this patch\n\n\n\nCompatable cards\n\n\n\nNvidia Geforce 4 Ti and up\n\nATi 9200,9500\n\n\n\nto install extract to the hl2/materials folder.\n\n\n\nThis patch gives Nvidia and ati9200/9500 users near DX9 quality water. Real time reflections 0 performance loss and just about the same quality as DX9 water.\n\n\n\nDownload here\n\nhttp://www.pcgamemods.com/8877/ (http://www.pcgamemods.com/8877/) \n\n\n\nAlso for details on the CSS version of the patch go here\n\n\n\n/forums/...threadid=195917 (/forums/showthread.php?s=&threadid=195917)\n\n\n\nhttp://up1.fastuploads.com/d1_canals_060005.jpg (http://up1.fastuploads.com/d1_canals_060005.jpg)\n\nhttp://up1.fastuploads.com/71808965...nals_130003.jpg (http://up1.fastuploads.com/71808965_d1_canals_130003.jpg)\n\nhttp://up1.fastuploads.com/76574660...nals_130001.jpg (http://up1.fastuploads.com/76574660_d1_canals_130001.jpg)\n\nhttp://up1.fastuploads.com/82688868...als_01a0000.jpg (http://up1.fastuploads.com/82688868_d1_canals_01a0000.jpg)', '127.0.0.1', 1),
