(1734904, 197721, 1040, 101581, 1072936800, 'Way to copy the Halo\'s Slayer for your DM game, Valve.', 'Way to copy the Halo for your deathmatch game Valve.\n\n\n\nHalo DM: You spawn with a accurate pistol, a useless spammy machine gun,  and grenades.\n\n\n\nHalf-Life 2 DM: You spawn with a accurate pistol, a useless spammy machine gun, and grenades...\n\n\n\nWhat in the hell were you doing when designing your death-match... honestly, you went from the best DM game ever (HL1DM) to this, this thing....\n\n\n\nIt\'s a tragedy. I\'m going to walk into Microsofts Office and kill them for popularizing Halo. It destroyed my favorite DM game of all time.\n\n\n\nI played Halo Valve. Most of us here have... and most of us think it was over hyped bull beans and that the DM was the worst DM to come to gaming since... well never. It\'s the worst MP game in history.\n\n\n\nWhy would you base your model off of it... I\'m shellshocked that you would think of doing it, not to mention taking the time and effort to accually go through with such an appalling idea. I hope this wepaon setup is some kind of joke and will be change when the user community, if they haven\'t allready forgotten you like you have of them, produces some maps.\n\n\n\nWhat else is bad beside such Halo-ish copycating? \n\n\n\nUseless --Halo style-- hand grenade spam. Unless you combine it with the gravity gun to make it into a timed rocket launcher, there entirely useless, and player who doesn\'t have the stamina to run away will simply blast away the grenade with the gravity guns primary fire. In MP games, nobody dies of grenades anymore. There a useless toy.\n\n\n\nNo crowbar. WTF were you thinking...\n\n\n\nThe pistol is meak, oddly enough where it was over-usefull in SP game it\'s underusefull in the MP game. Really, it\'s made as a backup for after you\'ve emptied an entire SMG clip into an opponet, which you will often do because of the total uselessness of the SMG.\n\n\n\nI don\'t know why you dicided to go to CS 1.5, take the glocks damage, the machine guns accuracy, and smake \'em together with a new model and call it a SMG. It\'s an abomination of the gun. The orignal was a PICK UP and it\' KICKED @$$, and the grenades, of which you could hold 10 of them, where  awsome fun to use, and combo.\n\n\n\nThe only counter to that is the Plasma gun, which is much more rarely used, but also kicks @$$. I like this gun in SP, and I like it more in MP, to bad you didn\'t know what to do with two automatic guns and instead made one crap and another a underavailable weapon. You have 1 on each map....\n\n\n\nThey next tragedy is the shotgun... OMG.... what have you done to my favorite weapon in FPS history. I kid you not. It was a amazing weapon that when properly utilized blew people away. Now, unless your point black, it takes 5 shots to kill. Good luck doing that when someone with a tiney 357 comes around the corner and blasts you away with a 100% accurate 100 DMG shot... its\' not easy, it\'s not fun, and it\'s more of a relief to accually kill someone in that situation that a sense of accomplishment. Even the SMG counters the shotgun in close range combat.\n\n\n\nThe next gun is the 357. I won\'t say to much, as there is a official hate thread for it already ( and maybe soon a website ) that points out that taking this weapon, that requiring 2 shots would have been overpowered against any of the other guns already, and turning it into a one shot kill machine, is mindnumbing. Honestly, you have a spammy machine gun, a meak pistol, a drasticly underpowered shotgun, and what do you throw it to even it out... a insta gib pistol... does it make any sense to you in retrospect.... did you even play this before you shipped it out?\n\n\n\nAnd of coarse, not even the rocket launcher escaped a Halo make over. The cool ultra responsive ness is competely gone. Like the Halo RL, it\'s almost completly point and shoot. How do you take a fun and unique weapon and turn into another vastly overpowered medicor weapon? Take away it\'s aim ability. You should have made it less powerful, less dominating, instead of doing a Halo cut-and-paste and eliminating the one thing that made this RL stand out from the crowd.\n\n\n\nThe maps themselve encourage camping... from the fan area that holds 2 insta-kill-pistols and a RL, to the RL on  top of the building of the other map. You could argue that this works because player as a team or not will rush that point to try to take advantage of it, but that doesn\'t happen often.  Who, with badly underpowered guns and grenades totally useless at smokeing out campers, it going to go against a bunch of the opposing team with 357 and RLs... its suicide, nobody does it, It doesn\'t work to any advatage at all, and the whoe game has this feeling of that it\'s been played before.\n\n\n\nHalo DM sucks, HL2 DM heavily abids by a Halo DM rule set. HL2 DM doesn\'t suck. I\'m too much of a fan of Valve to say it for myself. However, drastic changes need to be made to the gameplay, or HL2DM will go down as fast as Halo DM did... and hey... and least in Halo DM you could easily set the Heath to half which evened out most of it\'s imbalances... what can you say about HL2 plaguing issues?\n\n\n\nPS\n\nThis is coming from a person that the most positive view of HL2 DM apone discovery. I love the Half-Life series, and one screw up isn\'t going to change that. Just fix the guns. Think for yourselves. The mod community can make maps for you, but it\'s up to you to design --not copy-- the game.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1734931, 197721, 1040, 101582, 1072936800, '', 'OMG YOU SPAWN WITH A PISTOL, HALO COPY CAT... newb', '127.0.0.1', 1),
(1734964, 197721, 1040, 101583, 1072936800, '', 'Don\'t worry. They\'ll fix things up, they\'re not stupid.\n\n\n\nJust wait.', '127.0.0.1', 1),
