(1799600, 203474, 1040, 100464, 1072936800, '', 'quote:Originally posted by Aim4DaBrain \n\nwhats prodigy  \n\n\n\nu new to CS? []\n\n\n\nIts one of the old favorites.  It was in CS 1.6 and CS:CZ.  IMO, its one of the better maps.\n\n\n\nSo yippie, another good map to play on....cant wait.  I\'m suprised this thread hasnt been spammed yet....usually when a valve member posts, its at like 5 pages in a few minutes. []  Guess after the HL2DM update, everyone went away []', '127.0.0.1', 1),
