(1799653, 203474, 1040, 101085, 1072936800, '', 'nice one cliffe, i hope its not as dark as havana..\n\nbites lip.\n\n\n\nanyway.\n\ncs:s rocks.\n\nleet player and sas + oldskool menus would be leet.\n\ntill march at least []\n\n\n\n\n\nps. if you give us leet and sas i wont mind if prod is dark, i will but hey\n\n;', '127.0.0.1', 1),
